(7116311, 1087096, 119419, '<td valign="top">A beautiful scene, great use of light and perspective. These guys seem a little too innocent maybe, but that''s the catch isn''t it. Nicely done. 6.</td>', 'A beautiful scene, great use of light and perspective. These guys seem a little too innocent maybe, but that''s the catch isn''t it. Nicely done. 6.', '2013-10-16 05:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
