(7116379, 1087216, 99263, '<td valign="top">"Green Lady" by Vladimir Tretchikov, Jimi Hendrix and I don''t know whose face that is at the bottom. It''s not J.D. Salinger anyway, if it is I don''t recognize him from other photo''s of him.  That stalk is not Rye but some kind of reed, perhaps that is why in the title it''s "Wry" instead of "Rye" ?   7</td>', '"Green Lady" by Vladimir Tretchikov, Jimi Hendrix and I don''t know whose face that is at the bottom. It''s not J.D. Salinger anyway, if it is I don''t recognize him from other photo''s of him.  That stalk is not Rye but some kind of reed, perhaps that is why in the title it''s "Wry" instead of "Rye" ?   7', '2013-10-16 09:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
