(7116465, 1087135, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is a straightforward interpretation of the title. The butterfly is, I suppose, Plath''s soul being stifled. Competent, but cliched. 4</td>', 'This is a straightforward interpretation of the title. The butterfly is, I suppose, Plath''s soul being stifled. Competent, but cliched. 4', '2013-10-16 12:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
