(7116479, 1086939, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''ll be honest, I was dreading this title... but your sunrise mirrors the 1920''s gloominess of the book. And I''m impressed with the painting effect. 6</td>', 'I''ll be honest, I was dreading this title... but your sunrise mirrors the 1920''s gloominess of the book. And I''m impressed with the painting effect. 6', '2013-10-16 13:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
