(7116553, 1087071, 12611, '<td valign="top">I never thought a burning book could be so beautiful. I feel a bit guilty. Well done, nonetheless.</td>', 'I never thought a burning book could be so beautiful. I feel a bit guilty. Well done, nonetheless.', '2013-10-16 14:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116559, 1086479, 124815, '<td valign="top">I did not read the book so I looked it up:<br/><i>Cold Comfort Farm is a comic novel by English author Stella Gibbons, published in 1932. It parodies the romanticised, sometimes doom-laden accounts of rural life popular at the time</i> <br/>Your image seems to be a shoehorn for the title of the book. Moreover, I am not in favor of the processing and somehow disappointed by the presence of a landscape in this challenge that does not seem to have a real connotation with the novel. 4</td>', 'I did not read the book so I looked it up:Cold Comfort Farm is a comic novel by English author Stella Gibbons, published in 1932. It parodies the romanticised, sometimes doom-laden accounts of rural life popular at the time Your image seems to be a shoehorn for the title of the book. Moreover, I am not in favor of the processing and somehow disappointed by the presence of a landscape in this challenge that does not seem to have a real connotation with the novel. 4', '2013-10-16 14:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116580, 1087187, 103142, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot and a wonderful place, but the walls seem over processed, imo. I actually think the doorway is the most interesting part, and the processing of the walls distracts from the wonderful moodiness and loneliness of the doorway. I think the story is there in the doorway, but the trappings of the rest are taking over the story. -6-</td>', 'Interesting shot and a wonderful place, but the walls seem over processed, imo. I actually think the doorway is the most interesting part, and the processing of the walls distracts from the wonderful moodiness and loneliness of the doorway. I think the story is there in the doorway, but the trappings of the rest are taking over the story. -6-', '2013-10-16 15:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116585, 1087222, 124815, '<td valign="top">Well, we all remember a book differently and my score will not reflect the fact that I have a totally different recollection of this novel. <br/>Your image looks very odd to me from a lot of points of view. It looks like an awkward collage heavily processed. <br/>4</td>', 'Well, we all remember a book differently and my score will not reflect the fact that I have a totally different recollection of this novel. Your image looks very odd to me from a lot of points of view. It looks like an awkward collage heavily processed. 4', '2013-10-16 15:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116591, 1087150, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m having difficulties finding this novel. I''m only finding a song...<br/> <br/>I like the water a lot, but the rocks and the sky seem a little flat. I''m curious what it would look like with a bit more contrast in the rocks. Also, your horizon is tilted.<br/> <br/>I do like the diagonal slash that the rocks make in the composition.<br/> <br/>Overall, nice picture, but it doesn''t really evoke anything as is, and it''s hard when I can''t find the novel. -5-</td>', 'I''m having difficulties finding this novel. I''m only finding a song... I like the water a lot, but the rocks and the sky seem a little flat. I''m curious what it would look like with a bit more contrast in the rocks. Also, your horizon is tilted. I do like the diagonal slash that the rocks make in the composition. Overall, nice picture, but it doesn''t really evoke anything as is, and it''s hard when I can''t find the novel. -5-', '2013-10-16 15:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116593, 1087096, 103142, '<td valign="top">Little young for Lord of the Flies, but very nice shot. I like the lighting and the textures. I wonder what it would have looked like if you had let it be even a bit more blown in the highlights. -7-</td>', 'Little young for Lord of the Flies, but very nice shot. I like the lighting and the textures. I wonder what it would have looked like if you had let it be even a bit more blown in the highlights. -7-', '2013-10-16 15:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116594, 1086999, 103142, '<td valign="top">Excellent! Fits the novel beautifully, love the dirty hand. Not sure of cutting off the fingers on the bottom and the negative space. I think I like the negative space, but would have liked the fingers? I would have cloned the white speck up on the background, as well (doesn''t hurt the score, just a critique). -8-</td>', 'Excellent! Fits the novel beautifully, love the dirty hand. Not sure of cutting off the fingers on the bottom and the negative space. I think I like the negative space, but would have liked the fingers? I would have cloned the white speck up on the background, as well (doesn''t hurt the score, just a critique). -8-', '2013-10-16 15:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116597, 1087194, 47091, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2013-10-16 15:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116601, 1086983, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. It doesn''t have that much to do with the novel, but I could still see it as a symbolic cover. One thing bothers me a tad -- it looks like the image is tilted... the drops aren''t falling straight down, they''re falling at an angle. It doesn''t look quite right.<br/> <br/>-7-</td>', 'Very nicely done. It doesn''t have that much to do with the novel, but I could still see it as a symbolic cover. One thing bothers me a tad -- it looks like the image is tilted... the drops aren''t falling straight down, they''re falling at an angle. It doesn''t look quite right. -7-', '2013-10-16 15:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116602, 1086672, 103142, '<td valign="top">Quite creepy! Good idea and good execution. (although I hesitate to use the word execution when someone''s holding a knife...) -8-</td>', 'Quite creepy! Good idea and good execution. (although I hesitate to use the word execution when someone''s holding a knife...) -8-', '2013-10-16 15:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116604, 1086453, 103142, '<td valign="top">Intriguing. I like the greens. I find myself wishing there was more definition in the "figure", but as I''m trying to make more definition, more is appearing. It gets better as I look at it. -6-</td>', 'Intriguing. I like the greens. I find myself wishing there was more definition in the "figure", but as I''m trying to make more definition, more is appearing. It gets better as I look at it. -6-', '2013-10-16 15:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116608, 1087121, 30861, '<td valign="top">Whoa that''s ugly weather :-) I generally like this, though I feel the execution''s not getting all it could out of the image. A little more structure and darkening of the edges, would enhance the mood I think, make it a bit more intense.<br/> <br/>I''m giving this one a 6.</td>', 'Whoa that''s ugly weather :-) I generally like this, though I feel the execution''s not getting all it could out of the image. A little more structure and darkening of the edges, would enhance the mood I think, make it a bit more intense. I''m giving this one a 6.', '2013-10-16 15:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116612, 1087015, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is not working for me at all, sorry. The composition is awkward, the processing is lackluster, and the fit for the book is marginal at best: there''s no sense of height, for one thing (think "house on a hill") and there no sense of "wuthering", which is the oppressive sound the wind makes as it scours the lonely, bleak and barren moors. None of that comes through.<br/> <br/>4 from me.</td>', 'This is not working for me at all, sorry. The composition is awkward, the processing is lackluster, and the fit for the book is marginal at best: there''s no sense of height, for one thing (think "house on a hill") and there no sense of "wuthering", which is the oppressive sound the wind makes as it scours the lonely, bleak and barren moors. None of that comes through. 4 from me.', '2013-10-16 15:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116613, 1087100, 153814, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2013-10-16 15:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116616, 1086936, 30861, '<td valign="top">Not working for me, not even as an ironic take. Try as I might, I can''t bring "wonderland" out of this at all, and beyond that, the grace of Alice is that she''s naive and trusting, which this woman looks like she''s anything but, so I get no sense of the book here...<br/> <br/>4 from me.</td>', 'Not working for me, not even as an ironic take. Try as I might, I can''t bring "wonderland" out of this at all, and beyond that, the grace of Alice is that she''s naive and trusting, which this woman looks like she''s anything but, so I get no sense of the book here... 4 from me.', '2013-10-16 15:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116617, 1087195, 153814, '<td valign="top">Very well done I think a better crop could have helped this a bit.<br/>The stuff in the bottom left is a bit distracting.<br/></td>', 'Very well done I think a better crop could have helped this a bit.The stuff in the bottom left is a bit distracting.', '2013-10-16 15:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
