(7116721, 1087162, 124982, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture, what a story! You can''t help but wonder what he is seeing when he looks at himself in the mirror..and how does he relate himself to the man in the picture. Very thought-provoking!</td>', 'Very nice capture, what a story! You can''t help but wonder what he is seeing when he looks at himself in the mirror..and how does he relate himself to the man in the picture. Very thought-provoking!', '2013-10-16 19:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
