(7116763, 1087096, 124982, '<td valign="top">Really wonderful snapshot of life here with the kids running around, playing and having fun! Somewhat incongruous though with the book, which was about brutality and savagery of primitive living.</td>', 'Really wonderful snapshot of life here with the kids running around, playing and having fun! Somewhat incongruous though with the book, which was about brutality and savagery of primitive living.', '2013-10-16 21:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116765, 1087007, 124982, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and eerie processing. Wish he was holding something a little more "substantial" and menacing in his hand, since Lord of the Flies was really about the barbarian lifestyle the children adopted in their primitive society. Right now, it''s just a boy with a stick.</td>', 'Nice lighting and eerie processing. Wish he was holding something a little more "substantial" and menacing in his hand, since Lord of the Flies was really about the barbarian lifestyle the children adopted in their primitive society. Right now, it''s just a boy with a stick.', '2013-10-16 21:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116766, 1087151, 124815, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, well felt shot, I particularly like the B&amp;W treatment. I am glad that I looked at this shot on a different monitor because the darkness obscures almost totally the little boy.<br/>It lacks though this element that I was looking for here: the magic.<br/>7</td>', 'Beautiful, well felt shot, I particularly like the B&W treatment. I am glad that I looked at this shot on a different monitor because the darkness obscures almost totally the little boy.It lacks though this element that I was looking for here: the magic.7', '2013-10-16 21:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116767, 1087120, 124982, '<td valign="top">Certainly a unique shot for the challenge! Quite the vantage point and view you have there! Wish the perspective was a little straighter and perhaps more focussed/cropped on a particular area. Right now my eye wanders all over the frame, and can''t really find a focal point to rest on.</td>', 'Certainly a unique shot for the challenge! Quite the vantage point and view you have there! Wish the perspective was a little straighter and perhaps more focussed/cropped on a particular area. Right now my eye wanders all over the frame, and can''t really find a focal point to rest on.', '2013-10-16 21:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116768, 1086914, 124982, '<td valign="top">Simple. Elegant. Beautiful. Nice macro shot with beautiful lighting.</td>', 'Simple. Elegant. Beautiful. Nice macro shot with beautiful lighting.', '2013-10-16 21:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116769, 1086340, 124982, '<td valign="top">Ha! Classic take on a classic book :) I admire your creativity! And certainly, I admire your execution..nicely done! Fun image, I like it!</td>', 'Ha! Classic take on a classic book :) I admire your creativity! And certainly, I admire your execution..nicely done! Fun image, I like it!', '2013-10-16 21:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116770, 1086105, 124982, '<td valign="top">Nice use of shapes and geometry to create an image of interest. Really like the green to red transition! Not quite the menacing spectacle one would expect to see for War of the Worlds, where you''d expect to see massive destruction, not construction :)</td>', 'Nice use of shapes and geometry to create an image of interest. Really like the green to red transition! Not quite the menacing spectacle one would expect to see for War of the Worlds, where you''d expect to see massive destruction, not construction :)', '2013-10-16 21:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116771, 1087100, 124982, '<td valign="top">Yup, you nailed it. Lovely take on the book, and so PERFECTLY executed with your choice of light and minimal subject in focus/view. Very sparse and poignant!</td>', 'Yup, you nailed it. Lovely take on the book, and so PERFECTLY executed with your choice of light and minimal subject in focus/view. Very sparse and poignant!', '2013-10-16 21:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116772, 1087057, 124982, '<td valign="top">Image definitely follows the theme for the book ... what I would give to be on that boat floating gently away down the river! (critique: wish you had cloned out the signposts)</td>', 'Image definitely follows the theme for the book ... what I would give to be on that boat floating gently away down the river! (critique: wish you had cloned out the signposts)', '2013-10-16 21:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116773, 1087015, 124815, '<td valign="top">So much sharpening that the image trembles. <br/>I know that it does not matter for a photo inspired by a classic novel, but showing a house implies some kind of faithfulness to the book. And I remember vaguely as having elaborate gothic designs around the front door. <br/>I do not want a literal image, but I think that you aimed for one. <br/>I wish I can mark this with a 5 but the processing is way too disturbing<br/>4</td>', 'So much sharpening that the image trembles. I know that it does not matter for a photo inspired by a classic novel, but showing a house implies some kind of faithfulness to the book. And I remember vaguely as having elaborate gothic designs around the front door. I do not want a literal image, but I think that you aimed for one. I wish I can mark this with a 5 but the processing is way too disturbing4', '2013-10-16 21:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116774, 1087223, 124982, '<td valign="top">Nice use of blur to create the sense of motion of the viewer disappearing down the proverbial hole with the girl!</td>', 'Nice use of blur to create the sense of motion of the viewer disappearing down the proverbial hole with the girl!', '2013-10-16 21:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116775, 1087188, 124982, '<td valign="top">Excellent motion blur and beautiful colors! Nicely caught, really seems to capture the movement in the race. And obviously, very applicable to the book title chosen!</td>', 'Excellent motion blur and beautiful colors! Nicely caught, really seems to capture the movement in the race. And obviously, very applicable to the book title chosen!', '2013-10-16 21:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116776, 1087071, 124982, '<td valign="top">Great idea for the book! Very nicely captured! Love the flames and charred pages!</td>', 'Great idea for the book! Very nicely captured! Love the flames and charred pages!', '2013-10-16 21:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116779, 1087044, 124982, '<td valign="top">This is simply beautiful. Nice shot...really stresses the size and immensity of the mountains. Wish the crop was a little more water, and a little less sky. Feels unbalanced, with the empty sky not providing much.</td>', 'This is simply beautiful. Nice shot...really stresses the size and immensity of the mountains. Wish the crop was a little more water, and a little less sky. Feels unbalanced, with the empty sky not providing much.', '2013-10-16 21:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116780, 1086744, 124982, '<td valign="top">Such crisp, sharp water drops and gorgeous background blur! Nice capture!</td>', 'Such crisp, sharp water drops and gorgeous background blur! Nice capture!', '2013-10-16 21:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116782, 1086992, 35804, '<td valign="top">6...I like the gritty feel of it, the dust and roughness, the peevish looks on the fella''s face. I don''t enjoy the white vignette all that much though.</td>', '6...I like the gritty feel of it, the dust and roughness, the peevish looks on the fella''s face. I don''t enjoy the white vignette all that much though.', '2013-10-16 21:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116784, 1087082, 124982, '<td valign="top">I want to say I''ve seen this lighthouse in challenge before (maybe a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=96574" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">cuttooth</a>?). Anyway, beautiful sky - my word! That orange sunset rocks! The blurry water too! Only think I think could be improved is the front side of the lighthouse which seems underexposed. A splash of some dodging or curves to bring that out would''ve made a huge difference. I''m missing that detail in the bricks where my eye is drawn to slap band in the middle of the frame. Nonetheless, lovely shot!</td>', 'I want to say I''ve seen this lighthouse in challenge before (maybe a  cuttooth?). Anyway, beautiful sky - my word! That orange sunset rocks! The blurry water too! Only think I think could be improved is the front side of the lighthouse which seems underexposed. A splash of some dodging or curves to bring that out would''ve made a huge difference. I''m missing that detail in the bricks where my eye is drawn to slap band in the middle of the frame. Nonetheless, lovely shot!', '2013-10-16 21:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116786, 1087198, 124982, '<td valign="top">Very elegant, accomplished portrait. Love the contemplative expression on his face!</td>', 'Very elegant, accomplished portrait. Love the contemplative expression on his face!', '2013-10-16 21:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116787, 1087100, 124815, '<td valign="top">Dickens-iana , only that the bowl had to be made of metal and the hands of a young boy and not so delicate and clean!<br/>Nevertheless, a nice image - a square crop might be even better<br/>7</td>', 'Dickens-iana , only that the bowl had to be made of metal and the hands of a young boy and not so delicate and clean!Nevertheless, a nice image - a square crop might be even better7', '2013-10-16 21:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116788, 1087036, 124982, '<td valign="top">Most beautiful reflections on the water, and the splash of blue on the tower! Beautiful take and restraint on the processing.</td>', 'Most beautiful reflections on the water, and the splash of blue on the tower! Beautiful take and restraint on the processing.', '2013-10-16 21:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116789, 1087048, 124982, '<td valign="top">Nice splash of red in the leave and play of shadows and light. Not getting so much "secret" garden though, but still serene and peaceful nonetheless!</td>', 'Nice splash of red in the leave and play of shadows and light. Not getting so much "secret" garden though, but still serene and peaceful nonetheless!', '2013-10-16 21:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116795, 1087190, 124982, '<td valign="top">Nice take, and very subtle &amp; effective lighting. Wish you had let the flames burn a little longer to get some of those black bits of ash and burned pages to add to the complexity of the image. Still, I enjoyed it and very applicable to the chosen book title!</td>', 'Nice take, and very subtle & effective lighting. Wish you had let the flames burn a little longer to get some of those black bits of ash and burned pages to add to the complexity of the image. Still, I enjoyed it and very applicable to the chosen book title!', '2013-10-16 21:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116796, 1086453, 124815, '<td valign="top">Nice, but in a deja vu way. In any case it does not have enough fantasy and horror to match the novel<br/>5</td>', 'Nice, but in a deja vu way. In any case it does not have enough fantasy and horror to match the novel5', '2013-10-16 21:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116797, 1086700, 35804, '<td valign="top">6...it''s a competent photograph, but lacks an sort of emotion and is visually flat. I''m going to assume that''s a bloodied bandage, so perhaps color would have been more effective in this situation? And perhaps spreading the scene out a bit...the tattered bandage winding its way to a flower...and a mouse.</td>', '6...it''s a competent photograph, but lacks an sort of emotion and is visually flat. I''m going to assume that''s a bloodied bandage, so perhaps color would have been more effective in this situation? And perhaps spreading the scene out a bit...the tattered bandage winding its way to a flower...and a mouse.', '2013-10-16 21:44:04.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(7116798, 1086986, 124982, '<td valign="top">haha, took me several looks at the photo before I noticed the face on the bottom left! Quite well camoflaged! Good take on the challenge, with the very salient expressions on their faces!</td>', 'haha, took me several looks at the photo before I noticed the face on the bottom left! Quite well camoflaged! Good take on the challenge, with the very salient expressions on their faces!', '2013-10-16 21:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116799, 1087096, 124815, '<td valign="top">A cute picture of two lovely boys playing in a rather peaceful forest, shoehorned for the challenge<br/>5</td>', 'A cute picture of two lovely boys playing in a rather peaceful forest, shoehorned for the challenge5', '2013-10-16 21:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116802, 1086936, 35804, '<td valign="top">4...to me this looks like just a regular static sort of street candid. Nothing about it conjures the story for me at all.</td>', '4...to me this looks like just a regular static sort of street candid. Nothing about it conjures the story for me at all.', '2013-10-16 21:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116805, 1086992, 124815, '<td valign="top">Well caught the menacing broken window almost casting a threatening shadow. And the damn dust<br/>Nice composition<br/>7</td>', 'Well caught the menacing broken window almost casting a threatening shadow. And the damn dustNice composition7', '2013-10-16 21:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116806, 1087222, 35804, '<td valign="top">6...kudos for being fun! I''m not a big fan of the processing.</td>', '6...kudos for being fun! I''m not a big fan of the processing.', '2013-10-16 21:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116808, 1086983, 124815, '<td valign="top">Quite timeless in its angriness<br/>7</td>', 'Quite timeless in its angriness7', '2013-10-16 21:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116810, 1087221, 124815, '<td valign="top">A literal illustration of the title. <br/>I wish that you would have included some violence, at least between the beauty of an orange and the technical rigid mechanism of a clock<br/>5</td>', 'A literal illustration of the title. I wish that you would have included some violence, at least between the beauty of an orange and the technical rigid mechanism of a clock5', '2013-10-16 21:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116812, 1086433, 124982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky! Really like the vivid reds and oranges!Wish the foreground had a smidge more detail though, but know it''s hard capturing the huge dynamic range present in this shot.</td>', 'Beautiful sky! Really like the vivid reds and oranges!Wish the foreground had a smidge more detail though, but know it''s hard capturing the huge dynamic range present in this shot.', '2013-10-16 21:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116813, 1086939, 124982, '<td valign="top">Very curious processing. Guessing you''ve used some Topaz Simplify to get this effect? Very painterly feel to it, and it works for the most part!</td>', 'Very curious processing. Guessing you''ve used some Topaz Simplify to get this effect? Very painterly feel to it, and it works for the most part!', '2013-10-16 21:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116815, 1087150, 124815, '<td valign="top">Is this a novel? I am totally ignorant about this title in literature. <br/>I mind a lot the tilted horizon. The colors are nice but the picture does not bring enough interest, especially in this challenge<br/>4</td>', 'Is this a novel? I am totally ignorant about this title in literature. I mind a lot the tilted horizon. The colors are nice but the picture does not bring enough interest, especially in this challenge4', '2013-10-16 21:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116823, 1087122, 35804, '<td valign="top">4...not  fan of the processing, though the reflections in the water where it''s still are really mesmerizing.</td>', '4...not  fan of the processing, though the reflections in the water where it''s still are really mesmerizing.', '2013-10-16 22:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116827, 1086679, 35804, '<td valign="top">6...I would love this completely if that drawn face on the left was not there though I still kinda love it regardless. I just keep wanting to see past it and enjoy that warm divine light fully.</td>', '6...I would love this completely if that drawn face on the left was not there though I still kinda love it regardless. I just keep wanting to see past it and enjoy that warm divine light fully.', '2013-10-16 22:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116828, 1087152, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of set-up shots on white backgrounds. What is this Platonic environment you''re trying to create? (Don''t answer that. I know it''s just a practical matter.) However, I will give you a point for the tracks of blood, suggesting both the pain of the new, and also the frightfulness of the new. 4</td>', 'I''m not a fan of set-up shots on white backgrounds. What is this Platonic environment you''re trying to create? (Don''t answer that. I know it''s just a practical matter.) However, I will give you a point for the tracks of blood, suggesting both the pain of the new, and also the frightfulness of the new. 4', '2013-10-16 22:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116829, 1086983, 50695, '<td valign="top">A technically sharp photo combined with a clumsy, obvious idea is particularly unattractive. There is no charm to clumsiness when it is done so professionally. 2</td>', 'A technically sharp photo combined with a clumsy, obvious idea is particularly unattractive. There is no charm to clumsiness when it is done so professionally. 2', '2013-10-16 22:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116833, 1087210, 50695, '<td valign="top">Well, I like the texture of the shot. It creates a painterly sort of prettiness on what is otherwise an unimaginative shot. In its favor, it is well composed. I like the trees and fences coming out of his eyes. It''s a pleasing placement of the horizon. 5 for giving me something pleasing to look at.</td>', 'Well, I like the texture of the shot. It creates a painterly sort of prettiness on what is otherwise an unimaginative shot. In its favor, it is well composed. I like the trees and fences coming out of his eyes. It''s a pleasing placement of the horizon. 5 for giving me something pleasing to look at.', '2013-10-16 22:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116834, 1087007, 35804, '<td valign="top">9...it would have been more awesome without the t-shirt. I love the look on his face, the POV...good stuff!</td>', '9...it would have been more awesome without the t-shirt. I love the look on his face, the POV...good stuff!', '2013-10-16 22:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116835, 1087000, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''m finding the odriew effect to be a bit oppressive indoors. Too much glow going on. But I do like the blurred foreground elements combined with the wall pattern. 5</td>', 'I''m finding the odriew effect to be a bit oppressive indoors. Too much glow going on. But I do like the blurred foreground elements combined with the wall pattern. 5', '2013-10-16 22:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116838, 1087125, 50695, '<td valign="top">This looks oversharpened to me, and the colors are too ripe, even the sky. I will give you a point for the rather random composition. It adds some energy. 3</td>', 'This looks oversharpened to me, and the colors are too ripe, even the sky. I will give you a point for the rather random composition. It adds some energy. 3', '2013-10-16 22:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116839, 1087170, 50695, '<td valign="top">I find this a dull photo of computers. Yes, it connects to the novel, but what else does it connect to? 2</td>', 'I find this a dull photo of computers. Yes, it connects to the novel, but what else does it connect to? 2', '2013-10-16 22:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116840, 1087086, 124982, '<td valign="top">Very dark and moody, and definitely a feel of something evil! Not quite sure I grasp the connection between a fairground and "wicked", but I assume that''s my fault!</td>', 'Very dark and moody, and definitely a feel of something evil! Not quite sure I grasp the connection between a fairground and "wicked", but I assume that''s my fault!', '2013-10-16 22:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116841, 1086979, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love the light, but I don''t like seeing it through this weird HDR processing. The composition is low energy. 3</td>', 'I love the light, but I don''t like seeing it through this weird HDR processing. The composition is low energy. 3', '2013-10-16 22:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116843, 1087000, 35804, '<td valign="top">10...you''ve captured it. It''s a memory, a future, a past and a passing thought all wrapped up in a piece of silken chiffon.</td>', '10...you''ve captured it. It''s a memory, a future, a past and a passing thought all wrapped up in a piece of silken chiffon.', '2013-10-16 22:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116844, 1087170, 124982, '<td valign="top">Quite the array of monitors and hardware! 1984 was advanced beyond its years :) Not quite sure of the connection between the image and the book though?</td>', 'Quite the array of monitors and hardware! 1984 was advanced beyond its years :) Not quite sure of the connection between the image and the book though?', '2013-10-16 22:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116845, 1086744, 50695, '<td valign="top">competent macro shot of a spider. Dull, centered composition without enough web to make it dramatic. If the web were completely invisible and we only saw the water drops, that might be interesting. 3</td>', 'competent macro shot of a spider. Dull, centered composition without enough web to make it dramatic. If the web were completely invisible and we only saw the water drops, that might be interesting. 3', '2013-10-16 22:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116847, 1087151, 124982, '<td valign="top">For some reason, I find this image to be very unsettling and eerie! The reflection of the child is almost ghost-like! Quite sinister feeling. Fits well with the title!</td>', 'For some reason, I find this image to be very unsettling and eerie! The reflection of the child is almost ghost-like! Quite sinister feeling. Fits well with the title!', '2013-10-16 22:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116848, 1087187, 124982, '<td valign="top">What a lot of character in this ruined building, from the broken door to chipped plaster on the windowsill, to the holes in the boards in the window. Definitely has the feeling of something in decay...which fits the theme of poverty prevalent in the McCourt''s memoire. (upping vote from previous)</td>', 'What a lot of character in this ruined building, from the broken door to chipped plaster on the windowsill, to the holes in the boards in the window. Definitely has the feeling of something in decay...which fits the theme of poverty prevalent in the McCourt''s memoire. (upping vote from previous)', '2013-10-16 22:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116850, 1086761, 124982, '<td valign="top">Very gritty image, well portrayed by the desaturated and noisy processing. Fits neatly with the title!</td>', 'Very gritty image, well portrayed by the desaturated and noisy processing. Fits neatly with the title!', '2013-10-16 22:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116851, 1087015, 35804, '<td valign="top">4...this is just too crunchy. It lacks the atmosphere I would expect from something inspired by Wuthering Heights. It''s a not terribly well composed image of a stone building in bright dappled sunlight and is that a cyclone fence over on the left? Doesn''t really conjured the Yorkshire moors for me.</td>', '4...this is just too crunchy. It lacks the atmosphere I would expect from something inspired by Wuthering Heights. It''s a not terribly well composed image of a stone building in bright dappled sunlight and is that a cyclone fence over on the left? Doesn''t really conjured the Yorkshire moors for me.', '2013-10-16 22:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116852, 1087184, 124982, '<td valign="top">A somewhat snap-shotty photo that normally doesn''t appeal to me, but for some reason this strikes a chord with me. Just a great shot of everyday life!</td>', 'A somewhat snap-shotty photo that normally doesn''t appeal to me, but for some reason this strikes a chord with me. Just a great shot of everyday life!', '2013-10-16 22:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116853, 1086986, 50695, '<td valign="top">Good job, particularly with rounding up the kids and getting them to perform. I like the wide distribution of your subjects, to the edges of the frame. It makes the shot more immersive and energetic. I wonder if you could have found better "curves" though... more contrast... or moved them into a place with more sunlight shooting through it, like the light on the boy in back. 6</td>', 'Good job, particularly with rounding up the kids and getting them to perform. I like the wide distribution of your subjects, to the edges of the frame. It makes the shot more immersive and energetic. I wonder if you could have found better "curves" though... more contrast... or moved them into a place with more sunlight shooting through it, like the light on the boy in back. 6', '2013-10-16 22:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116854, 1087150, 124982, '<td valign="top">Nice foreground and vista! Wish it was exposed a little better...a little dark for my likeing and robs some of the appeal of the overall scene and detail in the rocks.</td>', 'Nice foreground and vista! Wish it was exposed a little better...a little dark for my likeing and robs some of the appeal of the overall scene and detail in the rocks.', '2013-10-16 22:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116855, 1087044, 50695, '<td valign="top">I didn''t read the book. Yes, you have mountains.<br/> <br/>Well, I like that the mountaintops fade away, but otherwise it is a slick low-energy picture. 4</td>', 'I didn''t read the book. Yes, you have mountains. Well, I like that the mountaintops fade away, but otherwise it is a slick low-energy picture. 4', '2013-10-16 22:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116856, 1087183, 124982, '<td valign="top">Snow white and the wicked witch in black to the right :) Interesting pose captured of the woman holding her ipod out. Wish she was more in focus, and the background out of focus, as there are many distracting elements in this image.</td>', 'Snow white and the wicked witch in black to the right :) Interesting pose captured of the woman holding her ipod out. Wish she was more in focus, and the background out of focus, as there are many distracting elements in this image.', '2013-10-16 22:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116858, 1087221, 50695, '<td valign="top">Nothing bores me quite so much as a photo of a clock on a black background. The good part is that you stuck it on an orange. The bad part is yet another person making this "joke" about this title. 3</td>', 'Nothing bores me quite so much as a photo of a clock on a black background. The good part is that you stuck it on an orange. The bad part is yet another person making this "joke" about this title. 3', '2013-10-16 22:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116859, 1086700, 50695, '<td valign="top">It''s been a long time since I read this book. I guess the scissors and bandage represent whatever operation was performed to give the main character intelligence? I''m not a fan of items assembled on a black background, though this does have a certain elegance to it. 4</td>', 'It''s been a long time since I read this book. I guess the scissors and bandage represent whatever operation was performed to give the main character intelligence? I''m not a fan of items assembled on a black background, though this does have a certain elegance to it. 4', '2013-10-16 22:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116862, 1087102, 124982, '<td valign="top">A dark and ugly place indeed! Very nicely tonemapped, a little close to the edge though (some halo-ing around the roof). Wish it was a little darker though, perhaps in B&amp;W to emphasize the state of dereliction the structure is in. The bright, cheerful processing almost seems at odds with the actual state of it!</td>', 'A dark and ugly place indeed! Very nicely tonemapped, a little close to the edge though (some halo-ing around the roof). Wish it was a little darker though, perhaps in B&W to emphasize the state of dereliction the structure is in. The bright, cheerful processing almost seems at odds with the actual state of it!', '2013-10-16 22:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116863, 1086936, 124982, '<td valign="top">Shoehorn in Wonderland? :) Loose connection to the title not withstanding, quite like the edgy portrait, but not so much the distracting elements in the reflections and windows. I think for this image to work, it would need a UWA perspective to capture her in the crazy wonderland of urban city life</td>', 'Shoehorn in Wonderland? :) Loose connection to the title not withstanding, quite like the edgy portrait, but not so much the distracting elements in the reflections and windows. I think for this image to work, it would need a UWA perspective to capture her in the crazy wonderland of urban city life', '2013-10-16 22:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116864, 1087004, 124982, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition and perspective! It works, I like it. Lighting seems a little flat though, wish there was more dynamic range though...some more prominent highlights as it''s coming off a little flat for me.</td>', 'Interesting composition and perspective! It works, I like it. Lighting seems a little flat though, wish there was more dynamic range though...some more prominent highlights as it''s coming off a little flat for me.', '2013-10-16 22:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116866, 1087207, 124982, '<td valign="top">Guess you''d need to be familiar with O Henry (William Porter) for this image to make sense, which is asking a lot of the voting masses I fear. Beautifully crisp cabbage, love the detail in the leaves and waterdrops.</td>', 'Guess you''d need to be familiar with O Henry (William Porter) for this image to make sense, which is asking a lot of the voting masses I fear. Beautifully crisp cabbage, love the detail in the leaves and waterdrops.', '2013-10-16 22:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116867, 1086453, 124982, '<td valign="top">Very disturbing image and very chaotic. Perfect for the chosen book! Can''t help but see a set of eyes and a face in the white portion on the left! eerie!</td>', 'Very disturbing image and very chaotic. Perfect for the chosen book! Can''t help but see a set of eyes and a face in the white portion on the left! eerie!', '2013-10-16 22:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116868, 1087001, 124982, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp detail on the web, and narrow DoF. Wish the background was blurred a little more, but still a well executed image!</td>', 'Nice crisp detail on the web, and narrow DoF. Wish the background was blurred a little more, but still a well executed image!', '2013-10-16 22:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116871, 1087221, 124982, '<td valign="top">very creative! At first pass, I never noticed the clock was actually an orange! Very crafty and subtle.  Exceptionally sharp detail on the clock face, and nice soft lighting!</td>', 'very creative! At first pass, I never noticed the clock was actually an orange! Very crafty and subtle.  Exceptionally sharp detail on the clock face, and nice soft lighting!', '2013-10-16 22:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116873, 1087022, 124982, '<td valign="top">Very abstract, yet appealing in its off-the-wall nature! Perfect decision to go with B&amp;W.</td>', 'Very abstract, yet appealing in its off-the-wall nature! Perfect decision to go with B&W.', '2013-10-16 22:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116881, 1087072, 124982, '<td valign="top">Quirky little image! And quite appropriate for the book title! The glimpse of the skull behind the sign makes it all the more curious! What is this store? What does it sell?</td>', 'Quirky little image! And quite appropriate for the book title! The glimpse of the skull behind the sign makes it all the more curious! What is this store? What does it sell?', '2013-10-16 23:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116882, 1087205, 124982, '<td valign="top">Very interesting processing on this leaves! Almost painterly! Quite appealing. Wish there was a little more lights/highlights to give it some depth - comes off a little flat right now. Probably crop that bottom strip off too. Anyway, these leaves have surely failed in their search for lost time as must all things in time.</td>', 'Very interesting processing on this leaves! Almost painterly! Quite appealing. Wish there was a little more lights/highlights to give it some depth - comes off a little flat right now. Probably crop that bottom strip off too. Anyway, these leaves have surely failed in their search for lost time as must all things in time.', '2013-10-16 23:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116883, 1086978, 124982, '<td valign="top">Nice image with several contrasts. You have the lovely splash of color in the leaf contrasting with the black pavement, and the clash between nature and industrialization. Would have a little more kick to it if it was cleaner (ie..all the small twigs removed, leaving just the lead on the road).</td>', 'Nice image with several contrasts. You have the lovely splash of color in the leaf contrasting with the black pavement, and the clash between nature and industrialization. Would have a little more kick to it if it was cleaner (ie..all the small twigs removed, leaving just the lead on the road).', '2013-10-16 23:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116884, 1087201, 124982, '<td valign="top">Good composition with the nice pathway leading to the secret garden! A little heavy handed with the processing though, as the green in the center of the frame seems over-saturated and blown out with no detail?</td>', 'Good composition with the nice pathway leading to the secret garden! A little heavy handed with the processing though, as the green in the center of the frame seems over-saturated and blown out with no detail?', '2013-10-16 23:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116886, 1087210, 124982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful horse, and perfect model for the challenge! He/she looks a touch over-sharpened though, since it seems to have sharpening artifacts on the face. A slightly different composition without the distracting tree in the background would''ve helped it too.</td>', 'Beautiful horse, and perfect model for the challenge! He/she looks a touch over-sharpened though, since it seems to have sharpening artifacts on the face. A slightly different composition without the distracting tree in the background would''ve helped it too.', '2013-10-16 23:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116887, 1087122, 124982, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the rive that perfectly relates to your chosen book! The birds on the bank provide some added layers of interest! Only critique is the overuse of tonemapping, ad the trees and foliage have taken on an unnatural appearance. Tone that down slightly, and this would''ve been really good!</td>', 'Nice capture of the rive that perfectly relates to your chosen book! The birds on the bank provide some added layers of interest! Only critique is the overuse of tonemapping, ad the trees and foliage have taken on an unnatural appearance. Tone that down slightly, and this would''ve been really good!', '2013-10-16 23:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116888, 1087093, 124982, '<td valign="top">Wow! Now that''s a close-up of a snout as I''ve ever seen! :) Wonderful detail and clarity (maybe a touch over-processed?). Never read the book, but this fits the title perfectly!</td>', 'Wow! Now that''s a close-up of a snout as I''ve ever seen! :) Wonderful detail and clarity (maybe a touch over-processed?). Never read the book, but this fits the title perfectly!', '2013-10-16 23:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116890, 1086989, 35804, '<td valign="top">6...or maybe 7...this is growing on me as I look at it. At first the yellow seemed garish but as I let it settle in, it grows on me. I particularly like it in contrast with the deep blacks. 7</td>', '6...or maybe 7...this is growing on me as I look at it. At first the yellow seemed garish but as I let it settle in, it grows on me. I particularly like it in contrast with the deep blacks. 7', '2013-10-16 23:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116891, 1087216, 124982, '<td valign="top">Clever take on the title! Very artistic shoehorn :) I do quite love the paintings! Pity the noggin is there distracting my appreciation of them! ;)</td>', 'Clever take on the title! Very artistic shoehorn :) I do quite love the paintings! Pity the noggin is there distracting my appreciation of them! ;)', '2013-10-16 23:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116892, 1086683, 35804, '<td valign="top">10...it''s not just a photograph, it''s a feeling.</td>', '10...it''s not just a photograph, it''s a feeling.', '2013-10-16 23:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116894, 1086744, 35804, '<td valign="top">7...these photographs have always seemed magical to me. Perhaps I''m to much a romantic...and the fact that spiders don''t freak me out helps too. A little queen sits atop her web full of pearls waits for dinner to come her way.</td>', '7...these photographs have always seemed magical to me. Perhaps I''m to much a romantic...and the fact that spiders don''t freak me out helps too. A little queen sits atop her web full of pearls waits for dinner to come her way.', '2013-10-16 23:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116911, 1087086, 124815, '<td valign="top">A very good picture in all. Yes, something is bound to happen here. I particularly like the foreground that looks enigmatic and ominous<br/>7 (for now)</td>', 'A very good picture in all. Yes, something is bound to happen here. I particularly like the foreground that looks enigmatic and ominous7 (for now)', '2013-10-16 23:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116914, 1087183, 68178, '<td valign="top">Wearing a bit of white doesn''t really make the tie to Snow White to me, especially with the prominence of the yellow pants. A little too much competing for my attention in the background that doesn''t really add to the story as well. A decent candid though, and I may have scored better in a different challenge. 4</td>', 'Wearing a bit of white doesn''t really make the tie to Snow White to me, especially with the prominence of the yellow pants. A little too much competing for my attention in the background that doesn''t really add to the story as well. A decent candid though, and I may have scored better in a different challenge. 4', '2013-10-16 23:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116917, 1086979, 163469, '<td valign="top">beautiful place.....looks familiar to me</td>', 'beautiful place.....looks familiar to me', '2013-10-16 23:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116920, 1086493, 124815, '<td valign="top">I cannot imagine how this novel inspired you to take this picture unless you found the title suitable for some kind of image of abandon (that again does not have one thing in common with the novel).<br/>The photo is ambitious but I find a few details very distracting such as the white lighting (halo) on her right arm and dress. The tattoo is another unfortunate thing that does not have to do with you. <br/>I am in 2 minds about score here. I do not like the staging, the lack of expression ...<br/>I give it a 5 in this context - a lot of lesser shots get 5 for different reasons, but I try to look at each image without comparing to the entire pool</td>', 'I cannot imagine how this novel inspired you to take this picture unless you found the title suitable for some kind of image of abandon (that again does not have one thing in common with the novel).The photo is ambitious but I find a few details very distracting such as the white lighting (halo) on her right arm and dress. The tattoo is another unfortunate thing that does not have to do with you. I am in 2 minds about score here. I do not like the staging, the lack of expression ...I give it a 5 in this context - a lot of lesser shots get 5 for different reasons, but I try to look at each image without comparing to the entire pool', '2013-10-17 00:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116923, 1087184, 68178, '<td valign="top">While not reflective of the story, I was a bit amused by the tie in to the title. Could use a little light on the postman though, as the background, especially the tree behind him draws my attention. 4</td>', 'While not reflective of the story, I was a bit amused by the tie in to the title. Could use a little light on the postman though, as the background, especially the tree behind him draws my attention. 4', '2013-10-17 00:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116927, 1087201, 119419, '<td valign="top">Murky and lurky scene. Creates the right atmosphere but the scene at the end of the tunnel is a little bit of a let down. To your credit, the right leaf wall is wonderful to explore and the blueish path is good. 5.</td>', 'Murky and lurky scene. Creates the right atmosphere but the scene at the end of the tunnel is a little bit of a let down. To your credit, the right leaf wall is wonderful to explore and the blueish path is good. 5.', '2013-10-17 00:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116928, 1087015, 68178, '<td valign="top">This seems like it wants to have a darker moody feel, but it doesn''t really happen. A little more on the black scale would have helped I think. That said, I have not read this book so may be missing something. 4</td>', 'This seems like it wants to have a darker moody feel, but it doesn''t really happen. A little more on the black scale would have helped I think. That said, I have not read this book so may be missing something. 4', '2013-10-17 00:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116929, 1086936, 124815, '<td valign="top">The modern Alice in a world of technical wonders. Just got out from not such a great place where she got her potion that will probably make her teeny tiny ..<br/>A good spoof I think but when it comes to marking it, I cannot go past 5 since I cannot appreciate this photo as much  in itself, out of this context.</td>', 'The modern Alice in a world of technical wonders. Just got out from not such a great place where she got her potion that will probably make her teeny tiny ..A good spoof I think but when it comes to marking it, I cannot go past 5 since I cannot appreciate this photo as much  in itself, out of this context.', '2013-10-17 00:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116930, 1087208, 119419, '<td valign="top">Nice enough cameo by the moose (or elk? I don''t know), not really up on my moose etiquette enough to know what''s going on, but I''ll take your (and its'') word on it. Composition is interesting enough, maybe a little crop off the right side. 5.</td>', 'Nice enough cameo by the moose (or elk? I don''t know), not really up on my moose etiquette enough to know what''s going on, but I''ll take your (and its'') word on it. Composition is interesting enough, maybe a little crop off the right side. 5.', '2013-10-17 00:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116931, 1087139, 124815, '<td valign="top">Have to admit my total ignorance concerning this book. I just searched the title (quite a nice one) and yes, I did hear about inspector Rebus though. In the absence of any connection that i can make with the book, I just look at the image but I have little to appreciate about it, save for a lovely hue<br/>4</td>', 'Have to admit my total ignorance concerning this book. I just searched the title (quite a nice one) and yes, I did hear about inspector Rebus though. In the absence of any connection that i can make with the book, I just look at the image but I have little to appreciate about it, save for a lovely hue4', '2013-10-17 00:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116932, 1086761, 35804, '<td valign="top">8...I like this so much I don''t even care if it has anything to do with a novel or not, though the quote does work nicely with it. Wait, I''m bumping this to a 9 now...it''s the stain, the magic of the stain. I''m back, to add this to my favorites. I''m bumping to a 10. It made me come back and that''s something. 10.</td>', '8...I like this so much I don''t even care if it has anything to do with a novel or not, though the quote does work nicely with it. Wait, I''m bumping this to a 9 now...it''s the stain, the magic of the stain. I''m back, to add this to my favorites. I''m bumping to a 10. It made me come back and that''s something. 10.', '2013-10-17 00:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116933, 1086157, 124815, '<td valign="top">A very heavy handed picture of a quite lovely spot. The double border does not help in the least<br/>4</td>', 'A very heavy handed picture of a quite lovely spot. The double border does not help in the least4', '2013-10-17 00:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116934, 1086734, 119419, '<td valign="top">Magic shot, hard to beat this as a majestic scene, so I''m guessing top ten if not the winner. Fits your novel title well, no real negatives because it exudes overwhelming wonderment. If you post processed a lot well done, if straight from camera, even better. 7.</td>', 'Magic shot, hard to beat this as a majestic scene, so I''m guessing top ten if not the winner. Fits your novel title well, no real negatives because it exudes overwhelming wonderment. If you post processed a lot well done, if straight from camera, even better. 7.', '2013-10-17 00:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116935, 1087055, 68178, '<td valign="top">Somewhat appropriate tie to the book, though would have preferred a more time appropriate look. The clothing and tattoo detract because of this. The lighting seems to try to draw my attention to the hip. 3</td>', 'Somewhat appropriate tie to the book, though would have preferred a more time appropriate look. The clothing and tattoo detract because of this. The lighting seems to try to draw my attention to the hip. 3', '2013-10-17 00:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116936, 1087072, 119419, '<td valign="top">I like the skull peeking out from behind, maybe more of the shop would have been more of interest. 5.</td>', 'I like the skull peeking out from behind, maybe more of the shop would have been more of interest. 5.', '2013-10-17 00:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116937, 1086692, 124815, '<td valign="top">Lovely tonality and lovely processing here. As to the subject of it, I am not sure of where to place this shot other than in a file with excellent family pics. Lovely memories.<br/>You just alluded to the novel which is better than illustrating a title<br/>I give it 6 for its qualities but unfortunately this photo is not telling me much</td>', 'Lovely tonality and lovely processing here. As to the subject of it, I am not sure of where to place this shot other than in a file with excellent family pics. Lovely memories.You just alluded to the novel which is better than illustrating a titleI give it 6 for its qualities but unfortunately this photo is not telling me much', '2013-10-17 00:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116938, 1087190, 119419, '<td valign="top">I didn''t realize John Grisham''s The Last Juror was on the hit list. I like the flames. Not a enough going on here for me I''m afraid. 5.</td>', 'I didn''t realize John Grisham''s The Last Juror was on the hit list. I like the flames. Not a enough going on here for me I''m afraid. 5.', '2013-10-17 00:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116939, 1087207, 68178, '<td valign="top">I have read very little O. Henry, so I may be missing something. Since I don''t know the tie to the author, the image just looks like an oddly placed cabbage and some cards. 4</td>', 'I have read very little O. Henry, so I may be missing something. Since I don''t know the tie to the author, the image just looks like an oddly placed cabbage and some cards. 4', '2013-10-17 00:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116940, 1087022, 119419, '<td valign="top">A brave novel from an African-American writer at a time of turmoil. The cultural sculpture reinforces your choice.5.</td>', 'A brave novel from an African-American writer at a time of turmoil. The cultural sculpture reinforces your choice.5.', '2013-10-17 00:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116941, 1086767, 35804, '<td valign="top">7...I''ve come back to this a few times. I love the skeleton, the delicate-ness of it. What I don''t care for is the vignette, or maybe more of how the vignette is done. A more careful darkening around the remains would have been more effective I think, not the typical/generic bring-in-the-darkness-from-the-corners sort of thing. I also think a careful B&amp;W conversion could be stunning. As far as the novel inspiration part...it works for me, everything''s allegory.</td>', '7...I''ve come back to this a few times. I love the skeleton, the delicate-ness of it. What I don''t care for is the vignette, or maybe more of how the vignette is done. A more careful darkening around the remains would have been more effective I think, not the typical/generic bring-in-the-darkness-from-the-corners sort of thing. I also think a careful B&W conversion could be stunning. As far as the novel inspiration part...it works for me, everything''s allegory.', '2013-10-17 00:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116943, 1087048, 119419, '<td valign="top">Beautiful branch, shame you couldn''t have shifted to include the end of the branch, I imagine the was a choice made. Lovely light you''ve chosen, but it doesn''t quite reinforce a secret garden scene. Lovely shot all the same.5.</td>', 'Beautiful branch, shame you couldn''t have shifted to include the end of the branch, I imagine the was a choice made. Lovely light you''ve chosen, but it doesn''t quite reinforce a secret garden scene. Lovely shot all the same.5.', '2013-10-17 00:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116946, 1087216, 68178, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what to make of this. Odd lighting and angles, strange props and some untold wry humor. I want there to be a story in here, maybe some youthful rebellion but I can''t find it. 3</td>', 'I''m not sure what to make of this. Odd lighting and angles, strange props and some untold wry humor. I want there to be a story in here, maybe some youthful rebellion but I can''t find it. 3', '2013-10-17 00:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116948, 1086858, 119419, '<td valign="top">Beautiful structure, a good travel shot to promote Delhi. A little too symmetrical to tell a story, other than to marvel at the artistry of the stone. You nailed the symmetry marvelously and the carving is a joy to explore.5.</td>', 'Beautiful structure, a good travel shot to promote Delhi. A little too symmetrical to tell a story, other than to marvel at the artistry of the stone. You nailed the symmetry marvelously and the carving is a joy to explore.5.', '2013-10-17 00:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116949, 1086744, 124815, '<td valign="top">A lovely shot with droplets and web. We see versions of it often though. The background is particularly pretty and the roundness of the web is awe inspiring, therefore quite good for the novel. <br/>6</td>', 'A lovely shot with droplets and web. We see versions of it often though. The background is particularly pretty and the roundness of the web is awe inspiring, therefore quite good for the novel. 6', '2013-10-17 00:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116950, 1087150, 119419, '<td valign="top">Don''t know that one, couldn''t find it either. The light, while subtle, is a little on the dull side which is a pity because post processing could have really primed it (but not HDR) .5.</td>', 'Don''t know that one, couldn''t find it either. The light, while subtle, is a little on the dull side which is a pity because post processing could have really primed it (but not HDR) .5.', '2013-10-17 00:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116951, 1087223, 124815, '<td valign="top">A cute adaptation of the title and a sincere shot. <br/>6</td>', 'A cute adaptation of the title and a sincere shot. 6', '2013-10-17 00:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116953, 1087078, 119419, '<td valign="top">A brave attempt to capture a dark time, Arthur probably would have liked it. Good use of interesting patterns and perspective to reinforce the mood.6.</td>', 'A brave attempt to capture a dark time, Arthur probably would have liked it. Good use of interesting patterns and perspective to reinforce the mood.6.', '2013-10-17 00:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116957, 1086683, 124815, '<td valign="top">Powerful and delicate picture in the same time and fitting the novel so well. There is a lot to think about when looking at this<br/>8</td>', 'Powerful and delicate picture in the same time and fitting the novel so well. There is a lot to think about when looking at this8', '2013-10-17 00:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116958, 1087121, 119419, '<td valign="top">Certainly looks like you''d have to be keen to be out there. Courageous, I don''t know, maybe more unlucky. Harvey would have been at home. 5.</td>', 'Certainly looks like you''d have to be keen to be out there. Courageous, I don''t know, maybe more unlucky. Harvey would have been at home. 5.', '2013-10-17 00:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116959, 1087150, 68178, '<td valign="top">The horizon line is a little off, and it seems a little flat but these are minor. Really though, it is mostly lacking an element that really grabs your interest. The sky and the rocks alternately could and don''t. 4</td>', 'The horizon line is a little off, and it seems a little flat but these are minor. Really though, it is mostly lacking an element that really grabs your interest. The sky and the rocks alternately could and don''t. 4', '2013-10-17 00:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116965, 1087195, 119419, '<td valign="top">Not quite the connection between your scene and the plot of the novel, but I really like this shot.6.</td>', 'Not quite the connection between your scene and the plot of the novel, but I really like this shot.6.', '2013-10-17 00:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116967, 1087184, 119419, '<td valign="top">Well, what the title says is what you see ;) 5.</td>', 'Well, what the title says is what you see ;) 5.', '2013-10-17 01:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116970, 1086999, 68178, '<td valign="top">There are some excellent shots in this challenge that really reflect not just the title of the book, but the content as well. This is one of them. The second I opened this I could hear his voice in my head politely asking for some more, please. Bonus points for doing this as a grainy dark black and white. 9</td>', 'There are some excellent shots in this challenge that really reflect not just the title of the book, but the content as well. This is one of them. The second I opened this I could hear his voice in my head politely asking for some more, please. Bonus points for doing this as a grainy dark black and white. 9', '2013-10-17 01:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116978, 1087183, 35804, '<td valign="top">7...omg...she is fabulous. Under that leopard print scarf I know there must be some even more fabulous hair. A nit pick, the crop. I think I would enjoy this more squared up. And I would be remiss not to mention the Snow White-ness of it, or lack there of...but she''s just so wonderful and ready for fashion battle.</td>', '7...omg...she is fabulous. Under that leopard print scarf I know there must be some even more fabulous hair. A nit pick, the crop. I think I would enjoy this more squared up. And I would be remiss not to mention the Snow White-ness of it, or lack there of...but she''s just so wonderful and ready for fashion battle.', '2013-10-17 01:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116980, 1087194, 68178, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot. There is a lot of subtle detail in this that really make it stand out. The smoke trails coming from the rear of the cannon, the sparks from the front, the soil spray, the rain (I think) on the left. 8</td>', 'Very cool shot. There is a lot of subtle detail in this that really make it stand out. The smoke trails coming from the rear of the cannon, the sparks from the front, the soil spray, the rain (I think) on the left. 8', '2013-10-17 01:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
