(7117063, 1086700, 119419, '<td valign="top">You have symbolized the story with the flower, gauze and medical scissors quite well, a clean and clear arrangement. The toning adds to the mood nicely. A pleasant image true to the novel.6.</td>', 'You have symbolized the story with the flower, gauze and medical scissors quite well, a clean and clear arrangement. The toning adds to the mood nicely. A pleasant image true to the novel.6.', '2013-10-17 07:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
