(7117074, 1087148, 119419, '<td valign="top">Ah the classic story. Got the essential ingredients there, though I''m fond of the half face mask myself, but props are props, the relationship is established. B&amp;W is a good choice.5.</td>', 'Ah the classic story. Got the essential ingredients there, though I''m fond of the half face mask myself, but props are props, the relationship is established. B&W is a good choice.5.', '2013-10-17 07:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
