(7117128, 1087122, 134859, '<td valign="top">I like this shot and think it could have worked really well, but it''s a little too harsh for my liking.  A little too much on the tone mapping, IMHO.  <br/>The title is fitting.  The colors are nice.  <br/>A little softer look and I would have scored it higher.  <br/>Gave it a 6</td>', 'I like this shot and think it could have worked really well, but it''s a little too harsh for my liking.  A little too much on the tone mapping, IMHO.  The title is fitting.  The colors are nice.  A little softer look and I would have scored it higher.  Gave it a 6', '2013-10-17 10:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
