(7117236, 1087071, 8759, '<td valign="top">Shows preparation and commitment :). A single book looks a bit odd related to the novel, more like a single incident. The fire is well photographed. To me looks a bit too staged. 6</td>', 'Shows preparation and commitment :). A single book looks a bit odd related to the novel, more like a single incident. The fire is well photographed. To me looks a bit too staged. 6', '2013-10-17 12:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117239, 1087125, 8759, '<td valign="top">Can see the inspiration but the image itself seems limited. It looks like is documenting a place rather then creating an atmosphere. The foreground is too busy and IMO is lacking a subject. 4</td>', 'Can see the inspiration but the image itself seems limited. It looks like is documenting a place rather then creating an atmosphere. The foreground is too busy and IMO is lacking a subject. 4', '2013-10-17 12:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117240, 1087072, 8759, '<td valign="top">good find that could have been exploited better with a different angle. It looks like it was taking in a rush. I would have also tried to ge tin the frame the crane that looked old and curios. 5</td>', 'good find that could have been exploited better with a different angle. It looks like it was taking in a rush. I would have also tried to ge tin the frame the crane that looked old and curios. 5', '2013-10-17 12:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117241, 1087004, 8759, '<td valign="top">It does depict the windmill but it lacks the fight. It also appears to be a replica and looses authenticity. The composition is fine but the whites are to dim hence lacking contrast. 4</td>', 'It does depict the windmill but it lacks the fight. It also appears to be a replica and looses authenticity. The composition is fine but the whites are to dim hence lacking contrast. 4', '2013-10-17 12:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
