(7117251, 1086914, 8759, '<td valign="top">Seems like a good composition only a bit too much of the subject in the foreground which to me seems to hold the movement inspired. Lovely contrast and exposure, nicely isolated form the black background. 6</td>', 'Seems like a good composition only a bit too much of the subject in the foreground which to me seems to hold the movement inspired. Lovely contrast and exposure, nicely isolated form the black background. 6', '2013-10-17 12:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
