(7117291, 1087048, 153814, '<td valign="top">Very nice it has a certain mystical moodiness to it.<br/>Well done.</td>', 'Very nice it has a certain mystical moodiness to it.Well done.', '2013-10-17 15:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117297, 1087086, 153814, '<td valign="top">Very ominous looking. Well done.</td>', 'Very ominous looking. Well done.', '2013-10-17 15:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117332, 1087208, 50695, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle. The composition is low-energy, cropped close to the subject but not quite touching the edge except for the bottom. 4</td>', 'Interesting angle. The composition is low-energy, cropped close to the subject but not quite touching the edge except for the bottom. 4', '2013-10-17 17:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117335, 1086936, 50695, '<td valign="top">For me, the fishnets and boots are a little surprising, coming out of that print dress. This sort of friction is reminiscent of Alice being out of place in Wonderland. You could also say her iPod is a wonderland that she is currently lost in. So, there is some connection there. Negatives are a rather dull composition, plus I''m not fond of candids of people absorbed in their iAnythings. 4</td>', 'For me, the fishnets and boots are a little surprising, coming out of that print dress. This sort of friction is reminiscent of Alice being out of place in Wonderland. You could also say her iPod is a wonderland that she is currently lost in. So, there is some connection there. Negatives are a rather dull composition, plus I''m not fond of candids of people absorbed in their iAnythings. 4', '2013-10-17 17:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117336, 1086978, 50695, '<td valign="top">The yellow line on the left really helps the composition. So does the contrast between yellow and blue. But now I''ve run out of things to say about the image. 4</td>', 'The yellow line on the left really helps the composition. So does the contrast between yellow and blue. But now I''ve run out of things to say about the image. 4', '2013-10-17 17:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117339, 1087120, 50695, '<td valign="top">Not familiar with the book, which leaves me with the photo. It''s not very interesting to me. Yes, it''s an airport. And? 3</td>', 'Not familiar with the book, which leaves me with the photo. It''s not very interesting to me. Yes, it''s an airport. And? 3', '2013-10-17 17:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117340, 1086479, 68504, '<td valign="top">Great photo of sky and horizon. Better seen at a much larger size, I suspect. I would crop two thirds of the verdure at bottom for a better composition Marginal connection to the novel, although having now read a synopsis, I look forward to reading it thanks to you. 5</td>', 'Great photo of sky and horizon. Better seen at a much larger size, I suspect. I would crop two thirds of the verdure at bottom for a better composition Marginal connection to the novel, although having now read a synopsis, I look forward to reading it thanks to you. 5', '2013-10-17 17:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117341, 1087141, 50695, '<td valign="top">Not crazy about the slight touch of purple combined with pure whites in other areas. It''s not pleasing to my eye. The architecture is interesting, but the puffed up processing is too melodramatic for my taste. 4</td>', 'Not crazy about the slight touch of purple combined with pure whites in other areas. It''s not pleasing to my eye. The architecture is interesting, but the puffed up processing is too melodramatic for my taste. 4', '2013-10-17 17:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117343, 1086989, 50695, '<td valign="top">Lovely light. The composition isn''t stunning, but it''s okay. I do like the power lines leading down out of frame, and the layers of black, blue and yellow... yes, I do like the limited palette while still being a color photo. 6</td>', 'Lovely light. The composition isn''t stunning, but it''s okay. I do like the power lines leading down out of frame, and the layers of black, blue and yellow... yes, I do like the limited palette while still being a color photo. 6', '2013-10-17 17:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117345, 1087192, 50695, '<td valign="top">I find the composition low energy with its centered subject cut off in an uninteresting place. You nailed the focus, but to what end? So we can look very closely at his head? What''s inside that head? I still don''t know. 3</td>', 'I find the composition low energy with its centered subject cut off in an uninteresting place. You nailed the focus, but to what end? So we can look very closely at his head? What''s inside that head? I still don''t know. 3', '2013-10-17 17:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117349, 1087187, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''m tired of this genre of façade photos. The textures are nice, though. This place seems more condemned than poor. I wonder if some perspective correction would have made the top of the photo work better. I like the bottom. 5</td>', 'I''m tired of this genre of façade photos. The textures are nice, though. This place seems more condemned than poor. I wonder if some perspective correction would have made the top of the photo work better. I like the bottom. 5', '2013-10-17 17:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117354, 1087100, 50695, '<td valign="top">The photo is too dark and contrived for my taste. The large area of black on top just makes it seem like you ran out of props and costumes. In general, I think if your photo is going to be largely black, it feels contrived to have one portion be well lit and the rest completely invisible. 2</td>', 'The photo is too dark and contrived for my taste. The large area of black on top just makes it seem like you ran out of props and costumes. In general, I think if your photo is going to be largely black, it feels contrived to have one portion be well lit and the rest completely invisible. 2', '2013-10-17 17:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117359, 1087004, 50695, '<td valign="top">The connection between Don Quixote and windmills is obvious, so you can be neither punished nor rewarded for it. The composition is close-up with the paddles going out of frame, which is good, but I''m not a fan of the orb in lower right... I don''t think anything is counterbalancing it. It "grounds" your image too much. 4</td>', 'The connection between Don Quixote and windmills is obvious, so you can be neither punished nor rewarded for it. The composition is close-up with the paddles going out of frame, which is good, but I''m not a fan of the orb in lower right... I don''t think anything is counterbalancing it. It "grounds" your image too much. 4', '2013-10-17 17:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117377, 1087065, 124815, '<td valign="top">Just as the title says. A good image. I am trying to understand why it does not touch me though, which is of lesser importance but I am one of the viewer of this photo. Must be the directness of the message.<br/>I particularly like the rain, like pointy arrows of the sky.<br/>6</td>', 'Just as the title says. A good image. I am trying to understand why it does not touch me though, which is of lesser importance but I am one of the viewer of this photo. Must be the directness of the message.I particularly like the rain, like pointy arrows of the sky.6', '2013-10-17 18:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117380, 1087007, 124815, '<td valign="top">I understand why this is a popular book in this challenge; easier to stage.<br/>Very good movement of the boy. The hunter being hunted. The quivering trees.<br/>7</td>', 'I understand why this is a popular book in this challenge; easier to stage.Very good movement of the boy. The hunter being hunted. The quivering trees.7', '2013-10-17 18:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117382, 1087135, 124815, '<td valign="top">Sylvia Plath. Did not read the book but I read about it. The photo has a lot of meaning but the butterfly is alive and well while the jar seems to go through hell. Splitting hair. I expected more of a shattering feeling from this picture.<br/>It has every piece that connects it to Plath but lacks the anguish.<br/>7</td>', 'Sylvia Plath. Did not read the book but I read about it. The photo has a lot of meaning but the butterfly is alive and well while the jar seems to go through hell. Splitting hair. I expected more of a shattering feeling from this picture.It has every piece that connects it to Plath but lacks the anguish.7', '2013-10-17 18:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117384, 1087023, 100831, '<td valign="top">Great idea for the title. I love the contrary blues and golds and the tilt works really well IMO.</td>', 'Great idea for the title. I love the contrary blues and golds and the tilt works really well IMO.', '2013-10-17 18:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117385, 1087152, 124815, '<td valign="top">I keep on looking at this shot. Great idea here to accompany Huxley. <br/><i>How beauteous mankind is! O brave new world</i> <br/>There is a great sense of loneliness.<br/>It took me a while to see the egg, I wished that you did something more interesting with the red, but all in all, a very strong image.<br/>8</td>', 'I keep on looking at this shot. Great idea here to accompany Huxley. How beauteous mankind is! O brave new world There is a great sense of loneliness.It took me a while to see the egg, I wished that you did something more interesting with the red, but all in all, a very strong image.8', '2013-10-17 18:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117387, 1086999, 124815, '<td valign="top">Too bad that you did not find a boy to hold the bowl. There are a few inconsistencies here determined mostly by the awkwardness of the sitter. I would be happy if you will revisit this idea. I would like to see the result.<br/>5</td>', 'Too bad that you did not find a boy to hold the bowl. There are a few inconsistencies here determined mostly by the awkwardness of the sitter. I would be happy if you will revisit this idea. I would like to see the result.5', '2013-10-17 18:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117394, 1087170, 124815, '<td valign="top">Could be a page from his book anytime. As a photo, I am not impressed with it. I mean, outside of this challenge the photo does not stand on its own in my opinion. <br/>5</td>', 'Could be a page from his book anytime. As a photo, I am not impressed with it. I mean, outside of this challenge the photo does not stand on its own in my opinion. 5', '2013-10-17 19:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
