(7117409, 1087198, 124815, '<td valign="top">You found a good enough hat and a young, slender man, and the title goes well with the portrait only that it does not go too well with Joyce. It is a good shot but I am not capable to really like it. <br/>5</td>', 'You found a good enough hat and a young, slender man, and the title goes well with the portrait only that it does not go too well with Joyce. It is a good shot but I am not capable to really like it. 5', '2013-10-17 19:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117414, 1086679, 124815, '<td valign="top">I think that there are here too many elements - some quite beautiful such as the crouched silhouette, but a little confusing. There is something that does not attract me here, as I was not attracted to read the book (yet). <br/>5</td>', 'I think that there are here too many elements - some quite beautiful such as the crouched silhouette, but a little confusing. There is something that does not attract me here, as I was not attracted to read the book (yet). 5', '2013-10-17 19:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117421, 1087001, 124815, '<td valign="top">This shot is definitely less suitable for the radiance of the novel. I do not like to see here the rear end of this creature that seems in search of food instead of weaving a marvel for our amazement. <br/>5 for the effort</td>', 'This shot is definitely less suitable for the radiance of the novel. I do not like to see here the rear end of this creature that seems in search of food instead of weaving a marvel for our amazement. 5 for the effort', '2013-10-17 19:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117422, 1086987, 100975, '<td valign="top">I can see this as an interpretation of a water baby.  The person is a fish until redemption.<br/> <br/>The image looks like watercolor.  I like that.  The one distraction for me is the yellow wisps at the top right of the image.  They keep pulling my eye away.  Overall I like the image.<br/> <br/>Gave it a 5</td>', 'I can see this as an interpretation of a water baby.  The person is a fish until redemption. The image looks like watercolor.  I like that.  The one distraction for me is the yellow wisps at the top right of the image.  They keep pulling my eye away.  Overall I like the image. Gave it a 5', '2013-10-17 20:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117434, 1087187, 100975, '<td valign="top">I get the poverty in the picture as a reference to the book.<br/>The thing that keeps me from scoring this higher is that the image feels to distort a little and leaves me feeling a little off balanced.  I would also like to see a little more contrast overall.<br/> <br/>Gave it a 4</td>', 'I get the poverty in the picture as a reference to the book.The thing that keeps me from scoring this higher is that the image feels to distort a little and leaves me feeling a little off balanced.  I would also like to see a little more contrast overall. Gave it a 4', '2013-10-17 20:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117436, 1087194, 124815, '<td valign="top">Did not read the novel and I believe that this reenactment is as accurate as it could be but the picture does not inspire me much in terms of a good photograph. Could be a good as reference photo.<br/>5</td>', 'Did not read the novel and I believe that this reenactment is as accurate as it could be but the picture does not inspire me much in terms of a good photograph. Could be a good as reference photo.5', '2013-10-17 20:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117438, 1087120, 68178, '<td valign="top">This is a shot that not many people can take. Fits the challenge well, but doesn''t really wow me. I do like the controls in the lower portion of the shot, but don''t like the bright daylight and plain sky. 5</td>', 'This is a shot that not many people can take. Fits the challenge well, but doesn''t really wow me. I do like the controls in the lower portion of the shot, but don''t like the bright daylight and plain sky. 5', '2013-10-17 20:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117442, 1087125, 68178, '<td valign="top">This really could use some dramatic clouds with a sunrise or sunset, or at least just a better time of day''s light. The vague link to literature, and a deeper story with it is my main gripe though. 4</td>', 'This really could use some dramatic clouds with a sunrise or sunset, or at least just a better time of day''s light. The vague link to literature, and a deeper story with it is my main gripe though. 4', '2013-10-17 20:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117443, 1087195, 124815, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape, delicate but falls short for this challenge and it seems just chosen to suit the title of the novel but not its content that has so much more to say.  <br/>There is a surfeit of sunsets and sunrises in photography and we all try our hands to capture them but they shall be shown sparingly for more effect.<br/>5</td>', 'Nice landscape, delicate but falls short for this challenge and it seems just chosen to suit the title of the novel but not its content that has so much more to say.  There is a surfeit of sunsets and sunrises in photography and we all try our hands to capture them but they shall be shown sparingly for more effect.5', '2013-10-17 20:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117445, 1087183, 103142, '<td valign="top">I wish I was getting the connection on this one, but I''m not. :(<br/> <br/>I like the awkwardness of the feet and the hand and I like the color palette. However, in thinking all the way through the story, I''m just not coming up with a connection (unless eating the apple makes you nearsighted first. :)<br/> <br/>Sorry. -5-</td>', 'I wish I was getting the connection on this one, but I''m not. :( I like the awkwardness of the feet and the hand and I like the color palette. However, in thinking all the way through the story, I''m just not coming up with a connection (unless eating the apple makes you nearsighted first. :) Sorry. -5-', '2013-10-17 20:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117448, 1086986, 124815, '<td valign="top">Excellent for the book and a powerful image in its own right. I like how the boys become one with the wild nature. The ribs are like the frowzled background<br/><strike>8 (for now)</strike> <br/>I am quite haunted by the look of these boys.<br/>9</td>', 'Excellent for the book and a powerful image in its own right. I like how the boys become one with the wild nature. The ribs are like the frowzled background8 (for now) I am quite haunted by the look of these boys.9', '2013-10-17 20:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117450, 1087188, 103142, '<td valign="top">Are these women, though?? <br/> <br/>I like the swirling of the runners. I wish you could have taken down the bright light streak at the top of the photo -- it really draws the eye away from the wonderful frenzy. -6-</td>', 'Are these women, though??  I like the swirling of the runners. I wish you could have taken down the bright light streak at the top of the photo -- it really draws the eye away from the wonderful frenzy. -6-', '2013-10-17 20:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117451, 1086936, 68178, '<td valign="top">At first I didn''t think that this played well with the story. I''m still on the fence, but in a weird way I can see her falling down a rabbit hole into a much different version of the story. 5</td>', 'At first I didn''t think that this played well with the story. I''m still on the fence, but in a weird way I can see her falling down a rabbit hole into a much different version of the story. 5', '2013-10-17 20:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117452, 1087151, 103142, '<td valign="top">This one took me a second until I thought back through the book. Part of me wants the boy to be lighter, part of me likes just how dark he is. The stones on the left seem intrusive, though. I''m curious what it would look like cropped in more, or with a heavier vignette, something to de-emphasize the stone since the rest is so wonderfully subtle. -7-</td>', 'This one took me a second until I thought back through the book. Part of me wants the boy to be lighter, part of me likes just how dark he is. The stones on the left seem intrusive, though. I''m curious what it would look like cropped in more, or with a heavier vignette, something to de-emphasize the stone since the rest is so wonderfully subtle. -7-', '2013-10-17 20:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117453, 1087100, 103142, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, and nice bowl, but I''m feeling that it''s too dark. Perhaps it''s the heavy shadows between the fingers -- because I like the idea of the back of the bowl and the person disappearing. -6-</td>', 'Nice idea, and nice bowl, but I''m feeling that it''s too dark. Perhaps it''s the heavy shadows between the fingers -- because I like the idea of the back of the bowl and the person disappearing. -6-', '2013-10-17 21:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117455, 1087162, 68178, '<td valign="top">This is another of the shots in this challenge that not only matches title but story, and in a way that brings it to life. I''m blown away by the setup, and the inclusion of the painting in particular. 9</td>', 'This is another of the shots in this challenge that not only matches title but story, and in a way that brings it to life. I''m blown away by the setup, and the inclusion of the painting in particular. 9', '2013-10-17 21:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117457, 1087100, 119419, '<td valign="top">An odd look, I feel I want to turn it upside down for some strange reason. The low key approach is ok, but the emptiness above the bowl leaves me feeling just that, not as an effect of the topic, but there is something lacking in the composition. Probably, because they are a man''s hands you were without a boyish model, a low key face would have completed the picture for me.5.</td>', 'An odd look, I feel I want to turn it upside down for some strange reason. The low key approach is ok, but the emptiness above the bowl leaves me feeling just that, not as an effect of the topic, but there is something lacking in the composition. Probably, because they are a man''s hands you were without a boyish model, a low key face would have completed the picture for me.5.', '2013-10-17 21:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117458, 1087219, 100975, '<td valign="top">Black Swan...I get it.<br/> <br/>It seems a little dull to me.  Maybe more detail in the face area and maybe a little different composition would have made this a nicer image for me.<br/> <br/>gave it a 4</td>', 'Black Swan...I get it. It seems a little dull to me.  Maybe more detail in the face area and maybe a little different composition would have made this a nicer image for me. gave it a 4', '2013-10-17 21:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117459, 1086992, 68178, '<td valign="top">Very well done. The grain, the solemn worn look, the broken window, the darkness in the house all lend to the story, and not just the title. 8</td>', 'Very well done. The grain, the solemn worn look, the broken window, the darkness in the house all lend to the story, and not just the title. 8', '2013-10-17 21:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117460, 1087201, 100975, '<td valign="top">I particularly do not like the image myself.  The colors seem over processed and there are weird tendril looking shapes all in the photo.  The image is too dark and could have used better lighting or a longer exposure.  The idea is good, but the execution is lacking.<br/> <br/>gave it a 2</td>', 'I particularly do not like the image myself.  The colors seem over processed and there are weird tendril looking shapes all in the photo.  The image is too dark and could have used better lighting or a longer exposure.  The idea is good, but the execution is lacking. gave it a 2', '2013-10-17 21:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117461, 1086433, 100975, '<td valign="top">Not rating, but I like it.  When you first showed us the image, it made me think of a robot that would fire a laser down upon some town or whatever.  I like the clouds in the sky.  Seems apocalyptic...</td>', 'Not rating, but I like it.  When you first showed us the image, it made me think of a robot that would fire a laser down upon some town or whatever.  I like the clouds in the sky.  Seems apocalyptic...', '2013-10-17 21:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117462, 1087065, 119419, '<td valign="top">A well produced work, good choice with mono and the rain. I like the symbolism of distress/despair. I have a dislike for those eye prop things from overexposure to the zombie zombies, but they reinforce the story. Composition is good with good bokeh. Nice work.8.</td>', 'A well produced work, good choice with mono and the rain. I like the symbolism of distress/despair. I have a dislike for those eye prop things from overexposure to the zombie zombies, but they reinforce the story. Composition is good with good bokeh. Nice work.8.', '2013-10-17 21:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117464, 1087188, 119419, '<td valign="top">A good blur, gives the feeling of a marathon and the man at the back. Doesn''t quite connect enough to the novel in any other way for me, but I like the shot all the same.5.</td>', 'A good blur, gives the feeling of a marathon and the man at the back. Doesn''t quite connect enough to the novel in any other way for me, but I like the shot all the same.5.', '2013-10-17 21:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117467, 1087210, 68178, '<td valign="top">This definitely ties well to the story. The light and the sky work well, but there is some weird spotting on the ground. The horse is alternately a tad over sharp, and a tad over smoothed in spots. 5</td>', 'This definitely ties well to the story. The light and the sky work well, but there is some weird spotting on the ground. The horse is alternately a tad over sharp, and a tad over smoothed in spots. 5', '2013-10-17 21:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117469, 1086744, 119419, '<td valign="top">A literal interpretation, good focus on the droplets, Charlotte is a bit of a blob though, don''t know if that is her best side. An interesting one to wander the eye through all the same.5.</td>', 'A literal interpretation, good focus on the droplets, Charlotte is a bit of a blob though, don''t know if that is her best side. An interesting one to wander the eye through all the same.5.', '2013-10-17 21:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117480, 1086700, 100975, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting in the photo and the B &amp; W.  Not sure how the net and the scissors play into this, but I have never read the book.<br/> <br/>I give it a 7</td>', 'I like the lighting in the photo and the B & W.  Not sure how the net and the scissors play into this, but I have never read the book. I give it a 7', '2013-10-17 21:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117484, 1087120, 100975, '<td valign="top">Although this may have been a planned shot, it seems to me like a snapshot out a plane window.  There is no appeal in this photo to me.<br/> <br/>Gave it a 3</td>', 'Although this may have been a planned shot, it seems to me like a snapshot out a plane window.  There is no appeal in this photo to me. Gave it a 3', '2013-10-17 21:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117486, 1087192, 119419, '<td valign="top">Call of the Wild is a hard one, while a good shot of the lizzy, there''s nothing for me to connect a reptile with Buck the sled dog in Alaska. The primary theme of the story is of survival and a return to primitivism, I can see somewhat that thought process here, and understand the constraints of coming up with the dog, snow, trappers etc anyway I like the shot regardless.5.</td>', 'Call of the Wild is a hard one, while a good shot of the lizzy, there''s nothing for me to connect a reptile with Buck the sled dog in Alaska. The primary theme of the story is of survival and a return to primitivism, I can see somewhat that thought process here, and understand the constraints of coming up with the dog, snow, trappers etc anyway I like the shot regardless.5.', '2013-10-17 21:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117490, 1086761, 100975, '<td valign="top">On its own, this is kind of a cool photo.  Not really sure how this relates to Les Miserables other than pavement.<br/> <br/>If I was judging just on the photo, I would give it a 6 or 7, but due to the challenge, I give it a 4</td>', 'On its own, this is kind of a cool photo.  Not really sure how this relates to Les Miserables other than pavement. If I was judging just on the photo, I would give it a 6 or 7, but due to the challenge, I give it a 4', '2013-10-17 21:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117504, 1087219, 119419, '<td valign="top">The task of this challenge is a little like the Black Swan theory. "The extreme impact of certain kinds of rare and unpredictable events (outliers) and humans'' tendency to find simplistic explanations for these events retrospectively" ;) I like the pose, mono secures a black swan too. The image has a pleasing graphic about it.5.</td>', 'The task of this challenge is a little like the Black Swan theory. "The extreme impact of certain kinds of rare and unpredictable events (outliers) and humans'' tendency to find simplistic explanations for these events retrospectively" ;) I like the pose, mono secures a black swan too. The image has a pleasing graphic about it.5.', '2013-10-17 21:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117510, 1087207, 100975, '<td valign="top">I get the cabbage and cards.  I think this could have been staged a lot better to make it more interesting.  The lighting on the cabbage is good.<br/> <br/>Gave it a 3</td>', 'I get the cabbage and cards.  I think this could have been staged a lot better to make it more interesting.  The lighting on the cabbage is good. Gave it a 3', '2013-10-17 21:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117531, 1087055, 119419, '<td valign="top">Sure does have that alluring look. This one raises a lot more issues than what I would perceive as the first reading of the novel. Lighting is a bit uneven, the models stance and wardrobe does support the theme, and her gaze is spot on.5.</td>', 'Sure does have that alluring look. This one raises a lot more issues than what I would perceive as the first reading of the novel. Lighting is a bit uneven, the models stance and wardrobe does support the theme, and her gaze is spot on.5.', '2013-10-17 21:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117532, 1087152, 68178, '<td valign="top">A funny take on the book. Looks like hot sauce blood? Would have like to see some of the offspring, even if just a shadow or something. 5</td>', 'A funny take on the book. Looks like hot sauce blood? Would have like to see some of the offspring, even if just a shadow or something. 5', '2013-10-17 21:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117534, 1087125, 124982, '<td valign="top">It is a quite lovely pond at that! The overall scene lacks some contrast though, maybe shooting early morning or late afternoon would give it more of a "golden" look.</td>', 'It is a quite lovely pond at that! The overall scene lacks some contrast though, maybe shooting early morning or late afternoon would give it more of a "golden" look.', '2013-10-17 21:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117536, 1087141, 100975, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of the photo.  The lighting is great and the clouds look cool.<br/> <br/>Gave it an 8</td>', 'I like the composition of the photo.  The lighting is great and the clouds look cool. Gave it an 8', '2013-10-17 21:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117537, 1087055, 124982, '<td valign="top">Not sure what to say really. Although I''m sure that probably won''t be the case with some other more vocal voters! Composition is lacking, more seductive posing required.</td>', 'Not sure what to say really. Although I''m sure that probably won''t be the case with some other more vocal voters! Composition is lacking, more seductive posing required.', '2013-10-17 21:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117538, 1087219, 124982, '<td valign="top">You have quite the black swan here, so definitely meet the challenge. Unfortunately said swan is heavily over-processed. The feathers and eye look too unnatural and robs the beast of it''s beauty and elegance.</td>', 'You have quite the black swan here, so definitely meet the challenge. Unfortunately said swan is heavily over-processed. The feathers and eye look too unnatural and robs the beast of it''s beauty and elegance.', '2013-10-17 21:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117541, 1086683, 124982, '<td valign="top">I want to like this from a creativity viewpoint, but I just don''t see the connection to the Book title. Is that my fault or yours? I''ll reserve voting while I ponder this some more.</td>', 'I want to like this from a creativity viewpoint, but I just don''t see the connection to the Book title. Is that my fault or yours? I''ll reserve voting while I ponder this some more.', '2013-10-17 21:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117543, 1086986, 100975, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool shot.  I like how you can see the bones of the kids.  Makes it look like they have been in search of food.  The best part of the photo is the kid in the bottom left...just peeking out a little.<br/> <br/>Gave it a 6</td>', 'Pretty cool shot.  I like how you can see the bones of the kids.  Makes it look like they have been in search of food.  The best part of the photo is the kid in the bottom left...just peeking out a little. Gave it a 6', '2013-10-17 21:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117544, 1087194, 124982, '<td valign="top">Nice capture! Great timing on the explosion with the smoke and dust! If find the processing a little over-cooked. What appears to be HDR/tonemapping has robbed it of it''s gritty character, though.</td>', 'Nice capture! Great timing on the explosion with the smoke and dust! If find the processing a little over-cooked. What appears to be HDR/tonemapping has robbed it of it''s gritty character, though.', '2013-10-17 21:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117545, 1086340, 68504, '<td valign="top">I am giving this a 3 because it is nicely lighted and composed, and does indeed related to the book. Taking 7 points away because I am bored to death with little toys, and although well arranged, there is not really any story or drama or interactions. You can do better.</td>', 'I am giving this a 3 because it is nicely lighted and composed, and does indeed related to the book. Taking 7 points away because I am bored to death with little toys, and although well arranged, there is not really any story or drama or interactions. You can do better.', '2013-10-17 21:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117547, 1087222, 124982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition, I really like the rusty car and the pose of the woman! But... wow...the processing has killed this so bad! Way too overboard. While HDR/Tonemapping may suit the car and surrounding structure, it is lethal to people. Notice how her legs look like they''re made of plastic and how her dress like it''s made from wax. I think you had a great image here, I really do but the choice of heavy-handed processing undid it.</td>', 'Wonderful composition, I really like the rusty car and the pose of the woman! But... wow...the processing has killed this so bad! Way too overboard. While HDR/Tonemapping may suit the car and surrounding structure, it is lethal to people. Notice how her legs look like they''re made of plastic and how her dress like it''s made from wax. I think you had a great image here, I really do but the choice of heavy-handed processing undid it.', '2013-10-17 21:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117549, 1087048, 68178, '<td valign="top">The tie to the story is loose on this, but it is there. Would like better light, and maybe more emphasis on the path through the trees behind. 5</td>', 'The tie to the story is loose on this, but it is there. Would like better light, and maybe more emphasis on the path through the trees behind. 5', '2013-10-17 21:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117552, 1087093, 100975, '<td valign="top">It''s got some great detail in the face, but it is just a piercing of a cow''s?? nose.  I know it goes with the title of the book, but the theme of the book has nothing to really do with this...at least from what I read about it. Maybe a different piercing with a dark undertone or something?<br/> <br/>I gave it a 3.</td>', 'It''s got some great detail in the face, but it is just a piercing of a cow''s?? nose.  I know it goes with the title of the book, but the theme of the book has nothing to really do with this...at least from what I read about it. Maybe a different piercing with a dark undertone or something? I gave it a 3.', '2013-10-17 21:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117553, 1086979, 100975, '<td valign="top">It''s been a long time since I have read the book so.....<br/>This does not seem like an image that suggest Brave New World to me.<br/>I like how you have captured the light in the photo, and I like the foreground grass, but the overall image does not doesn''t piece together well for me.<br/> <br/>I gave it a 3.</td>', 'It''s been a long time since I have read the book so.....This does not seem like an image that suggest Brave New World to me.I like how you have captured the light in the photo, and I like the foreground grass, but the overall image does not doesn''t piece together well for me. I gave it a 3.', '2013-10-17 21:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117554, 1086914, 100975, '<td valign="top">Ok, so the plant is an aspidistra, but other than that, I don''t see the relationship with the book other than the one word in the title.<br/> <br/>For the pic:<br/>It would have been a good play on words had the plant been suspended in air or something.  I would have liked to have seen more detail in the greener areas as well.  Maybe a thinner angle for the bottom of the leaf too.<br/> <br/>Gave it a 3</td>', 'Ok, so the plant is an aspidistra, but other than that, I don''t see the relationship with the book other than the one word in the title. For the pic:It would have been a good play on words had the plant been suspended in air or something.  I would have liked to have seen more detail in the greener areas as well.  Maybe a thinner angle for the bottom of the leaf too. Gave it a 3', '2013-10-17 21:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117555, 1087208, 100975, '<td valign="top">Alright, so my take on the photo.<br/> <br/>I can see some literal translations in this photo...<br/>One obviously the animal is calling...and it is wild.  Got it.<br/>Now for the stretch...the dog''s name is Buck.  I guess this animal would be a Buck if that is how they name the male.<br/> <br/>The image is just ok to me.  It doesn''t really make me feel anything.  The whites on the body would be better if there was more contrast.  I would also like to see more detail in the horns.  It looks like they have great texture.<br/> <br/>Gave it a 3</td>', 'Alright, so my take on the photo. I can see some literal translations in this photo...One obviously the animal is calling...and it is wild.  Got it.Now for the stretch...the dog''s name is Buck.  I guess this animal would be a Buck if that is how they name the male. The image is just ok to me.  It doesn''t really make me feel anything.  The whites on the body would be better if there was more contrast.  I would also like to see more detail in the horns.  It looks like they have great texture. Gave it a 3', '2013-10-17 21:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117556, 1087198, 100975, '<td valign="top">I like the shot.  I particularly like the expression on his face...almost a look of destitution.  I am not getting Irish as much as I am getting Amish.  I know Amish isn''t a nationality, and I guess you could have Amish Irishmen.<br/> <br/>I give it a 6</td>', 'I like the shot.  I particularly like the expression on his face...almost a look of destitution.  I am not getting Irish as much as I am getting Amish.  I know Amish isn''t a nationality, and I guess you could have Amish Irishmen. I give it a 6', '2013-10-17 21:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117558, 1086939, 100975, '<td valign="top">The photo seems a little odd to me.  I personally do not like the dark clouds and the blue/gray sky.  I guess the photo seems a little choppy and doesn''t really flow throughout.<br/> <br/>Gave it a 3</td>', 'The photo seems a little odd to me.  I personally do not like the dark clouds and the blue/gray sky.  I guess the photo seems a little choppy and doesn''t really flow throughout. Gave it a 3', '2013-10-17 21:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
