(7117568, 1087078, 124982, '<td valign="top">Quite a peculiar image, not quite sure what I am looking at..and in that, I find it intriguing and deserving of a longer look. The processing is a little extreme and contrasty for my tastes though, wish it was a little more subdued.</td>', 'Quite a peculiar image, not quite sure what I am looking at..and in that, I find it intriguing and deserving of a longer look. The processing is a little extreme and contrasty for my tastes though, wish it was a little more subdued.', '2013-10-17 21:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117569, 1087039, 124982, '<td valign="top">Nice urban landscape and choice of blue tint. Always feel it works well with buildings! Compositionally I find this lacking a little with all the distracting elements. Maybe some skyscrapers with a nice dramatic sky would''ve had more effect/impact?</td>', 'Nice urban landscape and choice of blue tint. Always feel it works well with buildings! Compositionally I find this lacking a little with all the distracting elements. Maybe some skyscrapers with a nice dramatic sky would''ve had more effect/impact?', '2013-10-17 21:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117570, 1087015, 124982, '<td valign="top">Not a huge fan of this processing, which seems a little extreme for my tastes. Choice of B&amp;W doesn''t seem to benefit it much. Wonder how it would''ve looked in color, with some more subtle processing?</td>', 'Not a huge fan of this processing, which seems a little extreme for my tastes. Choice of B&W doesn''t seem to benefit it much. Wonder how it would''ve looked in color, with some more subtle processing?', '2013-10-17 22:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117573, 1087192, 124982, '<td valign="top">So SHARP! Absolutely love this shot. Really like the tones and blur of the background. Image is crying for a tighter crop - although I know you were restrained with what you could do at the time! Hope it''s doing well for you!</td>', 'So SHARP! Absolutely love this shot. Really like the tones and blur of the background. Image is crying for a tighter crop - although I know you were restrained with what you could do at the time! Hope it''s doing well for you!', '2013-10-17 22:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117574, 1087057, 68178, '<td valign="top">The gentle waves on the water, the warm autumn sun at the waters edge, the river itself all reflect the story well. 6</td>', 'The gentle waves on the water, the warm autumn sun at the waters edge, the river itself all reflect the story well. 6', '2013-10-17 22:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117575, 1087222, 68178, '<td valign="top">The title says you didn''t intend a direct tie to the story. The girl fits the stories era, but the rest of the scene doesn''t really. Overall an interesting take. My biggest gripe is the excess smoothing on the girl. 5</td>', 'The title says you didn''t intend a direct tie to the story. The girl fits the stories era, but the rest of the scene doesn''t really. Overall an interesting take. My biggest gripe is the excess smoothing on the girl. 5', '2013-10-17 22:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117576, 1086987, 68504, '<td valign="top">A bit of stretch from this strange tale. Kingsley was a distant relative of my partner''s; as well my father and his siblings were models for the American illustrator of a later edition. Later, Kingsley did really go off his rocker, and your fish maybe illustrate his strange intense energy more than anything else. 5</td>', 'A bit of stretch from this strange tale. Kingsley was a distant relative of my partner''s; as well my father and his siblings were models for the American illustrator of a later edition. Later, Kingsley did really go off his rocker, and your fish maybe illustrate his strange intense energy more than anything else. 5', '2013-10-17 22:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117579, 1087122, 68178, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit too much like a grab at the title and not so much the story. The processing on the back row of trees comes off well, but the middle and forward trees it doesn''t work as well. I do like the herons on the bank, but not really relevant to this. 5</td>', 'Seems a bit too much like a grab at the title and not so much the story. The processing on the back row of trees comes off well, but the middle and forward trees it doesn''t work as well. I do like the herons on the bank, but not really relevant to this. 5', '2013-10-17 22:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117581, 1087100, 68504, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of interpreting this literally and abstractly at the same time. But I must confess I am bothered by what looks like a nice teak salad bowl - at once too specific to be abstract, too large and inappropriate to be authentic. Everything counts in a picture, and is more easily counted in a minimal one. 5</td>', 'I like the idea of interpreting this literally and abstractly at the same time. But I must confess I am bothered by what looks like a nice teak salad bowl - at once too specific to be abstract, too large and inappropriate to be authentic. Everything counts in a picture, and is more easily counted in a minimal one. 5', '2013-10-17 22:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117583, 1086992, 68504, '<td valign="top">gritty, appropriate and effective. 7</td>', 'gritty, appropriate and effective. 7', '2013-10-17 22:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117584, 1087007, 68504, '<td valign="top">oh yes, the tension and the drama, boy with sticks looking over his shoulder. the heart of the book. 8</td>', 'oh yes, the tension and the drama, boy with sticks looking over his shoulder. the heart of the book. 8', '2013-10-17 22:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117585, 1086979, 124982, '<td valign="top">No matter what the naysayers say, I totally dig this, Paddy!</td>', 'No matter what the naysayers say, I totally dig this, Paddy!', '2013-10-17 22:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117587, 1087152, 68504, '<td valign="top">chilling. as it should be.  it is obvious what it is, how you set it up, but the initial impression(s) are highly visceral. 7</td>', 'chilling. as it should be.  it is obvious what it is, how you set it up, but the initial impression(s) are highly visceral. 7', '2013-10-17 22:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117589, 1087208, 30861, '<td valign="top">Well, that''s an extraordinary view isn''t it? He''s definitely bugling, too :-) The eyes are fantastic. Works fine with the book.<br/> <br/>I''ll give it a 7.</td>', 'Well, that''s an extraordinary view isn''t it? He''s definitely bugling, too :-) The eyes are fantastic. Works fine with the book. I''ll give it a 7.', '2013-10-17 22:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117591, 1087205, 30861, '<td valign="top">"In Search of Lost Time" or, more commonly in English, "Remembrance of Things Past", Proust''s masterpiece and a seminal work of literature. While I might have been more engaged by some stale, dusty <i>madeleines</i>, this works quite well for me: there''s a sort of an aching husk of longing to it.<br/> <br/>7 from me.</td>', '"In Search of Lost Time" or, more commonly in English, "Remembrance of Things Past", Proust''s masterpiece and a seminal work of literature. While I might have been more engaged by some stale, dusty madeleines, this works quite well for me: there''s a sort of an aching husk of longing to it. 7 from me.', '2013-10-17 22:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117619, 1086999, 35804, '<td valign="top">4...Oh I wish I could give you more, because I do like your idea, and the fact that you did more than merely search out a title to match an image. This tells me you know a bit of what''s going on between the covers. I''ve handed you a 4 becasue I think this is poorly crafted. There is that weird little hot white pixel above the left side of his head. There is also a grayish one right above the left thumb. Maybe it''s stuff on the ground, but it could have been cloned or healed away.There is also a haloing around some edges, perhaps from over sharpening. It''s also noisy. I don''t mind some natural looking grain sort of noise, and sometimes digital noise works, but for this image I don''t care for it. Lastly, the B&amp;W conversion is quite flat. I think a simple levels or curve adjustment might help that. Simple little technical fixes would make this quite a nice little photograph.</td>', '4...Oh I wish I could give you more, because I do like your idea, and the fact that you did more than merely search out a title to match an image. This tells me you know a bit of what''s going on between the covers. I''ve handed you a 4 becasue I think this is poorly crafted. There is that weird little hot white pixel above the left side of his head. There is also a grayish one right above the left thumb. Maybe it''s stuff on the ground, but it could have been cloned or healed away.There is also a haloing around some edges, perhaps from over sharpening. It''s also noisy. I don''t mind some natural looking grain sort of noise, and sometimes digital noise works, but for this image I don''t care for it. Lastly, the B&W conversion is quite flat. I think a simple levels or curve adjustment might help that. Simple little technical fixes would make this quite a nice little photograph.', '2013-10-17 23:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117620, 1086939, 35804, '<td valign="top">4...I love how the clouds look, very painterly. That being said, it conjures nothing of what the book is actually about. For me, this photograph is more about finding a title to suit an image. i think it might be a little over sharpened too. I can''t tell for sure, if it''s that or some sort of filter effect.</td>', '4...I love how the clouds look, very painterly. That being said, it conjures nothing of what the book is actually about. For me, this photograph is more about finding a title to suit an image. i think it might be a little over sharpened too. I can''t tell for sure, if it''s that or some sort of filter effect.', '2013-10-17 23:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117622, 1087219, 68178, '<td valign="top">Definitely a black swan, and even an outlier. Would have liked a little more distinction between the black and the grey. The chopped top of the neck is a distraction as well. 5</td>', 'Definitely a black swan, and even an outlier. Would have liked a little more distinction between the black and the grey. The chopped top of the neck is a distraction as well. 5', '2013-10-17 23:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117623, 1087022, 35804, '<td valign="top">3...this is so cold and hard. I don''t see a connection to the story at all. Nothing about this says early 20th American South, much less the story of an African American woman making here way through life in that era. To me this just looks like a photograph of another persons sculpture.</td>', '3...this is so cold and hard. I don''t see a connection to the story at all. Nothing about this says early 20th American South, much less the story of an African American woman making here way through life in that era. To me this just looks like a photograph of another persons sculpture.', '2013-10-17 23:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117627, 1086767, 68178, '<td valign="top">Did you find this as is? This is a well staged shot. Not a mockingbird, and not at all relevant to the story, but I can''t help but score it well. 7</td>', 'Did you find this as is? This is a well staged shot. Not a mockingbird, and not at all relevant to the story, but I can''t help but score it well. 7', '2013-10-17 23:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117632, 1086157, 68178, '<td valign="top">Really like the colors and feel. The mist in the trees and the fog feel to the water mixed with the bright yellows and greens feel like out of the story. The major element of the story is fly fishing though and this only has a loose connection there. If this were another challenge I would have bumped it one maybe. 7</td>', 'Really like the colors and feel. The mist in the trees and the fog feel to the water mixed with the bright yellows and greens feel like out of the story. The major element of the story is fly fishing though and this only has a loose connection there. If this were another challenge I would have bumped it one maybe. 7', '2013-10-17 23:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117648, 1087221, 68178, '<td valign="top">Ok, that''s funny! Looking for more story, but at least there is wit. 5</td>', 'Ok, that''s funny! Looking for more story, but at least there is wit. 5', '2013-10-18 00:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117653, 1086453, 68178, '<td valign="top">I like the movement, and really like the colors. The hint of a skull or face lends to the story. Still a tad too abstract. 6</td>', 'I like the movement, and really like the colors. The hint of a skull or face lends to the story. Still a tad too abstract. 6', '2013-10-18 00:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117655, 1087001, 68178, '<td valign="top">A worthy book for this shot, or vise versa. Looks like it even has a tasty snack! 7</td>', 'A worthy book for this shot, or vise versa. Looks like it even has a tasty snack! 7', '2013-10-18 00:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
