(7117839, 1087183, 68504, '<td valign="top">I love this. Barthelme''s Snow White, now of a certain age and, at some strange hesitant remove, texting.  Barthelme is all about text, and she is wise to keep her distance. And the great secret about where in NYC, near tvsometime''s favourite place, she has got slime on her boots.  Barthelme would love that too.<br/> <br/>But you don''t have to know anything about Barthelme, or his Snow White, to appreciate this picture of Snow White. (And the younger and more passive Rose Red, like us, waiting for Mr. Right Scene to flash by). 8 for now.</td>', 'I love this. Barthelme''s Snow White, now of a certain age and, at some strange hesitant remove, texting.  Barthelme is all about text, and she is wise to keep her distance. And the great secret about where in NYC, near tvsometime''s favourite place, she has got slime on her boots.  Barthelme would love that too. But you don''t have to know anything about Barthelme, or his Snow White, to appreciate this picture of Snow White. (And the younger and more passive Rose Red, like us, waiting for Mr. Right Scene to flash by). 8 for now.', '2013-10-18 02:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117840, 1086936, 68504, '<td valign="top">We love it, it is almost vicious. 8</td>', 'We love it, it is almost vicious. 8', '2013-10-18 02:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
