(7117957, 1087055, 8759, '<td valign="top">Very bold entry. The lighting is a bit off. The spot on the hip distracts a bit. Maybe the circumstances did not allow but I would have played more with the poses and the light. 6</td>', 'Very bold entry. The lighting is a bit off. The spot on the hip distracts a bit. Maybe the circumstances did not allow but I would have played more with the poses and the light. 6', '2013-10-18 11:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117958, 1087135, 159196, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured not only the essence of being trapped, but I also feel that the external colors contrast well with the butterfly to create a feeling of depression and darkness. The choice of butterfly is good, as it bears resemblance to the fragile protagonist in the novel, albeit that I''m not sure that I visualized her as this colorful. A 7 from me.</td>', 'You''ve captured not only the essence of being trapped, but I also feel that the external colors contrast well with the butterfly to create a feeling of depression and darkness. The choice of butterfly is good, as it bears resemblance to the fragile protagonist in the novel, albeit that I''m not sure that I visualized her as this colorful. A 7 from me.', '2013-10-18 11:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117960, 1087093, 159196, '<td valign="top">I haven''t read the novel, but read up a little bit about it. Not sure if this portrays the novel well, as I understand it to be quite a weird, dark and violent work. From me 5</td>', 'I haven''t read the novel, but read up a little bit about it. Not sure if this portrays the novel well, as I understand it to be quite a weird, dark and violent work. From me 5', '2013-10-18 11:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117961, 1087188, 159196, '<td valign="top">I kinda like it but the colors (in particular) don''t give me the impression of the thriller it''s supposed to depict. It''s 4 from me.</td>', 'I kinda like it but the colors (in particular) don''t give me the impression of the thriller it''s supposed to depict. It''s 4 from me.', '2013-10-18 11:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117962, 1087055, 159196, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t say that this is erotic. 4</td>', 'I wouldn''t say that this is erotic. 4', '2013-10-18 11:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117964, 1087039, 159196, '<td valign="top">I haven''t read the book, but I think that it''s meant to be set in New York, so I''d expect high rise glass buildings. I do like the mood though. I would have expected to see a hint of the character in the photograph. A 4 from me.</td>', 'I haven''t read the book, but I think that it''s meant to be set in New York, so I''d expect high rise glass buildings. I do like the mood though. I would have expected to see a hint of the character in the photograph. A 4 from me.', '2013-10-18 11:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117966, 1086744, 159196, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge well. Love the web. Charlotte could be a tad sharper. a 6 from me</td>', 'Meets the challenge well. Love the web. Charlotte could be a tad sharper. a 6 from me', '2013-10-18 11:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117968, 1086105, 159196, '<td valign="top">Probably one of my favorites! This is because I perceive it to be difficult to achieve a science fiction look with ordinary things - and you''ve done that very well (although I don''t know where or what this is). The colors work well. A 7 from me</td>', 'Probably one of my favorites! This is because I perceive it to be difficult to achieve a science fiction look with ordinary things - and you''ve done that very well (although I don''t know where or what this is). The colors work well. A 7 from me', '2013-10-18 11:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117969, 1087184, 159196, '<td valign="top">Whilst this doesn''t make me think of a film noir, I really like it, especially the contrast in light, and it''s spot on for the title. A 6 from me</td>', 'Whilst this doesn''t make me think of a film noir, I really like it, especially the contrast in light, and it''s spot on for the title. A 6 from me', '2013-10-18 11:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117970, 1087007, 85430, '<td valign="top">Maybe a preference thing, but I would have cropped out some of the upper left portion of the photo. The image is in monochrome, yet somehow it doesn''t show much of a contrast.<br/> <br/>I like the expression on the subject''s face. The shot feels like it is part of bigger story, which suits the challenge well. <br/> <br/>6 from me.</td>', 'Maybe a preference thing, but I would have cropped out some of the upper left portion of the photo. The image is in monochrome, yet somehow it doesn''t show much of a contrast. I like the expression on the subject''s face. The shot feels like it is part of bigger story, which suits the challenge well.  6 from me.', '2013-10-18 11:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117971, 1087120, 85430, '<td valign="top">The inclusion of the cockpit and dashboard objects did not work out well for me.<br/> <br/>The upper left portion provides opprtunity to crop an image that may work out well for a cover of the chosen novel.<br/> <br/>5 from me.</td>', 'The inclusion of the cockpit and dashboard objects did not work out well for me. The upper left portion provides opprtunity to crop an image that may work out well for a cover of the chosen novel. 5 from me.', '2013-10-18 11:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117973, 1087082, 159196, '<td valign="top">Apt and meets the challenge. The colors hint at turmoil and changes and the overall impression creates the desired atmosphere. A 7 from me</td>', 'Apt and meets the challenge. The colors hint at turmoil and changes and the overall impression creates the desired atmosphere. A 7 from me', '2013-10-18 11:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117974, 1087000, 85430, '<td valign="top">The soft focus on the edges did not work out well for me.  I would have cropped a portrait (as in vertical crop) of the subject, which was nicely captured, and I see that portrait as a nice cover for the selected novel.<br/> <br/>Overall an appealing shot that somehow tells a story. Perfect for the challenge.<br/> <br/>6 from me.</td>', 'The soft focus on the edges did not work out well for me.  I would have cropped a portrait (as in vertical crop) of the subject, which was nicely captured, and I see that portrait as a nice cover for the selected novel. Overall an appealing shot that somehow tells a story. Perfect for the challenge. 6 from me.', '2013-10-18 12:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117975, 1087187, 159196, '<td valign="top">This is exactly how I picture the cover of the book. Black and white works so well for this. The attention to detail is perfect. In my top 3. A 9 from me.</td>', 'This is exactly how I picture the cover of the book. Black and white works so well for this. The attention to detail is perfect. In my top 3. A 9 from me.', '2013-10-18 12:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117976, 1087022, 85430, '<td valign="top">The image was nicely captured -- technically a good photo.  Yet I feel that the symbolism of it all is presented, not by the photography, but by the original piece of art which was photographed here. <br/> <br/>6 would be fair.</td>', 'The image was nicely captured -- technically a good photo.  Yet I feel that the symbolism of it all is presented, not by the photography, but by the original piece of art which was photographed here.  6 would be fair.', '2013-10-18 12:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117977, 1086936, 85430, '<td valign="top">Hmm. Perhaps we read a different novel of the same title, this isn''t the Alice in Wonderland that I remember.<br/> <br/>I am a fan of street portraits though, and perhaps if this was in a street photography challenge, I would have rated this higher. For now I will give this a 5.</td>', 'Hmm. Perhaps we read a different novel of the same title, this isn''t the Alice in Wonderland that I remember. I am a fan of street portraits though, and perhaps if this was in a street photography challenge, I would have rated this higher. For now I will give this a 5.', '2013-10-18 12:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117979, 1087055, 85430, '<td valign="top">I am not familiar with the novel, but if it was about the story of a woman in a sexually oriented literature, then the image doesn''t do it justice.<br/> <br/>Lighting is harsh and doesn''t suit the mood of the image. The exposure and focus on the face seem to be a bit off, and the background is too messy and distracting.<br/> <br/>4 from me.</td>', 'I am not familiar with the novel, but if it was about the story of a woman in a sexually oriented literature, then the image doesn''t do it justice. Lighting is harsh and doesn''t suit the mood of the image. The exposure and focus on the face seem to be a bit off, and the background is too messy and distracting. 4 from me.', '2013-10-18 12:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117982, 1087125, 85430, '<td valign="top">I see that you have aligned the image based on a false horizon. The river may be running diagonally in your frame, and you mistook it for a horizon. But water is flat, and so all reflections must be perfectly vertical, which isn''t the case for your your image.<br/> <br/>5</td>', 'I see that you have aligned the image based on a false horizon. The river may be running diagonally in your frame, and you mistook it for a horizon. But water is flat, and so all reflections must be perfectly vertical, which isn''t the case for your your image. 5', '2013-10-18 12:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117983, 1087198, 85430, '<td valign="top">Wonderful portrait. I am not familiar with the novel, but it doesn''t matter. I like the soft natural light, but a little more contrast may have added some points.<br/> <br/>6</td>', 'Wonderful portrait. I am not familiar with the novel, but it doesn''t matter. I like the soft natural light, but a little more contrast may have added some points. 6', '2013-10-18 12:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117988, 1087093, 85430, '<td valign="top">I am not a border police, and in fact I often use top and bottom black borders myself. Though I wouldn''t do it in a challenge about novels. I was looking forward to portrait images that may work out well as book covers. But that''s probably just me.<br/> <br/>I would have set the focus range up to the eyes and applied selective gaussian to the corners with distracting elements.<br/> <br/>5 from me.</td>', 'I am not a border police, and in fact I often use top and bottom black borders myself. Though I wouldn''t do it in a challenge about novels. I was looking forward to portrait images that may work out well as book covers. But that''s probably just me. I would have set the focus range up to the eyes and applied selective gaussian to the corners with distracting elements. 5 from me.', '2013-10-18 12:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117989, 1086744, 85430, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I would have popped the colors a bit more in PP, but that''s just me. Your image is fine, and in fact id like to give it a 7</td>', 'Beautiful. I would have popped the colors a bit more in PP, but that''s just me. Your image is fine, and in fact id like to give it a 7', '2013-10-18 12:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117991, 1086692, 85430, '<td valign="top">Classic indeed. I see this printed in an overleaf, or perhaps the cover itsslf. 7 from me.</td>', 'Classic indeed. I see this printed in an overleaf, or perhaps the cover itsslf. 7 from me.', '2013-10-18 12:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118000, 1087125, 118154, '<td valign="top">Really just a snap of some water,no merit in my opinion.4.<br/>Classic Novel ?  I believe it was a play that was made into a film.</td>', 'Really just a snap of some water,no merit in my opinion.4.Classic Novel ?  I believe it was a play that was made into a film.', '2013-10-18 12:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
