(7118015, 1086734, 112828, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Great alpine image.<br/> <br/>The book does take place in this setting, so it evokes that.<br/> <br/>I could wish for more story, but this is a good fit, and a very nice image. 7</td>', 'Wow.  Great alpine image. The book does take place in this setting, so it evokes that. I could wish for more story, but this is a good fit, and a very nice image. 7', '2013-10-18 13:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118023, 1087023, 50695, '<td valign="top">A slight evocation of a castle, and I suppose any office building evokes Kafka-esque bureaucracy... plus the windows within windows present a Kafka-esque sort of maze. Outside of the challenge, though, the photo isn''t exciting. 5</td>', 'A slight evocation of a castle, and I suppose any office building evokes Kafka-esque bureaucracy... plus the windows within windows present a Kafka-esque sort of maze. Outside of the challenge, though, the photo isn''t exciting. 5', '2013-10-18 13:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118027, 1087162, 50695, '<td valign="top">wow, this is quite the elaborate set up. Your processing and costumes does invoke the period. I really like the face in the window. Negatives? Well, the composition is not imaginative, making the whole thing seem like an exercise to meet the topic instead of something independent. 6</td>', 'wow, this is quite the elaborate set up. Your processing and costumes does invoke the period. I really like the face in the window. Negatives? Well, the composition is not imaginative, making the whole thing seem like an exercise to meet the topic instead of something independent. 6', '2013-10-18 13:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118030, 1087183, 50695, '<td valign="top">hoo boy, more and more candids of people looking at iPods and iPhones... I guess I will now become the old man who dolefully recalls when people used to look at each other. <br/> <br/>There is an element of humor to this, though. The main character is twisting away from the viewer, in her own world, and the title just imposes a character onto her because of this funny coat-blouse she''s wearing. I like humor, especially when it''s pulled from a candid, so I give you a 6.</td>', 'hoo boy, more and more candids of people looking at iPods and iPhones... I guess I will now become the old man who dolefully recalls when people used to look at each other.  There is an element of humor to this, though. The main character is twisting away from the viewer, in her own world, and the title just imposes a character onto her because of this funny coat-blouse she''s wearing. I like humor, especially when it''s pulled from a candid, so I give you a 6.', '2013-10-18 13:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118032, 1087071, 50695, '<td valign="top">The concept is obvious and done to death. I do like the odd composition, though... rather oppressive like the book. 5</td>', 'The concept is obvious and done to death. I do like the odd composition, though... rather oppressive like the book. 5', '2013-10-18 13:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118033, 1087048, 50695, '<td valign="top">a pretty tree with sunlight on it. not an exciting composition. not an interesting "garden", nor does it look secret. 4</td>', 'a pretty tree with sunlight on it. not an exciting composition. not an interesting "garden", nor does it look secret. 4', '2013-10-18 13:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118034, 1087222, 50695, '<td valign="top">ok, this is immediately intriguing because of its oddness. That car doesn''t look like it''s from the 1920s, but I think you''re trying to imply that... a sense of time travel. The woman is long gone, though she is fresh in our imagination, which allows her to cheat death and decay. I''m not sure how that relates to the themes of the book, though I admit I''m rusty on them. I''m giving you a 6 for an image that shakes me up, even if it doesn''t take me very far.</td>', 'ok, this is immediately intriguing because of its oddness. That car doesn''t look like it''s from the 1920s, but I think you''re trying to imply that... a sense of time travel. The woman is long gone, though she is fresh in our imagination, which allows her to cheat death and decay. I''m not sure how that relates to the themes of the book, though I admit I''m rusty on them. I''m giving you a 6 for an image that shakes me up, even if it doesn''t take me very far.', '2013-10-18 13:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118035, 1087148, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of a collection of objects that are obvious symbols. Yes, these are two things that are sort of in Phantom of the Opera. Yes, you created an image that sort of connects to the book. But to get a good score from me the image must have some merit beyond that. I don''t see it. 2</td>', 'I''m not a fan of a collection of objects that are obvious symbols. Yes, these are two things that are sort of in Phantom of the Opera. Yes, you created an image that sort of connects to the book. But to get a good score from me the image must have some merit beyond that. I don''t see it. 2', '2013-10-18 13:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118036, 1086679, 118154, '<td valign="top">This is an appealing image to me,not sure why and don''t know the title so .7.</td>', 'This is an appealing image to me,not sure why and don''t know the title so .7.', '2013-10-18 13:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118037, 1087102, 50695, '<td valign="top">I don''t know the book so I''m glad you''ve pointed me a little further along in your title. The building is decayed, though not ugly. It might be dark but you''re not really conveying that. It comes across to me as a fairly straightforward documentation of the building, with no interest as an image. Whatever is happening with sunlight and weather, you seem to be minimizing instead of showing... and really a photograph is essentially the document of a moment, not a thing. 2</td>', 'I don''t know the book so I''m glad you''ve pointed me a little further along in your title. The building is decayed, though not ugly. It might be dark but you''re not really conveying that. It comes across to me as a fairly straightforward documentation of the building, with no interest as an image. Whatever is happening with sunlight and weather, you seem to be minimizing instead of showing... and really a photograph is essentially the document of a moment, not a thing. 2', '2013-10-18 13:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118039, 1087122, 50695, '<td valign="top">this processing, with these colors, are unattractive. it looks like mucus. 2</td>', 'this processing, with these colors, are unattractive. it looks like mucus. 2', '2013-10-18 13:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118040, 1086157, 118154, '<td valign="top">Over processed which I sort of half like. Composition is good .The border is certainly a mistake in my personal opinion.7.</td>', 'Over processed which I sort of half like. Composition is good .The border is certainly a mistake in my personal opinion.7.', '2013-10-18 13:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118057, 1086761, 12611, '<td valign="top">All novels aside, I Love the stark presentation here. The feeling of malevolent urgency.</td>', 'All novels aside, I Love the stark presentation here. The feeling of malevolent urgency.', '2013-10-18 14:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118060, 1087222, 12611, '<td valign="top">I love the skin tones, the pink and the shadows on the arm are terrific. An excellent flapper as well, and the car looks super. (My one small gripe is all that warm pinkish sepia tone kinda takes over)</td>', 'I love the skin tones, the pink and the shadows on the arm are terrific. An excellent flapper as well, and the car looks super. (My one small gripe is all that warm pinkish sepia tone kinda takes over)', '2013-10-18 14:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118061, 1086734, 12611, '<td valign="top">absolutely stunning.</td>', 'absolutely stunning.', '2013-10-18 14:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118070, 1086679, 159196, '<td valign="top">Not sure about this one - there are elements I like about it (especially the window/door, the light and the person sitting in front of it) and bits I feel uncertain about (the face). For me, had the face been more out of focus than the person and the window, it would have made more sense, but it''s a personal thing. I think the colors work well. A 5 from me.</td>', 'Not sure about this one - there are elements I like about it (especially the window/door, the light and the person sitting in front of it) and bits I feel uncertain about (the face). For me, had the face been more out of focus than the person and the window, it would have made more sense, but it''s a personal thing. I think the colors work well. A 5 from me.', '2013-10-18 15:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118073, 1086986, 159196, '<td valign="top">I loved the book. I''m not sure that it captures the essence of the plot - perhaps it looks a tad too staged. Black and white works and I like the fact that each boy is shown in different degrees of detail. From me a 5</td>', 'I loved the book. I''m not sure that it captures the essence of the plot - perhaps it looks a tad too staged. Black and white works and I like the fact that each boy is shown in different degrees of detail. From me a 5', '2013-10-18 15:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118075, 1087141, 159196, '<td valign="top">An interesting, alternative take on the book. I haven''t read it, but this portrayal has definitely sparked an interest. The dramatic clouds and usage of light make it well worthwhile to look at this in detail. A 6 from me</td>', 'An interesting, alternative take on the book. I haven''t read it, but this portrayal has definitely sparked an interest. The dramatic clouds and usage of light make it well worthwhile to look at this in detail. A 6 from me', '2013-10-18 15:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118095, 1086433, 94815, '<td valign="top">As a sunset, not badly exposed, brilliant color and I like the little star-flare. But it''s a stretch to relate it to the novel I think. 5 for effort</td>', 'As a sunset, not badly exposed, brilliant color and I like the little star-flare. But it''s a stretch to relate it to the novel I think. 5 for effort', '2013-10-18 16:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118097, 1086683, 94815, '<td valign="top">To me this relates well to the bleakness of the novel and I like it even if not. The banding adds a primatively futuristic (or defective high-tech) effect. 6</td>', 'To me this relates well to the bleakness of the novel and I like it even if not. The banding adds a primatively futuristic (or defective high-tech) effect. 6', '2013-10-18 16:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118102, 1087151, 94815, '<td valign="top">This relates well enough to the novel but the photo lacks impact. Some processing could help and a modified crop to better relate the strong lines of the window to the framing edges of the image. 5</td>', 'This relates well enough to the novel but the photo lacks impact. Some processing could help and a modified crop to better relate the strong lines of the window to the framing edges of the image. 5', '2013-10-18 16:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118108, 1086865, 94815, '<td valign="top">Not Kilimanjaro but good mountain peaks in difficult but lovingly rendered light. As a landscape it contains nicely detailed layering and sufficient shadow detail and well-controlled highlights. For me a transitional device connecting the image to the frame is important and the foreground grasses growing off the edge do the trick well. 7</td>', 'Not Kilimanjaro but good mountain peaks in difficult but lovingly rendered light. As a landscape it contains nicely detailed layering and sufficient shadow detail and well-controlled highlights. For me a transitional device connecting the image to the frame is important and the foreground grasses growing off the edge do the trick well. 7', '2013-10-18 17:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118111, 1087141, 94815, '<td valign="top">Haven''t read the book but my kids did. From what I read in synopsis, this passes as sympathetic with the novel, and at the purely artictic and technical levels, the image is very well done. The statue could be in the mind of Owen Meany presenting himself as Christ-like. 7</td>', 'Haven''t read the book but my kids did. From what I read in synopsis, this passes as sympathetic with the novel, and at the purely artictic and technical levels, the image is very well done. The statue could be in the mind of Owen Meany presenting himself as Christ-like. 7', '2013-10-18 17:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118112, 1087007, 11769, '<td valign="top">A Neat shot. 8</td>', 'A Neat shot. 8', '2013-10-18 17:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118114, 1087223, 11769, '<td valign="top">Beautiful blur. 9</td>', 'Beautiful blur. 9', '2013-10-18 17:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118115, 1086986, 11769, '<td valign="top">perfect,</td>', 'perfect,', '2013-10-18 17:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118116, 1087086, 11769, '<td valign="top">The cloud make this 7</td>', 'The cloud make this 7', '2013-10-18 17:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118117, 1086939, 94815, '<td valign="top">Seems a good literal interpretation of the title except for the artificial, almost painterly rendition of the clouds which could better serve a science fictional location. But the tones and contrast provide immediate impact that is pleasing to view on its own merits. 6</td>', 'Seems a good literal interpretation of the title except for the artificial, almost painterly rendition of the clouds which could better serve a science fictional location. But the tones and contrast provide immediate impact that is pleasing to view on its own merits. 6', '2013-10-18 17:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118119, 1086983, 94815, '<td valign="top">Didn''t even have to look at the title to know it. Well staged - visually effective. 8</td>', 'Didn''t even have to look at the title to know it. Well staged - visually effective. 8', '2013-10-18 17:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118122, 1087055, 153814, '<td valign="top">I get it, the tattoo doesn''t do much for the shot but it works.<br/>Not too shabby.</td>', 'I get it, the tattoo doesn''t do much for the shot but it works.Not too shabby.', '2013-10-18 17:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118123, 1086744, 153814, '<td valign="top">"SOME PIG"<br/>Just read this with my kids not long ago.<br/>Perfect for the challenge well done.</td>', '"SOME PIG"Just read this with my kids not long ago.Perfect for the challenge well done.', '2013-10-18 18:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118135, 1086983, 68178, '<td valign="top">Very well composed and executed image. I don''t think it has much to do with the story though, and that is really what I was looking for. In another challenge I would have marked it higher. 6</td>', 'Very well composed and executed image. I don''t think it has much to do with the story though, and that is really what I was looking for. In another challenge I would have marked it higher. 6', '2013-10-18 19:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118137, 1087170, 68178, '<td valign="top">Definitely see the Big Brother overtone in this. A very minor nitpick, but the  dark frame on top and bottom could be a tiny thicker to give it more of the cinema feel. 7</td>', 'Definitely see the Big Brother overtone in this. A very minor nitpick, but the  dark frame on top and bottom could be a tiny thicker to give it more of the cinema feel. 7', '2013-10-18 19:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118138, 1087223, 68178, '<td valign="top">A very appropriate story for the distortion and mood of this one. I get the feeling that she is chasing a rabbit. 7</td>', 'A very appropriate story for the distortion and mood of this one. I get the feeling that she is chasing a rabbit. 7', '2013-10-18 19:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118143, 1087192, 68178, '<td valign="top">Not many of these in the snowy north! A fantastic shot, but it doesn''t really tie to the story. Would have scored higher in another challenge. 6</td>', 'Not many of these in the snowy north! A fantastic shot, but it doesn''t really tie to the story. Would have scored higher in another challenge. 6', '2013-10-18 20:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
