(7118145, 1086734, 100975, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting...I like the image.  Best in the competition.<br/> <br/>Gave it a 10</td>', 'I like the lighting...I like the image.  Best in the competition. Gave it a 10', '2013-10-18 20:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118146, 1087004, 100975, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and the composition.<br/> <br/>Gave it an 8</td>', 'I like the lighting and the composition. Gave it an 8', '2013-10-18 20:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118147, 1086983, 100975, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and the concept.  I almost did the same thing.  I think yours turned out better than what I would have done.<br/> <br/>Gave it a 7</td>', 'I like the lighting and the concept.  I almost did the same thing.  I think yours turned out better than what I would have done. Gave it a 7', '2013-10-18 20:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118148, 1087036, 100975, '<td valign="top">I like your image.  Not voting on it.  I like the calm water and the reflection.  The colors are nice too.</td>', 'I like your image.  Not voting on it.  I like the calm water and the reflection.  The colors are nice too.', '2013-10-18 20:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118162, 1086978, 68504, '<td valign="top">Well yes, it is a leaf. Nice beefed up colours, but apart from it being a leaf it does not connect me to O Henry''s short story (not a novel) in which the last leaf falls unseen and is replaced by a painting of a leaf which never falls. 3<br/>Not a helpful comment really.  I must not have been drinking.(!)I was nitpicking about the story. My problem with the photo is really visual.  It looks like too many of my own photos best forgotten, always trying to fish something from what I happen upon; here you have milked the colours just as I would have - amazing the colours of stone, and you have framed a composition of sorts - simple elements, rule of thirds, contrast, but the lighting is not interesting or natural, unless that is a vignette. A picture has to be more. Just wait for it. Bumping to a 4 just because I have succeeded in annoying myself.</td>', 'Well yes, it is a leaf. Nice beefed up colours, but apart from it being a leaf it does not connect me to O Henry''s short story (not a novel) in which the last leaf falls unseen and is replaced by a painting of a leaf which never falls. 3Not a helpful comment really.  I must not have been drinking.(!)I was nitpicking about the story. My problem with the photo is really visual.  It looks like too many of my own photos best forgotten, always trying to fish something from what I happen upon; here you have milked the colours just as I would have - amazing the colours of stone, and you have framed a composition of sorts - simple elements, rule of thirds, contrast, but the lighting is not interesting or natural, unless that is a vignette. A picture has to be more. Just wait for it. Bumping to a 4 just because I have succeeded in annoying myself.', '2013-10-18 22:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118167, 1087183, 94815, '<td valign="top">This could be the witch in disguise and looking at herself in the high tech mirror.</td>', 'This could be the witch in disguise and looking at herself in the high tech mirror.', '2013-10-18 22:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118168, 1087125, 11769, '<td valign="top">I could lay on that bank for hours</td>', 'I could lay on that bank for hours', '2013-10-18 22:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118170, 1087102, 94815, '<td valign="top">I think of Wuthering Heights as a moldering old mansion; so this doesn''t quite fit. However, the stonework is nicely detailed, the color is natural except for the sky, and the composition is good and tight the way I like it. Overall for the topic: 5</td>', 'I think of Wuthering Heights as a moldering old mansion; so this doesn''t quite fit. However, the stonework is nicely detailed, the color is natural except for the sky, and the composition is good and tight the way I like it. Overall for the topic: 5', '2013-10-18 22:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118171, 1087072, 35804, '<td valign="top">3...no. This is lazy. At least show me what''s in the darn window. ETA, I wanted to add to my original gut reaction. I''m still giving this a 3 and here''s why...it''s just visually unappealing to me.The composition is lazy/flat/boring. Show the viewer the curiosity shop, not just the sign. And to be perfectly honest, beautiful light, of which there is none here, can make the most boring things come to life...even to <i>Sorry We''re Closed</i> signs living in bad compositions.</td>', '3...no. This is lazy. At least show me what''s in the darn window. ETA, I wanted to add to my original gut reaction. I''m still giving this a 3 and here''s why...it''s just visually unappealing to me.The composition is lazy/flat/boring. Show the viewer the curiosity shop, not just the sign. And to be perfectly honest, beautiful light, of which there is none here, can make the most boring things come to life...even to Sorry We''re Closed signs living in bad compositions.', '2013-10-18 22:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118172, 1086672, 68178, '<td valign="top">An interesting take on the dual personality. Not really reflective of the book era, but a minor nitpick. Otherwise well shot and composed. 7</td>', 'An interesting take on the dual personality. Not really reflective of the book era, but a minor nitpick. Otherwise well shot and composed. 7', '2013-10-18 22:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118173, 1087205, 68769, '<td valign="top">I an one of a few that have taken on the Comment on every vote challenge. I will post the score I gave you then try to explain my reasons for said vote. Hopefully nothing below will be taken personally, and maybe we can both learn from it..<br/>On this I leave a 6, I dont know enough, or anything of this novel to form any opinion of how it relates. The image is nice and might make for a good cover, but for me the picture contains few words to describe a novel.</td>', 'I an one of a few that have taken on the Comment on every vote challenge. I will post the score I gave you then try to explain my reasons for said vote. Hopefully nothing below will be taken personally, and maybe we can both learn from it..On this I leave a 6, I dont know enough, or anything of this novel to form any opinion of how it relates. The image is nice and might make for a good cover, but for me the picture contains few words to describe a novel.', '2013-10-18 22:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118174, 1087183, 11769, '<td valign="top">HA! She''s picking a tune. 6</td>', 'HA! She''s picking a tune. 6', '2013-10-18 22:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118175, 1087086, 68178, '<td valign="top">This is another of the shots that really reflect the book well. The ominous clouds and almost abandoned looking carnival in the harvested corn field are almost too much. One of my favorites of the challenge. 9</td>', 'This is another of the shots that really reflect the book well. The ominous clouds and almost abandoned looking carnival in the harvested corn field are almost too much. One of my favorites of the challenge. 9', '2013-10-18 22:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118176, 1086453, 94815, '<td valign="top">Quite a challenge to take on this story. But as I remember reading the lurking terror, this is not a bad representation of what was in the minds of the kids. The darkness and grassy background are appropriate, and the vaguely articulated figure seems quite appropriate. 6</td>', 'Quite a challenge to take on this story. But as I remember reading the lurking terror, this is not a bad representation of what was in the minds of the kids. The darkness and grassy background are appropriate, and the vaguely articulated figure seems quite appropriate. 6', '2013-10-18 22:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118181, 1087004, 68178, '<td valign="top">I have not read the book, but I''ve seen enough pictures to know the windmill is a tie in. Image wise, I like the framing of this shot and the staggered greys. Well composed. 7</td>', 'I have not read the book, but I''ve seen enough pictures to know the windmill is a tie in. Image wise, I like the framing of this shot and the staggered greys. Well composed. 7', '2013-10-18 22:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118183, 1087100, 94815, '<td valign="top">A famous quote risks letdown when the image doesn''t fit. Here the hands lack the wear and tear of an urchin, and without a suitable face or at least some hint of one, the image is incomplete. Nice try with the bowl and hands which might be enough for some viewers. 5</td>', 'A famous quote risks letdown when the image doesn''t fit. Here the hands lack the wear and tear of an urchin, and without a suitable face or at least some hint of one, the image is incomplete. Nice try with the bowl and hands which might be enough for some viewers. 5', '2013-10-18 22:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118185, 1086865, 119419, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene, I like the shadow line dividing the peaks. The foreground treeline could have use a bit more definition (I find Nik software Viveza with control point great for this. So an inspired theme from the title rather than Harry awaiting his slow death contemplating his life. Certainly a scene for contemplation.5.</td>', 'Pretty scene, I like the shadow line dividing the peaks. The foreground treeline could have use a bit more definition (I find Nik software Viveza with control point great for this. So an inspired theme from the title rather than Harry awaiting his slow death contemplating his life. Certainly a scene for contemplation.5.', '2013-10-18 22:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118186, 1087151, 119419, '<td valign="top">A good mood created that focuses more on a study of the child rather than the environment. I like how you have the faint image of the boy set in his usual surrounds. One of the few entries that really makes me feel the connection. 8.</td>', 'A good mood created that focuses more on a study of the child rather than the environment. I like how you have the faint image of the boy set in his usual surrounds. One of the few entries that really makes me feel the connection. 8.', '2013-10-18 22:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118187, 1087112, 94815, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice find and well photographed, but seems a bad fit for the chosen novel. It has the period costume and furnishings, but none of the gloomy mood. I give high points for technical proficiency though. 6</td>', 'It''s a nice find and well photographed, but seems a bad fit for the chosen novel. It has the period costume and furnishings, but none of the gloomy mood. I give high points for technical proficiency though. 6', '2013-10-18 22:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118188, 1087071, 94815, '<td valign="top">Dramatic shot - possible cover art. 7</td>', 'Dramatic shot - possible cover art. 7', '2013-10-18 22:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118189, 1087148, 94815, '<td valign="top">Evocative shot although a greater sense of horror would have been appropriate. Anyway, nice and clean photography. 6</td>', 'Evocative shot although a greater sense of horror would have been appropriate. Anyway, nice and clean photography. 6', '2013-10-18 22:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118190, 1087082, 119419, '<td valign="top">Luckily it didn''t take you 10 years to get there ;) Don''t know if this is Godrevy at all, they all look the same somehow. A dynamic looking sky, the lighthouse probably could have gone off centre a bit more for me would help, bur it probably depended on where you shot from at the time. You''ve handled the light quite ok. 5 .</td>', 'Luckily it didn''t take you 10 years to get there ;) Don''t know if this is Godrevy at all, they all look the same somehow. A dynamic looking sky, the lighthouse probably could have gone off centre a bit more for me would help, bur it probably depended on where you shot from at the time. You''ve handled the light quite ok. 5 .', '2013-10-18 23:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118191, 1086679, 94815, '<td valign="top">Don''t remember much of this but the image evokes a sense of wonderment in the search for knowledge and enlightenment in the teachings of a prophet. The shot is cleverly constructed to that purpose. 6</td>', 'Don''t remember much of this but the image evokes a sense of wonderment in the search for knowledge and enlightenment in the teachings of a prophet. The shot is cleverly constructed to that purpose. 6', '2013-10-18 23:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118192, 1087048, 94815, '<td valign="top">Nice try with bright and natural color and good framing. What it lacks is any association with the story as far as I can see. 5</td>', 'Nice try with bright and natural color and good framing. What it lacks is any association with the story as far as I can see. 5', '2013-10-18 23:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118193, 1087122, 119419, '<td valign="top">I like these scenes, but not the HDR effect. Good to see that you appreciate the variety of textures out there, the composition is balanced although I feel a little tilt to the left (maybe I''m the one tilted). The mood probably fits the first part of the story. The wild and undeveloped, but doesn''t go much further than that as a connection, probably an old shack or muslim looking model somewhere, but I understand the constraints of trying to come up with that ;) 6. because I like the scene.</td>', 'I like these scenes, but not the HDR effect. Good to see that you appreciate the variety of textures out there, the composition is balanced although I feel a little tilt to the left (maybe I''m the one tilted). The mood probably fits the first part of the story. The wild and undeveloped, but doesn''t go much further than that as a connection, probably an old shack or muslim looking model somewhere, but I understand the constraints of trying to come up with that ;) 6. because I like the scene.', '2013-10-18 23:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118194, 1087036, 119419, '<td valign="top">I like the imagery of the light reflections looking like sword blades and the colours. A little too modern a scene for my concepts of old Arabia, but that says more about me. Well executed night shot all the same.5.</td>', 'I like the imagery of the light reflections looking like sword blades and the colours. A little too modern a scene for my concepts of old Arabia, but that says more about me. Well executed night shot all the same.5.', '2013-10-18 23:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118195, 1087096, 94815, '<td valign="top">They seem a bit younger than I remember but otherwise it captures a mood of unsupervised activity in the woods, which fits. Visually the image is well executed and composed. The light is wonderfully captured.</td>', 'They seem a bit younger than I remember but otherwise it captures a mood of unsupervised activity in the woods, which fits. Visually the image is well executed and composed. The light is wonderfully captured.', '2013-10-18 23:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118196, 1087223, 94815, '<td valign="top">The figure seems a bit young and small but the mood of fantasy if nicely conveyed by the blur and tonality. 6</td>', 'The figure seems a bit young and small but the mood of fantasy if nicely conveyed by the blur and tonality. 6', '2013-10-18 23:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118197, 1087221, 94815, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I like the literal interpretation of the title but I have to admit I smiled.</td>', 'I don''t think I like the literal interpretation of the title but I have to admit I smiled.', '2013-10-18 23:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118199, 1087135, 94815, '<td valign="top">Haven''t read it but this looks like a bell jar, and the butterfly might represent something about Sylvia Plath''s spirituality, and the shot is well done. Giving the benefit of the doubt (due to my ignorance) my vote is a 6</td>', 'Haven''t read it but this looks like a bell jar, and the butterfly might represent something about Sylvia Plath''s spirituality, and the shot is well done. Giving the benefit of the doubt (due to my ignorance) my vote is a 6', '2013-10-18 23:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118201, 1086979, 94815, '<td valign="top">This looks more like the garden of eden than the utopian world conceived by Aldus Huxley in the book as I remember it. But still is is a well executed photo with a more generalized utopian ideal nicely presented.</td>', 'This looks more like the garden of eden than the utopian world conceived by Aldus Huxley in the book as I remember it. But still is is a well executed photo with a more generalized utopian ideal nicely presented.', '2013-10-18 23:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118203, 1087093, 94815, '<td valign="top">You want a classic novel? I don''t need no classic novel. I like the in your face image but there''s no association with the modern novel as far as I can tell. Image could be a 6 in another challenge. Here its only a 5.</td>', 'You want a classic novel? I don''t need no classic novel. I like the in your face image but there''s no association with the modern novel as far as I can tell. Image could be a 6 in another challenge. Here its only a 5.', '2013-10-18 23:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118204, 1086105, 94815, '<td valign="top">Not a bad image but quite a stretch for that particular story. 5</td>', 'Not a bad image but quite a stretch for that particular story. 5', '2013-10-18 23:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118206, 1087001, 85430, '<td valign="top">The background is distracting, and it seems a bit of a fair distance from the subject, so it could have easily been blurred out by normal lenses.<br/> <br/>5</td>', 'The background is distracting, and it seems a bit of a fair distance from the subject, so it could have easily been blurred out by normal lenses. 5', '2013-10-18 23:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118207, 1087208, 85430, '<td valign="top">Wonderful wildlife shot. Easily a 7 from me.</td>', 'Wonderful wildlife shot. Easily a 7 from me.', '2013-10-18 23:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118208, 1086989, 94815, '<td valign="top">Good shot but the point of view is not quite right since they characters approach the lighthouse from the sea. But at least there is an appropriate background from which they could be coming... The image works well as a layered land/seascape although the color seems more imaginary than real - which might be your intention. 6</td>', 'Good shot but the point of view is not quite right since they characters approach the lighthouse from the sea. But at least there is an appropriate background from which they could be coming... The image works well as a layered land/seascape although the color seems more imaginary than real - which might be your intention. 6', '2013-10-18 23:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118209, 1087072, 85430, '<td valign="top">I would have given this image a grunge color treatment to make it seem like a graphic cover, but it is a personal preference.<br/> <br/>5</td>', 'I would have given this image a grunge color treatment to make it seem like a graphic cover, but it is a personal preference. 5', '2013-10-18 23:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118210, 1086858, 85430, '<td valign="top">perfect symmetry and good details. 6 from me.</td>', 'perfect symmetry and good details. 6 from me.', '2013-10-18 23:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118211, 1086157, 94815, '<td valign="top">The image works well - good color and processing for an illustrative picture. But in all my years of art school and since, I''ve never seen, nor can I understand the purpose of this particular border, which becomes a serious distraction for me. without it, the shot is a 7. With the border, it is a 6.</td>', 'The image works well - good color and processing for an illustrative picture. But in all my years of art school and since, I''ve never seen, nor can I understand the purpose of this particular border, which becomes a serious distraction for me. without it, the shot is a 7. With the border, it is a 6.', '2013-10-18 23:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118213, 1086433, 85430, '<td valign="top">I would have brightened up some of the details. 5 from me</td>', 'I would have brightened up some of the details. 5 from me', '2013-10-18 23:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118214, 1087001, 94815, '<td valign="top">The shot is topical but the reflection across the upper section disrupts the visual impression. 5</td>', 'The shot is topical but the reflection across the upper section disrupts the visual impression. 5', '2013-10-18 23:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118215, 1087162, 94815, '<td valign="top">Good work and interpretation. 9</td>', 'Good work and interpretation. 9', '2013-10-18 23:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118216, 1087122, 85430, '<td valign="top">I think the image is a bit overprocessed, that it takes away any good points I would have given for the other factors that I would have considered.<br/> <br/>5 from me</td>', 'I think the image is a bit overprocessed, that it takes away any good points I would have given for the other factors that I would have considered. 5 from me', '2013-10-18 23:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118217, 1087190, 100975, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the image, but maybe a different composition would make it more interesting.<br/> <br/>gave it a 4</td>', 'I like the idea of the image, but maybe a different composition would make it more interesting. gave it a 4', '2013-10-18 23:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118218, 1087170, 85430, '<td valign="top">Just for this one time only, I am going to play border police. :) I normally have no problems with borders, but this one simly doesn''t add any good points to your image. 5 from me.</td>', 'Just for this one time only, I am going to play border police. :) I normally have no problems with borders, but this one simly doesn''t add any good points to your image. 5 from me.', '2013-10-18 23:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118219, 1087048, 85430, '<td valign="top">I like the painting feel of the image. Beautiful colors, although a bit dark for me. 6</td>', 'I like the painting feel of the image. Beautiful colors, although a bit dark for me. 6', '2013-10-18 23:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118220, 1086914, 85430, '<td valign="top">I like the subject popping out of the pure black background. The black space actually adds an area where you could put in an imaginary text title, and you''ll have a cover image for the novel. 6 from me.</td>', 'I like the subject popping out of the pure black background. The black space actually adds an area where you could put in an imaginary text title, and you''ll have a cover image for the novel. 6 from me.', '2013-10-18 23:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118221, 1087184, 94815, '<td valign="top">Well, this is a literal representation of the title, but as you know it has nothing to do with the story. Technically, the composition is good but the light is a problem and difficult, admittedly, to fix. My suggestion in cases like this is to convert to black &amp; white and work with the shadows to bring up more detail, say, in his face. I''m giving a 5.</td>', 'Well, this is a literal representation of the title, but as you know it has nothing to do with the story. Technically, the composition is good but the light is a problem and difficult, admittedly, to fix. My suggestion in cases like this is to convert to black & white and work with the shadows to bring up more detail, say, in his face. I''m giving a 5.', '2013-10-18 23:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118222, 1087036, 85430, '<td valign="top">The setting may suit the title well, but it doesn''t have much story to tell. In a night photography challenge, I would have rated it much higher. 6 for now.</td>', 'The setting may suit the title well, but it doesn''t have much story to tell. In a night photography challenge, I would have rated it much higher. 6 for now.', '2013-10-18 23:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118224, 1087148, 100975, '<td valign="top">I like the image.  I like the detail in the mask.  I like the overall composition.<br/> <br/>Gave it an 8</td>', 'I like the image.  I like the detail in the mask.  I like the overall composition. Gave it an 8', '2013-10-18 23:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118232, 1086105, 100975, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors in this shot.  The image itself feels robotic to me...in a good way...like War of the Worlds advanced alien robot army.<br/> <br/>Gave it an 8</td>', 'I really like the colors in this shot.  The image itself feels robotic to me...in a good way...like War of the Worlds advanced alien robot army. Gave it an 8', '2013-10-19 00:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118236, 1087139, 100975, '<td valign="top">Simple.  I like it, but maybe a little different angle would have made it a stronger image.<br/> <br/>Gave it a 5</td>', 'Simple.  I like it, but maybe a little different angle would have made it a stronger image. Gave it a 5', '2013-10-19 00:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118239, 1086157, 100975, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the Smoky Mountains...one of my favorite vacation spots.<br/> <br/>I like the longer shutter speed for the river.  I like the saturation of the colors.  The one thing that keeps me from scoring it higher is that the left side of the middle seems busy and cluttered.  It kind of pulls my attention away from the good stuff.<br/> <br/>Gave it a 6</td>', 'Reminds me of the Smoky Mountains...one of my favorite vacation spots. I like the longer shutter speed for the river.  I like the saturation of the colors.  The one thing that keeps me from scoring it higher is that the left side of the middle seems busy and cluttered.  It kind of pulls my attention away from the good stuff. Gave it a 6', '2013-10-19 00:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118240, 1087001, 100975, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it...<br/> <br/>Oh wait...now I get it.<br/> <br/>The idea is good, but it is just a picture of a spider and its web.  Nothing jumps out to me and gives me that wow look at that spider.  To make it more interesting to me, I would have found a way to get a different background, and I would have tried to get more detail of the spider itself.  Now my lenses aren''t great, so maybe I wouldn''t have been able to do any better myself, but if I could, that is what I would try.<br/> <br/>Gave it a 3</td>', 'I don''t get it... Oh wait...now I get it. The idea is good, but it is just a picture of a spider and its web.  Nothing jumps out to me and gives me that wow look at that spider.  To make it more interesting to me, I would have found a way to get a different background, and I would have tried to get more detail of the spider itself.  Now my lenses aren''t great, so maybe I wouldn''t have been able to do any better myself, but if I could, that is what I would try. Gave it a 3', '2013-10-19 00:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118242, 1087183, 100975, '<td valign="top">This does not say Snow White to me at all.  Maybe I am missing the boat on this one.  It seems to be a snapshot of a lady on the sidewalk listening to music.  <br/> <br/>Gave it a 2</td>', 'This does not say Snow White to me at all.  Maybe I am missing the boat on this one.  It seems to be a snapshot of a lady on the sidewalk listening to music.   Gave it a 2', '2013-10-19 00:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118243, 1087100, 100975, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the image.  The lighting looks good on this one.  Very minimalist in this.  Seems like it needs something else.<br/> <br/>Gave it a 6</td>', 'I like the idea of the image.  The lighting looks good on this one.  Very minimalist in this.  Seems like it needs something else. Gave it a 6', '2013-10-19 00:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118244, 1087122, 100975, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of the image.<br/> <br/>Something looks wrong with the processing of the image...overprocessed maybe?  The bottom left seems to have whatever it is the worst to me.  Maybe it is nothing and that is just the way the foliage looks I don''t know.<br/> <br/>Gave it a 4</td>', 'I like the composition of the image. Something looks wrong with the processing of the image...overprocessed maybe?  The bottom left seems to have whatever it is the worst to me.  Maybe it is nothing and that is just the way the foliage looks I don''t know. Gave it a 4', '2013-10-19 00:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118245, 1087065, 100975, '<td valign="top">I don''t know anything about the book...<br/> <br/>Freaky eyes.  I like the composition and the lighting.  <br/> <br/>Gave it a 7</td>', 'I don''t know anything about the book... Freaky eyes.  I like the composition and the lighting.   Gave it a 7', '2013-10-19 00:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118246, 1087086, 100975, '<td valign="top">I like the darkness of the image.  Gives that Wicked feeling.  I think the image would have done better had you moved closer to the tents.  I know you wouldn''t get all of them, but it would have been more to me.<br/> <br/>Gave it a 6</td>', 'I like the darkness of the image.  Gives that Wicked feeling.  I think the image would have done better had you moved closer to the tents.  I know you wouldn''t get all of them, but it would have been more to me. Gave it a 6', '2013-10-19 00:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118266, 1087023, 112828, '<td valign="top">Strange book.<br/> <br/>I can see where you were coming from, but it seems to me that this really nice image might have found a better fit with a different novel.<br/> <br/>Image is good, might suggest a few changes in composition, but overall good.  Fit is less good.<br/> <br/>5</td>', 'Strange book. I can see where you were coming from, but it seems to me that this really nice image might have found a better fit with a different novel. Image is good, might suggest a few changes in composition, but overall good.  Fit is less good. 5', '2013-10-19 01:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118275, 1087086, 112828, '<td valign="top">Hmm...  It was more halloween than carnival - but this image does evoke that darkness of the novel.<br/> <br/>I think your processing killed this image - everything is plastic smooth.  Bit of a shame really, as this is quite nice. <br/> <br/>6</td>', 'Hmm...  It was more halloween than carnival - but this image does evoke that darkness of the novel. I think your processing killed this image - everything is plastic smooth.  Bit of a shame really, as this is quite nice.  6', '2013-10-19 01:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118281, 1087148, 112828, '<td valign="top">Cool.<br/> <br/>Image works for the novel, and the overall image is good.  Well lit, well processed, and a reasonably good composition.<br/> <br/>7</td>', 'Cool. Image works for the novel, and the overall image is good.  Well lit, well processed, and a reasonably good composition. 7', '2013-10-19 01:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118282, 1086340, 112828, '<td valign="top">:)<br/> <br/>Fun!  Is that a piranha?<br/> <br/>Anyway, it fits.  The image is cheesy, but fun.  <br/> <br/>6</td>', ':) Fun!  Is that a piranha? Anyway, it fits.  The image is cheesy, but fun.   6', '2013-10-19 01:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118283, 1086767, 112828, '<td valign="top">Extraordinary.<br/> <br/>Although this fails to deliver the racial punch the novel did, I suppose the fact that the mockingbird is noted in the novel ties this together.<br/> <br/>Would have liked something more provocative, but this is a really nice image.<br/> <br/>7</td>', 'Extraordinary. Although this fails to deliver the racial punch the novel did, I suppose the fact that the mockingbird is noted in the novel ties this together. Would have liked something more provocative, but this is a really nice image. 7', '2013-10-19 01:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118300, 1087210, 112828, '<td valign="top">Excellent.<br/> <br/>A well connected image - and a beautiful horse.<br/> <br/>Processing really hurts this image though - the image feels noisy, but yet over-smooth.  <br/> <br/>5</td>', 'Excellent. A well connected image - and a beautiful horse. Processing really hurts this image though - the image feels noisy, but yet over-smooth.   5', '2013-10-19 02:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118306, 1087201, 112828, '<td valign="top">Yes.  It evokes the novel.<br/> <br/>Why are those greens SCREAMING NEON GREEN?<br/> <br/>Otherwise, this image is fairly good - but the way saturated blues and greens hurt the image.<br/> <br/>6</td>', 'Yes.  It evokes the novel. Why are those greens SCREAMING NEON GREEN? Otherwise, this image is fairly good - but the way saturated blues and greens hurt the image. 6', '2013-10-19 02:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118309, 1087048, 112828, '<td valign="top">Hmm...  I picture something more intimate when I read that novel.<br/> <br/>Still, roughly applicable, and what a LOVELY shade of red.<br/> <br/>6</td>', 'Hmm...  I picture something more intimate when I read that novel. Still, roughly applicable, and what a LOVELY shade of red. 6', '2013-10-19 02:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118336, 1087125, 68769, '<td valign="top">I an one of a few that have taken on the Comment on every vote challenge. I will post the score I gave you then try to explain my reasons for said vote. Hopefully nothing below will be taken personally, and maybe we can both learn from it..<br/>What a lovely pond, I only get to see things like this through others eyes as I live in the desert.<br/>In this case unfortunately the best score I can give is a 4, allow me to explain. When I suggested this topic I was  hoping for inspiration from the content of the novel rather then the title. Now granted I have not read this book but I did see the movie years ago. If I recall correctly it was less about a pond and more about the relationship of a troubled family.<br/>The image shows new photographer mistakes, heck I have made them myself, the trees in the background are a bit strange. My suggestion is to  post this picture on forums after the challenge has finished in voting, there are several people here that will be more eager to help you get where you want to go in photography.</td>', 'I an one of a few that have taken on the Comment on every vote challenge. I will post the score I gave you then try to explain my reasons for said vote. Hopefully nothing below will be taken personally, and maybe we can both learn from it..What a lovely pond, I only get to see things like this through others eyes as I live in the desert.In this case unfortunately the best score I can give is a 4, allow me to explain. When I suggested this topic I was  hoping for inspiration from the content of the novel rather then the title. Now granted I have not read this book but I did see the movie years ago. If I recall correctly it was less about a pond and more about the relationship of a troubled family.The image shows new photographer mistakes, heck I have made them myself, the trees in the background are a bit strange. My suggestion is to  post this picture on forums after the challenge has finished in voting, there are several people here that will be more eager to help you get where you want to go in photography.', '2013-10-19 06:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118339, 1087194, 68769, '<td valign="top">I an one of a few that have taken on the Comment on every vote challenge. I will post the score I gave you then try to explain my reasons for said vote. Hopefully nothing below will be taken personally, and maybe we can both learn from it..<br/>This is a fantastic cannon stop action shot, but, your actors are killing me on the believable scale. I give the cannon a 10, actors a 4 only because of period dress. Score for this entry a 7.</td>', 'I an one of a few that have taken on the Comment on every vote challenge. I will post the score I gave you then try to explain my reasons for said vote. Hopefully nothing below will be taken personally, and maybe we can both learn from it..This is a fantastic cannon stop action shot, but, your actors are killing me on the believable scale. I give the cannon a 10, actors a 4 only because of period dress. Score for this entry a 7.', '2013-10-19 06:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118341, 1087190, 68769, '<td valign="top">I an one of a few that have taken on the Comment on every vote challenge. I will post the score I gave you then try to explain my reasons for said vote. Hopefully nothing below will be taken personally, and maybe we can both learn from it..<br/>This is a tough one. I am impressed with your capture of the flame, but, I am also offset by the fact you destroyed a book to accomplish it. Ill leave this as a 6 for now.</td>', 'I an one of a few that have taken on the Comment on every vote challenge. I will post the score I gave you then try to explain my reasons for said vote. Hopefully nothing below will be taken personally, and maybe we can both learn from it..This is a tough one. I am impressed with your capture of the flame, but, I am also offset by the fact you destroyed a book to accomplish it. Ill leave this as a 6 for now.', '2013-10-19 06:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
