(7118356, 1086761, 15832, '<td valign="top">Nice work. Really like those gradient lines and the framing. 8</td>', 'Nice work. Really like those gradient lines and the framing. 8', '2013-10-19 07:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118357, 1087198, 68769, '<td valign="top">I an one of a few that have taken on the Comment on every vote challenge. I will post the score I gave you then try to explain my reasons for said vote. Hopefully nothing below will be taken personally, and maybe we can both learn from it..<br/>Although a fine portrait, there is little that ties this to the 19th century, although the hat helps a bit. I am hung between quality of image and believability of challenge topic. I will place this in the middle and give a point for the hat6</td>', 'I an one of a few that have taken on the Comment on every vote challenge. I will post the score I gave you then try to explain my reasons for said vote. Hopefully nothing below will be taken personally, and maybe we can both learn from it..Although a fine portrait, there is little that ties this to the 19th century, although the hat helps a bit. I am hung between quality of image and believability of challenge topic. I will place this in the middle and give a point for the hat6', '2013-10-19 08:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118362, 1087223, 68769, '<td valign="top">I an one of a few that have taken on the Comment on every vote challenge. I will post the score I gave you then try to explain my reasons for said vote. Hopefully nothing below will be taken personally, and maybe we can both learn from it..<br/>Somehow for all the wrong or right reasons this fits. I feel I am chasing a girl thats chasing a rabbit into the unknown. 8 or 9 I debate, cat with a grin says 9 seats at tea.</td>', 'I an one of a few that have taken on the Comment on every vote challenge. I will post the score I gave you then try to explain my reasons for said vote. Hopefully nothing below will be taken personally, and maybe we can both learn from it..Somehow for all the wrong or right reasons this fits. I feel I am chasing a girl thats chasing a rabbit into the unknown. 8 or 9 I debate, cat with a grin says 9 seats at tea.', '2013-10-19 09:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118363, 1087065, 68769, '<td valign="top">I an one of a few that have taken on the Comment on every vote challenge. I will post the score I gave you then try to explain my reasons for said vote. Hopefully nothing below will be taken personally, and maybe we can both learn from it..<br/>Not knowing the book I did a wiki on it. Between your image and what I read on Wikipedia I feel the need to search out my next adventure. Thank you. BTW a score of 9.</td>', 'I an one of a few that have taken on the Comment on every vote challenge. I will post the score I gave you then try to explain my reasons for said vote. Hopefully nothing below will be taken personally, and maybe we can both learn from it..Not knowing the book I did a wiki on it. Between your image and what I read on Wikipedia I feel the need to search out my next adventure. Thank you. BTW a score of 9.', '2013-10-19 09:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118366, 1086734, 100831, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous scenery... real or imagined, it''s all about time. Difficult book. Wonderful image.</td>', 'Gorgeous scenery... real or imagined, it''s all about time. Difficult book. Wonderful image.', '2013-10-19 09:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118368, 1087000, 100831, '<td valign="top">Imaginative, Intelligent... this is a thoughtful delight of an image and one of my highest votes in the challenge.</td>', 'Imaginative, Intelligent... this is a thoughtful delight of an image and one of my highest votes in the challenge.', '2013-10-19 10:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118369, 1087007, 100831, '<td valign="top">Yes, this works very well... I feel the youth and torment. Love the toning and light.</td>', 'Yes, this works very well... I feel the youth and torment. Love the toning and light.', '2013-10-19 10:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118370, 1087071, 100831, '<td valign="top">Gosh, aside from hoping no books were "really" burned in the process, this is excellent.  Both the interpretation and the execution. Picture perfect.</td>', 'Gosh, aside from hoping no books were "really" burned in the process, this is excellent.  Both the interpretation and the execution. Picture perfect.', '2013-10-19 10:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118372, 1086936, 68769, '<td valign="top">I an one of a few that have taken on the Comment on every vote challenge. I will post the score I gave you then try to explain my reasons for said vote. Hopefully nothing below will be taken personally, and maybe we can both learn from it..<br/>A modern day rewrite? Hell I dont know. I know I am fascinated by this woman. There is a story here, and her name might be Alice.<br/>A 10 and faved.</td>', 'I an one of a few that have taken on the Comment on every vote challenge. I will post the score I gave you then try to explain my reasons for said vote. Hopefully nothing below will be taken personally, and maybe we can both learn from it..A modern day rewrite? Hell I dont know. I know I am fascinated by this woman. There is a story here, and her name might be Alice.A 10 and faved.', '2013-10-19 10:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118379, 1087207, 68769, '<td valign="top">I an one of a few that have taken on the Comment on every vote challenge. I will post the score I gave you then try to explain my reasons for said vote. Hopefully nothing below will be taken personally, and maybe we can both learn from it.<br/>Im sorry this image has little to do with what I suggested this challenge to be, a score of 3. Ill leave it at that.</td>', 'I an one of a few that have taken on the Comment on every vote challenge. I will post the score I gave you then try to explain my reasons for said vote. Hopefully nothing below will be taken personally, and maybe we can both learn from it.Im sorry this image has little to do with what I suggested this challenge to be, a score of 3. Ill leave it at that.', '2013-10-19 10:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118380, 1087201, 68178, '<td valign="top">Definitely looks like a path to the secret garden. I like the point of view from the dark pathway looking in to the sunny exit. The harshly lit stone in the middle is a tiny distraction. 6</td>', 'Definitely looks like a path to the secret garden. I like the point of view from the dark pathway looking in to the sunny exit. The harshly lit stone in the middle is a tiny distraction. 6', '2013-10-19 10:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118381, 1086672, 68769, '<td valign="top">I an one of a few that have taken on the Comment on every vote challenge. I will post the score I gave you then try to explain my reasons for said vote. Hopefully nothing below will be taken personally, and maybe we can both learn from it..<br/>I think you did a damn fine job capturing both sides of the personality. Your efforts gain a 9 from me.</td>', 'I an one of a few that have taken on the Comment on every vote challenge. I will post the score I gave you then try to explain my reasons for said vote. Hopefully nothing below will be taken personally, and maybe we can both learn from it..I think you did a damn fine job capturing both sides of the personality. Your efforts gain a 9 from me.', '2013-10-19 10:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118382, 1087071, 68178, '<td valign="top">I like the framing of the book and the fire, but man I hate seeing books burn! I hope it wasn''t the Bradbury! Totally out of your control, but would have liked the flames a little more isolated from one another. Cutting the tops off the flames off doesn''t help them feel less cluttered. I do like that the ash remains, and the little piece of story trying to show though the destruction. 6</td>', 'I like the framing of the book and the fire, but man I hate seeing books burn! I hope it wasn''t the Bradbury! Totally out of your control, but would have liked the flames a little more isolated from one another. Cutting the tops off the flames off doesn''t help them feel less cluttered. I do like that the ash remains, and the little piece of story trying to show though the destruction. 6', '2013-10-19 10:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118387, 1086986, 68178, '<td valign="top">Love the snarls! Definitely right out of the book.  The black and white are a little flat. Would definitely like more on the dark scale, particularly with this story. 6</td>', 'Love the snarls! Definitely right out of the book.  The black and white are a little flat. Would definitely like more on the dark scale, particularly with this story. 6', '2013-10-19 11:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118389, 1087190, 68178, '<td valign="top">The flames and tone are just right, except that the tops of the flames are cut off. The best part of the fire shots are the wispy tops. Still, a burning page right out of the book! 6</td>', 'The flames and tone are just right, except that the tops of the flames are cut off. The best part of the fire shots are the wispy tops. Still, a burning page right out of the book! 6', '2013-10-19 11:37:58.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(7118390, 1086105, 68178, '<td valign="top">An interesting place. The colors help emote the story, but I still feel like it''s a bit of a reach. 5</td>', 'An interesting place. The colors help emote the story, but I still feel like it''s a bit of a reach. 5', '2013-10-19 11:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118391, 1086692, 68178, '<td valign="top">The girl sort of fits the story, but it seems like a reach. A pun on the title still, and a quite nice shot. Would have rated it higher in a different challenge. 6</td>', 'The girl sort of fits the story, but it seems like a reach. A pun on the title still, and a quite nice shot. Would have rated it higher in a different challenge. 6', '2013-10-19 11:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118392, 1087102, 68178, '<td valign="top">I could see a ghost attachment to this place. Technically sound, but difficult to make spooky with the stronger light. The transition from sky to house seems to have a glow that I think detracts. 6</td>', 'I could see a ghost attachment to this place. Technically sound, but difficult to make spooky with the stronger light. The transition from sky to house seems to have a glow that I think detracts. 6', '2013-10-19 11:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118397, 1087096, 68178, '<td valign="top">A curious take on an oft violent story. They almost seem too innocent, though I guess the story starts innocent in a way. I would like it a tad darker and more black toned only because of the dark overtones in the book. 6</td>', 'A curious take on an oft violent story. They almost seem too innocent, though I guess the story starts innocent in a way. I would like it a tad darker and more black toned only because of the dark overtones in the book. 6', '2013-10-19 12:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118407, 1087195, 8759, '<td valign="top">I personally would have tried to take the pic a bit earlier. If circumstances did not allow I would have tried to underexpose a bit as the sun look blown out. Nevertheless is a nice entry, warm tones and soft focus. Could also have cloned out some of the spots on the water. 6</td>', 'I personally would have tried to take the pic a bit earlier. If circumstances did not allow I would have tried to underexpose a bit as the sun look blown out. Nevertheless is a nice entry, warm tones and soft focus. Could also have cloned out some of the spots on the water. 6', '2013-10-19 12:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118408, 1087078, 8759, '<td valign="top">Intriguing. Good BW. Bleak as the title. I do not know what I would have done differently. 6</td>', 'Intriguing. Good BW. Bleak as the title. I do not know what I would have done differently. 6', '2013-10-19 12:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118409, 1087201, 8759, '<td valign="top">Fits the title, looks secret. I would have tired a soft focus (a layer of blur ). The highlights are a bit blown on the rock and that is a bit distracting. So i find the green at the end of the path. I would also have tried to get rid of the leaves on the top left. <br/> <br/>Is the view from the garden or towards? 6</td>', 'Fits the title, looks secret. I would have tired a soft focus (a layer of blur ). The highlights are a bit blown on the rock and that is a bit distracting. So i find the green at the end of the path. I would also have tried to get rid of the leaves on the top left.  Is the view from the garden or towards? 6', '2013-10-19 12:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118411, 1086479, 8759, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, good balance and compositon. I would have personally cropped a bit more tight on the bottom. 6</td>', 'Nice colors, good balance and compositon. I would have personally cropped a bit more tight on the bottom. 6', '2013-10-19 12:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118413, 1087120, 94815, '<td valign="top">This image looks like a mistake as an illustration for the book/movie which takes place during a huge snowstorm. Maybe better for "On a Clear Day You Can See Forever...". So it is quite a stretch to see this as inspired by the novel. As an image, yes it is quite sharp and well exposed but lacks any content to stimulate visual or intellectual interest. If you are a pilot, then enjoy your flying and keep shooting. For this one my vote is a 5.</td>', 'This image looks like a mistake as an illustration for the book/movie which takes place during a huge snowstorm. Maybe better for "On a Clear Day You Can See Forever...". So it is quite a stretch to see this as inspired by the novel. As an image, yes it is quite sharp and well exposed but lacks any content to stimulate visual or intellectual interest. If you are a pilot, then enjoy your flying and keep shooting. For this one my vote is a 5.', '2013-10-19 12:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118417, 1087221, 8759, '<td valign="top">Cool. Good concept, nice exposure colors. I would have tried to keep it all the numbers in focus. Even though it''s neatly put together I would have spent a bit more on the finish of the set up - the orange dial on the 11 - 12 hours. <br/> <br/>I will give it a 6 but might come back later. Good Luck</td>', 'Cool. Good concept, nice exposure colors. I would have tried to keep it all the numbers in focus. Even though it''s neatly put together I would have spent a bit more on the finish of the set up - the orange dial on the 11 - 12 hours.  I will give it a 6 but might come back later. Good Luck', '2013-10-19 12:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118420, 1086983, 118154, '<td valign="top">As an image its arresting and tells a story.As to the connection to the title a little literal but it does convey despair.6.</td>', 'As an image its arresting and tells a story.As to the connection to the title a little literal but it does convey despair.6.', '2013-10-19 12:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
