(7118429, 1087187, 8759, '<td valign="top">Well, I like BW. This one looks a bit too processed. Seems that is something missing, a cat, a person. The image also appears distorted and its bothering a bit. 5 Good luck</td>', 'Well, I like BW. This one looks a bit too processed. Seems that is something missing, a cat, a person. The image also appears distorted and its bothering a bit. 5 Good luck', '2013-10-19 13:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
