(7118465, 1087004, 94815, '<td valign="top">Windmills in his mind. I like the point of view here as seen by the knight - a target for his lance. Technically, it''s a little dull - some processing to bring out contrast and details would help. I give it a 7 for content, a 6 for composition and a 5 for technique. Result: 6</td>', 'Windmills in his mind. I like the point of view here as seen by the knight - a target for his lance. Technically, it''s a little dull - some processing to bring out contrast and details would help. I give it a 7 for content, a 6 for composition and a 5 for technique. Result: 6', '2013-10-19 14:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118466, 1087162, 59029, '<td valign="top">That you, Josh?  Great triple-self port, even the ugly one :-) 9</td>', 'That you, Josh?  Great triple-self port, even the ugly one :-) 9', '2013-10-19 14:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118467, 1086999, 59029, '<td valign="top">Good image but missing that little bit extra - he''s meant to be asking for more porridge so there should be some hint of residue in the spoon and bowl.</td>', 'Good image but missing that little bit extra - he''s meant to be asking for more porridge so there should be some hint of residue in the spoon and bowl.', '2013-10-19 14:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
