(7118469, 1086986, 59029, '<td valign="top">Some boys playing with sticks in the woods.  By their expressions I''d guess they''re meant to be hunters.  I''d expect to see them a lot more scruffed up, like with scratches and bruises on their arms etc (hey, it''s October - you can get fake blood and scar tissue anywhere) than they are to add some authenticity to the scene.</td>', 'Some boys playing with sticks in the woods.  By their expressions I''d guess they''re meant to be hunters.  I''d expect to see them a lot more scruffed up, like with scratches and bruises on their arms etc (hey, it''s October - you can get fake blood and scar tissue anywhere) than they are to add some authenticity to the scene.', '2013-10-19 14:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118470, 1086744, 59029, '<td valign="top">Elegantly simple. 7</td>', 'Elegantly simple. 7', '2013-10-19 14:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118473, 1086761, 94815, '<td valign="top">The sentiment seems a stretch mitigated by the quote to guide our thinking. So we see residue and I think detritus of past lives such as Jean Valjean''s on the run. Still a stretch, but I enjoy edgy shots and this has a spare visual quality that prompts our minds to take another look and thought. 6, for the edge.</td>', 'The sentiment seems a stretch mitigated by the quote to guide our thinking. So we see residue and I think detritus of past lives such as Jean Valjean''s on the run. Still a stretch, but I enjoy edgy shots and this has a spare visual quality that prompts our minds to take another look and thought. 6, for the edge.', '2013-10-19 14:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118479, 1087216, 94815, '<td valign="top">I suppose this is a "wry" take on "rye" but I''m sorry for not getting it. I look forward to some kind of hint when voting is over. Trying even to relate the pictural elements is a struggle. Let''s see: black curtain; Hendricks poster; another poster seems familiar but can''t place it; a balding smiley face (lurking in the Hendrix Experience museum?); and a sprig of rye? Probably. But what does it all mean? Something obscure, at least to me. I like obscurity. 6</td>', 'I suppose this is a "wry" take on "rye" but I''m sorry for not getting it. I look forward to some kind of hint when voting is over. Trying even to relate the pictural elements is a struggle. Let''s see: black curtain; Hendricks poster; another poster seems familiar but can''t place it; a balding smiley face (lurking in the Hendrix Experience museum?); and a sprig of rye? Probably. But what does it all mean? Something obscure, at least to me. I like obscurity. 6', '2013-10-19 14:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118484, 1087125, 94815, '<td valign="top">This lacks atmosphere or a connection to the "golden" aspect of the story. Just a country pond. Color is good but the composition is uncommitted. Like a passing glance with lots of trees and not much pond. Could have been better as a landscape centering on the pond''s breadth and depth with watery reflections of gold and red. Even a simple cropping out the upper 60% of the shot could come closer to title''s idea. 4</td>', 'This lacks atmosphere or a connection to the "golden" aspect of the story. Just a country pond. Color is good but the composition is uncommitted. Like a passing glance with lots of trees and not much pond. Could have been better as a landscape centering on the pond''s breadth and depth with watery reflections of gold and red. Even a simple cropping out the upper 60% of the shot could come closer to title''s idea. 4', '2013-10-19 14:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118485, 1087207, 94815, '<td valign="top">Why choose a short story writer for a "Classic Novel" topic? Visually I love the wet cabbage. Hold for topics such as "colitis cures", or "vegan card party" challenges. 5 for the cabbage.</td>', 'Why choose a short story writer for a "Classic Novel" topic? Visually I love the wet cabbage. Hold for topics such as "colitis cures", or "vegan card party" challenges. 5 for the cabbage.', '2013-10-19 15:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118487, 1087150, 94815, '<td valign="top">Don''t know the book and can''t find it with Google. Doesn''t seem to have any reference to the dike plugging story, so regrets for defaulting to a DNMC. The image looks unprocessed on my monitor, but could be improved in a photo editor as with most digital images. Overall, it needs contrast and some selective editing to bring out detail and accurate colors. 4</td>', 'Don''t know the book and can''t find it with Google. Doesn''t seem to have any reference to the dike plugging story, so regrets for defaulting to a DNMC. The image looks unprocessed on my monitor, but could be improved in a photo editor as with most digital images. Overall, it needs contrast and some selective editing to bring out detail and accurate colors. 4', '2013-10-19 15:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118488, 1087219, 94815, '<td valign="top">Black Swan or at least a goose it is.. Comp, tones and detail add up to an appealing image. 6</td>', 'Black Swan or at least a goose it is.. Comp, tones and detail add up to an appealing image. 6', '2013-10-19 15:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118499, 1086679, 68178, '<td valign="top">I have not read this book. With that in mind, this has an appropriateness about it. The hint of worship and the warm rich yellows really work well. 8</td>', 'I have not read this book. With that in mind, this has an appropriateness about it. The hint of worship and the warm rich yellows really work well. 8', '2013-10-19 15:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118527, 1086340, 68178, '<td valign="top">Clever! Not a bad take, but it doesn''t blow me away either. 5</td>', 'Clever! Not a bad take, but it doesn''t blow me away either. 5', '2013-10-19 16:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118530, 1086113, 68178, '<td valign="top">A decent candid. I get the tie to the story, but it feels forced a little. A little more on the dark scale would have helped build the story in this picture, as the only really dark spot is in the top corner and pulls my attention to it. 5</td>', 'A decent candid. I get the tie to the story, but it feels forced a little. A little more on the dark scale would have helped build the story in this picture, as the only really dark spot is in the top corner and pulls my attention to it. 5', '2013-10-19 16:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118534, 1087039, 94815, '<td valign="top">It''s a real stretch to call this a "classic" novel and although the very harsh processing does add a brittle quality (as of glass in a fantasy world), in the end the extreme processing becomes too overpowering and the digital artifacts dominate the impact, especially in the mottled sky and the black mush of the shadows. 5</td>', 'It''s a real stretch to call this a "classic" novel and although the very harsh processing does add a brittle quality (as of glass in a fantasy world), in the end the extreme processing becomes too overpowering and the digital artifacts dominate the impact, especially in the mottled sky and the black mush of the shadows. 5', '2013-10-19 16:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118540, 1087039, 68178, '<td valign="top">There are apparently several of these books, none of which I''ve read and mostly new. Not sure if I''m missing something there. I like the mood of this shot, but there are some aberrations that keep me from loving it. There is some over-sharpness particularly on the windows and cars, and some over smoothing on the sidewalks and clouds. Neither would be that bad by themselves in the context of this image, but combined they clash. 5</td>', 'There are apparently several of these books, none of which I''ve read and mostly new. Not sure if I''m missing something there. I like the mood of this shot, but there are some aberrations that keep me from loving it. There is some over-sharpness particularly on the windows and cars, and some over smoothing on the sidewalks and clouds. Neither would be that bad by themselves in the context of this image, but combined they clash. 5', '2013-10-19 16:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118543, 1086858, 68178, '<td valign="top">Interesting architecture. Well framed and interesting. I''m not sure I would consider that a classic though, and as such it feels like a forced entry. Might have scored better in a different challenge. 5</td>', 'Interesting architecture. Well framed and interesting. I''m not sure I would consider that a classic though, and as such it feels like a forced entry. Might have scored better in a different challenge. 5', '2013-10-19 16:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118548, 1086479, 68178, '<td valign="top">I can''t really tell if it is sunset on a farm, or on a field. The colors are nice and I like the silhouette of the trees, but it still seems to be missing a stronger tie to the story. 5</td>', 'I can''t really tell if it is sunset on a farm, or on a field. The colors are nice and I like the silhouette of the trees, but it still seems to be missing a stronger tie to the story. 5', '2013-10-19 16:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118549, 1087093, 68178, '<td valign="top">Love the shot, but the tie to the story is not there. Not really what I would consider a classic either. Would have rated it higher in a different challenge. 5</td>', 'Love the shot, but the tie to the story is not there. Not really what I would consider a classic either. Would have rated it higher in a different challenge. 5', '2013-10-19 16:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118550, 1086914, 94815, '<td valign="top">I think the aspidistra alone is too literal to serve as a visual extension of the novel although in the image, it does have the thrust of motion upward and away and so appears to reflect the title. The strictly photographic qualities do not make it stand out beyond a simple plant macro however, so it is difficult to consider better than an average vote. 5</td>', 'I think the aspidistra alone is too literal to serve as a visual extension of the novel although in the image, it does have the thrust of motion upward and away and so appears to reflect the title. The strictly photographic qualities do not make it stand out beyond a simple plant macro however, so it is difficult to consider better than an average vote. 5', '2013-10-19 16:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118552, 1086672, 30861, '<td valign="top">You made a very good choice here, changing the eye colors and expressions on each side of the face. I actually think this works, as an image, a LOT better than the heavily bilateral one you showed me earlier. I''m not voting on this, of course, but if I were you''d be in my 8 group right now.</td>', 'You made a very good choice here, changing the eye colors and expressions on each side of the face. I actually think this works, as an image, a LOT better than the heavily bilateral one you showed me earlier. I''m not voting on this, of course, but if I were you''d be in my 8 group right now.', '2013-10-19 16:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118554, 1087023, 68178, '<td valign="top">I can kind of see the tie here. If this is a government building it would help tie it to the story in a modern way, but I can''t tell if that is the case. Otherwise an interesting shot. The colors and angles play well, and the sky gives it a sense of height. Still, it seems forced in this challenge. 5</td>', 'I can kind of see the tie here. If this is a government building it would help tie it to the story in a modern way, but I can''t tell if that is the case. Otherwise an interesting shot. The colors and angles play well, and the sky gives it a sense of height. Still, it seems forced in this challenge. 5', '2013-10-19 16:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118557, 1087194, 30861, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot to like in this image, as far as lighting and processing, though to my eyes you''ve tone-mapped it a little too flat. But the thing of it is, what''s not working as well for me here is that every face is obscured, not visible. I know there''s not much you could do about it (sure don''t want to stand in FRONT of these event) but the bottom line is, it''s all so STATIC: a hint of emotion in the faces would have helped that.<br/> <br/>A 5 from me.</td>', 'There''s a lot to like in this image, as far as lighting and processing, though to my eyes you''ve tone-mapped it a little too flat. But the thing of it is, what''s not working as well for me here is that every face is obscured, not visible. I know there''s not much you could do about it (sure don''t want to stand in FRONT of these event) but the bottom line is, it''s all so STATIC: a hint of emotion in the faces would have helped that. A 5 from me.', '2013-10-19 16:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118560, 1086986, 30861, '<td valign="top">This works rather well with the novel :-) The expression of the central boy''s not entirely convincing, but the unexpected face in the lower left is priceless. I like the matter-of-fact processing and the artless composition. By "artless", I mean that it doesn''t seem forced or unnatural or contrived, it feels spontaneous.<br/> <br/>Very nicely done, 8 from me.</td>', 'This works rather well with the novel :-) The expression of the central boy''s not entirely convincing, but the unexpected face in the lower left is priceless. I like the matter-of-fact processing and the artless composition. By "artless", I mean that it doesn''t seem forced or unnatural or contrived, it feels spontaneous. Very nicely done, 8 from me.', '2013-10-19 17:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118562, 1087015, 94815, '<td valign="top">Overprocessing has clumped up the normal tonal range and the composition lacks clear intent. As to subject matter, this comes closer to the source inspiration than most images in the challenge. 5</td>', 'Overprocessing has clumped up the normal tonal range and the composition lacks clear intent. As to subject matter, this comes closer to the source inspiration than most images in the challenge. 5', '2013-10-19 17:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118564, 1087072, 68178, '<td valign="top">This seems like a loose tie to the book, though I have only read the plot summary so take this with a grain of salt. Not a bad shot, but I don''t get the feeling that it emotes much of the story. 5</td>', 'This seems like a loose tie to the book, though I have only read the plot summary so take this with a grain of salt. Not a bad shot, but I don''t get the feeling that it emotes much of the story. 5', '2013-10-19 17:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118565, 1087057, 94815, '<td valign="top">Captures the mood of the lazy autumn day, although the outboard motor becomes an anachronism when considering Huck Finn. Composition and tones look good and I love the reflected mast leading in. 6</td>', 'Captures the mood of the lazy autumn day, although the outboard motor becomes an anachronism when considering Huck Finn. Composition and tones look good and I love the reflected mast leading in. 6', '2013-10-19 17:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118567, 1087201, 94815, '<td valign="top">The image is too contrasty and oversaturated, but there is some of the mood as if we were looking out from a secret place to the outside light. 5</td>', 'The image is too contrasty and oversaturated, but there is some of the mood as if we were looking out from a secret place to the outside light. 5', '2013-10-19 17:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118568, 1087122, 30861, '<td valign="top">I want to like this one so much more than I actually do :-( What''s NOT to like? A curving stream, some shorebirds, an interesting tree... The elements are here. The composition''s decent. But the processing isn''t doing this justice; you''ve used tone mapping to flatten the scene very unnaturally, and it''s also feeling very "crunchy" as a result of too much added structure or local-area contrast.<br/> <br/>But, beyond technical issues, there''s nothing much in this image to serve as a focal point around which it can organize. That''s not always a serious flaw, but the issue here is that there are so MANY details that we need at least ONE aspect of it to stand out and take control. If, for example, one of the birds were wading in the nearer foreground, that might help a lot.<br/> <br/>5 from me</td>', 'I want to like this one so much more than I actually do :-( What''s NOT to like? A curving stream, some shorebirds, an interesting tree... The elements are here. The composition''s decent. But the processing isn''t doing this justice; you''ve used tone mapping to flatten the scene very unnaturally, and it''s also feeling very "crunchy" as a result of too much added structure or local-area contrast. But, beyond technical issues, there''s nothing much in this image to serve as a focal point around which it can organize. That''s not always a serious flaw, but the issue here is that there are so MANY details that we need at least ONE aspect of it to stand out and take control. If, for example, one of the birds were wading in the nearer foreground, that might help a lot. 5 from me', '2013-10-19 17:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118571, 1087222, 94815, '<td valign="top">Creative visual effect - she looks like a poster cutout pasted onto a photorealistic old car painting. A character transported from the Gatsby country club into a barn. 6 for something different.</td>', 'Creative visual effect - she looks like a poster cutout pasted onto a photorealistic old car painting. A character transported from the Gatsby country club into a barn. 6 for something different.', '2013-10-19 17:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118572, 1086761, 30861, '<td valign="top">A striking image. Very powerful. The connection to Les Mis is tenuous for me, but I''m taking things perhaps more literally than ought to be doing, and I''ll acknowledge that at a metaphorical level you''re it''s working hard.<br/> <br/>8 from me</td>', 'A striking image. Very powerful. The connection to Les Mis is tenuous for me, but I''m taking things perhaps more literally than ought to be doing, and I''ll acknowledge that at a metaphorical level you''re it''s working hard. 8 from me', '2013-10-19 17:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118573, 1087205, 94815, '<td valign="top">Haven''t read Proust but I know it''s long and can understand how the shriveled leaves may reflect such a long passage of time spend in writing the entire set, or perhaps Proust''s regret for "lost time". So the image might even serve as an illustration for a literary work which defies illustration. As to the image itself, the color and detail are suburb but the crop/composition could be improved quite a bit. In other words, while the subject itself (the leaves) are visually appealing, the effect is marred by several unattractive elements such as the black glare (upper right) and the edge of the shelf. Better to burn in the glare and crop out the shelf. And of course, if possible recapture the right edges of the leaves which are currently cropped out. Ultimately the worthy qualities are outweighed by these defects which if corrected could result in a 6 or 7 from me but in its current state, only a 5.</td>', 'Haven''t read Proust but I know it''s long and can understand how the shriveled leaves may reflect such a long passage of time spend in writing the entire set, or perhaps Proust''s regret for "lost time". So the image might even serve as an illustration for a literary work which defies illustration. As to the image itself, the color and detail are suburb but the crop/composition could be improved quite a bit. In other words, while the subject itself (the leaves) are visually appealing, the effect is marred by several unattractive elements such as the black glare (upper right) and the edge of the shelf. Better to burn in the glare and crop out the shelf. And of course, if possible recapture the right edges of the leaves which are currently cropped out. Ultimately the worthy qualities are outweighed by these defects which if corrected could result in a 6 or 7 from me but in its current state, only a 5.', '2013-10-19 17:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118574, 1086987, 94815, '<td valign="top">I know these fish. Love the color and the filigree and the sense of depth even in a shallow pool. Water yes, but babies - ok transformed into water creatures, maybe. 6 anyway for visual appeal.</td>', 'I know these fish. Love the color and the filigree and the sense of depth even in a shallow pool. Water yes, but babies - ok transformed into water creatures, maybe. 6 anyway for visual appeal.', '2013-10-19 17:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118576, 1086672, 94815, '<td valign="top">Shouldn''t the knife blade be on the other side amplifying Hyde''s personality, or is this Hyde threatening Jekyll? Anyway, technically well produced as a photo although the facial expressions doesn''t quite fit with my impression of the story or its characters. 6</td>', 'Shouldn''t the knife blade be on the other side amplifying Hyde''s personality, or is this Hyde threatening Jekyll? Anyway, technically well produced as a photo although the facial expressions doesn''t quite fit with my impression of the story or its characters. 6', '2013-10-19 17:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118581, 1087036, 68178, '<td valign="top">Not sure I see the connection to the story, outside of architecture. I like the reflection on the water and the subtle ripples, and the just after sundown blue really looks nice. Would have rated higher in a different challenge. 6</td>', 'Not sure I see the connection to the story, outside of architecture. I like the reflection on the water and the subtle ripples, and the just after sundown blue really looks nice. Would have rated higher in a different challenge. 6', '2013-10-19 17:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118582, 1087198, 30861, '<td valign="top">What''s nice about this, is that it actually feels like it''s a reasonable period piece, faithful to the time in which Joyce wrote the book. The eyes are terrific, the ears weighted down by the hat, the upthrust chin: there''s a bit of bewildered, a bit of apprehension, a bit of resistance all speaking here.<br/> <br/>The eyes aren''t quite as sharp as the nose and lips, and I''d like them to be tack sharp. The skin color seems a little cool to me. But allin all, a very nice entry. 7 from me.</td>', 'What''s nice about this, is that it actually feels like it''s a reasonable period piece, faithful to the time in which Joyce wrote the book. The eyes are terrific, the ears weighted down by the hat, the upthrust chin: there''s a bit of bewildered, a bit of apprehension, a bit of resistance all speaking here. The eyes aren''t quite as sharp as the nose and lips, and I''d like them to be tack sharp. The skin color seems a little cool to me. But allin all, a very nice entry. 7 from me.', '2013-10-19 17:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118587, 1086858, 112828, '<td valign="top">Hardly a classic novel.<br/> <br/>Image fits the book well though.  And is quite well shot and processed.<br/> <br/>6</td>', 'Hardly a classic novel. Image fits the book well though.  And is quite well shot and processed. 6', '2013-10-19 17:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118592, 1086914, 68178, '<td valign="top">I have not read the book, but I read the plot summary and this seems like a fitting piece. The stark black and the simplicity are quite appealing. 7</td>', 'I have not read the book, but I read the plot summary and this seems like a fitting piece. The stark black and the simplicity are quite appealing. 7', '2013-10-19 17:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118601, 1086700, 68178, '<td valign="top">The deep tones on the black and white scale are very appropriate for this shot, and reflect on the story well. All of the items are very symbolic of the main pieces of the story, down to the flower for the mouses grave. 8</td>', 'The deep tones on the black and white scale are very appropriate for this shot, and reflect on the story well. All of the items are very symbolic of the main pieces of the story, down to the flower for the mouses grave. 8', '2013-10-19 17:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118614, 1086987, 112828, '<td valign="top">Fits better than expected really.  The image here seems to really work for the novel in unexpected ways.<br/> <br/>The motion blur is really quite well done too.  <br/> <br/>A bit of artifacting/oversharpening will keep me from giving this all the love it could have gotten, but I think a 7 is deserved.</td>', 'Fits better than expected really.  The image here seems to really work for the novel in unexpected ways. The motion blur is really quite well done too.   A bit of artifacting/oversharpening will keep me from giving this all the love it could have gotten, but I think a 7 is deserved.', '2013-10-19 18:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118621, 1086683, 68178, '<td valign="top">The tones and grain give it a sense of foreboding that I like. The slight disassociated feel of the plant works well. This is one of the Vonnegut books that I haven''t read, and reading the plot summary doesn''t give me enough to make a tie to the story. 7</td>', 'The tones and grain give it a sense of foreboding that I like. The slight disassociated feel of the plant works well. This is one of the Vonnegut books that I haven''t read, and reading the plot summary doesn''t give me enough to make a tie to the story. 7', '2013-10-19 18:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118625, 1086989, 68178, '<td valign="top">Clearly a main theme of the book. The warm orange tones are pleasant, the foggy haze in front of the islands gives it depth. Would like a little more story rather than just scene, but that is a minor nitpick. 7</td>', 'Clearly a main theme of the book. The warm orange tones are pleasant, the foggy haze in front of the islands gives it depth. Would like a little more story rather than just scene, but that is a minor nitpick. 7', '2013-10-19 18:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118627, 1087195, 68178, '<td valign="top">Outstanding shot! The smooth water with ever so faint ripples, and low sun in the fog, leaving just a silhouette of the trees is very well done. I have only read the plot summary and not the book, but the tie to the story rather than the title is not clear. Would have rated it higher in another challenge, or with a clearer story tie (though I may be missing that). 7</td>', 'Outstanding shot! The smooth water with ever so faint ripples, and low sun in the fog, leaving just a silhouette of the trees is very well done. I have only read the plot summary and not the book, but the tie to the story rather than the title is not clear. Would have rated it higher in another challenge, or with a clearer story tie (though I may be missing that). 7', '2013-10-19 18:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118629, 1087078, 68178, '<td valign="top">Perfect range of deep blacks and stark whites. I''m not sure what this is, and I can''t find a relation to the story. A tad too abstract for me, leaving the tie to the story something I can only imagine. Might have scored it higher in a different challenge. 6</td>', 'Perfect range of deep blacks and stark whites. I''m not sure what this is, and I can''t find a relation to the story. A tad too abstract for me, leaving the tie to the story something I can only imagine. Might have scored it higher in a different challenge. 6', '2013-10-19 18:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118631, 1087205, 68178, '<td valign="top">I have not read the story, only the plot summary. This still feels like an ambiguous take on the story, that may or may not have anything at all to do with what the story is about. The colors and tones and textures all work well, but the edge at the bottom of the page could be straightened or removed. It draws my attention from the content as it is. 6</td>', 'I have not read the story, only the plot summary. This still feels like an ambiguous take on the story, that may or may not have anything at all to do with what the story is about. The colors and tones and textures all work well, but the edge at the bottom of the page could be straightened or removed. It draws my attention from the content as it is. 6', '2013-10-19 18:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118637, 1087198, 68178, '<td valign="top">Frankly I''m surprised this wasn''t done more. I for the most part want more ties to the story, but this is a little different. It still loosely reflects the story, but is a play on the art commonly associated with this book. For that I can forgive the beard, but the round glasses are a crucial part of that art. 6</td>', 'Frankly I''m surprised this wasn''t done more. I for the most part want more ties to the story, but this is a little different. It still loosely reflects the story, but is a play on the art commonly associated with this book. For that I can forgive the beard, but the round glasses are a crucial part of that art. 6', '2013-10-19 18:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118642, 1086987, 68178, '<td valign="top">I like the color and the motion here. The framing is a little weird, but that may have been unavoidable. I have not read the book, only the synopsis, so I am unsure of the water babies are represented as fish or something else entirely. 6</td>', 'I like the color and the motion here. The framing is a little weird, but that may have been unavoidable. I have not read the book, only the synopsis, so I am unsure of the water babies are represented as fish or something else entirely. 6', '2013-10-19 18:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118643, 1086978, 68178, '<td valign="top">A very fitting image for the story, or vice versa. The yellow leaf contrasts nicely against the damp soil (from the storm that knocked the last leaf off?) and stones. Would have maybe moved the pine needles, but it doesn''t really distract. 7</td>', 'A very fitting image for the story, or vice versa. The yellow leaf contrasts nicely against the damp soil (from the storm that knocked the last leaf off?) and stones. Would have maybe moved the pine needles, but it doesn''t really distract. 7', '2013-10-19 19:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118645, 1086865, 68178, '<td valign="top">Quite a nice image, but lacking in it''s tie to the story. Feels like just a play on the title, and then a loose one as it''s clearly not Africa. Would have scored it higher in a different challenge. 6</td>', 'Quite a nice image, but lacking in it''s tie to the story. Feels like just a play on the title, and then a loose one as it''s clearly not Africa. Would have scored it higher in a different challenge. 6', '2013-10-19 19:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118646, 1087135, 68178, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot that I don''t feel ties to the story well. I like the darker tones, and the curious nature of the prop. Would like to see it more centered, and maybe framed better by the plants if possible. 6</td>', 'An interesting shot that I don''t feel ties to the story well. I like the darker tones, and the curious nature of the prop. Would like to see it more centered, and maybe framed better by the plants if possible. 6', '2013-10-19 19:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118648, 1087022, 68178, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what the tie to the story is with this shot. I have only read the synopsis, so I may be missing something. I like the grey tones, but would like a little stronger blacks and whites. The missing left portion of the statue distracts some as well. 5</td>', 'I''m not sure what the tie to the story is with this shot. I have only read the synopsis, so I may be missing something. I like the grey tones, but would like a little stronger blacks and whites. The missing left portion of the statue distracts some as well. 5', '2013-10-19 19:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118649, 1086433, 68178, '<td valign="top">A very nice shot, but the tie to the book is a reach. The sundown reds are quite nice, and the scope as the foreground element works well. Would have scored it higher in a different challenge. 6</td>', 'A very nice shot, but the tie to the book is a reach. The sundown reds are quite nice, and the scope as the foreground element works well. Would have scored it higher in a different challenge. 6', '2013-10-19 19:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118650, 1087065, 68178, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, and the tie to the story is strong. The model walking in the rain seemingly blind fits well. The tones are nice and I''m glad it''s black and white. Not sure I''m ready to call it a classic, but I didn''t mark it down for that. 7</td>', 'Lovely shot, and the tie to the story is strong. The model walking in the rain seemingly blind fits well. The tones are nice and I''m glad it''s black and white. Not sure I''m ready to call it a classic, but I didn''t mark it down for that. 7', '2013-10-19 19:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118652, 1087141, 68178, '<td valign="top">A stark mood, that seems appropriate for the story. Black and white, right and wrong. The religious statue and church like building are pluses. Not sure I''m ready to call it a classic, but I didn''t mark it down for that. 7</td>', 'A stark mood, that seems appropriate for the story. Black and white, right and wrong. The religious statue and church like building are pluses. Not sure I''m ready to call it a classic, but I didn''t mark it down for that. 7', '2013-10-19 19:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118655, 1086734, 68178, '<td valign="top">Pretty spectacular! I really like he motion in the blowing snow and clouds, and deep contrast in the sky. Having only read the synopsis, the tie to the story is not great but it is there. 8</td>', 'Pretty spectacular! I really like he motion in the blowing snow and clouds, and deep contrast in the sky. Having only read the synopsis, the tie to the story is not great but it is there. 8', '2013-10-19 19:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118656, 1087162, 100831, '<td valign="top">Excellent image.... book perfect!  Bump.</td>', 'Excellent image.... book perfect!  Bump.', '2013-10-19 19:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118657, 1087044, 68178, '<td valign="top">Not really a tie to the book, other than the title. Quite a nice shot otherwise. The layered blues and impending storm work well together, and play on the obvious cold. Would have rated it higher in a different challenge. 6</td>', 'Not really a tie to the book, other than the title. Quite a nice shot otherwise. The layered blues and impending storm work well together, and play on the obvious cold. Would have rated it higher in a different challenge. 6', '2013-10-19 19:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118658, 1087057, 50695, '<td valign="top">Competent photo of water and reeds, but it says nothing to me. 2</td>', 'Competent photo of water and reeds, but it says nothing to me. 2', '2013-10-19 19:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118659, 1086761, 68178, '<td valign="top">An grab at an interpretation I think, but none the less I really like this. The minimalism, grain and colors all play well. 7</td>', 'An grab at an interpretation I think, but none the less I really like this. The minimalism, grain and colors all play well. 7', '2013-10-19 19:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118660, 1086979, 68178, '<td valign="top">I can kind of feel the tie to the story on this one but it may be a bit of a stretch. I like the rays of light though the trees and water fall. The plants in the foreground might be a tad over processed, especially in the light on the left. 6</td>', 'I can kind of feel the tie to the story on this one but it may be a bit of a stretch. I like the rays of light though the trees and water fall. The plants in the foreground might be a tad over processed, especially in the light on the left. 6', '2013-10-19 19:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118661, 1087000, 68178, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and soft feel to this, but it may be a tad too soft. The plants covering her chin distract a little. 6</td>', 'I like the colors and soft feel to this, but it may be a tad too soft. The plants covering her chin distract a little. 6', '2013-10-19 19:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118663, 1086113, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like this energetic angle and composition, combined with the angry micro-expression of what I believe is a fast food employee going beyond the call of duty. <br/> <br/>The more I read about the novel, the less this seems to connect to it, but I do see a connection to the title and to the author, as we see capitalism in action, and anger repressed beneath it. 8</td>', 'I like this energetic angle and composition, combined with the angry micro-expression of what I believe is a fast food employee going beyond the call of duty.  The more I read about the novel, the less this seems to connect to it, but I do see a connection to the title and to the author, as we see capitalism in action, and anger repressed beneath it. 8', '2013-10-19 19:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118664, 1087139, 68178, '<td valign="top">Not a clear tie to the book, except for the title. The layout and DOF are nice, and the tones very realistic, but it doesn''t wow me. 5</td>', 'Not a clear tie to the book, except for the title. The layout and DOF are nice, and the tones very realistic, but it doesn''t wow me. 5', '2013-10-19 19:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118665, 1087194, 50695, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t feel like the decisive moment, even though I see sparks flying from the cannon. Everyone is looking away or has their face blocked. Sometimes this can be intriguing, but in this case it just creates a sense of everyone being bored. The flag in the foreground is awkwardly placed. The processing is weird... an oversaturated HDR. I don''t know what effect you''re trying to create with it. Also, the composition is close in on a centered subject, and therefore low energy. 2</td>', 'This doesn''t feel like the decisive moment, even though I see sparks flying from the cannon. Everyone is looking away or has their face blocked. Sometimes this can be intriguing, but in this case it just creates a sense of everyone being bored. The flag in the foreground is awkwardly placed. The processing is weird... an oversaturated HDR. I don''t know what effect you''re trying to create with it. Also, the composition is close in on a centered subject, and therefore low energy. 2', '2013-10-19 19:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118666, 1087121, 68178, '<td valign="top">I like the subtle variations in the greys and whites. There is a strong tie to the story. I can almost feel the chill from the rain. 7</td>', 'I like the subtle variations in the greys and whites. There is a strong tie to the story. I can almost feel the chill from the rain. 7', '2013-10-19 19:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118667, 1086999, 50695, '<td valign="top">all the details of the photo are comfortable middle class, which underlines that this photo is only an exercise (seeing some dirt on his right hand just makes it seem more contrived). on a positive note, I like the composition of dark shapes protruding from the background. It gives a sculptural feel to the image. 4</td>', 'all the details of the photo are comfortable middle class, which underlines that this photo is only an exercise (seeing some dirt on his right hand just makes it seem more contrived). on a positive note, I like the composition of dark shapes protruding from the background. It gives a sculptural feel to the image. 4', '2013-10-19 19:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118668, 1086939, 68178, '<td valign="top">This really looks like a painting, especially the clouds and sun. A nice shot, but it plays only on the title and not so much on the story, though I have only read the synopsis and might be missing something. I might have rated it higher in a different challenge. 6</td>', 'This really looks like a painting, especially the clouds and sun. A nice shot, but it plays only on the title and not so much on the story, though I have only read the synopsis and might be missing something. I might have rated it higher in a different challenge. 6', '2013-10-19 19:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118669, 1087223, 50695, '<td valign="top">Lovely blur effect, appropriate for the book you are portraying, as is the position and pose of the girl... entering another world. Unfortunately, it''s become almost a cliche to put someone on a walkway with lots of leading-line perspective and add a kind of glowing blur to it. 6</td>', 'Lovely blur effect, appropriate for the book you are portraying, as is the position and pose of the girl... entering another world. Unfortunately, it''s become almost a cliche to put someone on a walkway with lots of leading-line perspective and add a kind of glowing blur to it. 6', '2013-10-19 19:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118670, 1087187, 94815, '<td valign="top">I hate to nitpick topicality but the book is neither a novel nor can it be considered a "classic". However the image seems suitable, say, as a possible dilapidated building where the author might have lived. As to the image itself, I enjoy the collection of textures and spaces, even the random wiring that characterizes such a run-down urban residence. But visually the problem is that there is so much going on that the viewer is quickly overwhelmed with too much information, especially with the texture-amplifying processing. Personally, I''m drawn to the deep blackness of the door, but distracted by the surrounding activity. I think a tighter crop on the window and door would make the impact much stronger. It''s a tough subject and the image reminds me of many I''ve taken myself but disgarded because I couldn''t decide what to do with them. So your effort is commendable but I can''t go above a 6 for the reasons above.</td>', 'I hate to nitpick topicality but the book is neither a novel nor can it be considered a "classic". However the image seems suitable, say, as a possible dilapidated building where the author might have lived. As to the image itself, I enjoy the collection of textures and spaces, even the random wiring that characterizes such a run-down urban residence. But visually the problem is that there is so much going on that the viewer is quickly overwhelmed with too much information, especially with the texture-amplifying processing. Personally, I''m drawn to the deep blackness of the door, but distracted by the surrounding activity. I think a tighter crop on the window and door would make the impact much stronger. It''s a tough subject and the image reminds me of many I''ve taken myself but disgarded because I couldn''t decide what to do with them. So your effort is commendable but I can''t go above a 6 for the reasons above.', '2013-10-19 20:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118671, 1087055, 50695, '<td valign="top">this is indeed appropriate to the book. I like the look she''s giving DPC. It says "Screw you!" There''s not much to commend this as an image, but at least it has a message with some oomph, so I''ll give you a 6.</td>', 'this is indeed appropriate to the book. I like the look she''s giving DPC. It says "Screw you!" There''s not much to commend this as an image, but at least it has a message with some oomph, so I''ll give you a 6.', '2013-10-19 20:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118672, 1086479, 50695, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect caused by all that sharpness. It creates an interesting texture on a scene that would otherwise bore me. In fact, that abrasive sharpness is a form of "cold comfort," so I''ll give you a 6.</td>', 'Interesting effect caused by all that sharpness. It creates an interesting texture on a scene that would otherwise bore me. In fact, that abrasive sharpness is a form of "cold comfort," so I''ll give you a 6.', '2013-10-19 20:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118676, 1086865, 30861, '<td valign="top">As reflected in a Rocky Mountain lake :-) It''s a very beautiful scene, and it benefits from the clean, understated processing. I''m not completely wowed by it, but I appreciate a good landscape shot, and I''m slotting it in my 7 group for now, pending later revision as I see more images.</td>', 'As reflected in a Rocky Mountain lake :-) It''s a very beautiful scene, and it benefits from the clean, understated processing. I''m not completely wowed by it, but I appreciate a good landscape shot, and I''m slotting it in my 7 group for now, pending later revision as I see more images.', '2013-10-19 20:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118677, 1086479, 94815, '<td valign="top">This is pretty as a rural sunset but hasn''t much in the way of references to the book, at least as I understand from a synopsis. Maybe some farm buildings or a fence or some equipment or better some farmers, especially a younger woman, we could sense something of the novel. 5</td>', 'This is pretty as a rural sunset but hasn''t much in the way of references to the book, at least as I understand from a synopsis. Maybe some farm buildings or a fence or some equipment or better some farmers, especially a younger woman, we could sense something of the novel. 5', '2013-10-19 20:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118679, 1087170, 94815, '<td valign="top">It''s one thing to show racks of what might be security/surveillance equipment and quite another to relate it to the story. The connection is missing here as far as I can see. There is nothing threatening as in the novel, just banks of equipment whose purpose is not clear in the image. Visually, is lacks a point of reference which could be achieved by closer point of view on something significant such as a camera or someone being spied upon in the monitors. It''s an interesting subject, however, to which most of us may never have access and could use a lot of visual explaining. Look at all those red switches, for example. What do they do? How could you visually hint at their use? As is, the image doesn''t tell us anything. 4</td>', 'It''s one thing to show racks of what might be security/surveillance equipment and quite another to relate it to the story. The connection is missing here as far as I can see. There is nothing threatening as in the novel, just banks of equipment whose purpose is not clear in the image. Visually, is lacks a point of reference which could be achieved by closer point of view on something significant such as a camera or someone being spied upon in the monitors. It''s an interesting subject, however, to which most of us may never have access and could use a lot of visual explaining. Look at all those red switches, for example. What do they do? How could you visually hint at their use? As is, the image doesn''t tell us anything. 4', '2013-10-19 20:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118680, 1087055, 94815, '<td valign="top">Yes quite a "classic" as I remember. This certainly suggests the raw sexuality of the book, but I think the thong is an anachronism. Better wearing nothing at all if a period piece of undress isn''t available. Also I think the book was an indoor setting, so the leafy shadows don''t fit either. But enough nitpicking. The challenge was to draw inspiration, and that you''ve done. Clearly, in a most elemental way. 5 for a lovely breast.</td>', 'Yes quite a "classic" as I remember. This certainly suggests the raw sexuality of the book, but I think the thong is an anachronism. Better wearing nothing at all if a period piece of undress isn''t available. Also I think the book was an indoor setting, so the leafy shadows don''t fit either. But enough nitpicking. The challenge was to draw inspiration, and that you''ve done. Clearly, in a most elemental way. 5 for a lovely breast.', '2013-10-19 20:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118681, 1087036, 94815, '<td valign="top">The location seems right and the reflections are lovely. 6</td>', 'The location seems right and the reflections are lovely. 6', '2013-10-19 20:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118682, 1087208, 94815, '<td valign="top">But it was about wolves as I remember. Still, a shot that could be considered inspired by the book and an impossibly literal interpretation of the title. 7 for the rarity.</td>', 'But it was about wolves as I remember. Still, a shot that could be considered inspired by the book and an impossibly literal interpretation of the title. 7 for the rarity.', '2013-10-19 20:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118687, 1087195, 94815, '<td valign="top">I think the challenge is to draw inspiration from the novel, not simply the title of the novel. This has no connection to the novel itself. But it is indeed a pretty, even unusually beautiful image of the sun and misty land/waterscape. It could be a 6 or better if on topic. But as is in this challenge, 5.</td>', 'I think the challenge is to draw inspiration from the novel, not simply the title of the novel. This has no connection to the novel itself. But it is indeed a pretty, even unusually beautiful image of the sun and misty land/waterscape. It could be a 6 or better if on topic. But as is in this challenge, 5.', '2013-10-19 21:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118690, 1087122, 94815, '<td valign="top">Like so many images in this challenge, the topicality is lacking except in the most literal sense of the title. Using the title doesn''t say much about drawing inspiration from the novel itself. The image itself is well detailed if a little bleached out in processing. Some find this attractive but not I. There are some potentially appealing birds but they''re too small to count for much. 5</td>', 'Like so many images in this challenge, the topicality is lacking except in the most literal sense of the title. Using the title doesn''t say much about drawing inspiration from the novel itself. The image itself is well detailed if a little bleached out in processing. Some find this attractive but not I. There are some potentially appealing birds but they''re too small to count for much. 5', '2013-10-19 21:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118693, 1087004, 68504, '<td valign="top">a nice tilt. a thick darkness, spare graphics, a bit bleak, almost dull, which is not bad in itself but missing the twist. 4</td>', 'a nice tilt. a thick darkness, spare graphics, a bit bleak, almost dull, which is not bad in itself but missing the twist. 4', '2013-10-19 21:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118695, 1087000, 94815, '<td valign="top">Don''t know the book but based on its synopsis this image seems a suitable representation of the young protagonist. The image is interestingly composed with the inner framing by the plant, but the crop at the bottom abruptly slices off her hands - an unpleasant effect. The foggy effect is a bit overdone at least for me because it robs the shot of any clear focus and leaves viewers like me constantly trying to focus our eyes. A sharper focus on the face or at least her eyes could save it. All in all, a creative attempt but overdone. 5</td>', 'Don''t know the book but based on its synopsis this image seems a suitable representation of the young protagonist. The image is interestingly composed with the inner framing by the plant, but the crop at the bottom abruptly slices off her hands - an unpleasant effect. The foggy effect is a bit overdone at least for me because it robs the shot of any clear focus and leaves viewers like me constantly trying to focus our eyes. A sharper focus on the face or at least her eyes could save it. All in all, a creative attempt but overdone. 5', '2013-10-19 21:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118696, 1087036, 68504, '<td valign="top">a passable view at night of a possibly once Moorish locale. possibly punny, but I regret missing the flavour of the work. 3</td>', 'a passable view at night of a possibly once Moorish locale. possibly punny, but I regret missing the flavour of the work. 3', '2013-10-19 21:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118697, 1087135, 8759, '<td valign="top">There is something that I like about it. There is also something that does not work well. The jar looks more like a glass hence a feeling that the butterfly can easily fly away. The butterfly also looks as it is on the glass rather then captive inside. I would have also cloned out some of the leaves on the corners. The contrast and colors look fine. 5</td>', 'There is something that I like about it. There is also something that does not work well. The jar looks more like a glass hence a feeling that the butterfly can easily fly away. The butterfly also looks as it is on the glass rather then captive inside. I would have also cloned out some of the leaves on the corners. The contrast and colors look fine. 5', '2013-10-19 21:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118698, 1087122, 68504, '<td valign="top">well it is a bend in the river, a rather nice one, but a little overshopped. I miss any more than nominal reference to the book, which makes me sad as I am a great fan of V.S. Naipaul. 4</td>', 'well it is a bend in the river, a rather nice one, but a little overshopped. I miss any more than nominal reference to the book, which makes me sad as I am a great fan of V.S. Naipaul. 4', '2013-10-19 21:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118700, 1086672, 68504, '<td valign="top">not badly contrived, but wanting in horror. 4</td>', 'not badly contrived, but wanting in horror. 4', '2013-10-19 21:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118701, 1087222, 68504, '<td valign="top">everyone will tell you that the car is all wrong, but your model embodies the silly drinkiness of the times. 5</td>', 'everyone will tell you that the car is all wrong, but your model embodies the silly drinkiness of the times. 5', '2013-10-19 21:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
