(7118717, 1086105, 8759, '<td valign="top">That would do much better without the people that do look like visitor in a museum. Still a 6</td>', 'That would do much better without the people that do look like visitor in a museum. Still a 6', '2013-10-19 22:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118719, 1086453, 8759, '<td valign="top">It will indeed. 6</td>', 'It will indeed. 6', '2013-10-19 22:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118721, 1087162, 8759, '<td valign="top">This is good. I would have tried to crop differently on the right . The light (flash) on the character (not the reflection in the mirror is a bit harsh but still OK. My first 7 so far</td>', 'This is good. I would have tried to crop differently on the right . The light (flash) on the character (not the reflection in the mirror is a bit harsh but still OK. My first 7 so far', '2013-10-19 22:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118722, 1087205, 8759, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and textures. Nice take on the lost time. Reminds me of my father and the way he used to gather rusted autumn leaves in his workshop. 7</td>', 'Beautiful colors and textures. Nice take on the lost time. Reminds me of my father and the way he used to gather rusted autumn leaves in his workshop. 7', '2013-10-19 22:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118724, 1086865, 8759, '<td valign="top">Only that is not Kilimanjaro :-) I would have cropped tighter around the sunset /  rise mountains tops. But that is just me.  I feel that the dark area catch the attention way to much. 5</td>', 'Only that is not Kilimanjaro :-) I would have cropped tighter around the sunset /  rise mountains tops. But that is just me.  I feel that the dark area catch the attention way to much. 5', '2013-10-19 22:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118725, 1086986, 8759, '<td valign="top">Too busy makes me dizzy for searching of the subject. 5</td>', 'Too busy makes me dizzy for searching of the subject. 5', '2013-10-19 22:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118727, 1086978, 35804, '<td valign="top">6...such a good story. As far as this photograph, I enjoy the contrast between the warm golden leaf and the cool hard ground. I might have tried cloning out the stem on the left there and the one at the top right. I find the vignette is fighting the composition as it''s too centered. The image would have been fine without it, or if the center of the vignetting were over the actual leaf.</td>', '6...such a good story. As far as this photograph, I enjoy the contrast between the warm golden leaf and the cool hard ground. I might have tried cloning out the stem on the left there and the one at the top right. I find the vignette is fighting the composition as it''s too centered. The image would have been fine without it, or if the center of the vignetting were over the actual leaf.', '2013-10-19 22:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118730, 1087023, 35804, '<td valign="top">6...it''s a all technically nice, it just doesn''t move me in any sort of way.</td>', '6...it''s a all technically nice, it just doesn''t move me in any sort of way.', '2013-10-19 22:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118731, 1087082, 35804, '<td valign="top">7...that''s a tough exposure to make. The sky may be slightly hot, but if the colors were even slightly duller, the entire image wouldn''t be as appealing IMO. The water is really beautiful.</td>', '7...that''s a tough exposure to make. The sky may be slightly hot, but if the colors were even slightly duller, the entire image wouldn''t be as appealing IMO. The water is really beautiful.', '2013-10-19 22:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118733, 1087135, 35804, '<td valign="top">6...It''s a nice enough image, the sharpness of the butterfly is fabulous, but I see nothing of the referenced book really. I suppose this could be metaphorical, but I would at least expect to see and actual bell jar. Technically, some of the darks seem too dark, loosing information in the shadows, particularly in the ground and the area at the top of the jar.</td>', '6...It''s a nice enough image, the sharpness of the butterfly is fabulous, but I see nothing of the referenced book really. I suppose this could be metaphorical, but I would at least expect to see and actual bell jar. Technically, some of the darks seem too dark, loosing information in the shadows, particularly in the ground and the area at the top of the jar.', '2013-10-19 23:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118735, 1087048, 35804, '<td valign="top">6...the first thing that popped into my mind was Weirwood from Game of Thrones. It''s those bright red leaves. I like it more for those series of novels. I suppose it works for Secret Garden, but it seems like an obvious thing for that. Technically, I wish there was more information to see in the trees trunk, but I know this wasn''t a simple exposure. A little more space on the left would have given the branch a bit of breathing room too, but that may not have been possible.</td>', '6...the first thing that popped into my mind was Weirwood from Game of Thrones. It''s those bright red leaves. I like it more for those series of novels. I suppose it works for Secret Garden, but it seems like an obvious thing for that. Technically, I wish there was more information to see in the trees trunk, but I know this wasn''t a simple exposure. A little more space on the left would have given the branch a bit of breathing room too, but that may not have been possible.', '2013-10-19 23:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118740, 1087184, 8759, '<td valign="top">It''s ok. The background is a bit too bright and you loose details on the subject. The picture is too busy. And looks more as a snapshot. I love postmen. 4</td>', 'It''s ok. The background is a bit too bright and you loose details on the subject. The picture is too busy. And looks more as a snapshot. I love postmen. 4', '2013-10-19 23:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118741, 1086157, 35804, '<td valign="top">6...this is quite nice and fits the book. I can''t stand the border. I''m not anti-border, just anti <i>this</i> border. That little white border is really fighting the image for attention, and it''s winning. And the way the black in almost nonexistent at the top and bottom...I don''t know why or for what purpose. A simple black border would have been perfect.</td>', '6...this is quite nice and fits the book. I can''t stand the border. I''m not anti-border, just anti this border. That little white border is really fighting the image for attention, and it''s winning. And the way the black in almost nonexistent at the top and bottom...I don''t know why or for what purpose. A simple black border would have been perfect.', '2013-10-19 23:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118742, 1087078, 35804, '<td valign="top">6...I''m not familiar with the novel, but this is fun to look at...great movement a texture.</td>', '6...I''m not familiar with the novel, but this is fun to look at...great movement a texture.', '2013-10-19 23:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118745, 1087195, 100975, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in this shot.  The reflection is great.  The only thing that I do not like about it is the dark corners.<br/> <br/>Gave it a 6</td>', 'I like the colors in this shot.  The reflection is great.  The only thing that I do not like about it is the dark corners. Gave it a 6', '2013-10-19 23:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
