(7118748, 1087023, 8759, '<td valign="top">Never have thought that the castle looks like this. But I can take it. I would have tried a diagonal composition and to get rid of the tree on the bottom. 5</td>', 'Never have thought that the castle looks like this. But I can take it. I would have tried a diagonal composition and to get rid of the tree on the bottom. 5', '2013-10-19 23:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118750, 1086989, 100975, '<td valign="top">I think this could have been a better picture.  I would like to see a little more detail in the foreground and maybe a shot closer to the lighthouse.<br/> <br/>Gave it a 4</td>', 'I think this could have been a better picture.  I would like to see a little more detail in the foreground and maybe a shot closer to the lighthouse. Gave it a 4', '2013-10-19 23:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118751, 1087072, 94815, '<td valign="top">Cute quip on the topic. But except for a smile, the image has not much more to offer. Purely on technical grounds, it is a competent quick, unprocessed take. 3</td>', 'Cute quip on the topic. But except for a smile, the image has not much more to offer. Purely on technical grounds, it is a competent quick, unprocessed take. 3', '2013-10-19 23:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118752, 1087210, 100975, '<td valign="top">Decent picture.  I think I would have liked it more with a different angle in the background.  Maybe a closeup of the face with just the sky in the background.<br/> <br/>Gave it a 5</td>', 'Decent picture.  I think I would have liked it more with a different angle in the background.  Maybe a closeup of the face with just the sky in the background. Gave it a 5', '2013-10-19 23:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118753, 1087188, 100975, '<td valign="top">I understand the concept of your image, but I think it would have been better had it been a single runner and the blur wasn''t messy looking.<br/> <br/>Gave it a 3</td>', 'I understand the concept of your image, but I think it would have been better had it been a single runner and the blur wasn''t messy looking. Gave it a 3', '2013-10-19 23:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118754, 1087205, 100975, '<td valign="top">I am not familiar with the book, but the image doesn''t appeal to me. The colors go well together, but the composition could be better, and that yellow area at the bottom is not straight and distracts me from the rest of the image.  It looks like there could have been some really cool texture in those leaves and maybe would have benefited from showing more of it.<br/> <br/>Gave it a 3</td>', 'I am not familiar with the book, but the image doesn''t appeal to me. The colors go well together, but the composition could be better, and that yellow area at the bottom is not straight and distracts me from the rest of the image.  It looks like there could have been some really cool texture in those leaves and maybe would have benefited from showing more of it. Gave it a 3', '2013-10-19 23:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118755, 1087208, 100831, '<td valign="top">Magnificent.</td>', 'Magnificent.', '2013-10-19 23:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118756, 1087190, 94815, '<td valign="top">I hope no important books were damaged in this image. It''s well executed (especially the flames) and exemplary as possible cover art for the book. But in its reduced, closely cropped form, it seems a bit sterile. 6</td>', 'I hope no important books were damaged in this image. It''s well executed (especially the flames) and exemplary as possible cover art for the book. But in its reduced, closely cropped form, it seems a bit sterile. 6', '2013-10-19 23:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118757, 1086978, 100975, '<td valign="top">This would have been a better image had this had a different composition.  Suggestions...<br/>Close up of the leaf to get the texture and colors up close.<br/> <br/>Or<br/> <br/>Get rid of the pine needles (or whatever they are)...they are distracting.<br/>Gave it a 3</td>', 'This would have been a better image had this had a different composition.  Suggestions...Close up of the leaf to get the texture and colors up close. Or Get rid of the pine needles (or whatever they are)...they are distracting.Gave it a 3', '2013-10-19 23:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118758, 1086986, 94815, '<td valign="top">Brilliantly staged and photographed. Perhaps the only image in the challenge which faithfully represents the book as I remember it. Well done bw. 9</td>', 'Brilliantly staged and photographed. Perhaps the only image in the challenge which faithfully represents the book as I remember it. Well done bw. 9', '2013-10-19 23:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118759, 1087078, 100975, '<td valign="top">I really do not understand the picture and how it represents darkness at noon.<br/>I have not read the book, so I don''t know if there is anything to this.<br/> <br/>There are aspects that I like such as the contrast, but overall it doesn''t make me feel anything.<br/> <br/>Gave it a 5</td>', 'I really do not understand the picture and how it represents darkness at noon.I have not read the book, so I don''t know if there is anything to this. There are aspects that I like such as the contrast, but overall it doesn''t make me feel anything. Gave it a 5', '2013-10-19 23:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118761, 1087223, 100975, '<td valign="top">I like the "trippy" feel of this image.  I think that the blur could have been done a little different with the in focus portion on the girl.  This would have made it seem more like the girl was normal and the surroundings were crazy.<br/> <br/>Gave it a 7</td>', 'I like the "trippy" feel of this image.  I think that the blur could have been done a little different with the in focus portion on the girl.  This would have made it seem more like the girl was normal and the surroundings were crazy. Gave it a 7', '2013-10-19 23:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118762, 1087192, 100975, '<td valign="top">I like the detail of the lizard, and I like the background.  However other than being a "wild" animal, this has nothing to do with the book.  This book title was too easy to play off of and doesn''t seem like any thought was put into it other than, "Hey, I will take a picture of a lizard and call it Call of the Wild".<br/> <br/>Gave it a 4</td>', 'I like the detail of the lizard, and I like the background.  However other than being a "wild" animal, this has nothing to do with the book.  This book title was too easy to play off of and doesn''t seem like any thought was put into it other than, "Hey, I will take a picture of a lizard and call it Call of the Wild". Gave it a 4', '2013-10-20 00:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118763, 1087044, 100831, '<td valign="top">Go Tell it ON the Mountain, though I''m sure you''ve been told. <br/>And if you haven''t heard the gospel song that this title was based on, please find a way to listen.  Prayers of the Saints ... this is so good.  hahahah... by the way, I''m a new yorker, pretty sure this book took place in the city. But I love your image.</td>', 'Go Tell it ON the Mountain, though I''m sure you''ve been told. And if you haven''t heard the gospel song that this title was based on, please find a way to listen.  Prayers of the Saints ... this is so good.  hahahah... by the way, I''m a new yorker, pretty sure this book took place in the city. But I love your image.', '2013-10-20 00:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118765, 1087201, 100831, '<td valign="top">Some may not like the exaggerated processing, but I think it fits the secret.</td>', 'Some may not like the exaggerated processing, but I think it fits the secret.', '2013-10-20 00:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118766, 1086453, 100831, '<td valign="top">Fabulous seeing... great book... wonderful interpretation. bump.</td>', 'Fabulous seeing... great book... wonderful interpretation. bump.', '2013-10-20 00:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118781, 1087188, 68178, '<td valign="top">I haven''t read the book, so I''m not sure if the tie to the story is there. An interesting picture, it definitely feels like they are rushing by. Maybe a little too much movement though, as it''s difficult to find any focus. 5</td>', 'I haven''t read the book, so I''m not sure if the tie to the story is there. An interesting picture, it definitely feels like they are rushing by. Maybe a little too much movement though, as it''s difficult to find any focus. 5', '2013-10-20 01:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118785, 1086692, 94815, '<td valign="top">No pun intended eh? Hard to say she is inspired by the novel of similar name. Photographically, as a portrait the lighting effects dominate and distract from her face and those pearls. The result is harsh and not very appealing. 5</td>', 'No pun intended eh? Hard to say she is inspired by the novel of similar name. Photographically, as a portrait the lighting effects dominate and distract from her face and those pearls. The result is harsh and not very appealing. 5', '2013-10-20 01:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118787, 1087198, 94815, '<td valign="top">Good enough as a serious young portrait, but there''s nothing to hint at his artistic side. Photographically, although the skin tones work well enough, the background colors are muddy the forms have no clear compositional purpose and therefore become distracting. I think black &amp; white treatment could have been much stronger and eliminated the color issues. 5</td>', 'Good enough as a serious young portrait, but there''s nothing to hint at his artistic side. Photographically, although the skin tones work well enough, the background colors are muddy the forms have no clear compositional purpose and therefore become distracting. I think black & white treatment could have been much stronger and eliminated the color issues. 5', '2013-10-20 01:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118792, 1086999, 94815, '<td valign="top">The neat haircut and mature brow don''t suit the street urchin. Technically, the foreground oof area doesn''t work either. Arguably, you may be trying to draw attention to the sharply focused spoon but it doesn''t work as technique because other elements would have to be similarly oof, especially his cuff, ear and the aforesaid brow. 5</td>', 'The neat haircut and mature brow don''t suit the street urchin. Technically, the foreground oof area doesn''t work either. Arguably, you may be trying to draw attention to the sharply focused spoon but it doesn''t work as technique because other elements would have to be similarly oof, especially his cuff, ear and the aforesaid brow. 5', '2013-10-20 01:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118793, 1087192, 94815, '<td valign="top">From wolves in Alaska to the a lizard in the prairie is quite a leap of inspiration. It''s a good wildlife shot, technically well exposed and detailed and could merit a 6 or better except for the lack of topicality. 5</td>', 'From wolves in Alaska to the a lizard in the prairie is quite a leap of inspiration. It''s a good wildlife shot, technically well exposed and detailed and could merit a 6 or better except for the lack of topicality. 5', '2013-10-20 01:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118798, 1087223, 23484, '<td valign="top">Beautiful job on the portrayal.</td>', 'Beautiful job on the portrayal.', '2013-10-20 01:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118799, 1087112, 23484, '<td valign="top">Excellent retro style.</td>', 'Excellent retro style.', '2013-10-20 01:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118812, 1086340, 171768, '<td valign="top">lovely &lt;3</td>', 'lovely <3', '2013-10-20 04:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118815, 1087036, 171768, '<td valign="top">it is a beautiful shot indeed but I think is more modern that to be fit for the this book!</td>', 'it is a beautiful shot indeed but I think is more modern that to be fit for the this book!', '2013-10-20 04:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118828, 1087135, 118154, '<td valign="top">Not sure if it is or not but this looks very false ? Without the butterfly if may have been a decent image.3.</td>', 'Not sure if it is or not but this looks very false ? Without the butterfly if may have been a decent image.3.', '2013-10-20 05:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118841, 1087187, 12611, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrayal of decay, I get the spirit of the writing in this shot.</td>', 'Excellent portrayal of decay, I get the spirit of the writing in this shot.', '2013-10-20 09:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118972, 1087125, 40391, '<td valign="top">This image is nice with pleasant colours and good framing. I feel it would be better to clone out those sensor dusts as they do distract from the image. I do particularly like the contrast of the dead tree though. 5</td>', 'This image is nice with pleasant colours and good framing. I feel it would be better to clone out those sensor dusts as they do distract from the image. I do particularly like the contrast of the dead tree though. 5', '2013-10-20 18:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118977, 1087007, 40391, '<td valign="top">There is much to like here for me. I appreciate the technicals of nice bokeh, the duotone processing and lighting. I particularly like the subtle connections you have made to the book. The boy is blended as one with the forest but looks out of place. He has basic weapons and is looking behind in fear for the aggressive tribe of kids. At least this is what I feel from this image. 8</td>', 'There is much to like here for me. I appreciate the technicals of nice bokeh, the duotone processing and lighting. I particularly like the subtle connections you have made to the book. The boy is blended as one with the forest but looks out of place. He has basic weapons and is looking behind in fear for the aggressive tribe of kids. At least this is what I feel from this image. 8', '2013-10-20 18:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118979, 1086914, 40391, '<td valign="top">I can''t really comment on the connection with the novel as I''m not familiar with it. I do see a connection with the Aspidistra plant though. As far as the image it is something that I like. Such as the black background, good lighting and effective use of a shallow depth of field. 6</td>', 'I can''t really comment on the connection with the novel as I''m not familiar with it. I do see a connection with the Aspidistra plant though. As far as the image it is something that I like. Such as the black background, good lighting and effective use of a shallow depth of field. 6', '2013-10-20 18:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118980, 1087184, 40391, '<td valign="top">The first thought I had is that if I had taken this I would have allowed the background to be overexposed to bring the postman out of the shadows. But I have to admit the concept and execution makes me smile and so I can connect with the image. I particularly like his pink sweat bands and is that pepper spray for dogs attached to his bag? 6</td>', 'The first thought I had is that if I had taken this I would have allowed the background to be overexposed to bring the postman out of the shadows. But I have to admit the concept and execution makes me smile and so I can connect with the image. I particularly like his pink sweat bands and is that pepper spray for dogs attached to his bag? 6', '2013-10-20 19:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118981, 1087065, 40391, '<td valign="top">This image is amazing. I really like the B&amp;W conversion, DoF and lighting. Those eyes are great an I particularly like the inclusion of rain. 9</td>', 'This image is amazing. I really like the B&W conversion, DoF and lighting. Those eyes are great an I particularly like the inclusion of rain. 9', '2013-10-20 19:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118983, 1087192, 40391, '<td valign="top">This in a nice enough image of a lizard but I feel there is a bit of a stretch to connect with a book about sled dogs. 4</td>', 'This in a nice enough image of a lizard but I feel there is a bit of a stretch to connect with a book about sled dogs. 4', '2013-10-20 19:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118984, 1086987, 40391, '<td valign="top">I really love the colours and motion of this image. The painted feeling works well and I could see this on the cover of the novel. 8</td>', 'I really love the colours and motion of this image. The painted feeling works well and I could see this on the cover of the novel. 8', '2013-10-20 19:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118986, 1087188, 40391, '<td valign="top">A wonderful mix of limbs, heads and hair. 7</td>', 'A wonderful mix of limbs, heads and hair. 7', '2013-10-20 19:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118988, 1087221, 40391, '<td valign="top">This image does bring a smile to my face. The shadow at the top looks more like a rotten section of orange so is a little distracting but I do like the awkward composition. 7.</td>', 'This image does bring a smile to my face. The shadow at the top looks more like a rotten section of orange so is a little distracting but I do like the awkward composition. 7.', '2013-10-20 19:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118993, 1087121, 50695, '<td valign="top">Nice photo of sailboats in fog. Pleasant. 4</td>', 'Nice photo of sailboats in fog. Pleasant. 4', '2013-10-20 19:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118994, 1086992, 50695, '<td valign="top">Evokes a sense of dust, determination and loss, like the book. Well composed with a looming negative shape of missing glass that acts as a sort of ghost. 8</td>', 'Evokes a sense of dust, determination and loss, like the book. Well composed with a looming negative shape of missing glass that acts as a sort of ghost. 8', '2013-10-20 19:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118995, 1087188, 50695, '<td valign="top">Good leroy neiman (sp) feeling to this. decent long exposure motion capture. 5</td>', 'Good leroy neiman (sp) feeling to this. decent long exposure motion capture. 5', '2013-10-20 19:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118996, 1087036, 50695, '<td valign="top">Yes, this does look Arabian and it is night. Otherwise, it''s an overly symmetrical urban landscape photo with very little energy. 2</td>', 'Yes, this does look Arabian and it is night. Otherwise, it''s an overly symmetrical urban landscape photo with very little energy. 2', '2013-10-20 19:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118998, 1087219, 50695, '<td valign="top">This book had quite an impact on me. It''s not a novel, by the way, though I don''t care much about such distinctions. I like the crop/framing. That saves it from being a mere shoehorn wildlife photo. You''ve created a rather menacing vice, like the trap that awaits you when you''re not ready for the next black swan. 6</td>', 'This book had quite an impact on me. It''s not a novel, by the way, though I don''t care much about such distinctions. I like the crop/framing. That saves it from being a mere shoehorn wildlife photo. You''ve created a rather menacing vice, like the trap that awaits you when you''re not ready for the next black swan. 6', '2013-10-20 20:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118999, 1087072, 50695, '<td valign="top">The photo hasn''t much merit on its own, but I do like the confrontational attitude has in the context of this challenge. I haven''t read the book, and apparently, you''re not going to let me! 5</td>', 'The photo hasn''t much merit on its own, but I do like the confrontational attitude has in the context of this challenge. I haven''t read the book, and apparently, you''re not going to let me! 5', '2013-10-20 20:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119000, 1087150, 50695, '<td valign="top">I don''t know the book, but I do like the blues and golds of this palette. I like the simple composition as well with its strong diagonal that breaks the horizon line. 5</td>', 'I don''t know the book, but I do like the blues and golds of this palette. I like the simple composition as well with its strong diagonal that breaks the horizon line. 5', '2013-10-20 20:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119006, 1087210, 40391, '<td valign="top">A nice enough picture of a horse. There does appear to be some strange artefacts around the horse''s chin and body (perhaps from masking). I don''t know if you added the forehead marking or it was found like that but it is a nice connection to the books character.  5.</td>', 'A nice enough picture of a horse. There does appear to be some strange artefacts around the horse''s chin and body (perhaps from masking). I don''t know if you added the forehead marking or it was found like that but it is a nice connection to the books character.  5.', '2013-10-20 20:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119007, 1087198, 40391, '<td valign="top">Not having read this book I did a quick Google search and found a few images representing this novel. You have captured the general composition here too so there should be little risk of DNMC voting. I''m not sure how much control you had over the background but I wish the nice blues extended beyond the right hand side of the image. The details captured are very good and I quite like his expression. 6.</td>', 'Not having read this book I did a quick Google search and found a few images representing this novel. You have captured the general composition here too so there should be little risk of DNMC voting. I''m not sure how much control you had over the background but I wish the nice blues extended beyond the right hand side of the image. The details captured are very good and I quite like his expression. 6.', '2013-10-20 20:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119008, 1087219, 40391, '<td valign="top">This image really appeals to me. I love the curvature of the shot and the contrast with the background is great. Nice details of the eye too. 7</td>', 'This image really appeals to me. I love the curvature of the shot and the contrast with the background is great. Nice details of the eye too. 7', '2013-10-20 21:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119009, 1087071, 119419, '<td valign="top">It''s all in the timing, bet the mechanical hounds have been at this one ;) 5</td>', 'It''s all in the timing, bet the mechanical hounds have been at this one ;) 5', '2013-10-20 21:00:56.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(7119010, 1087194, 119419, '<td valign="top">Well there''s 3 of them, all the right symbols are there. You snapped at a good time to catch the report. I like the HDR style I think it reinforces the imagery.5.</td>', 'Well there''s 3 of them, all the right symbols are there. You snapped at a good time to catch the report. I like the HDR style I think it reinforces the imagery.5.', '2013-10-20 21:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119011, 1087086, 119419, '<td valign="top">A bizarre looking scene, I like it. Well proportioned, gives me more than a literal interpretation of the title.6.</td>', 'A bizarre looking scene, I like it. Well proportioned, gives me more than a literal interpretation of the title.6.', '2013-10-20 21:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119012, 1087150, 40391, '<td valign="top">I''m am not familiar with this novel and to be honest, I could not find any book with this title on google so I will consider this to be not fully meeting the challenge. The image itself doesn''t do a lot for me and the tilted horizon is distracting. However, I do like the softness and colour of the sky and the overall composition is nice. 3</td>', 'I''m am not familiar with this novel and to be honest, I could not find any book with this title on google so I will consider this to be not fully meeting the challenge. The image itself doesn''t do a lot for me and the tilted horizon is distracting. However, I do like the softness and colour of the sky and the overall composition is nice. 3', '2013-10-20 21:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119013, 1087039, 119419, '<td valign="top">Nice toning, I like the tilt too. Something indicating Jace and Clary would have been a help, but who has those two hanging around at a shoot ;) .5.</td>', 'Nice toning, I like the tilt too. Something indicating Jace and Clary would have been a help, but who has those two hanging around at a shoot ;) .5.', '2013-10-20 21:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119014, 1086978, 119419, '<td valign="top">I don''t care what novel this is or isn''t about, it gives me a beautiful feeling when I look at it, well done. I''m not going to make any suggestions for changes, I kind of think this is a reflection of your artistry.8.</td>', 'I don''t care what novel this is or isn''t about, it gives me a beautiful feeling when I look at it, well done. I''m not going to make any suggestions for changes, I kind of think this is a reflection of your artistry.8.', '2013-10-20 21:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119015, 1086989, 119419, '<td valign="top">Yummy golden stuff, the power lines as leading lines conflict with the path for me. Gives the feeling of remoteness, some abandonment which is in the novel.6.</td>', 'Yummy golden stuff, the power lines as leading lines conflict with the path for me. Gives the feeling of remoteness, some abandonment which is in the novel.6.', '2013-10-20 21:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119016, 1087201, 40391, '<td valign="top">The heavily saturated image provides an interesting guidance through to a different world. I doubt this will appeal to many but I rather like this. 7</td>', 'The heavily saturated image provides an interesting guidance through to a different world. I doubt this will appeal to many but I rather like this. 7', '2013-10-20 21:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119017, 1086683, 119419, '<td valign="top">Yeah, this looks mean, ominous, downright trickery, a cannibalistic witch living deep in the forest in a house constructed of cake and confectionery in mono. Schlachthof-fünf never looked better.8.</td>', 'Yeah, this looks mean, ominous, downright trickery, a cannibalistic witch living deep in the forest in a house constructed of cake and confectionery in mono. Schlachthof-fünf never looked better.8.', '2013-10-20 21:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119021, 1086992, 119419, '<td valign="top">Very good, the broken outline of the ''antagonist'' over the repressed and dispossessed. Fine piece of imagery that bonds with the novel.9.</td>', 'Very good, the broken outline of the ''antagonist'' over the repressed and dispossessed. Fine piece of imagery that bonds with the novel.9.', '2013-10-20 21:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119022, 1087222, 40391, '<td valign="top">Despite the heavy handed approach to the processing this image is strangely appealing. It does look like this image may have been produced using two shots which is against the rules but, of course, I''m voting as if this was achieved within the rules. 6</td>', 'Despite the heavy handed approach to the processing this image is strangely appealing. It does look like this image may have been produced using two shots which is against the rules but, of course, I''m voting as if this was achieved within the rules. 6', '2013-10-20 21:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119029, 1087139, 119419, '<td valign="top">Nice close up of the organ, not much connected to the novel that I know unless that is a Scottish organ produced by Russian businessmen, but I''ve only read the plot summary. 5.</td>', 'Nice close up of the organ, not much connected to the novel that I know unless that is a Scottish organ produced by Russian businessmen, but I''ve only read the plot summary. 5.', '2013-10-20 21:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119033, 1087170, 119419, '<td valign="top">Official deception, secret surveillance, and manipulation of the past by a totalitarian or authoritarian state isn''t conveyed in this for me, looks more like a tv broadcast centre. But an interesting look.5.</td>', 'Official deception, secret surveillance, and manipulation of the past by a totalitarian or authoritarian state isn''t conveyed in this for me, looks more like a tv broadcast centre. But an interesting look.5.', '2013-10-20 21:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119037, 1086761, 119419, '<td valign="top">A great minimalist interpretation, a brave and successful attempt as well. I only wish the driver wasn''t indicating going forward, rather if I was given the impression of driving away it would reinforce the title even better (but a minor point by me). I hope this is in the top ten if not top three.9.</td>', 'A great minimalist interpretation, a brave and successful attempt as well. I only wish the driver wasn''t indicating going forward, rather if I was given the impression of driving away it would reinforce the title even better (but a minor point by me). I hope this is in the top ten if not top three.9.', '2013-10-20 21:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119040, 1087183, 40391, '<td valign="top">In my opinion this is quite the shoehorn. However, the image itself is very interesting with elements such as her boots, the way she is holding her phone, her stance, the photog in the background and the way she is sitting, and the flags in the background providing a sense of place. Overall, there is much to see here. One more thing, when I first opened the image and read your title it made me laugh and I do like images that does that for me. 7</td>', 'In my opinion this is quite the shoehorn. However, the image itself is very interesting with elements such as her boots, the way she is holding her phone, her stance, the photog in the background and the way she is sitting, and the flags in the background providing a sense of place. Overall, there is much to see here. One more thing, when I first opened the image and read your title it made me laugh and I do like images that does that for me. 7', '2013-10-20 21:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119044, 1086479, 119419, '<td valign="top">Flora Poste''s farm is looking good, nice sunset. As far as connection to the novel, it establishes the minimum requirements. As a landscape it is picturesque, a little unbalanced and dark on the left but makes me feel ''country''.5.</td>', 'Flora Poste''s farm is looking good, nice sunset. As far as connection to the novel, it establishes the minimum requirements. As a landscape it is picturesque, a little unbalanced and dark on the left but makes me feel ''country''.5.', '2013-10-20 21:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119048, 1087022, 40391, '<td valign="top">An interesting image. Nice find. 6</td>', 'An interesting image. Nice find. 6', '2013-10-20 21:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119053, 1086692, 119419, '<td valign="top">Wodke Hawkinson''s pun in the sun, I wonder how many get confused with this one. I like how the flare looks like a jewel around her neck. An odd expression on her face though, sort of caught in between emotions or trying not to smile. Lovely dress ;) 5.</td>', 'Wodke Hawkinson''s pun in the sun, I wonder how many get confused with this one. I like how the flare looks like a jewel around her neck. An odd expression on her face though, sort of caught in between emotions or trying not to smile. Lovely dress ;) 5.', '2013-10-20 21:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119055, 1087015, 119419, '<td valign="top">Makes me dizzy to look at, but I kind of like that. Eerily inviting but the processing keeps distracting my appreciation. Mono was a good choice, I get the feeling of the WH era and gloom. 5.</td>', 'Makes me dizzy to look at, but I kind of like that. Eerily inviting but the processing keeps distracting my appreciation. Mono was a good choice, I get the feeling of the WH era and gloom. 5.', '2013-10-20 21:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119056, 1087141, 119419, '<td valign="top">John Wheelwright couldn''t have asked for a better interpretation. An odd feeling of detachment and solitude, maybe abstractness as in the theological philosophical style. Good toning and clarity help the connection between image and novel.7.</td>', 'John Wheelwright couldn''t have asked for a better interpretation. An odd feeling of detachment and solitude, maybe abstractness as in the theological philosophical style. Good toning and clarity help the connection between image and novel.7.', '2013-10-20 21:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119057, 1086700, 40391, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image. I like the flowers to tie in with the title and the medical instrument and gauze to reflect the plot. The thought and composition is met with a wonderfully shot and processed photo. Now, the only nitpick I have is that for me the composition feels a little off. Perhaps a bit more room to the left of the image may have helped. Still, an overall wonderful image. 9.</td>', 'A beautiful image. I like the flowers to tie in with the title and the medical instrument and gauze to reflect the plot. The thought and composition is met with a wonderfully shot and processed photo. Now, the only nitpick I have is that for me the composition feels a little off. Perhaps a bit more room to the left of the image may have helped. Still, an overall wonderful image. 9.', '2013-10-20 21:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119060, 1087000, 119419, '<td valign="top">A beautiful picture, cropping most of the right side would maybe make it a little less cluttered. As Esperanza dreams, hopes, and plans are symbolized by a house I don''t get that here, but I do get her introspection, youthful lamentation and a yearning (I suppose to leave Mango Street). A really good effort.8.</td>', 'A beautiful picture, cropping most of the right side would maybe make it a little less cluttered. As Esperanza dreams, hopes, and plans are symbolized by a house I don''t get that here, but I do get her introspection, youthful lamentation and a yearning (I suppose to leave Mango Street). A really good effort.8.', '2013-10-20 22:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119063, 1086992, 40391, '<td valign="top">I can really see this as the cover for the book. If fits beautifully. The image itself is fascinating and appealing. I like the composition and the high contrast of the man and the broken window. I wasnt too sure about the processing but having had the time to appreciate the image I feel it was a good choice. 9.</td>', 'I can really see this as the cover for the book. If fits beautifully. The image itself is fascinating and appealing. I like the composition and the high contrast of the man and the broken window. I wasnt too sure about the processing but having had the time to appreciate the image I feel it was a good choice. 9.', '2013-10-20 22:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119064, 1087093, 119419, '<td valign="top">In relation to the novel, looking at a single moment of horror from every angle and the type of crime committed by Kawashima doesn''t appear here. If this is a type of allegory, then you could get away with a connection ;) I''ll judge you on the latter anyway. Technically, a little overprocessed for me but your composition includes all the key elements to convey the message.5.</td>', 'In relation to the novel, looking at a single moment of horror from every angle and the type of crime committed by Kawashima doesn''t appear here. If this is a type of allegory, then you could get away with a connection ;) I''ll judge you on the latter anyway. Technically, a little overprocessed for me but your composition includes all the key elements to convey the message.5.', '2013-10-20 22:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119067, 1087151, 40391, '<td valign="top">I find this image to be quite appealing. The emotion I wish to see in this child ties it in nicely with the book. The image itself really is beautiful. 8</td>', 'I find this image to be quite appealing. The emotion I wish to see in this child ties it in nicely with the book. The image itself really is beautiful. 8', '2013-10-20 22:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119069, 1086433, 119419, '<td valign="top">Not enough here to convey the novel for me so I can''t really say much.5.</td>', 'Not enough here to convey the novel for me so I can''t really say much.5.', '2013-10-20 22:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119071, 1087170, 40391, '<td valign="top">Nice find and this really relates to the novel well. Im not really sure of what Im looking at here but it portrays Big Brother watching nicely. 6.</td>', 'Nice find and this really relates to the novel well. Im not really sure of what Im looking at here but it portrays Big Brother watching nicely. 6.', '2013-10-20 22:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119075, 1086453, 119419, '<td valign="top">Get the feeling of mystery, fuzzy, the unknown which ties it to the novel. I get to make up the characters as I look and feel. The colours a little flat for me, but a brave effort for this lot.6.</td>', 'Get the feeling of mystery, fuzzy, the unknown which ties it to the novel. I get to make up the characters as I look and feel. The colours a little flat for me, but a brave effort for this lot.6.', '2013-10-20 22:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119077, 1087004, 119419, '<td valign="top">Probably need a bit more in the composition to push it into a larger interpretation of the novel. I like the mono, but it is a little flat in the lighting. It has an old world feel and I like the angle you have chosen.5.</td>', 'Probably need a bit more in the composition to push it into a larger interpretation of the novel. I like the mono, but it is a little flat in the lighting. It has an old world feel and I like the angle you have chosen.5.', '2013-10-20 22:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119078, 1087001, 40391, '<td valign="top">Every time we get a Garden Orb Spider at our place my daughter names it Charlotte. The focus appears to be nicely on the spider but it doesnt quite feel sharp enough. The background is a little distracting though it does bring in a domesticated feel. I do like the leading lines of the web. 6</td>', 'Every time we get a Garden Orb Spider at our place my daughter names it Charlotte. The focus appears to be nicely on the spider but it doesnt quite feel sharp enough. The background is a little distracting though it does bring in a domesticated feel. I do like the leading lines of the web. 6', '2013-10-20 22:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119079, 1086672, 40391, '<td valign="top">Excellent concept beautifully executed. 8</td>', 'Excellent concept beautifully executed. 8', '2013-10-20 22:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119081, 1086999, 119419, '<td valign="top">I like the grungy feel, maybe a wooden spoon would have been better. Has potential though. The fringing is a little distracting, as is the white dot up top, and the blotchy finger is strange ;) I like the film effect you''ve produced, looks like a 60''s Life magazine shot.6.</td>', 'I like the grungy feel, maybe a wooden spoon would have been better. Has potential though. The fringing is a little distracting, as is the white dot up top, and the blotchy finger is strange ;) I like the film effect you''ve produced, looks like a 60''s Life magazine shot.6.', '2013-10-20 22:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119082, 1087007, 119419, '<td valign="top">Great location and bokeh, maybe if you had the boy''s shirt off and some tribal marking it would have added to the atmosphere. Toning is great, like the composition and his look supports the story. 7.</td>', 'Great location and bokeh, maybe if you had the boy''s shirt off and some tribal marking it would have added to the atmosphere. Toning is great, like the composition and his look supports the story. 7.', '2013-10-20 22:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119083, 1086105, 119419, '<td valign="top">Does have a great sci fi look, I imagine you toned it , so that helps as well. Good use of lateral presentation to support your interpretation. More about the technology than the invasion.6.</td>', 'Does have a great sci fi look, I imagine you toned it , so that helps as well. Good use of lateral presentation to support your interpretation. More about the technology than the invasion.6.', '2013-10-20 22:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119084, 1087162, 119419, '<td valign="top">A great interpretation, this selection really does benefit from a real model in the shot. Props are great, the use of mono very supportive of the novel theme. I would have cropped the right a lot closer to the model but that''s only a minor issue. Good work.8.</td>', 'A great interpretation, this selection really does benefit from a real model in the shot. Props are great, the use of mono very supportive of the novel theme. I would have cropped the right a lot closer to the model but that''s only a minor issue. Good work.8.', '2013-10-20 22:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119085, 1087023, 40391, '<td valign="top">I have to admit Im finding it difficult to make the connection with this picture of a building with the novel. I havent read this book but I have now read some reviews on line. There isnt a lot of emotion for me from this image. However, I guess architectural photos arent meant to create emotion. I do like the colours, perspective and deep DoF though. 4.</td>', 'I have to admit Im finding it difficult to make the connection with this picture of a building with the novel. I havent read this book but I have now read some reviews on line. There isnt a lot of emotion for me from this image. However, I guess architectural photos arent meant to create emotion. I do like the colours, perspective and deep DoF though. 4.', '2013-10-20 22:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119094, 1087205, 40391, '<td valign="top">I have not read these books but after a bit of research I think I will need to. I rather like this image. Wonderful soft colours yet a powerful still life image. 8.</td>', 'I have not read these books but after a bit of research I think I will need to. I rather like this image. Wonderful soft colours yet a powerful still life image. 8.', '2013-10-20 22:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119099, 1087141, 40391, '<td valign="top">A powerful and beautiful image. The lighting is wonderful and processing is great. Though there seams to be some haloing around the back of the building, I quite like the processing. 7</td>', 'A powerful and beautiful image. The lighting is wonderful and processing is great. Though there seams to be some haloing around the back of the building, I quite like the processing. 7', '2013-10-20 22:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119138, 1086992, 94815, '<td valign="top">There''s more going on in that window than he knows. Couldn''t ask for a more expressive image of a truly classic novel - one of the greatest fictional documents of its time. The bw treatment give it a period-specific treatment strikingly reminiscent of Dorothea Lange''s poignantly tragic dust bowl photos. 10</td>', 'There''s more going on in that window than he knows. Couldn''t ask for a more expressive image of a truly classic novel - one of the greatest fictional documents of its time. The bw treatment give it a period-specific treatment strikingly reminiscent of Dorothea Lange''s poignantly tragic dust bowl photos. 10', '2013-10-20 23:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119139, 1087195, 50695, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sun through fog. I like how the yellow reflects as blue. This might be nothing more than a bauble, but I wear it well. 6</td>', 'Beautiful sun through fog. I like how the yellow reflects as blue. This might be nothing more than a bauble, but I wear it well. 6', '2013-10-20 23:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119140, 1087007, 94815, '<td valign="top">Effective visualization of the novel. The expression on the boys face, combined with the shadows and forms of the environment have the nightmare quality of the book as I remember it. Very well done. 9</td>', 'Effective visualization of the novel. The expression on the boys face, combined with the shadows and forms of the environment have the nightmare quality of the book as I remember it. Very well done. 9', '2013-10-20 23:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119142, 1087082, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like how the warlike suncolors encroach on the lighthouse. This is well exposed. Somehow the simplistic composition actually helps this interpretation, the strong embattled soldier. I don''t like the blue haziness around his head, however. I think that''s a pipe dream. He knows his light is nothing beside the sun. I''d prefer you allow him his pathos, allow us to admire his strength rather than his false hope. 5</td>', 'I like how the warlike suncolors encroach on the lighthouse. This is well exposed. Somehow the simplistic composition actually helps this interpretation, the strong embattled soldier. I don''t like the blue haziness around his head, however. I think that''s a pipe dream. He knows his light is nothing beside the sun. I''d prefer you allow him his pathos, allow us to admire his strength rather than his false hope. 5', '2013-10-20 23:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119143, 1086767, 50695, '<td valign="top">as roadkill goes, this is magnificent. The skeleton is in some somber procession. Even the vignetting is excellent and interesting. look at the texture of the surface and the mysterious dark shapes.<br/> <br/>I think I see the soul escaping through his forehead. 8</td>', 'as roadkill goes, this is magnificent. The skeleton is in some somber procession. Even the vignetting is excellent and interesting. look at the texture of the surface and the mysterious dark shapes. I think I see the soul escaping through his forehead. 8', '2013-10-20 23:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119144, 1086453, 50695, '<td valign="top">yes, you''ve created that sense of something ominous approaching. 6</td>', 'yes, you''ve created that sense of something ominous approaching. 6', '2013-10-20 23:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119145, 1087044, 94815, '<td valign="top">Such an ethereally beautiful alpine landscape has nothing to do with the book and like many others in this challenge, it misses the topic by a wide margin. James Baldwin''s book was a widely admired milestone in the awakening of the horrors of racism in America. This image is the antithesis of the book. Still a beautiful shot whose photographic quality saves it from the lowest rating. 4</td>', 'Such an ethereally beautiful alpine landscape has nothing to do with the book and like many others in this challenge, it misses the topic by a wide margin. James Baldwin''s book was a widely admired milestone in the awakening of the horrors of racism in America. This image is the antithesis of the book. Still a beautiful shot whose photographic quality saves it from the lowest rating. 4', '2013-10-20 23:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119148, 1086914, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''ll trust you that this is aspidistra, and you have created a sense of flight. The image has a certain Weston-like appeal. 5</td>', 'I''ll trust you that this is aspidistra, and you have created a sense of flight. The image has a certain Weston-like appeal. 5', '2013-10-20 23:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119149, 1087086, 50695, '<td valign="top">You certainly did get an ominous photo of a carnival. I think it fits the mood of the title. I love the textures of the field in front of it. Your crop does the job. 7</td>', 'You certainly did get an ominous photo of a carnival. I think it fits the mood of the title. I love the textures of the field in front of it. Your crop does the job. 7', '2013-10-20 23:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119150, 1087078, 50695, '<td valign="top">I read this book... actually I started it and couldn''t finish. This image does a good job of explaining how it felt to read it. a maze of pain. 6</td>', 'I read this book... actually I started it and couldn''t finish. This image does a good job of explaining how it felt to read it. a maze of pain. 6', '2013-10-20 23:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119151, 1086683, 50695, '<td valign="top">This book is about memory, and how that makes us all time travelers. Your image feels like a memory. Also implied is that this is a door to a slaughterhouse. So this memory-door leads to death. Chilling. 8</td>', 'This book is about memory, and how that makes us all time travelers. Your image feels like a memory. Also implied is that this is a door to a slaughterhouse. So this memory-door leads to death. Chilling. 8', '2013-10-20 23:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119154, 1086672, 50695, '<td valign="top">Interesting how this face looks wicked to me but really is only half wicked. One side is the frightened Dr. Jekyll. But even the smirking Mr. Hyde is not as scary as both faces stuck together. Interesting.<br/> <br/>Cheesy eye colors, and arbitrary placement of knife, not interesting.<br/> <br/>I''ll split the difference and give you a 5.</td>', 'Interesting how this face looks wicked to me but really is only half wicked. One side is the frightened Dr. Jekyll. But even the smirking Mr. Hyde is not as scary as both faces stuck together. Interesting. Cheesy eye colors, and arbitrary placement of knife, not interesting. I''ll split the difference and give you a 5.', '2013-10-20 23:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119156, 1086865, 50695, '<td valign="top">Low energy landscape. The reflection makes the image too symmetrical. Symmetrical images are tedious to look at. 3</td>', 'Low energy landscape. The reflection makes the image too symmetrical. Symmetrical images are tedious to look at. 3', '2013-10-20 23:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119157, 1086157, 50695, '<td valign="top">this is an ok landscape. the water movement is good. the composition is competent. A little too slick and saturated for my taste. 4</td>', 'this is an ok landscape. the water movement is good. the composition is competent. A little too slick and saturated for my taste. 4', '2013-10-20 23:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119161, 1086858, 50695, '<td valign="top">this might have some relevance to the book, but I am way too ignorant about the book and this culture to know. So, all this is for me is another competent but uninspired architecture photo. 4</td>', 'this might have some relevance to the book, but I am way too ignorant about the book and this culture to know. So, all this is for me is another competent but uninspired architecture photo. 4', '2013-10-20 23:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119175, 1087039, 40391, '<td valign="top">The perspective, grain and processing all adds interest to this image. I particularly like the clouds. 6</td>', 'The perspective, grain and processing all adds interest to this image. I particularly like the clouds. 6', '2013-10-20 23:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119182, 1086999, 40391, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. The image is appealing and well processed. It is also the first entry I''ve come across that I knew what the book would be before seeing your title. 8</td>', 'Very nicely done. The image is appealing and well processed. It is also the first entry I''ve come across that I knew what the book would be before seeing your title. 8', '2013-10-20 23:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119210, 1086113, 94815, '<td valign="top">The man remanded: "Stop begging, comrade. Here is your banquet in a paper bag but first you must pay." I like this projection of there and then on here and now. A convincing link to the novel. I love the composition - dominated by the lines, angles and planes of the building which carom around the picture plane - even as it surrounds and compresses the individual (as in Communist society). This is one of the few in this challenge which make an intuitively inspired connection to the novel. 9</td>', 'The man remanded: "Stop begging, comrade. Here is your banquet in a paper bag but first you must pay." I like this projection of there and then on here and now. A convincing link to the novel. I love the composition - dominated by the lines, angles and planes of the building which carom around the picture plane - even as it surrounds and compresses the individual (as in Communist society). This is one of the few in this challenge which make an intuitively inspired connection to the novel. 9', '2013-10-21 00:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119216, 1087078, 94815, '<td valign="top">This is a studious attempt at showing the grueling horror of torture more literally described in the novel. Clawing clouds of light and dark conjure up the horrific atmosphere of the story. The image itself is well constructed to that end with exaggerated contrast and textures extending the visual impression to harsh extremes. 7</td>', 'This is a studious attempt at showing the grueling horror of torture more literally described in the novel. Clawing clouds of light and dark conjure up the horrific atmosphere of the story. The image itself is well constructed to that end with exaggerated contrast and textures extending the visual impression to harsh extremes. 7', '2013-10-21 00:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119218, 1086734, 94815, '<td valign="top">At least this image comes close to a representing the location of the novel, in the mountains of Davos, Switzerland. It might be better to have related it to the story but we can''t have everything. The image is otherworldly to most of us who can never experience first hand such a scene. The incredible beauty is very wall captured and would rate a 10 if quality were the only criteria. But as a visual representation inspired by the novel, not the title of the novel, it rates an 8.</td>', 'At least this image comes close to a representing the location of the novel, in the mountains of Davos, Switzerland. It might be better to have related it to the story but we can''t have everything. The image is otherworldly to most of us who can never experience first hand such a scene. The incredible beauty is very wall captured and would rate a 10 if quality were the only criteria. But as a visual representation inspired by the novel, not the title of the novel, it rates an 8.', '2013-10-21 00:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119233, 1086340, 94815, '<td valign="top">Grin. Effectively produced fishtank inspiration. There''s the plastic squid and something like the underwater suit of Cape Nemo. And then there''s the bored silver dollar fish in the background. There''s something brilliant at work here. 7</td>', 'Grin. Effectively produced fishtank inspiration. There''s the plastic squid and something like the underwater suit of Cape Nemo. And then there''s the bored silver dollar fish in the background. There''s something brilliant at work here. 7', '2013-10-21 00:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119248, 1087188, 94815, '<td valign="top">I regret to say that this doesn''t qualify as inspiration from the novel. It''s a good action shot of runners however. The color and tonal range is visually appealing and conveys the spirit of a track meet. But not the novel. 5</td>', 'I regret to say that this doesn''t qualify as inspiration from the novel. It''s a good action shot of runners however. The color and tonal range is visually appealing and conveys the spirit of a track meet. But not the novel. 5', '2013-10-21 00:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119253, 1087210, 94815, '<td valign="top">Appealing horse portrait which could be ripped from the book. The color palette is a little bland but has an attractive faded quality of an old image. Very well composed with carefully discriminating focus centered on the eye as it must be. 8</td>', 'Appealing horse portrait which could be ripped from the book. The color palette is a little bland but has an attractive faded quality of an old image. Very well composed with carefully discriminating focus centered on the eye as it must be. 8', '2013-10-21 00:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119361, 1087139, 159196, '<td valign="top">I don''t get a feel of a crime novel. I like the aged look, but feel that it could be a tad brighter. A 5 from me.</td>', 'I don''t get a feel of a crime novel. I like the aged look, but feel that it could be a tad brighter. A 5 from me.', '2013-10-21 07:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119363, 1086987, 159196, '<td valign="top">Whilst i haven''t read the book, it seems to me that it is about moral education. I can see the connection to fish and like the flow in the image. I find the colors and blending of colors works well to portray this fable and I see it as a modern representation of an old piece of writing. A 6 from me</td>', 'Whilst i haven''t read the book, it seems to me that it is about moral education. I can see the connection to fish and like the flow in the image. I find the colors and blending of colors works well to portray this fable and I see it as a modern representation of an old piece of writing. A 6 from me', '2013-10-21 07:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119364, 1087148, 159196, '<td valign="top">The floating mask works well and helps to meet the challenge. But there''s something missing - I can''t put my finger on it. I guess it''s missing excitement? A 6 from me</td>', 'The floating mask works well and helps to meet the challenge. But there''s something missing - I can''t put my finger on it. I guess it''s missing excitement? A 6 from me', '2013-10-21 07:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119365, 1087190, 159196, '<td valign="top">Captures the essence of the book well and the reality aspect of the fire draws one in. I like it and it gets a 7 from me.</td>', 'Captures the essence of the book well and the reality aspect of the fire draws one in. I like it and it gets a 7 from me.', '2013-10-21 07:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119367, 1087044, 159196, '<td valign="top">I really like the shot, but I don''t get any sense of what seems to be important threads in the book: religion, race, family relationships. However, I can see that there may be a spiritual feel to this, helped by the colors. Therefore, a 6 from me.</td>', 'I really like the shot, but I don''t get any sense of what seems to be important threads in the book: religion, race, family relationships. However, I can see that there may be a spiritual feel to this, helped by the colors. Therefore, a 6 from me.', '2013-10-21 08:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119368, 1087219, 159196, '<td valign="top">Similar image to one of the book covers. It meets the challenge well. I would have liked sharper focus on the beak and eye and perhaps sharper contrast in color, but I do like it. A 6 from me.</td>', 'Similar image to one of the book covers. It meets the challenge well. I would have liked sharper focus on the beak and eye and perhaps sharper contrast in color, but I do like it. A 6 from me.', '2013-10-21 08:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119370, 1087015, 159196, '<td valign="top">I like the mood of it, but somehow the setting lacks something, perhaps the great openness which should be around the house to give it a more apt Yorkshire moore setting. A 5 from me.</td>', 'I like the mood of it, but somehow the setting lacks something, perhaps the great openness which should be around the house to give it a more apt Yorkshire moore setting. A 5 from me.', '2013-10-21 08:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119376, 1087221, 159196, '<td valign="top">A literal take on the book. I like it - perhaps the clock face could have been a tad brighter. From me a 6</td>', 'A literal take on the book. I like it - perhaps the clock face could have been a tad brighter. From me a 6', '2013-10-21 08:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119380, 1086978, 159196, '<td valign="top">A literal depiction of a classic tale. For me it would have been more poignant if the leaf was still on the tree, the only one left. The yellow works well on the blue/grey background but perhaps the leaf could have been a tad sharper. A 5 from me.</td>', 'A literal depiction of a classic tale. For me it would have been more poignant if the leaf was still on the tree, the only one left. The yellow works well on the blue/grey background but perhaps the leaf could have been a tad sharper. A 5 from me.', '2013-10-21 08:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119382, 1087071, 159196, '<td valign="top">Good take on the challenge. The contrast works well and I especially like the crinkled, burnt paper/ashes, the glow and the textures. A 7 from me</td>', 'Good take on the challenge. The contrast works well and I especially like the crinkled, burnt paper/ashes, the glow and the textures. A 7 from me', '2013-10-21 08:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119384, 1086983, 159196, '<td valign="top">Whilst I don''t feel that the image has necessarily much to do with the book, I really like it! The dirty hand, the nails, the grapes and the lighting are great. Best of all for me are the grape juice droplets which could be interpreted as blood, pain etc. It tells a story of its own. A 7 from me.</td>', 'Whilst I don''t feel that the image has necessarily much to do with the book, I really like it! The dirty hand, the nails, the grapes and the lighting are great. Best of all for me are the grape juice droplets which could be interpreted as blood, pain etc. It tells a story of its own. A 7 from me.', '2013-10-21 08:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119385, 1086157, 159196, '<td valign="top">A literal take on the title. I love the shot, the atmosphere, the natural beauty and sense of a fairytale place. An 8 from me.</td>', 'A literal take on the title. I love the shot, the atmosphere, the natural beauty and sense of a fairytale place. An 8 from me.', '2013-10-21 08:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119386, 1087001, 159196, '<td valign="top">There''s a great Charlotte here. Perhaps the web could have been a tad brighter. A 7 from me.</td>', 'There''s a great Charlotte here. Perhaps the web could have been a tad brighter. A 7 from me.', '2013-10-21 08:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119387, 1086113, 159196, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite authors and books. I''m struggling to tie the shot to the book, perhaps I''m just not noticing something. A 4 from me.</td>', 'One of my favorite authors and books. I''m struggling to tie the shot to the book, perhaps I''m just not noticing something. A 4 from me.', '2013-10-21 08:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119392, 1086978, 94815, '<td valign="top">Whew. What to say? Not a novel but a short story. The image itself seems to be shot as found, which is ok, but doesn''t have much else to say. 4</td>', 'Whew. What to say? Not a novel but a short story. The image itself seems to be shot as found, which is ok, but doesn''t have much else to say. 4', '2013-10-21 08:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119403, 1087093, 8759, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Not familiar with the novel but seemed to refer to humans. Back to the picture, at this level of details should have been tack sharp. 5</td>', 'Interesting. Not familiar with the novel but seemed to refer to humans. Back to the picture, at this level of details should have been tack sharp. 5', '2013-10-21 09:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119404, 1087082, 8759, '<td valign="top">Good pic of a lighthouse with pretty background and nicely executed. Does it inspire? For me not much. 6</td>', 'Good pic of a lighthouse with pretty background and nicely executed. Does it inspire? For me not much. 6', '2013-10-21 09:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119405, 1087222, 8759, '<td valign="top">Inspired, yes. Too much processing for my taste, but is just me. What I dislike is the skin that looks like plastic. The smile also a bit off. Good try. 6</td>', 'Inspired, yes. Too much processing for my taste, but is just me. What I dislike is the skin that looks like plastic. The smile also a bit off. Good try. 6', '2013-10-21 09:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119408, 1087000, 8759, '<td valign="top">I''ll give this a 10. Because I like it. The style. Its personality. I am not familiar with neither the novel or the character so I did a bit of search. and I like it more. Big fan odriew!</td>', 'I''ll give this a 10. Because I like it. The style. Its personality. I am not familiar with neither the novel or the character so I did a bit of search. and I like it more. Big fan odriew!', '2013-10-21 09:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
