(7119456, 1087222, 138253, '<td valign="top">every time i look at this, and i''ve been back to look a few times, i can''t see this as a serious single image. the dress, shoes and legs look cartoonish and flat, the boat and glass look directly lit in a way that the area here does not look to be capable of.<br/>there is a fantastic attention to detail on everything else, and while the car may be reminiscent of ''old sports car'', it does not seem to fit for the period that Gatsby would be set in, nor would the car be in this state of disrepair.<br/>im giving this a 5</td>', 'every time i look at this, and i''ve been back to look a few times, i can''t see this as a serious single image. the dress, shoes and legs look cartoonish and flat, the boat and glass look directly lit in a way that the area here does not look to be capable of.there is a fantastic attention to detail on everything else, and while the car may be reminiscent of ''old sports car'', it does not seem to fit for the period that Gatsby would be set in, nor would the car be in this state of disrepair.im giving this a 5', '2013-10-21 11:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
