(7119461, 1087055, 30861, '<td valign="top">This isn''t working for me at all. Chalk it up to latent prudery if you want, but I find the image profoundly unappealing. The expression, especially, is quite disturbing. I suppose the image meets the challenge, in the sense that the book''s about a prostitute and it''s quite bawdy, but for me "bawdy" inspires a sense of rough-and-tumble fun (the book displays a tremendous amount of risque humor), and this doesn''t incorporate that element.<br/> <br/>Regardless, the image is not technically especially well done, either in lighting or in pose, IMO. I''ll give it a 5, which is what I give any image in this challenge that seems to me to MEET the challenge.</td>', 'This isn''t working for me at all. Chalk it up to latent prudery if you want, but I find the image profoundly unappealing. The expression, especially, is quite disturbing. I suppose the image meets the challenge, in the sense that the book''s about a prostitute and it''s quite bawdy, but for me "bawdy" inspires a sense of rough-and-tumble fun (the book displays a tremendous amount of risque humor), and this doesn''t incorporate that element. Regardless, the image is not technically especially well done, either in lighting or in pose, IMO. I''ll give it a 5, which is what I give any image in this challenge that seems to me to MEET the challenge.', '2013-10-21 11:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
