(7119465, 1087096, 138253, '<td valign="top">Several notable quotes from this book jump at me when i see this image. (below)<br/>It looks like the boys were having fun here, and that''s the most important part - capturing them being kids because further down the road that''s what you can look back at this and remember.<br/>I love the imagery here, the lighting is great through the trees and the detail is crisp.<br/>I may have cropped a bit more from the top, but it''s such a small criticism that it''s hardly worth mentioning aside from being honest in my thoughts on the image.<br/>A 9+ and contender for my favorite in the challenge.<br/> <br/>We did everything adults would do. What went wrong? <br/>The thing is - fear can''t hurt you any more than a dream. <br/>Maybe there is a beast maybe it''s only us.</td>', 'Several notable quotes from this book jump at me when i see this image. (below)It looks like the boys were having fun here, and that''s the most important part - capturing them being kids because further down the road that''s what you can look back at this and remember.I love the imagery here, the lighting is great through the trees and the detail is crisp.I may have cropped a bit more from the top, but it''s such a small criticism that it''s hardly worth mentioning aside from being honest in my thoughts on the image.A 9+ and contender for my favorite in the challenge. We did everything adults would do. What went wrong? The thing is - fear can''t hurt you any more than a dream. Maybe there is a beast maybe it''s only us.', '2013-10-21 11:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
