(7119489, 1087183, 30861, '<td valign="top">Such an intriguing image in its own right, but only the most tenuous connection to the fairy tale "Snow White", which isn''t a novel in any case. I''m gonna take a leap of faith and assume you are referencing Donald Barthelme''s modernist classic version of Snow White, which indeed makes numerous "absurdist" leaps in the narrative. Fits THAT one to a tee, it does, because this image is absurd :-)<br/> <br/>Give ya a 7.</td>', 'Such an intriguing image in its own right, but only the most tenuous connection to the fairy tale "Snow White", which isn''t a novel in any case. I''m gonna take a leap of faith and assume you are referencing Donald Barthelme''s modernist classic version of Snow White, which indeed makes numerous "absurdist" leaps in the narrative. Fits THAT one to a tee, it does, because this image is absurd :-) Give ya a 7.', '2013-10-21 12:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
