(7119618, 1086979, 35804, '<td valign="top">6...I love the light pouring through the trees.This conjures nothing of the novel for me. The HDR effect is almost too much for my taste.</td>', '6...I love the light pouring through the trees.This conjures nothing of the novel for me. The HDR effect is almost too much for my taste.', '2013-10-21 15:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119619, 1086453, 11769, '<td valign="top">blur coalescing to form. lovely</td>', 'blur coalescing to form. lovely', '2013-10-21 15:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119623, 1087065, 35804, '<td valign="top">6...Its freaky, and kind of cool. But the eyes remind me of the whole werewolf/vampire thing that is so popular now. It would have been interesting to portray the "white blindness" of the afflicted.  The B&amp;W conversion has nice pop, and the rain is quite lovely.</td>', '6...Its freaky, and kind of cool. But the eyes remind me of the whole werewolf/vampire thing that is so popular now. It would have been interesting to portray the "white blindness" of the afflicted.  The B&W conversion has nice pop, and the rain is quite lovely.', '2013-10-21 15:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119626, 1087004, 35804, '<td valign="top">3...I get it, the windmill. The 3 is for that flat and lifeless B&amp;W conversion and a meh composition. There is no energy here.</td>', '3...I get it, the windmill. The 3 is for that flat and lifeless B&W conversion and a meh composition. There is no energy here.', '2013-10-21 16:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119628, 1087086, 40391, '<td valign="top">A wonderful image to represent the book. The dark treatment of the sky and the agricultural foreground transfer what should be a happy place to something quite sinister. 8.</td>', 'A wonderful image to represent the book. The dark treatment of the sky and the agricultural foreground transfer what should be a happy place to something quite sinister. 8.', '2013-10-21 16:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119630, 1087184, 35804, '<td valign="top">3...for me this seems like a title pasted to a last minute candid.</td>', '3...for me this seems like a title pasted to a last minute candid.', '2013-10-21 16:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119633, 1087221, 35804, '<td valign="top">3...cute idea, it''s just not what I was looking for with this challenge. The lighting could use some work...it seems a bit harsh and flat all at the same time. Natural light might have been a better choice.</td>', '3...cute idea, it''s just not what I was looking for with this challenge. The lighting could use some work...it seems a bit harsh and flat all at the same time. Natural light might have been a better choice.', '2013-10-21 16:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119635, 1086767, 40391, '<td valign="top">Now that is one of the more literal book title representations Ive seen. I like the way you have produced this image. The vignetting works well and Im glad you left in the colour. 7.</td>', 'Now that is one of the more literal book title representations Ive seen. I like the way you have produced this image. The vignetting works well and Im glad you left in the colour. 7.', '2013-10-21 16:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119640, 1086105, 40391, '<td valign="top">Using my imagination I see the platforms as the Martian tripods. Im not sure if that is what you were trying to represent that is not so important as Ill vote on what I see. Im also not sure if the transition of colours is your doing or it is natural but I also relate this back to the book with the transition of earth green to the Martian red weed. I like what you made me see. 7.</td>', 'Using my imagination I see the platforms as the Martian tripods. Im not sure if that is what you were trying to represent that is not so important as Ill vote on what I see. Im also not sure if the transition of colours is your doing or it is natural but I also relate this back to the book with the transition of earth green to the Martian red weed. I like what you made me see. 7.', '2013-10-21 16:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119641, 1087205, 35804, '<td valign="top">4...I''m not familiar with the novel, but the leaves fit the title nicely I suppose. The texture of those leaves is fantastic. What ruins it for me is the edge of the MDF looking shelf they''re sitting on. Same shelf also isn''t quite level. And the strange plasticy texture in the background fights the organic-ness of those beautiful leaves. I tight crop of those mingled leaves would have lovely, and fitting I think.</td>', '4...I''m not familiar with the novel, but the leaves fit the title nicely I suppose. The texture of those leaves is fantastic. What ruins it for me is the edge of the MDF looking shelf they''re sitting on. Same shelf also isn''t quite level. And the strange plasticy texture in the background fights the organic-ness of those beautiful leaves. I tight crop of those mingled leaves would have lovely, and fitting I think.', '2013-10-21 16:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119642, 1087100, 40391, '<td valign="top">Nice low key image. I like the lighting and details too. 6.</td>', 'Nice low key image. I like the lighting and details too. 6.', '2013-10-21 16:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119646, 1087187, 35804, '<td valign="top">6...great textures and a nice snappy B&amp;W conversion. The distortion of the parallels bothers me a bit, but things like that can be remedied in PS.</td>', '6...great textures and a nice snappy B&W conversion. The distortion of the parallels bothers me a bit, but things like that can be remedied in PS.', '2013-10-21 16:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119647, 1087223, 40391, '<td valign="top">I do like the lensbaby effect when used well, such as with this image. The b&amp;w conversion is nicely done and a good choice. I ended up looking at this image longer than most. 8.</td>', 'I do like the lensbaby effect when used well, such as with this image. The b&w conversion is nicely done and a good choice. I ended up looking at this image longer than most. 8.', '2013-10-21 16:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119648, 1087125, 35804, '<td valign="top">4...Seem like a title only reference to me. Technically speaking, to me it seems a bu\it overexposed. A different time of day might have added some atmosphere to the scene....early morning...mid evening. This appears to be that harsh mid day sort of light that flattens everything out.</td>', '4...Seem like a title only reference to me. Technically speaking, to me it seems a bu\it overexposed. A different time of day might have added some atmosphere to the scene....early morning...mid evening. This appears to be that harsh mid day sort of light that flattens everything out.', '2013-10-21 16:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119649, 1086105, 23484, '<td valign="top">The title fits this image well.</td>', 'The title fits this image well.', '2013-10-21 16:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119650, 1086734, 23484, '<td valign="top">Looks like the skiers dream come true.</td>', 'Looks like the skiers dream come true.', '2013-10-21 16:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119651, 1087065, 23484, '<td valign="top">I love this. What a great shot and well processed.</td>', 'I love this. What a great shot and well processed.', '2013-10-21 16:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119652, 1087071, 23484, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, fits the tile well.</td>', 'Excellent shot, fits the tile well.', '2013-10-21 16:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119653, 1087102, 35804, '<td valign="top">4...I get nothing of Wuthering Heights from this at all. Some breathing space around the building, and perhaps a different angle may have been more interesting. I feel like I want to see more of the landscape around this building to see if it can tell me more of a story.</td>', '4...I get nothing of Wuthering Heights from this at all. Some breathing space around the building, and perhaps a different angle may have been more interesting. I feel like I want to see more of the landscape around this building to see if it can tell me more of a story.', '2013-10-21 16:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119655, 1087194, 23484, '<td valign="top">Gotta love those people that reenact the wars.  They make for great photography.</td>', 'Gotta love those people that reenact the wars.  They make for great photography.', '2013-10-21 16:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119656, 1086157, 23484, '<td valign="top">That was a really good movie and this is a very nice image.</td>', 'That was a really good movie and this is a very nice image.', '2013-10-21 16:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119657, 1087195, 23484, '<td valign="top">A very serene image. Nice.</td>', 'A very serene image. Nice.', '2013-10-21 16:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119659, 1086865, 35804, '<td valign="top">6...its nice. I love that little area to the left where we see the tree trunks and their reflection in the water.</td>', '6...its nice. I love that little area to the left where we see the tree trunks and their reflection in the water.', '2013-10-21 16:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119660, 1087121, 23484, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Looks like rough seas.</td>', 'Great shot. Looks like rough seas.', '2013-10-21 16:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119661, 1087122, 40391, '<td valign="top">It is probable the heavy HDR effect has improved this image but it doesnt quite work for me. I feel this would have worked better without so much detail available in the shadows as it lacks depth. My eye gets drawn to the out-of-focus foreground as it is as bright, if not brighter than the areas I should be focusing on. 4. It is quite a nice location and the composition is good. The birds are a nice inclusion too. 4.</td>', 'It is probable the heavy HDR effect has improved this image but it doesnt quite work for me. I feel this would have worked better without so much detail available in the shadows as it lacks depth. My eye gets drawn to the out-of-focus foreground as it is as bright, if not brighter than the areas I should be focusing on. 4. It is quite a nice location and the composition is good. The birds are a nice inclusion too. 4.', '2013-10-21 16:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119662, 1087086, 23484, '<td valign="top">Looks so ominous. Very cool image.</td>', 'Looks so ominous. Very cool image.', '2013-10-21 16:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119665, 1087198, 35804, '<td valign="top">4...seems more mennonite than James Joyce. Or maybe he''s just a hipster. The crop is strange to me, too tight perhaps? I keep wanting to see the whole hat.</td>', '4...seems more mennonite than James Joyce. Or maybe he''s just a hipster. The crop is strange to me, too tight perhaps? I keep wanting to see the whole hat.', '2013-10-21 16:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119671, 1087152, 35804, '<td valign="top">4...it just looks too much like ketchup to me. Having watched chicks come forth, I don''t remember it being nearly this bloody...or should I say ketchupy. I kid.  : D More dramatic/directional lighting may have been a good choice for this...would have been less scientific looking, but it would have created some nice atmosphere.</td>', '4...it just looks too much like ketchup to me. Having watched chicks come forth, I don''t remember it being nearly this bloody...or should I say ketchupy. I kid.  : D More dramatic/directional lighting may have been a good choice for this...would have been less scientific looking, but it would have created some nice atmosphere.', '2013-10-21 16:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119673, 1086936, 138253, '<td valign="top">she has the "chasing the white rabbit" look alright; though it seems she''s already obtained her spot of tea for the mad hatter''s party.<br/>the expression is what sells this image for me, regardless of location/era.<br/>i give it a 7</td>', 'she has the "chasing the white rabbit" look alright; though it seems she''s already obtained her spot of tea for the mad hatter''s party.the expression is what sells this image for me, regardless of location/era.i give it a 7', '2013-10-21 16:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119674, 1087112, 40391, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and beautiful details. There is something that bothers me though. When I look around the table I see a light that is coming from left that is then contradicted by the way her face is lit. With no shadows from the fire or the light that supposed be coming from behind her makes it feel too unnatural. Also, the light doesnt seem to be as natural as the rest (perhaps achieved by dodging?). I can appreciate the difficulties and complexity of lighting a setup like this and I would have no real idea on how to achieve it. Its just that with so much effort that has been taken to produce this it should all feel natural. 7.</td>', 'Lovely composition and beautiful details. There is something that bothers me though. When I look around the table I see a light that is coming from left that is then contradicted by the way her face is lit. With no shadows from the fire or the light that supposed be coming from behind her makes it feel too unnatural. Also, the light doesnt seem to be as natural as the rest (perhaps achieved by dodging?). I can appreciate the difficulties and complexity of lighting a setup like this and I would have no real idea on how to achieve it. Its just that with so much effort that has been taken to produce this it should all feel natural. 7.', '2013-10-21 16:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119675, 1086858, 35804, '<td valign="top">7...I''m not familiar with the book, but the textures and design of this is quite appealing. I assume some sort of HDRy process was used here, which usually don''t care for, but in this case it''s nice.</td>', '7...I''m not familiar with the book, but the textures and design of this is quite appealing. I assume some sort of HDRy process was used here, which usually don''t care for, but in this case it''s nice.', '2013-10-21 16:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119676, 1087192, 35804, '<td valign="top">6...I don''t see the reference to the actual /story/novel, more just a title plop. It is a nice picture of a lizard though.</td>', '6...I don''t see the reference to the actual /story/novel, more just a title plop. It is a nice picture of a lizard though.', '2013-10-21 16:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119677, 1087082, 138253, '<td valign="top">I Find this less about the lighthouse and more about the dramatic battle happening in the sky behind it. <br/>Personally, the lighthouse is underexposed as the primary subject in my opinion, and i truly cannot stop exploring the sky behind it, detracting from it as the subject.<br/>as pretty as this is, it''s getting a 5 from me.</td>', 'I Find this less about the lighthouse and more about the dramatic battle happening in the sky behind it. Personally, the lighthouse is underexposed as the primary subject in my opinion, and i truly cannot stop exploring the sky behind it, detracting from it as the subject.as pretty as this is, it''s getting a 5 from me.', '2013-10-21 16:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119678, 1087210, 35804, '<td valign="top">6...I like the handpainted  quality this has.</td>', '6...I like the handpainted  quality this has.', '2013-10-21 16:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119679, 1087121, 138253, '<td valign="top">Your title is infinitely smarter than the people on these boats.<br/>i could do with about 40-50% less sky above them and quite possibly a masked layer to increase contrast for the boats/people from the rain storm this image is clearly in <br/>a 6 from me</td>', 'Your title is infinitely smarter than the people on these boats.i could do with about 40-50% less sky above them and quite possibly a masked layer to increase contrast for the boats/people from the rain storm this image is clearly in a 6 from me', '2013-10-21 16:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119681, 1087216, 35804, '<td valign="top">7...it has good quirk.</td>', '7...it has good quirk.', '2013-10-21 16:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119682, 1086672, 138253, '<td valign="top">My thoughts on this - shouldn''t the knife be on the other side of the face to go with the "crazy" persona?<br/>the snarl on the lip is overly shadowy, leading to a void there instead of shadowy menacing that i picture being there from the eye.<br/>one further controllable change would be to have the Jekyll persona clean shaven to provide another layer of contrast to the monster. i can see where some may have issue with that visually since it is asymmetrical, but that is the intended purpose of trying to capture this image.<br/>a 7 from me regardless.</td>', 'My thoughts on this - shouldn''t the knife be on the other side of the face to go with the "crazy" persona?the snarl on the lip is overly shadowy, leading to a void there instead of shadowy menacing that i picture being there from the eye.one further controllable change would be to have the Jekyll persona clean shaven to provide another layer of contrast to the monster. i can see where some may have issue with that visually since it is asymmetrical, but that is the intended purpose of trying to capture this image.a 7 from me regardless.', '2013-10-21 16:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119685, 1087221, 138253, '<td valign="top">Amusing take, Georgie, though a bit Dim overall and it kind of Peters out on the right side, don''t you think? ;)<br/> <br/>Fantastic choice for a novel, I had thought of this book initially myself though opted for different later.<br/>I personally think the shallow focus provides several levels of appropriateness and it certainly looks thick skinned, hopefully it doesn''t have to randomly attack people for no particular reason.<br/>a 7 from me</td>', 'Amusing take, Georgie, though a bit Dim overall and it kind of Peters out on the right side, don''t you think? ;) Fantastic choice for a novel, I had thought of this book initially myself though opted for different later.I personally think the shallow focus provides several levels of appropriateness and it certainly looks thick skinned, hopefully it doesn''t have to randomly attack people for no particular reason.a 7 from me', '2013-10-21 16:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119688, 1087039, 138253, '<td valign="top">interesting perspective and tonal choice. i can see a vision of something grand here, a concept being pitched for "the city of tomorrow, today" or something of that sort.<br/>i like it, but at the same time it leaves me wanting more, which is good and bad because it certainly means you''ve succeeded in drawing me.<br/>a 7 from me.</td>', 'interesting perspective and tonal choice. i can see a vision of something grand here, a concept being pitched for "the city of tomorrow, today" or something of that sort.i like it, but at the same time it leaves me wanting more, which is good and bad because it certainly means you''ve succeeded in drawing me.a 7 from me.', '2013-10-21 17:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119691, 1087148, 138253, '<td valign="top">I can honestly say that this image calls to me. it''s power over me growing stronger yet!<br/> <br/>i love the simplicity of the setup; this is what it''s truly all about - a story in an glance, a picture for 1000 words as they say.<br/>an 8 from me.<br/>i''d give it a 9 and have it as a contender for my favorite image, except for the top left of the image being a tad too distracting with the lighter area existing where my mind wants to see a dark spot</td>', 'I can honestly say that this image calls to me. it''s power over me growing stronger yet! i love the simplicity of the setup; this is what it''s truly all about - a story in an glance, a picture for 1000 words as they say.an 8 from me.i''d give it a 9 and have it as a contender for my favorite image, except for the top left of the image being a tad too distracting with the lighter area existing where my mind wants to see a dark spot', '2013-10-21 17:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119694, 1087152, 94815, '<td valign="top">I read this book 50 years ago, and at first I didn''t remember that controlled births were a part of it. Now having researched Huxley and his attitudes, I see how this could fit. The image has the uncomfortable feel of a botched abortion, or in this case, the one that got away. Quite disturbing, as I understand Huxley felt about America. So, assuming it was your intention to graphically illustrate a grotesque form of birth control, it succeeds. The white environment has an anticeptic look whe the ketchup serves well enough. But the overall effect is too blunt and two dimensional in the context of the sophistication of the book. 5</td>', 'I read this book 50 years ago, and at first I didn''t remember that controlled births were a part of it. Now having researched Huxley and his attitudes, I see how this could fit. The image has the uncomfortable feel of a botched abortion, or in this case, the one that got away. Quite disturbing, as I understand Huxley felt about America. So, assuming it was your intention to graphically illustrate a grotesque form of birth control, it succeeds. The white environment has an anticeptic look whe the ketchup serves well enough. But the overall effect is too blunt and two dimensional in the context of the sophistication of the book. 5', '2013-10-21 17:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119699, 1087022, 94815, '<td valign="top">The photograph is techincally good with clean textures and extended black &amp; white tones. From the synopsis of the book, this seems only remotely connected with the story. Instead it takes inspiration from the title alone out of its likely aligorical context. I like the artwork, but can''t validly give a good score of it as yours. 3</td>', 'The photograph is techincally good with clean textures and extended black & white tones. From the synopsis of the book, this seems only remotely connected with the story. Instead it takes inspiration from the title alone out of its likely aligorical context. I like the artwork, but can''t validly give a good score of it as yours. 3', '2013-10-21 17:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119701, 1087065, 94815, '<td valign="top">As to the inspiration, it seems to work very well as a representation of the book which is where the majority of images in this challenge fail. And I was enjoying this image very much at first glance until I realized the eyes were manipulated in post processing. Now all I see is this defect in an otherwise very well executed shot. I think her blankly staring eyes could have been a wonderfully natural effect. Regretably, my vote is only a 4 in this form.</td>', 'As to the inspiration, it seems to work very well as a representation of the book which is where the majority of images in this challenge fail. And I was enjoying this image very much at first glance until I realized the eyes were manipulated in post processing. Now all I see is this defect in an otherwise very well executed shot. I think her blankly staring eyes could have been a wonderfully natural effect. Regretably, my vote is only a 4 in this form.', '2013-10-21 18:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119714, 1086979, 103142, '<td valign="top">Not sure the foreground adds much. At first I thought that the weeds in the lower left might lead nicely into the interesting area of the upper left, but I think it points out that that there''s just not much interesting in the foreground, and it''s quite shadowed. <br/> <br/>I would love to see this cropped just as the upper 1/4 of the photo. That part is particularly nice. :)<br/> <br/>I wish there was more of a connection to the novel, however. -6-</td>', 'Not sure the foreground adds much. At first I thought that the weeds in the lower left might lead nicely into the interesting area of the upper left, but I think it points out that that there''s just not much interesting in the foreground, and it''s quite shadowed.  I would love to see this cropped just as the upper 1/4 of the photo. That part is particularly nice. :) I wish there was more of a connection to the novel, however. -6-', '2013-10-21 18:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119715, 1087210, 103142, '<td valign="top">Works with the novel. Not crazy about the horizontal line going across the lower part of the background. But you probably didn''t have much of an option of going higher or lower to get it in a better place. -6-</td>', 'Works with the novel. Not crazy about the horizontal line going across the lower part of the background. But you probably didn''t have much of an option of going higher or lower to get it in a better place. -6-', '2013-10-21 18:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119716, 1087048, 103142, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite books. While the colors are lovely, this doesn''t really give me much of a feeling of a garden: either before when it''s overgrown or after, once they''ve started to take care of it. Perhaps adding people would have helped to get some emotion into the shot. -5-</td>', 'One of my favorite books. While the colors are lovely, this doesn''t really give me much of a feeling of a garden: either before when it''s overgrown or after, once they''ve started to take care of it. Perhaps adding people would have helped to get some emotion into the shot. -5-', '2013-10-21 18:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119722, 1087190, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice timing on capturing the flames.  Seems like it could use just a tad more contrast and levels adjustment (to get the blacks a little truer).  Overall a nice photo.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice timing on capturing the flames.  Seems like it could use just a tad more contrast and levels adjustment (to get the blacks a little truer).  Overall a nice photo.  Good luck.', '2013-10-21 19:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119723, 1087007, 30049, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  One finishing touch that would have put it over the top for me is some dirt on him (hands, arms, face).  Looks too freshly scrubbed for the story theme.  Still an 8 from me.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Great idea.  One finishing touch that would have put it over the top for me is some dirt on him (hands, arms, face).  Looks too freshly scrubbed for the story theme.  Still an 8 from me.  Nicely done!', '2013-10-21 19:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119724, 1086734, 40391, '<td valign="top">Spectacular image! The details are wonderful and its impressive how non of the whites I can see are blown despite the details available in the shadows. 8.</td>', 'Spectacular image! The details are wonderful and its impressive how non of the whites I can see are blown despite the details available in the shadows. 8.', '2013-10-21 19:13:53.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(7119726, 1087120, 40391, '<td valign="top">Nice composition with the cockpit and airport. 5</td>', 'Nice composition with the cockpit and airport. 5', '2013-10-21 19:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119728, 1087162, 112828, '<td valign="top">Extraordinary.<br/> <br/>A story is told, and it evokes the novel perfectly.<br/> <br/>My only 10 of the challenge.<br/> <br/>Well done.</td>', 'Extraordinary. A story is told, and it evokes the novel perfectly. My only 10 of the challenge. Well done.', '2013-10-21 19:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119729, 1087071, 112828, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  Obviously evokes the novel very strongly.<br/> <br/>Well shot too, and while I''m tempted to nit-pick the over-sharp flames, this is so good that I can''t bring myself to do so.<br/> <br/>9</td>', 'Excellent.  Obviously evokes the novel very strongly. Well shot too, and while I''m tempted to nit-pick the over-sharp flames, this is so good that I can''t bring myself to do so. 9', '2013-10-21 19:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119730, 1087112, 112828, '<td valign="top">A scene directly from the novel..<br/> <br/>Everything here is simply fantastic.  While I don''t see a strong story here, I do really like the image simply on visual merit and applicability to challenge topic.<br/> <br/>9 for you.  Well done.</td>', 'A scene directly from the novel.. Everything here is simply fantastic.  While I don''t see a strong story here, I do really like the image simply on visual merit and applicability to challenge topic. 9 for you.  Well done.', '2013-10-21 19:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119732, 1087065, 112828, '<td valign="top">I love it.  You didn''t really capture the darkness of the novel, but you did get the blindness right.<br/> <br/>If she only looked scared and miserable this would be a 9 or 10.<br/> <br/>As it is?  you get an 8</td>', 'I love it.  You didn''t really capture the darkness of the novel, but you did get the blindness right. If she only looked scared and miserable this would be a 9 or 10. As it is?  you get an 8', '2013-10-21 19:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119734, 1086672, 112828, '<td valign="top">not bad.  I''d say you captured the spirit here well.<br/> <br/>7<br/> <br/>I do think the red eye is a bit too pink, and a bit too saturated...</td>', 'not bad.  I''d say you captured the spirit here well. 7 I do think the red eye is a bit too pink, and a bit too saturated...', '2013-10-21 19:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119735, 1087082, 112828, '<td valign="top">Very literal.  But quite well shot.  And unlike many of the other over-literal images, this at least is from a novel that would otherwise be really difficult to find some other concept for shooting, and the lighthouse does after all play a key role in the story.<br/> <br/>A bit soft overall, and a bit too much saturation.  7</td>', 'Very literal.  But quite well shot.  And unlike many of the other over-literal images, this at least is from a novel that would otherwise be really difficult to find some other concept for shooting, and the lighthouse does after all play a key role in the story. A bit soft overall, and a bit too much saturation.  7', '2013-10-21 19:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119736, 1087190, 112828, '<td valign="top">Excellent novel, and this does capture it well.<br/> <br/>I think the truth is that loose pages burn better, but they also make for a kinda cluttered and messy composition.<br/> <br/>I think the color of the light on the pages could have been a bit more blue.<br/> <br/>With that being said?  yep.. very nice. :)<br/> <br/>7</td>', 'Excellent novel, and this does capture it well. I think the truth is that loose pages burn better, but they also make for a kinda cluttered and messy composition. I think the color of the light on the pages could have been a bit more blue. With that being said?  yep.. very nice. :) 7', '2013-10-21 19:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119737, 1086692, 40391, '<td valign="top">Your shoehorn title made me smile. The image is very beautiful and I would have scored this higher in a free study 5.<br/> <br/>But wait! Before I actually hit the score button I decided to google your title just in case I was wrong in assume it was a play on the well known classic Catcher in the Rye and their in Goodreads is your quoted book by Wodke Hawkinson and Dmitry Raykin. So it is not, IMO, a complete DNMC but only a slight shoe horn (what is considered a classic can be subjective but this book may be a bit of a stretch). 7.</td>', 'Your shoehorn title made me smile. The image is very beautiful and I would have scored this higher in a free study 5. But wait! Before I actually hit the score button I decided to google your title just in case I was wrong in assume it was a play on the well known classic Catcher in the Rye and their in Goodreads is your quoted book by Wodke Hawkinson and Dmitry Raykin. So it is not, IMO, a complete DNMC but only a slight shoe horn (what is considered a classic can be subjective but this book may be a bit of a stretch). 7.', '2013-10-21 19:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119738, 1086986, 112828, '<td valign="top">Much better.  Best of the "LOTF" entries.  Yours has the taste of the novel.<br/> <br/>7</td>', 'Much better.  Best of the "LOTF" entries.  Yours has the taste of the novel. 7', '2013-10-21 19:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119739, 1087223, 112828, '<td valign="top">An interesting take on this.<br/> <br/>Frankly, so far it''s one of the best.  Down the rabbit hole indeed.<br/> <br/>7</td>', 'An interesting take on this. Frankly, so far it''s one of the best.  Down the rabbit hole indeed. 7', '2013-10-21 19:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119740, 1087205, 112828, '<td valign="top">While I don''t know that it speaks directly to any part of this novel, I think it does a good enough job of evoking the feeling of the novel.<br/> <br/>Frankly, I like this a lot, it''s mundane, but well shot and processed, such that something which is otherwise uninteresting now has meaning and interest.<br/> <br/>7</td>', 'While I don''t know that it speaks directly to any part of this novel, I think it does a good enough job of evoking the feeling of the novel. Frankly, I like this a lot, it''s mundane, but well shot and processed, such that something which is otherwise uninteresting now has meaning and interest. 7', '2013-10-21 19:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119741, 1087195, 112828, '<td valign="top">WOW. Beautiful image - simply stunning reflection, fog, sun, everything.  This is great.<br/> <br/>Unfortunately, it''s also a bit too literal for me, and I think it misses the mark a bit for suitability.<br/> <br/>Still... How could I not give this a...  Shit, there isn''t a 6.5 vote is there? ...  Flip a coin... 7. ;)</td>', 'WOW. Beautiful image - simply stunning reflection, fog, sun, everything.  This is great. Unfortunately, it''s also a bit too literal for me, and I think it misses the mark a bit for suitability. Still... How could I not give this a...  Shit, there isn''t a 6.5 vote is there? ...  Flip a coin... 7. ;)', '2013-10-21 19:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119742, 1086989, 112828, '<td valign="top">This was a novel that literal worked for.  I think the tonality here is great, and love that rich yellow.<br/> <br/>Powerlines should have been cloned out, and I would have just loved a tiny touch of ''structure'' on that building.<br/> <br/>Anyway, 7</td>', 'This was a novel that literal worked for.  I think the tonality here is great, and love that rich yellow. Powerlines should have been cloned out, and I would have just loved a tiny touch of ''structure'' on that building. Anyway, 7', '2013-10-21 19:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119743, 1087022, 112828, '<td valign="top">Given the strong racial content of the book, I think this image does a strangely good job of evoking the feel of the novel''s subject.<br/> <br/>Composition isn''t quite what I think I''d like - but it''s generally quite good.<br/> <br/>7</td>', 'Given the strong racial content of the book, I think this image does a strangely good job of evoking the feel of the novel''s subject. Composition isn''t quite what I think I''d like - but it''s generally quite good. 7', '2013-10-21 19:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119744, 1087141, 112828, '<td valign="top">Fits the novel well enough, since faith and the church was a big part of that one.<br/> <br/>I like the image''s composition, and the subject.<br/> <br/>The building''s facade is nearly perfect, but the rest of the image seems to be over-sharp, and the shadow area of the building seems really soft.  Quite strange overall.<br/> <br/>Add to that the selenium coloration, and hard clouds, and we start heading down a rather dark path.<br/> <br/>I''m giving this a 6 for meeting the challenge well, and having a good composition.</td>', 'Fits the novel well enough, since faith and the church was a big part of that one. I like the image''s composition, and the subject. The building''s facade is nearly perfect, but the rest of the image seems to be over-sharp, and the shadow area of the building seems really soft.  Quite strange overall. Add to that the selenium coloration, and hard clouds, and we start heading down a rather dark path. I''m giving this a 6 for meeting the challenge well, and having a good composition.', '2013-10-21 19:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119745, 1087007, 112828, '<td valign="top">Not ''dark'' enough.  But it does almost get there.  Love the sticks. :)<br/> <br/>6</td>', 'Not ''dark'' enough.  But it does almost get there.  Love the sticks. :) 6', '2013-10-21 19:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119746, 1087121, 112828, '<td valign="top">Fits the novel well enough.  Not quite perfect, but hey - not bad either.<br/> <br/>The image itself leaves something to be desired - it seems flat, and just isn''t striking.  Despite that, it does fit well and isn''t badly deficient in any manner.   <br/> <br/>6</td>', 'Fits the novel well enough.  Not quite perfect, but hey - not bad either. The image itself leaves something to be desired - it seems flat, and just isn''t striking.  Despite that, it does fit well and isn''t badly deficient in any manner.    6', '2013-10-21 19:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119747, 1087100, 112828, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  The hands look rather well cared for, but I suppose ''poor'' hands are hard to come by on short notice.<br/> <br/>I think it fits the challenge very well, and is reasonably executed.<br/> <br/>The big issue I have here is the lighting, not only is it a bit too harsh (Chiaroscuro is good, but only to a point), but the entire midtone range is quite low-key and the highlights are a bit low as well.<br/> <br/>6 for meeting the challenge well, but not quite the processing that I would have preferred.</td>', 'Lovely.  The hands look rather well cared for, but I suppose ''poor'' hands are hard to come by on short notice. I think it fits the challenge very well, and is reasonably executed. The big issue I have here is the lighting, not only is it a bit too harsh (Chiaroscuro is good, but only to a point), but the entire midtone range is quite low-key and the highlights are a bit low as well. 6 for meeting the challenge well, but not quite the processing that I would have preferred.', '2013-10-21 19:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119748, 1086453, 112828, '<td valign="top">Dude.  Really?<br/> <br/>I mean, it''s Halloween season, and you deliver this for "Something Wicked"?<br/> <br/>Disappointing. 3<br/> <br/>Having spent more time with this, and really trying to see what''s going on, I''ve finally found a face (more obvious in thumbnail), and think it adds to the photograph.<br/> <br/>Can''t give it HUGE love, because it is so faint, but that 3 just became a 6.</td>', 'Dude.  Really? I mean, it''s Halloween season, and you deliver this for "Something Wicked"? Disappointing. 3 Having spent more time with this, and really trying to see what''s going on, I''ve finally found a face (more obvious in thumbnail), and think it adds to the photograph. Can''t give it HUGE love, because it is so faint, but that 3 just became a 6.', '2013-10-21 19:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119749, 1087004, 112828, '<td valign="top"><b>Initial Reaction: </b>Windmill... <br/><b>Suitability for Challenge Topic: </b>Tilting at windmills..  Hmm... Figurative, but directly related to the text.  <br/><b>Aesthetic: </b>A little bit low contrast, and a touch soft.  Tilted composition works here, and not just because of "tilting at windmills"..<br/><b>Needs Work: </b>Exposure/contrast<br/><b>Final Thoughts: </b>While this doesn''t really tell me a story, it is at least applicable.<br/><b>Score: </b>6</td>', 'Initial Reaction: Windmill... Suitability for Challenge Topic: Tilting at windmills..  Hmm... Figurative, but directly related to the text.  Aesthetic: A little bit low contrast, and a touch soft.  Tilted composition works here, and not just because of "tilting at windmills"..Needs Work: Exposure/contrastFinal Thoughts: While this doesn''t really tell me a story, it is at least applicable.Score: 6', '2013-10-21 19:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119751, 1087194, 112828, '<td valign="top">Good enough fit.<br/> <br/>Love the rain drops and sparks flying from the mouth of the cannon.<br/> <br/>What I don''t like is the absence of faces, and the ear plug which kinda dispels the period ''feeling'' of the shot.<br/> <br/>6</td>', 'Good enough fit. Love the rain drops and sparks flying from the mouth of the cannon. What I don''t like is the absence of faces, and the ear plug which kinda dispels the period ''feeling'' of the shot. 6', '2013-10-21 19:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119752, 1087135, 112828, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the novel.  I think it follows the cover art in a way, and that''s nice.<br/> <br/>I do think it fails to really convey the darkness and despair of the novel, the butterfly is just way too pretty and nice.<br/> <br/>...<br/> <br/>Photographic merit is pretty good here though, sharpness is really nice, exposure is great, composition is at least good. (there seems to be a slight tilt)..<br/> <br/>So... dunno?  6 I suppose</td>', 'Interesting take on the novel.  I think it follows the cover art in a way, and that''s nice. I do think it fails to really convey the darkness and despair of the novel, the butterfly is just way too pretty and nice. ... Photographic merit is pretty good here though, sharpness is really nice, exposure is great, composition is at least good. (there seems to be a slight tilt).. So... dunno?  6 I suppose', '2013-10-21 19:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119753, 1087015, 112828, '<td valign="top">Sorta gets the right feeling, that unexpected, but almost tangible evil in the air.<br/> <br/>Overall I don''t really care for the processing (too soft) or the composition, but I think it fits well enough to merit a 6.</td>', 'Sorta gets the right feeling, that unexpected, but almost tangible evil in the air. Overall I don''t really care for the processing (too soft) or the composition, but I think it fits well enough to merit a 6.', '2013-10-21 19:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119754, 1087208, 112828, '<td valign="top">Fascinating creature.  Is it an albino? <br/> <br/>I suppose this does evoke the wilds of Alaska, and the white color makes me think of the companion novel "White Fang"....<br/> <br/>Composition here isn''t bad, but the detail isn''t as solid as I would like either - there are too-sharp bits, and too-soft bits.  A bit of selective sharpening would have done much for this image.<br/> <br/>Anyway.  Nice job.  6</td>', 'Fascinating creature.  Is it an albino?  I suppose this does evoke the wilds of Alaska, and the white color makes me think of the companion novel "White Fang".... Composition here isn''t bad, but the detail isn''t as solid as I would like either - there are too-sharp bits, and too-soft bits.  A bit of selective sharpening would have done much for this image. Anyway.  Nice job.  6', '2013-10-21 19:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119755, 1087170, 112828, '<td valign="top">Yes.<br/> <br/>Actually the image isn''t great, I think the composition leaves something to be desired, but it''s not bad either.<br/> <br/>Fits the novel well, and I think you deserve a 6.</td>', 'Yes. Actually the image isn''t great, I think the composition leaves something to be desired, but it''s not bad either. Fits the novel well, and I think you deserve a 6.', '2013-10-21 19:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119756, 1087184, 112828, '<td valign="top">So...  The novel has a postman nowhere in it, and it''s just a non-sequitur..  How do I judge this?  <br/> <br/>Are you being cheeky, or did you simply choose a picture and find a title?...<br/> <br/>How to know...  Ambiguity is never my strong point - so I just have to go kinda middle of road on applicability.<br/> <br/>As for photographic merit - it''s not bad - keystoning bothers me some, and I think you could have pulled the highlights and shadows a bit..  But other than those small technical issues, I think you''ve captured quite a nice scene with real interest.<br/> <br/>So, kinda upper-middle for the image itself..<br/> <br/>6</td>', 'So...  The novel has a postman nowhere in it, and it''s just a non-sequitur..  How do I judge this?   Are you being cheeky, or did you simply choose a picture and find a title?... How to know...  Ambiguity is never my strong point - so I just have to go kinda middle of road on applicability. As for photographic merit - it''s not bad - keystoning bothers me some, and I think you could have pulled the highlights and shadows a bit..  But other than those small technical issues, I think you''ve captured quite a nice scene with real interest. So, kinda upper-middle for the image itself.. 6', '2013-10-21 19:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119757, 1086157, 112828, '<td valign="top">Hmm.  This registers about a 20% on the "Meets challenge" criterion.<br/> <br/>The image itself is really quite good, maybe a tad overdone, but really beautiful..<br/> <br/>A fly fisherman in waders here would have compelled me to give you a score of 8+, but as it is, I''m left with a desire for what this could have been, rather than a love for what it is.<br/> <br/>6</td>', 'Hmm.  This registers about a 20% on the "Meets challenge" criterion. The image itself is really quite good, maybe a tad overdone, but really beautiful.. A fly fisherman in waders here would have compelled me to give you a score of 8+, but as it is, I''m left with a desire for what this could have been, rather than a love for what it is. 6', '2013-10-21 19:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119758, 1087122, 112828, '<td valign="top">Hmm.  Literal - over-literal perhaps.<br/> <br/>In any case, the book was about way more than a river''s bend, but it did start with a shop on one.  Processing here is a bit harsh feeling. <br/> <br/>6</td>', 'Hmm.  Literal - over-literal perhaps. In any case, the book was about way more than a river''s bend, but it did start with a shop on one.  Processing here is a bit harsh feeling.  6', '2013-10-21 19:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119759, 1086865, 112828, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image...  We''re starting at 5 here because it''s perfect as far as technicals go.<br/> <br/>Now, the next 5 are based on fit.  ..  First, this isn''t a classic novel, but rather a classic story.  Ok. -1...  <br/> <br/>Now...  The story is about a dying man, in Africa on safari...  The mountain only comes in at the end, and he''s on top of it..  Hmm..  You''ve got a mountain, and it did at least play in, but you''re not on top of it, seeing the view I would expect the character in the novel to experience.<br/> <br/>Out of the four possible points remaining, I can''t see but to award a single point.  It is a mountain, there was a mountain in the book.<br/> <br/>It almost pains me, but this beautiful image is a 6 in this challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful image...  We''re starting at 5 here because it''s perfect as far as technicals go. Now, the next 5 are based on fit.  ..  First, this isn''t a classic novel, but rather a classic story.  Ok. -1...   Now...  The story is about a dying man, in Africa on safari...  The mountain only comes in at the end, and he''s on top of it..  Hmm..  You''ve got a mountain, and it did at least play in, but you''re not on top of it, seeing the view I would expect the character in the novel to experience. Out of the four possible points remaining, I can''t see but to award a single point.  It is a mountain, there was a mountain in the book. It almost pains me, but this beautiful image is a 6 in this challenge.', '2013-10-21 19:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119760, 1086692, 112828, '<td valign="top">Amazingly beautiful image, really nice portrait, and great lighting.<br/> <br/>The fit to the novel is... tenuous.  Sure, it''s about saving people, and I guess this might kinda sorta convey that a touch, but really, for me, it misses the mark and falls into the pun/over literal category.<br/> <br/>Still, beautiful light, and a very nice portrait.<br/> <br/>6</td>', 'Amazingly beautiful image, really nice portrait, and great lighting. The fit to the novel is... tenuous.  Sure, it''s about saving people, and I guess this might kinda sorta convey that a touch, but really, for me, it misses the mark and falls into the pun/over literal category. Still, beautiful light, and a very nice portrait. 6', '2013-10-21 19:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119761, 1086992, 112828, '<td valign="top">Seems reasonable, matches the book well enough. <br/> <br/>I don''t find myself drawn to this, despite the fact I should be.<br/> <br/>6.</td>', 'Seems reasonable, matches the book well enough.  I don''t find myself drawn to this, despite the fact I should be. 6.', '2013-10-21 19:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119762, 1087188, 112828, '<td valign="top">Cool image.<br/> <br/>But wasn''t the book about a guy getting tortured?  Yeah, maybe he was a runner, but really, the book wasn''t about marathons.<br/> <br/>A diamond, or a tooth being drilled into.. Hell, even a bottle of clove oil.  But this?  Dunno, not much here to compel me.<br/> <br/>Nice image though, so you get a 5</td>', 'Cool image. But wasn''t the book about a guy getting tortured?  Yeah, maybe he was a runner, but really, the book wasn''t about marathons. A diamond, or a tooth being drilled into.. Hell, even a bottle of clove oil.  But this?  Dunno, not much here to compel me. Nice image though, so you get a 5', '2013-10-21 19:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119763, 1086999, 112828, '<td valign="top">Nice.  But the bowl and spoon are far nicer than any orphan would have, or at least nicer than I picture when I read the novel, as is the rather nice shirt... And those hands do not speak to me of poverty.<br/> <br/>With that being said.  The image is good, if too grainy and just a touch over-sharp in some places (look at the thumbs)<br/> <br/>Fits the novel well enough, but not crazy well.  Composition leaves something to be desired.<br/> <br/>5</td>', 'Nice.  But the bowl and spoon are far nicer than any orphan would have, or at least nicer than I picture when I read the novel, as is the rather nice shirt... And those hands do not speak to me of poverty. With that being said.  The image is good, if too grainy and just a touch over-sharp in some places (look at the thumbs) Fits the novel well enough, but not crazy well.  Composition leaves something to be desired. 5', '2013-10-21 19:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119764, 1086479, 112828, '<td valign="top">Well.  Ok.  It''s a farm.  I suppose there was a farm in the book.  But this was about people more than farms.<br/> <br/>Sigh. 5</td>', 'Well.  Ok.  It''s a farm.  I suppose there was a farm in the book.  But this was about people more than farms. Sigh. 5', '2013-10-21 19:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119765, 1087102, 112828, '<td valign="top">Hmm...  Sorta on-key - but sorta not, really doesn''t evoke the Wuthering Heights of the novel, but is at least similar enough to give you a pass on that aspect.<br/> <br/>What isn''t present here is that sense of foreboding, of mystery and darkness.<br/> <br/>5</td>', 'Hmm...  Sorta on-key - but sorta not, really doesn''t evoke the Wuthering Heights of the novel, but is at least similar enough to give you a pass on that aspect. What isn''t present here is that sense of foreboding, of mystery and darkness. 5', '2013-10-21 19:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119766, 1087152, 112828, '<td valign="top">I see what you''ve tried to do here, with ''birth'' being the idea.<br/> <br/>I''ve hatched too many chickens to buy this.  Humans and horses bleed, chickens just come out slightly damp.<br/> <br/>With that being said, birth was a theme in the book but it was really quite different than this image conveys.  A test tube would have gotten far more love from me.<br/> <br/>5 (and only because it is a decent image technically)</td>', 'I see what you''ve tried to do here, with ''birth'' being the idea. I''ve hatched too many chickens to buy this.  Humans and horses bleed, chickens just come out slightly damp. With that being said, birth was a theme in the book but it was really quite different than this image conveys.  A test tube would have gotten far more love from me. 5 (and only because it is a decent image technically)', '2013-10-21 19:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119767, 1087000, 112828, '<td valign="top">Hmm.  So what about this says "writer" or "poverty"?<br/> <br/>She does have a book, so I suppose that''s not miles away..  Also, I think she looks more asian than latina.<br/> <br/>Processing here is going to have its fans, no doubt.  I''m not one of them. :)  I like crisp details on the face in a shot like this, and the overall softness isn''t doing it for me.  Nor do I love cross-processed images.<br/> <br/>With that being said, composition is good (wish her arm was more or less visible), and the image does have a reasonable impact.<br/> <br/>5 for coming close, but missing the mark.</td>', 'Hmm.  So what about this says "writer" or "poverty"? She does have a book, so I suppose that''s not miles away..  Also, I think she looks more asian than latina. Processing here is going to have its fans, no doubt.  I''m not one of them. :)  I like crisp details on the face in a shot like this, and the overall softness isn''t doing it for me.  Nor do I love cross-processed images. With that being said, composition is good (wish her arm was more or less visible), and the image does have a reasonable impact. 5 for coming close, but missing the mark.', '2013-10-21 19:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119768, 1086983, 112828, '<td valign="top">Too literal.<br/> <br/>The novel wasn''t at all about grapes, the title was simply from a battle hymn.<br/> <br/>Now, despite the fact that I think you''ve failed entirely to deliver on the challenge, I do think you''ve delivered an excellent image...<br/> <br/>What to do?  I''ll award a 5 for this, but it''s really only for sheer image quality.<br/> <br/>Bumped to 6 for astounding quality.</td>', 'Too literal. The novel wasn''t at all about grapes, the title was simply from a battle hymn. Now, despite the fact that I think you''ve failed entirely to deliver on the challenge, I do think you''ve delivered an excellent image... What to do?  I''ll award a 5 for this, but it''s really only for sheer image quality. Bumped to 6 for astounding quality.', '2013-10-21 19:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119769, 1087151, 112828, '<td valign="top">Hmm..  This novel evokes images of fantastic English gardens and high-culture.<br/> <br/>The image doesn''t really do that for me - this seems far more American and rural, and not like the imagery of the novel.<br/> <br/>With that being said, a lonely child was a strong theme of the novel, so points there.<br/> <br/>Overall, the image doesn''t really intrigue me, and I find the reflection to be the most interesting part - yet even then it''s still not terribly interesting.<br/> <br/>5</td>', 'Hmm..  This novel evokes images of fantastic English gardens and high-culture. The image doesn''t really do that for me - this seems far more American and rural, and not like the imagery of the novel. With that being said, a lonely child was a strong theme of the novel, so points there. Overall, the image doesn''t really intrigue me, and I find the reflection to be the most interesting part - yet even then it''s still not terribly interesting. 5', '2013-10-21 19:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119770, 1087207, 112828, '<td valign="top">Cabbages and Kings huh?...<br/> <br/>Technically that''s not a novel, it''s a collection of short stories.<br/> <br/>..<br/> <br/>Images like this upset me somewhat - it''s a good image, very nicely done.  But... It''s not right, it doesn''t meet the challenge.    Not only is it not a novel, but... Dunno.. Does the image really capture the work?  Or is it just a clever visual pun?<br/> <br/>So what am I left to do?  Reward the great image?  Or punish the failure to follow instructions?<br/> <br/>I suppose I''ll do both, and just wish that you had chosen a novel instead of a collection of short stories.<br/> <br/>5</td>', 'Cabbages and Kings huh?... Technically that''s not a novel, it''s a collection of short stories. .. Images like this upset me somewhat - it''s a good image, very nicely done.  But... It''s not right, it doesn''t meet the challenge.    Not only is it not a novel, but... Dunno.. Does the image really capture the work?  Or is it just a clever visual pun? So what am I left to do?  Reward the great image?  Or punish the failure to follow instructions? I suppose I''ll do both, and just wish that you had chosen a novel instead of a collection of short stories. 5', '2013-10-21 19:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119771, 1086105, 112828, '<td valign="top">It kinda does evoke that doesn''t it?<br/> <br/>Really weird coloration, but generally fits.<br/> <br/>Processing here does just absolutely nothing for me, and the image itself isn''t composed particularly well IMO.  <br/> <br/>In any case, this is a 5, simply for evoking the novel so well, and in such a strange way.</td>', 'It kinda does evoke that doesn''t it? Really weird coloration, but generally fits. Processing here does just absolutely nothing for me, and the image itself isn''t composed particularly well IMO.   In any case, this is a 5, simply for evoking the novel so well, and in such a strange way.', '2013-10-21 19:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119772, 1086978, 30049, '<td valign="top"><a href="//allwritefictionadvice.blogspot.com/2013/05/novel-v-short-story-is-there-difference.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Short Story vs Novel</a> <br/><a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Last_Leaf" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">The Last Leaf</a> <br/>I do like the complementary colors captured here.</td>', 'Short Story vs Novel The Last Leaf I do like the complementary colors captured here.', '2013-10-21 19:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119773, 1087055, 112828, '<td valign="top">Not familiar, but it seems she was a prostitute.  Also not sure this is really a novel, and not sure it''s a classic.<br/> <br/>I guess the model here could be a prostitute.. Sure why not...<br/> <br/>However, the image overall seems...  meh.  Lighting is harsh, and speckled from tree cover.. Pose is ok, but not great either.<br/> <br/>I''ll give some extra points for fit, and take some for finish.  5</td>', 'Not familiar, but it seems she was a prostitute.  Also not sure this is really a novel, and not sure it''s a classic. I guess the model here could be a prostitute.. Sure why not... However, the image overall seems...  meh.  Lighting is harsh, and speckled from tree cover.. Pose is ok, but not great either. I''ll give some extra points for fit, and take some for finish.  5', '2013-10-21 19:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119774, 1087148, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the concept overall.  It''s a little underexposed.</td>', 'I like the concept overall.  It''s a little underexposed.', '2013-10-21 19:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119775, 1086683, 112828, '<td valign="top">So... I like this image - overall it strikes me as having a mysterious quality.<br/> <br/>What it doesn''t do for me is convey that novel, the horror, the war, the soldiers, this doesn''t even strike me as a slaughterhouse.  <br/> <br/>:(  And there seems to be some pretty strong banding in the grain/noise.<br/> <br/>In any case, it''s a 5 because it almost sorta fits, but just misses the mark - but yet is still a rather interesting image.</td>', 'So... I like this image - overall it strikes me as having a mysterious quality. What it doesn''t do for me is convey that novel, the horror, the war, the soldiers, this doesn''t even strike me as a slaughterhouse.   :(  And there seems to be some pretty strong banding in the grain/noise. In any case, it''s a 5 because it almost sorta fits, but just misses the mark - but yet is still a rather interesting image.', '2013-10-21 19:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119776, 1086914, 112828, '<td valign="top">Heh...  Quite literal, but in the case of this book, it rather works, as the aspidistra in the book serves as a metaphor for acceptance of what life brings.<br/> <br/>I can''t give huge points, partially because I don''t find the image SUPER attractive (although, admittedly, it is pretty good), and because I fail to really get as much out of this as I would hope, perhaps if there was more context..<br/> <br/>Anyway .. 5..</td>', 'Heh...  Quite literal, but in the case of this book, it rather works, as the aspidistra in the book serves as a metaphor for acceptance of what life brings. I can''t give huge points, partially because I don''t find the image SUPER attractive (although, admittedly, it is pretty good), and because I fail to really get as much out of this as I would hope, perhaps if there was more context.. Anyway .. 5..', '2013-10-21 19:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119777, 1087187, 112828, '<td valign="top"><b>Initial Reaction: </b> An interesting old building entrance, unsure of book.<br/><b>Suitability for Challenge Topic: </b> Wiki tells me this is a book about poverty, and while this does appear more commercial than residential, I think it fits, at least to a point.  Nothing here really compels me.<br/><b>Aesthetic: </b> A bit too high contrast for me, while still not really making anything go ''pop''..  Perspective is really quite off, and needs correcting.<br/><b>Needs Work: </b>Perspective, concept<br/><b>Final Thoughts: </b> Not bad, but it doesn''t really have the impact I would want for this book.<br/><b>Score: </b>5</td>', 'Initial Reaction:  An interesting old building entrance, unsure of book.Suitability for Challenge Topic:  Wiki tells me this is a book about poverty, and while this does appear more commercial than residential, I think it fits, at least to a point.  Nothing here really compels me.Aesthetic:  A bit too high contrast for me, while still not really making anything go ''pop''..  Perspective is really quite off, and needs correcting.Needs Work: Perspective, conceptFinal Thoughts:  Not bad, but it doesn''t really have the impact I would want for this book.Score: 5', '2013-10-21 19:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119778, 1087096, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Kids are a little young for the theme I think.  :-)</td>', 'Nice idea.  Kids are a little young for the theme I think.  :-)', '2013-10-21 19:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119779, 1087198, 112828, '<td valign="top">Well.  He looks way more Amish than Irish.<br/> <br/>But it''s a reasonable portrait, and kinda fits the book.  No real story here to compel me, but it''s not bad.<br/> <br/>With that being said?  It''s not a <i>great</i> portrait.  I''ll give a 6, but it''s really more of a 5.5 for me.</td>', 'Well.  He looks way more Amish than Irish. But it''s a reasonable portrait, and kinda fits the book.  No real story here to compel me, but it''s not bad. With that being said?  It''s not a great portrait.  I''ll give a 6, but it''s really more of a 5.5 for me.', '2013-10-21 19:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119780, 1086700, 112828, '<td valign="top"><b>Initial Reaction: </b> Dark, not sure about match to book<br/><b>Suitability for Challenge Topic: </b> Not familiar with the book, but it seems that the flowers were on a grave, and Algernon was a mouse.  I don''t see how this ties in, other than the fact that there is a flower here.<br/><b>Aesthetic: </b> Reasonable composition, not as much fine detail as I would prefer (soft) A bit dark for my taste, but the highlight on the scissors does complicate this.<br/><b>Needs Work: </b>Sharpness, concept<br/><b>Final Thoughts: </b>While not a terrible image, also not terribly compelling.<br/><b>Score: </b>5</td>', 'Initial Reaction:  Dark, not sure about match to bookSuitability for Challenge Topic:  Not familiar with the book, but it seems that the flowers were on a grave, and Algernon was a mouse.  I don''t see how this ties in, other than the fact that there is a flower here.Aesthetic:  Reasonable composition, not as much fine detail as I would prefer (soft) A bit dark for my taste, but the highlight on the scissors does complicate this.Needs Work: Sharpness, conceptFinal Thoughts: While not a terrible image, also not terribly compelling.Score: 5', '2013-10-21 19:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119781, 1087078, 112828, '<td valign="top">Fascinating image.  Can''t connect it at all to the novel.  Oh, unless you just simply saw the word dark in the title and thought "Gee, this is dark"..<br/> <br/>Really, the book was about trials and prison, etc.  This doesn''t speak to that.<br/> <br/>4 - because it IS a wonderful image.</td>', 'Fascinating image.  Can''t connect it at all to the novel.  Oh, unless you just simply saw the word dark in the title and thought "Gee, this is dark".. Really, the book was about trials and prison, etc.  This doesn''t speak to that. 4 - because it IS a wonderful image.', '2013-10-21 19:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119782, 1086113, 112828, '<td valign="top">That''s not Wendy....  Oh .. Yeah. Ayn Rand...  Hmm.  Probably not her either.<br/> <br/>Seriously though, the book wasn''t about fast food workers.<br/> <br/>4</td>', 'That''s not Wendy....  Oh .. Yeah. Ayn Rand...  Hmm.  Probably not her either. Seriously though, the book wasn''t about fast food workers. 4', '2013-10-21 19:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119787, 1086734, 30049, '<td valign="top">Fantastic scene!</td>', 'Fantastic scene!', '2013-10-21 20:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119788, 1086979, 112828, '<td valign="top">This image would have been much more suited to "The Lost World"...  As it is, it''s entirely unconnected to the chosen novel.  What a shame..<br/> <br/>It''s a lovely image, but without the critical measure of meeting the challenge, I''m afraid I cannot but give this a 4 - which is entirely for the eyecandy.<br/> <br/>Bumped to a 5</td>', 'This image would have been much more suited to "The Lost World"...  As it is, it''s entirely unconnected to the chosen novel.  What a shame.. It''s a lovely image, but without the critical measure of meeting the challenge, I''m afraid I cannot but give this a 4 - which is entirely for the eyecandy. Bumped to a 5', '2013-10-21 20:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119799, 1086939, 112828, '<td valign="top">Wow.  And not in a good way.  This might have been a good image, but your processing murdered it, violently.<br/> <br/>Doesn''t really fit the novel either.<br/> <br/>2</td>', 'Wow.  And not in a good way.  This might have been a good image, but your processing murdered it, violently. Doesn''t really fit the novel either. 2', '2013-10-21 20:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119801, 1087183, 112828, '<td valign="top">I don''t think you''ve managed it..  This comes off as completely unconnected - it''s as if you simply shot a picture on the street, then randomly chose a novel (fairy tale actually, not at all a novel), and put that in as a title.<br/> <br/>For me this fails on all levels.  I don''t find it to even be a particularly compelling street shot.<br/> <br/>:(  2</td>', 'I don''t think you''ve managed it..  This comes off as completely unconnected - it''s as if you simply shot a picture on the street, then randomly chose a novel (fairy tale actually, not at all a novel), and put that in as a title. For me this fails on all levels.  I don''t find it to even be a particularly compelling street shot. :(  2', '2013-10-21 20:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119804, 1087192, 30049, '<td valign="top">That''s not a dog or a wolf.  ???</td>', 'That''s not a dog or a wolf.  ???', '2013-10-21 20:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119810, 1087055, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ummmm .... <br/> <br/>.... here''s an example of what I''d think of for this novel.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.google.com/imgres?imgurl=//i.digiguide.tv/up/0802/1193691600000-623492-FannyHill-1192790199281.jpg&amp;imgrefurl=//digiguide.tv/pick-of-the-day/29%2BOctober%2B2007/drama-fanny-hill-for-the-love-of-fanny/&amp;h=240&amp;w=160&amp;sz=1&amp;tbnid=jjrwATU23-GV7M:&amp;tbnh=160&amp;tbnw=106&amp;zoom=1&amp;usg=__gHRjdpHUlKCyBVWJnSiKw2lKLWE=&amp;docid=doxD5behWxnY0M&amp;itg=1&amp;sa=X&amp;ei=37NlUqH8J5TI4AOOzIDwCQ&amp;ved=0CHkQ_B0wCg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">This</a> <br/> <br/>**********  probably not safe for work **********<br/><a href="//www.google.com/imgres?imgurl=//images.moviepostershop.com/fanny-hill-movie-poster-1983-1020248887.jpg&amp;imgrefurl=//www.moviepostershop.com/fanny-hill-movie-poster-1983&amp;h=268&amp;w=188&amp;sz=1&amp;tbnid=YcaMGR5LnpJsBM:&amp;tbnh=160&amp;tbnw=112&amp;zoom=1&amp;usg=__GMDIpxc5FtAwALvrnjFY1BtawoM=&amp;docid=44-Yk0WMJ2UY9M&amp;itg=1&amp;sa=X&amp;ei=4rNlUtvKFM-w4AO9jIHoBQ&amp;ved=0CG8Q_B0wCg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">... or maybe even this.</a> <br/> <br/>Either a classy pose (with clothes), or subdued erotic (like the movie poster linked above).  <br/> <br/>Just my opinion.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Ummmm ....  .... here''s an example of what I''d think of for this novel. This  **********  probably not safe for work **********... or maybe even this.  Either a classy pose (with clothes), or subdued erotic (like the movie poster linked above).   Just my opinion.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2013-10-21 20:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119811, 1087125, 30049, '<td valign="top">Might have been better off coming in closer for some reflections rather than taking on the whole "pond".  The sky and dead tree in the skyline take away from it substantially IMO.  Sorry.  Good luck.</td>', 'Might have been better off coming in closer for some reflections rather than taking on the whole "pond".  The sky and dead tree in the skyline take away from it substantially IMO.  Sorry.  Good luck.', '2013-10-21 20:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119812, 1087208, 30049, '<td valign="top">That''s not a dog or wolf.  ???  Wasn''t it Jack London that wrote the novel titled the same as this photo?</td>', 'That''s not a dog or wolf.  ???  Wasn''t it Jack London that wrote the novel titled the same as this photo?', '2013-10-21 20:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119813, 1086105, 35804, '<td valign="top">6...it''s strange enough to be interesting. It''s the color that accomplishes this for me. It''s both futuristic and retro all at the same time.</td>', '6...it''s strange enough to be interesting. It''s the color that accomplishes this for me. It''s both futuristic and retro all at the same time.', '2013-10-21 20:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119814, 1087044, 30049, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo.  Very beautiful in fact.  I assume you meant "... tell it ON ..." in your title.  While I enjoy the photo I''m not sure this would make the cut (theme-wise) for the subject matter of the book.  ???</td>', 'Lovely photo.  Very beautiful in fact.  I assume you meant "... tell it ON ..." in your title.  While I enjoy the photo I''m not sure this would make the cut (theme-wise) for the subject matter of the book.  ???', '2013-10-21 20:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119817, 1087139, 35804, '<td valign="top">4...I''m not familiar with the story, but I just don''t find this image very engaging. I think my main problem is the light...it could use more pizazz. It looks like it''s being lit with an old school fluorescent tube.</td>', '4...I''m not familiar with the story, but I just don''t find this image very engaging. I think my main problem is the light...it could use more pizazz. It looks like it''s being lit with an old school fluorescent tube.', '2013-10-21 20:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119819, 1087001, 35804, '<td valign="top">4...I wish for more web.</td>', '4...I wish for more web.', '2013-10-21 20:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119820, 1086983, 35804, '<td valign="top">6...it''s technically sound, but it speaks nothing of the novel to me at all.</td>', '6...it''s technically sound, but it speaks nothing of the novel to me at all.', '2013-10-21 20:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119823, 1086987, 35804, '<td valign="top">6...I don''t know that this has anything to do with the besides the title, but it is pretty. My one gripe would be that I wish the fish at the top had a bit more breathing room. The fish at the bottom looks lovely in all her chiffon.</td>', '6...I don''t know that this has anything to do with the besides the title, but it is pretty. My one gripe would be that I wish the fish at the top had a bit more breathing room. The fish at the bottom looks lovely in all her chiffon.', '2013-10-21 20:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119824, 1087135, 119419, '<td valign="top">Sylvia''s roman à clef, quite a beautiful scene of fragility and captivity. As an inspiration of the novel it is quite good if not literal. Technically mostly pleasing, while composition off centre is preferred the space on the left is empty and feels that way. Nicely done otherwise.5.</td>', 'Sylvia''s roman à clef, quite a beautiful scene of fragility and captivity. As an inspiration of the novel it is quite good if not literal. Technically mostly pleasing, while composition off centre is preferred the space on the left is empty and feels that way. Nicely done otherwise.5.', '2013-10-21 20:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119826, 1087100, 35804, '<td valign="top">4...Oliver, a little more information if you please...or maybe some levels adjustment, then maybe I would have given you more.</td>', '4...Oliver, a little more information if you please...or maybe some levels adjustment, then maybe I would have given you more.', '2013-10-21 20:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119829, 1087086, 35804, '<td valign="top">8...something that actually evokes the novel for me. The b&amp;w conversion is great...so rich and lush yet maintaining good detail in the sky. The mood is menacing, the atmosphere foreboding...nice work. Bumping to a 9.</td>', '8...something that actually evokes the novel for me. The b&w conversion is great...so rich and lush yet maintaining good detail in the sky. The mood is menacing, the atmosphere foreboding...nice work. Bumping to a 9.', '2013-10-21 20:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119833, 1087036, 35804, '<td valign="top">7...excellent exposure and definitely a sense of place. As far as telling me something of the novel, I see only a nod to the title. It is a very well crafted image though.</td>', '7...excellent exposure and definitely a sense of place. As far as telling me something of the novel, I see only a nod to the title. It is a very well crafted image though.', '2013-10-21 20:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119836, 1087201, 35804, '<td valign="top">6...this hints at the story quite nicely. the greens down the path appear to be overexposed and have turned into this blobby looking mass with little to no texture or information. It''s a difficult exposure to say the least.</td>', '6...this hints at the story quite nicely. the greens down the path appear to be overexposed and have turned into this blobby looking mass with little to no texture or information. It''s a difficult exposure to say the least.', '2013-10-21 20:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119837, 1086340, 119419, '<td valign="top">Going to love to see the rest of the comments on this one ;) Playful, well set out, nicely lit but a little colour over saturated (no pun intended. In it''s genre is very appealing, and you made the connection with the novel.5.</td>', 'Going to love to see the rest of the comments on this one ;) Playful, well set out, nicely lit but a little colour over saturated (no pun intended. In it''s genre is very appealing, and you made the connection with the novel.5.', '2013-10-21 20:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119838, 1086479, 35804, '<td valign="top">6...it''s a farm, I guess...that''s the only tie I see to the book, or maybe to the title only. The texture of the greens is quite pleasing, as is the overall general color of the image.</td>', '6...it''s a farm, I guess...that''s the only tie I see to the book, or maybe to the title only. The texture of the greens is quite pleasing, as is the overall general color of the image.', '2013-10-21 20:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119839, 1087148, 35804, '<td valign="top">4..it seems like the obvious solution to me. The execution could be better. The light is flat and seems to be from above. The b&amp;W conversion is nice and contrasty but it lacks depth. Many shadow areas have lost their information and the whites could use a bit more pop.</td>', '4..it seems like the obvious solution to me. The execution could be better. The light is flat and seems to be from above. The b&W conversion is nice and contrasty but it lacks depth. Many shadow areas have lost their information and the whites could use a bit more pop.', '2013-10-21 20:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119841, 1087190, 35804, '<td valign="top">4...the fire could use a bit more breathing room I think. More contrast within the pages would work well also I think. The flames have a nice dance about them for sure.</td>', '4...the fire could use a bit more breathing room I think. More contrast within the pages would work well also I think. The flames have a nice dance about them for sure.', '2013-10-21 21:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119842, 1087188, 35804, '<td valign="top">6...I see a tie to the novel via title only really and no connection to the story within. The color and movement is super pleasing though.</td>', '6...I see a tie to the novel via title only really and no connection to the story within. The color and movement is super pleasing though.', '2013-10-21 21:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119843, 1086157, 119419, '<td valign="top">For someone who doesn''t like over saturation, this one has my attention, even if it leans to the left ;) It''s a great composition and quite a vibrant and wild scene, what I imagine the novel is like (with my little knowledge of it).6.</td>', 'For someone who doesn''t like over saturation, this one has my attention, even if it leans to the left ;) It''s a great composition and quite a vibrant and wild scene, what I imagine the novel is like (with my little knowledge of it).6.', '2013-10-21 21:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119844, 1087001, 119419, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid it''s a little too literal for me. A good try on a hard one though.5.</td>', 'I''m afraid it''s a little too literal for me. A good try on a hard one though.5.', '2013-10-21 21:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119845, 1086979, 119419, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light, the softness makes it a little murky, though the saturation brings a lot of detail out. The empty sky is in conflict with the large grass clump in the foreground. Individually, all the elements are very good, it doesn''t gel for me as a whole unfortunately, a shame because you have picked a beautiful place to go. In regard to the novel, is can be subjectively related but not strongly. A nice effort just the same.5.</td>', 'Beautiful light, the softness makes it a little murky, though the saturation brings a lot of detail out. The empty sky is in conflict with the large grass clump in the foreground. Individually, all the elements are very good, it doesn''t gel for me as a whole unfortunately, a shame because you have picked a beautiful place to go. In regard to the novel, is can be subjectively related but not strongly. A nice effort just the same.5.', '2013-10-21 21:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119846, 1087112, 35804, '<td valign="top">7...nice natural window light and definitely harkens back to the era.</td>', '7...nice natural window light and definitely harkens back to the era.', '2013-10-21 21:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119847, 1087222, 119419, '<td valign="top">Camp as !;) The dress looks absolutely strange using the over saturation. I like the gaiety, you''ve put quite some effort into the shot, it would make a great advert stock photo. Relates to the novel in a kitsch way.5.</td>', 'Camp as !;) The dress looks absolutely strange using the over saturation. I like the gaiety, you''ve put quite some effort into the shot, it would make a great advert stock photo. Relates to the novel in a kitsch way.5.', '2013-10-21 21:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119850, 1087223, 119419, '<td valign="top">Love it, you''ve captured the essence of the murky divide, the entry into the other, and perhaps the core of the lensbaby (could be wrong, but this is my story) Mono is a great choice, we have the subject in motion and showing intent and directing to a destination through an imaginary passageway the has ties to the real world. You are very clever ;).9.</td>', 'Love it, you''ve captured the essence of the murky divide, the entry into the other, and perhaps the core of the lensbaby (could be wrong, but this is my story) Mono is a great choice, we have the subject in motion and showing intent and directing to a destination through an imaginary passageway the has ties to the real world. You are very clever ;).9.', '2013-10-21 21:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119853, 1087057, 35804, '<td valign="top">6...I see the connection for sure. A nice and quiet sort of image. The color seems off to me...on my screens it has a purplish tint and I''m not sure if it was intentional or not.</td>', '6...I see the connection for sure. A nice and quiet sort of image. The color seems off to me...on my screens it has a purplish tint and I''m not sure if it was intentional or not.', '2013-10-21 21:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119855, 1087207, 35804, '<td valign="top">4...I have no idea what this is inspired by. The light and texture on the cabbage is nice, and I wish the cards weren''t there. They''re not in or out of focus enough to not be annoying. It''s just a weird little still life, but not weird enough to be interesting.</td>', '4...I have no idea what this is inspired by. The light and texture on the cabbage is nice, and I wish the cards weren''t there. They''re not in or out of focus enough to not be annoying. It''s just a weird little still life, but not weird enough to be interesting.', '2013-10-21 21:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119859, 1086157, 99263, '<td valign="top">Beautiful...like a wonderful oil on canvas. Would make the perfect book cover for this novel. 10</td>', 'Beautiful...like a wonderful oil on canvas. Would make the perfect book cover for this novel. 10', '2013-10-21 21:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119860, 1087096, 99263, '<td valign="top">Excellent image, beautiful lighting, great contrast, wonderful B&amp;W conversion. The scene depicted fits the theme almost perfectly..I say almost because the two boys in the photo are off course much too young compared to the boys in the actual novel. But that''s a minor detail really and it doesn''t detract from the top-notch execution of this image. 9</td>', 'Excellent image, beautiful lighting, great contrast, wonderful B&W conversion. The scene depicted fits the theme almost perfectly..I say almost because the two boys in the photo are off course much too young compared to the boys in the actual novel. But that''s a minor detail really and it doesn''t detract from the top-notch execution of this image. 9', '2013-10-21 21:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119861, 1086672, 35804, '<td valign="top">6...it''s interesting but something about it seems borderline cliche to me. The lighting reminds me of that strobe lighting you see used with all those athlete photos here and there. It is well crafted though and that knife makes me nervous.</td>', '6...it''s interesting but something about it seems borderline cliche to me. The lighting reminds me of that strobe lighting you see used with all those athlete photos here and there. It is well crafted though and that knife makes me nervous.', '2013-10-21 21:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119862, 1086433, 35804, '<td valign="top">6...it''s growing on me. The purple is pleasing.</td>', '6...it''s growing on me. The purple is pleasing.', '2013-10-21 21:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119864, 1086914, 35804, '<td valign="top">6...it makes a nice enough abstract.</td>', '6...it makes a nice enough abstract.', '2013-10-21 21:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119865, 1087170, 35804, '<td valign="top">4...it''s interesting, then again it''s not. Maybe if there were a shallower depth of field, better light? Generally speaking, I find photographs of electronics kinda boring.</td>', '4...it''s interesting, then again it''s not. Maybe if there were a shallower depth of field, better light? Generally speaking, I find photographs of electronics kinda boring.', '2013-10-21 21:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119866, 1087151, 35804, '<td valign="top">6...definitely conveys a sense of loneliness. My main 2 problems with this image are; the bit of window frame at the top, I might have cropped that out and the B&amp;W conversion seems a bit flat...it could do with a bit of a levels or curves adjustment.</td>', '6...definitely conveys a sense of loneliness. My main 2 problems with this image are; the bit of window frame at the top, I might have cropped that out and the B&W conversion seems a bit flat...it could do with a bit of a levels or curves adjustment.', '2013-10-21 21:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119870, 1087184, 100975, '<td valign="top">Obviously I get the title and the picture.  Other than that connection, I don''t really feel anything in this shot...seems very ordinary.<br/> <br/>Probably hard to get the guy to do any acting for you, but the shot could have been done at a different angle...maybe from behind.  Can''t see his face, maybe some fill lighting.  Maybe a dark feeling to the pic would have helped.<br/> <br/>Gave it a 3</td>', 'Obviously I get the title and the picture.  Other than that connection, I don''t really feel anything in this shot...seems very ordinary. Probably hard to get the guy to do any acting for you, but the shot could have been done at a different angle...maybe from behind.  Can''t see his face, maybe some fill lighting.  Maybe a dark feeling to the pic would have helped. Gave it a 3', '2013-10-21 22:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119872, 1086858, 100975, '<td valign="top">I like the symmetry in the photo.  Seems like it needs more detail.  I know there is detail in the architecture, but I can''t really see any of it.<br/> <br/>Gave it a 5</td>', 'I like the symmetry in the photo.  Seems like it needs more detail.  I know there is detail in the architecture, but I can''t really see any of it. Gave it a 5', '2013-10-21 22:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119873, 1087039, 100975, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of the photo.  I don''t get city of glass out of this shot though.  Looks like an architecture photo and that architecture has some windows in it.  <br/> <br/>Gave it a 5</td>', 'I like the composition of the photo.  I don''t get city of glass out of this shot though.  Looks like an architecture photo and that architecture has some windows in it.   Gave it a 5', '2013-10-21 22:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119877, 1087023, 124815, '<td valign="top">I like it a lot and wonder if Kafka would not have loved it also. <br/>Yes, this is about alienation, about bureaucracy, about the closing of the government ...ha, ha but it''s shown with an artist''s eye, and that''s our saving grace<br/>9</td>', 'I like it a lot and wonder if Kafka would not have loved it also. Yes, this is about alienation, about bureaucracy, about the closing of the government ...ha, ha but it''s shown with an artist''s eye, and that''s our saving grace9', '2013-10-21 22:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119879, 1086767, 124815, '<td valign="top">What a beauty this is! It looks like a fossil. It looks like it was constructed from tiny, most delicate pieces of ivory. It looks like a fabrication of the mind.<br/>It''s too bad that you applied the title of this novel to it. Might have been as well Dante''s Inferno. or a Conrad novel. <br/>Still, as a photo in itself it''s fascinating. <br/>9</td>', 'What a beauty this is! It looks like a fossil. It looks like it was constructed from tiny, most delicate pieces of ivory. It looks like a fabrication of the mind.It''s too bad that you applied the title of this novel to it. Might have been as well Dante''s Inferno. or a Conrad novel. Still, as a photo in itself it''s fascinating. 9', '2013-10-21 22:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119880, 1087121, 124815, '<td valign="top">I suppose that this is the father''s shipping lines. <br/>Very delicate image, well suited for a happy ending. Very clever processing and wonderful tones. <br/>8</td>', 'I suppose that this is the father''s shipping lines. Very delicate image, well suited for a happy ending. Very clever processing and wonderful tones. 8', '2013-10-21 22:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119883, 1086989, 124815, '<td valign="top">The second Virginia Woolf''s lighthouse in this challenge. To me, this is much closer to the symbolism of the novel. The trailing wires make the shot. Perhaps less saturation would have given more of the intangible feeling that I look for but the image has this burned-by-the-sun quality that is appealing also.<br/>7</td>', 'The second Virginia Woolf''s lighthouse in this challenge. To me, this is much closer to the symbolism of the novel. The trailing wires make the shot. Perhaps less saturation would have given more of the intangible feeling that I look for but the image has this burned-by-the-sun quality that is appealing also.7', '2013-10-21 22:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119884, 1086734, 124815, '<td valign="top">If this is the view from the sanatorium, I might change my easy chair around! Just kidding!<br/>What a zoomorphic mountain. Quite amazing. It''s a St Bernard dog. <br/>Greta shot. I might have preferred for this challenge a different type of image, but this is a good landscape<br/>7</td>', 'If this is the view from the sanatorium, I might change my easy chair around! Just kidding!What a zoomorphic mountain. Quite amazing. It''s a St Bernard dog. Greta shot. I might have preferred for this challenge a different type of image, but this is a good landscape7', '2013-10-21 22:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119885, 1087150, 35804, '<td valign="top">4...to my eye, the horizon doesn''t look quite level, just slightly off, and the image seems generally flat. I''m not familiar with the book, so I can''t make an informed comment on that.</td>', '4...to my eye, the horizon doesn''t look quite level, just slightly off, and the image seems generally flat. I''m not familiar with the book, so I can''t make an informed comment on that.', '2013-10-21 22:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119886, 1087207, 124815, '<td valign="top">It was clever of you not to title your picture "Cabbage &amp; Kings". <br/>A very crisp image, dew and all. Might have benefitted form a portrait format to allude to a book cover. <br/>7</td>', 'It was clever of you not to title your picture "Cabbage & Kings". A very crisp image, dew and all. Might have benefitted form a portrait format to allude to a book cover. 7', '2013-10-21 22:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119887, 1087216, 124815, '<td valign="top">Very fetching image. I  like the idea of a sort of diorama look but am in two minds abut the Oscar de la Renta look alike portrait that appears added to the picture - therefore your "wry" pun (?)<br/>I find that by cropping from the left adds to the composition<br/>7 (for now)</td>', 'Very fetching image. I  like the idea of a sort of diorama look but am in two minds abut the Oscar de la Renta look alike portrait that appears added to the picture - therefore your "wry" pun (?)I find that by cropping from the left adds to the composition7 (for now)', '2013-10-21 22:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119888, 1087000, 124815, '<td valign="top">I never heard about this book, is it a classic? <br/>The image reminds me of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=75618" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">odriew</a> way of treating a subject. Gentle, calm and filled with emotion, a little formulaic but mostly sincere. It is lovely and has a great deal of peaceful sadness. If this is the case, you certainly achieved to communicate it. <br/>7</td>', 'I never heard about this book, is it a classic? The image reminds me of  odriew way of treating a subject. Gentle, calm and filled with emotion, a little formulaic but mostly sincere. It is lovely and has a great deal of peaceful sadness. If this is the case, you certainly achieved to communicate it. 7', '2013-10-21 22:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119889, 1086939, 124815, '<td valign="top">This picture might be a good illustration for the meaning of Hemingway''s title originated from Ecclesiates<br/><i>The sun rises and the sun sets, and hurries back to where it rises</i> <br/>but it feel like a good sunset/sunrise shoehorned for this challenge. Yes, another good sunset.<br/><strike>6</strike> <br/>I came back to this image because of its painterly qualities. It does not fit the novel but there is some of Turner, some of the Dutch masters in it...<br/>7</td>', 'This picture might be a good illustration for the meaning of Hemingway''s title originated from EcclesiatesThe sun rises and the sun sets, and hurries back to where it rises but it feel like a good sunset/sunrise shoehorned for this challenge. Yes, another good sunset.6 I came back to this image because of its painterly qualities. It does not fit the novel but there is some of Turner, some of the Dutch masters in it...7', '2013-10-21 22:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119890, 1086700, 124815, '<td valign="top">Now I really do have to read the novel! I read about it in the past and now I need to fully understand the meaning of your your image. I like the ominous look of the scissors.<br/>I am a bit puzzled by the choice of leaving so much dark space on the right of the image and I try to understand it through the fact that I knew about the publishers'' urge for a change of the ending. You leave some breathing space.<br/> <br/>A crisp image that I would have probably marked 6 but in the context of this challenge it''s more like a 7.<br/>My criticism is that somehow it looks a bit like a stock image with a twist. The tonality is wonderful.<br/>7</td>', 'Now I really do have to read the novel! I read about it in the past and now I need to fully understand the meaning of your your image. I like the ominous look of the scissors.I am a bit puzzled by the choice of leaving so much dark space on the right of the image and I try to understand it through the fact that I knew about the publishers'' urge for a change of the ending. You leave some breathing space. A crisp image that I would have probably marked 6 but in the context of this challenge it''s more like a 7.My criticism is that somehow it looks a bit like a stock image with a twist. The tonality is wonderful.7', '2013-10-21 22:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119891, 1086761, 124815, '<td valign="top">I like this shot very much, I love the quote but it does not send me to Les Miserables. Although the puddle in the middle of the road reminds me of Hugo''s magnificent drawing starting from a spot of coffee. <br/>7</td>', 'I like this shot very much, I love the quote but it does not send me to Les Miserables. Although the puddle in the middle of the road reminds me of Hugo''s magnificent drawing starting from a spot of coffee. 7', '2013-10-21 22:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119893, 1087210, 124815, '<td valign="top">Quite straightforward isn''t it? <br/>Did you try it in B&amp;W? The tonality of the background is not decisive or interesting enough<br/>6</td>', 'Quite straightforward isn''t it? Did you try it in B&W? The tonality of the background is not decisive or interesting enough6', '2013-10-21 22:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119894, 1087188, 124815, '<td valign="top">Is this a classic? I don''t think so but never mind this.<br/>(I do like a lot that for this challenge I have to look up books and authors.)<br/>I did not read the book, just the synopsis and it''s considered a "conspiracy thriller" in which the marathon itself seems not to play such an important role as in your shot. <br/>It''s an engaging picture and I can see some foul play here - perhaps a wee too saturated but a good shot<br/>6</td>', 'Is this a classic? I don''t think so but never mind this.(I do like a lot that for this challenge I have to look up books and authors.)I did not read the book, just the synopsis and it''s considered a "conspiracy thriller" in which the marathon itself seems not to play such an important role as in your shot. It''s an engaging picture and I can see some foul play here - perhaps a wee too saturated but a good shot6', '2013-10-21 22:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119895, 1086979, 124815, '<td valign="top">I am not persuaded that this lovely image is suited for Huxley''s brave world. It''s a gorgeous place that looks somehow like a Flemish or Dutch painting.<br/>6</td>', 'I am not persuaded that this lovely image is suited for Huxley''s brave world. It''s a gorgeous place that looks somehow like a Flemish or Dutch painting.6', '2013-10-21 22:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119896, 1087044, 35804, '<td valign="top">4...this really doesn''t have anything to do with the content of the novel at all, just a nod to a title.</td>', '4...this really doesn''t have anything to do with the content of the novel at all, just a nod to a title.', '2013-10-21 22:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119897, 1087112, 124815, '<td valign="top">A likable shot taken probably in a historic place where they have reenactments - everything is working here but there is not much connection with the novel. I wished for some witchcraft, some odd things... some guilt ... a gable ...<br/>If you staged this, it''s quite good - there are a few details here and there to die for - the woman''s blouse, the rotten apple or quince, whatever it is it''s so nice. I do not like in the least the thin lines that delineate the image - just the dark maroon would have been great to let everything float. <br/>I give it a 6 though - but if you staged all this, I regret not having marked it higher</td>', 'A likable shot taken probably in a historic place where they have reenactments - everything is working here but there is not much connection with the novel. I wished for some witchcraft, some odd things... some guilt ... a gable ...If you staged this, it''s quite good - there are a few details here and there to die for - the woman''s blouse, the rotten apple or quince, whatever it is it''s so nice. I do not like in the least the thin lines that delineate the image - just the dark maroon would have been great to let everything float. I give it a 6 though - but if you staged all this, I regret not having marked it higher', '2013-10-21 22:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119898, 1087102, 124815, '<td valign="top">A very clean picture of a house that has some charm though. Or let''s say some potential! I never imagined the one in the novel like this; this one strikes me as very American and I don''t see the gnarled branches that were so important in the novel.<br/>The hues are lovely<br/>6</td>', 'A very clean picture of a house that has some charm though. Or let''s say some potential! I never imagined the one in the novel like this; this one strikes me as very American and I don''t see the gnarled branches that were so important in the novel.The hues are lovely6', '2013-10-21 22:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119899, 1086113, 124815, '<td valign="top">I did not read this book but know that it is mightily anticommunist and quasi autobiographical. <br/>Therefore, I really cannot make any comment on the suitability of your shot. There is not much to inform me here of the book. <br/>As a free standing photo I find the point of view interesting, the man''s expression quite absorbing and an interesting battle of shapes in the background. I would crop a lot from the upper part. <br/>6</td>', 'I did not read this book but know that it is mightily anticommunist and quasi autobiographical. Therefore, I really cannot make any comment on the suitability of your shot. There is not much to inform me here of the book. As a free standing photo I find the point of view interesting, the man''s expression quite absorbing and an interesting battle of shapes in the background. I would crop a lot from the upper part. 6', '2013-10-21 22:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119900, 1086858, 124815, '<td valign="top">You are making me read this book! I like Darlymple writing very, very much and other than some of his articles here and there I was totally engrossed by his book "From the Holy Mountain".<br/>Your picture is good and restrained in its processing and the rosy hues seem to give justice to the monument.<br/>It''s true that for this challenge I would have liked more of an interpretative shot, but you produced an honest picture<br/>6 (for now)</td>', 'You are making me read this book! I like Darlymple writing very, very much and other than some of his articles here and there I was totally engrossed by his book "From the Holy Mountain".Your picture is good and restrained in its processing and the rosy hues seem to give justice to the monument.It''s true that for this challenge I would have liked more of an interpretative shot, but you produced an honest picture6 (for now)', '2013-10-21 22:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119902, 1087055, 124815, '<td valign="top">Your take on this erotic novel is less daring than an Édouard-Henri Avril for instance;  it''s a well taken picture where the shadows make it more interesting. <br/>I would crop a little from the top of the head and right of the image for more concision<br/>6</td>', 'Your take on this erotic novel is less daring than an Édouard-Henri Avril for instance;  it''s a well taken picture where the shadows make it more interesting. I would crop a little from the top of the head and right of the image for more concision6', '2013-10-21 22:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119903, 1087044, 124815, '<td valign="top">That''s a funny error here: you went to tell IT, the story,  to the mountain!<br/>Seems like you adapted an image here to a title and your image is very sedated, more than I would imagine suitable for this novel. <br/>I love the layering of the mountains, I do not like that the whole looks a little like dipped in blue ink.<br/>5</td>', 'That''s a funny error here: you went to tell IT, the story,  to the mountain!Seems like you adapted an image here to a title and your image is very sedated, more than I would imagine suitable for this novel. I love the layering of the mountains, I do not like that the whole looks a little like dipped in blue ink.5', '2013-10-21 22:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119904, 1087120, 124815, '<td valign="top">Well, if you see an airport and take a picture of it you call it "Airport" - but I see no connection with a novel with an eponymous title. A clear shot though<br/>5</td>', 'Well, if you see an airport and take a picture of it you call it "Airport" - but I see no connection with a novel with an eponymous title. A clear shot though5', '2013-10-21 22:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119905, 1087192, 124815, '<td valign="top">I think that you adapted the title for this image. It''s more of a national geographic type<br/>5</td>', 'I think that you adapted the title for this image. It''s more of a national geographic type5', '2013-10-21 22:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119906, 1086865, 124815, '<td valign="top">The natural lighting here is just so damn hard to capture. The picture is pleasing but stays in between being too muddy for a clear sky day or too brilliant for the mystery of the woods. This being said, I don''t think that i would like to see it as a book cover or illustration of Hemingway''s novel<br/>5</td>', 'The natural lighting here is just so damn hard to capture. The picture is pleasing but stays in between being too muddy for a clear sky day or too brilliant for the mystery of the woods. This being said, I don''t think that i would like to see it as a book cover or illustration of Hemingway''s novel5', '2013-10-21 22:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119907, 1087184, 124815, '<td valign="top">Ha! You illustrated twice a non sequitur title but nothing, nothing of the crime novel perspires here.<br/>It''s a good snapshot of a postman ringing a bell once (or twice if we have to take your word). <br/>In any case, I do not mark down a picture for not meeting a challenge but what would I do with this shot other than placing it in a book about, let''s say, professions?<br/>5</td>', 'Ha! You illustrated twice a non sequitur title but nothing, nothing of the crime novel perspires here.It''s a good snapshot of a postman ringing a bell once (or twice if we have to take your word). In any case, I do not mark down a picture for not meeting a challenge but what would I do with this shot other than placing it in a book about, let''s say, professions?5', '2013-10-21 22:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119908, 1087194, 35804, '<td valign="top">4...The HDRish effect really flattens the image out. I might have cropped the flag on the right out. There isn''t enough of it showing to add any important information to what''s going on I think.</td>', '4...The HDRish effect really flattens the image out. I might have cropped the flag on the right out. There isn''t enough of it showing to add any important information to what''s going on I think.', '2013-10-21 22:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119909, 1087190, 124815, '<td valign="top">The very thing - but there are in my view too many unsolved elements. The flames seem really cropped and do not add the frightening element that I wish for. The pages (Grisham?) are almost delicately ripped and placed on top of each other too carefully only to be burned. The lighting is too even for such a terrible event.<br/>I know how hard is to take such a shot, I tried it myself and made a mess in the building!<br/>I bet we''ll try it again though!<br/>5 for effort</td>', 'The very thing - but there are in my view too many unsolved elements. The flames seem really cropped and do not add the frightening element that I wish for. The pages (Grisham?) are almost delicately ripped and placed on top of each other too carefully only to be burned. The lighting is too even for such a terrible event.I know how hard is to take such a shot, I tried it myself and made a mess in the building!I bet we''ll try it again though!5 for effort', '2013-10-21 22:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119910, 1087036, 124815, '<td valign="top">It sure is surely taken "somewhere over there", but it''s a postcard, albeit a good one. In the context of DPC and this particular challenge it presents no real interest to me. It''s a shoehorn. 5 for effort</td>', 'It sure is surely taken "somewhere over there", but it''s a postcard, albeit a good one. In the context of DPC and this particular challenge it presents no real interest to me. It''s a shoehorn. 5 for effort', '2013-10-21 22:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119911, 1087082, 124815, '<td valign="top">This is a nice lighthouse without a doubt but it''s not Virginia Woolf''s one. It lacks subtlety. lacks longing, philosophical introspections or childhood memories ...<br/>Must be also the fact that we are so saturated with images of lighthouses and sunsets that it''s hard to produce one that will blow us away<br/>5</td>', 'This is a nice lighthouse without a doubt but it''s not Virginia Woolf''s one. It lacks subtlety. lacks longing, philosophical introspections or childhood memories ...Must be also the fact that we are so saturated with images of lighthouses and sunsets that it''s hard to produce one that will blow us away5', '2013-10-21 22:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119912, 1087078, 124815, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting image but not powerful enough for Koestler''s take on communism. It''s not frightening enough. it quivers but it does not scream in pain. <br/>5</td>', 'It''s an interesting image but not powerful enough for Koestler''s take on communism. It''s not frightening enough. it quivers but it does not scream in pain. 5', '2013-10-21 22:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119913, 1087162, 124815, '<td valign="top">Seems like a clip from a movie but it''s not convincing enough. It has all the elements but lost the pathos , the poignancy, the scream - perhaps it narrates too much. It seems too even. The shadow that appears is too shy, it should have loomed over everything perhaps. <br/>I applaud though your effort and work. 5</td>', 'Seems like a clip from a movie but it''s not convincing enough. It has all the elements but lost the pathos , the poignancy, the scream - perhaps it narrates too much. It seems too even. The shadow that appears is too shy, it should have loomed over everything perhaps. I applaud though your effort and work. 5', '2013-10-21 23:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119914, 1086672, 124815, '<td valign="top">It''s not clear to me which one is which here and I would have preferred a different approach to the book. Not enough of the split personality I am afraid.<br/>It''s a good image altogether that unfortunately does not captivate me. <br/>5</td>', 'It''s not clear to me which one is which here and I would have preferred a different approach to the book. Not enough of the split personality I am afraid.It''s a good image altogether that unfortunately does not captivate me. 5', '2013-10-21 23:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119915, 1087093, 124815, '<td valign="top">Did not read this particular Murakami book and upon glancing at the synopsis I do not think that it has to do much with it, save for the title. <br/>Nevertheless, it''s a good picture, a National Geographic type but in this context it does not move me at all.<br/>5</td>', 'Did not read this particular Murakami book and upon glancing at the synopsis I do not think that it has to do much with it, save for the title. Nevertheless, it''s a good picture, a National Geographic type but in this context it does not move me at all.5', '2013-10-21 23:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119916, 1086978, 124815, '<td valign="top">I assume that it''s inspired by O''Henry''s short story. A nice shot that could have been in a lot of other challenge topics. I like the background that reminds of a starry night but I find the picture  a bit too common. The crude sharpening of the leaf is not very fortunate<br/>5</td>', 'I assume that it''s inspired by O''Henry''s short story. A nice shot that could have been in a lot of other challenge topics. I like the background that reminds of a starry night but I find the picture  a bit too common. The crude sharpening of the leaf is not very fortunate5', '2013-10-21 23:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119918, 1087039, 124815, '<td valign="top">I don''t know anything about the book you are referring to but I believe that you showed it like it is: city of glass turning wrong. Does not seem to have a happy ending. <br/>I like the tonality but the picture is a bit confusing, a little too inky in the shadows. <br/>5</td>', 'I don''t know anything about the book you are referring to but I believe that you showed it like it is: city of glass turning wrong. Does not seem to have a happy ending. I like the tonality but the picture is a bit confusing, a little too inky in the shadows. 5', '2013-10-21 23:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119919, 1087141, 124815, '<td valign="top">I truly understand the use of HDR  sometimes because it gives this surreal look, the hyperrealism that might be suited here to the book.<br/>I did not read the novel but I know that on top of religion and faith that you obviously show, it''s about war and friendship and fate. <br/>I appreciate parts of this shot, mostly the ground with the beautifully radiant shadows, but the whole is not too inspiring and the image seems forced. <br/>5</td>', 'I truly understand the use of HDR  sometimes because it gives this surreal look, the hyperrealism that might be suited here to the book.I did not read the novel but I know that on top of religion and faith that you obviously show, it''s about war and friendship and fate. I appreciate parts of this shot, mostly the ground with the beautifully radiant shadows, but the whole is not too inspiring and the image seems forced. 5', '2013-10-21 23:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119920, 1086433, 124815, '<td valign="top">Alas, I did not read any of Asimov''s short stories. All this science fiction stuff lies on my shelves collecting dust.<br/>Robots and such. <br/>Your horizon (or my eye) seems slanted. <br/>A few halos here and there from too much sharpening. Your shot is likable. But I do not find it oo stimulating visually. <br/>At least not for me.<br/>5</td>', 'Alas, I did not read any of Asimov''s short stories. All this science fiction stuff lies on my shelves collecting dust.Robots and such. Your horizon (or my eye) seems slanted. A few halos here and there from too much sharpening. Your shot is likable. But I do not find it oo stimulating visually. At least not for me.5', '2013-10-21 23:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119921, 1087071, 35804, '<td valign="top">4...Ha! Two of you had the same idea. It seems a bit over-saturated, particularly in the flames.</td>', '4...Ha! Two of you had the same idea. It seems a bit over-saturated, particularly in the flames.', '2013-10-21 23:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119923, 1086340, 124815, '<td valign="top">Oh boy, you created all this and I do not quite enjoy it! It''s cute but I read the book 3 times at least and have it so differently in mind.5 for effort</td>', 'Oh boy, you created all this and I do not quite enjoy it! It''s cute but I read the book 3 times at least and have it so differently in mind.5 for effort', '2013-10-21 23:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119926, 1087208, 124815, '<td valign="top">Oh, what would Buck say? I mean, Jack London''s one.<br/>I personally do not like this shot at all. It shows a very unhappy stuffed animal and a lot of sharpening<br/>4</td>', 'Oh, what would Buck say? I mean, Jack London''s one.I personally do not like this shot at all. It shows a very unhappy stuffed animal and a lot of sharpening4', '2013-10-21 23:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119927, 1087183, 124815, '<td valign="top">ha ha, Snow White is a tale not a novel but heck, she''s here in person. A photo of the story in which the mirror is the cell phone and the apple might  be the brand and in which she has a slight problem with her foot which can be as close to Cinderella as she can be. <br/>Other than my interpretation, this is a snapshot that is not telling much to me<br/>4</td>', 'ha ha, Snow White is a tale not a novel but heck, she''s here in person. A photo of the story in which the mirror is the cell phone and the apple might  be the brand and in which she has a slight problem with her foot which can be as close to Cinderella as she can be. Other than my interpretation, this is a snapshot that is not telling much to me4', '2013-10-21 23:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119928, 1087121, 77196, '<td valign="top">Comment Challenge. I really like the look of fog/mist around the boats. Not sure these quite compare to the majestic sailing ships of yore, but you''ve done a great job of capturing a nautical feel, and the size of the ship does not impact the courage of her captain.</td>', 'Comment Challenge. I really like the look of fog/mist around the boats. Not sure these quite compare to the majestic sailing ships of yore, but you''ve done a great job of capturing a nautical feel, and the size of the ship does not impact the courage of her captain.', '2013-10-21 23:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119929, 1087162, 35804, '<td valign="top">6...kudos for sticking to the actual story. The one thing I find could use some work is the lighting. It''s a bit too harsh and one directional...like an on camera flash. Some natural window light would have lent a great deal of atmosphere and mood.</td>', '6...kudos for sticking to the actual story. The one thing I find could use some work is the lighting. It''s a bit too harsh and one directional...like an on camera flash. Some natural window light would have lent a great deal of atmosphere and mood.', '2013-10-21 23:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119930, 1087044, 77196, '<td valign="top">Comment Challenge: Beautiful scene. The image is a bit too blue for my tastes. I like the feel of depth. It may be just my monitor, but the tops of the mountains fade into the white (pale blue) of the sky.</td>', 'Comment Challenge: Beautiful scene. The image is a bit too blue for my tastes. I like the feel of depth. It may be just my monitor, but the tops of the mountains fade into the white (pale blue) of the sky.', '2013-10-21 23:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119931, 1087208, 35804, '<td valign="top">4...IMO the critter needs some breathing space.</td>', '4...IMO the critter needs some breathing space.', '2013-10-21 23:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119933, 1086914, 77196, '<td valign="top">Comment Challenge: Nice colors &amp; contrast against the black background. The larger part of the plant (on the left) is the part that is OOF. For me, the shallow DOF detracts from the image, rather than adds to it. The patterns in the green are interesting, and the curve of the leaf edge add interest.</td>', 'Comment Challenge: Nice colors & contrast against the black background. The larger part of the plant (on the left) is the part that is OOF. For me, the shallow DOF detracts from the image, rather than adds to it. The patterns in the green are interesting, and the curve of the leaf edge add interest.', '2013-10-21 23:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119935, 1087219, 35804, '<td valign="top">4...nice detail in the feathers but the B&amp;W conversion needs some help. It seems mostly middle zones, no real blacks and very few white whites to give the image a nice pop. Overall it seems flat. That could also be due to the light...probably a combo of the two. And one last thing, the inner curve of the neck is quite graceful, I just wish you hadn''t chopped the bit off the top.It stops the movement of my eye through the image, it fights the curve.</td>', '4...nice detail in the feathers but the B&W conversion needs some help. It seems mostly middle zones, no real blacks and very few white whites to give the image a nice pop. Overall it seems flat. That could also be due to the light...probably a combo of the two. And one last thing, the inner curve of the neck is quite graceful, I just wish you hadn''t chopped the bit off the top.It stops the movement of my eye through the image, it fights the curve.', '2013-10-21 23:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119937, 1086989, 77196, '<td valign="top">Comment Challenge: What a great lighthouse! I love the yellow of the sky and yellow highlights / tones elsewhere. For me, this wants to be a closer crop. Almost 1/3 of the picture is (basically) featureless black with the two power lines and one road running through it. The same message could have been communicated with less distance. While I love the mountains and yellow sky, for me it wants to be tighter on both sides, focusing on the lighthouse complex and the rock that it sits on.</td>', 'Comment Challenge: What a great lighthouse! I love the yellow of the sky and yellow highlights / tones elsewhere. For me, this wants to be a closer crop. Almost 1/3 of the picture is (basically) featureless black with the two power lines and one road running through it. The same message could have been communicated with less distance. While I love the mountains and yellow sky, for me it wants to be tighter on both sides, focusing on the lighthouse complex and the rock that it sits on.', '2013-10-21 23:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119940, 1086692, 35804, '<td valign="top">6...it''s a nice senior portrait.</td>', '6...it''s a nice senior portrait.', '2013-10-21 23:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119941, 1087183, 77196, '<td valign="top">Comment Challenge: For me, the yellow pants and red headphone cord makes this shot. There are enough "different" elements in this to keep it interesting, and even worth a second look. The placement of yellow pants'' feet is curious, as is the foot position of the seated lady. I find it interesting that you chose to have no one looking at the camera. Perhaps cropping the top about the same distance above her head would reduce the badly distracting white upper floors of the background buildings.</td>', 'Comment Challenge: For me, the yellow pants and red headphone cord makes this shot. There are enough "different" elements in this to keep it interesting, and even worth a second look. The placement of yellow pants'' feet is curious, as is the foot position of the seated lady. I find it interesting that you chose to have no one looking at the camera. Perhaps cropping the top about the same distance above her head would reduce the badly distracting white upper floors of the background buildings.', '2013-10-21 23:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119944, 1087198, 77196, '<td valign="top">Comment Challenge: This is a great picture. I love the worried look between his eyebrows, the contrast of the background and the man, and that he is not looking directly at the camera. To me, this speaks of an artists'' uncertainty of whether his art will be accepted and appreciated.</td>', 'Comment Challenge: This is a great picture. I love the worried look between his eyebrows, the contrast of the background and the man, and that he is not looking directly at the camera. To me, this speaks of an artists'' uncertainty of whether his art will be accepted and appreciated.', '2013-10-21 23:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119949, 1086999, 77196, '<td valign="top">Comment Challenge: Please, sir, may I have some more? The creative angle and focus on the empty bowl make this shot. The fingers on the left side of the image look funky and are somewhat distracting. Perhaps a less fancy spoon and the bowl looking like it had been recently used (liquid or wet bottom or like it had been scraped bare and then the last bit drunk from it) would increase the impact of the picture. To me, the person holds the bowl seems to be an adult, and not a child - not sure what visual cues I''m picking up for that. Overall, a very nice image, and a great connection to the novel.</td>', 'Comment Challenge: Please, sir, may I have some more? The creative angle and focus on the empty bowl make this shot. The fingers on the left side of the image look funky and are somewhat distracting. Perhaps a less fancy spoon and the bowl looking like it had been recently used (liquid or wet bottom or like it had been scraped bare and then the last bit drunk from it) would increase the impact of the picture. To me, the person holds the bowl seems to be an adult, and not a child - not sure what visual cues I''m picking up for that. Overall, a very nice image, and a great connection to the novel.', '2013-10-21 23:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119950, 1087082, 77196, '<td valign="top">Comment Challenge: Love the fire in the sky. Great lighthouse. Perhaps a less centered composition would be an improvement (but how do you give up the fire in the clouds on either side?). Also, the lighthouse appears to be a bit underlit / dark.</td>', 'Comment Challenge: Love the fire in the sky. Great lighthouse. Perhaps a less centered composition would be an improvement (but how do you give up the fire in the clouds on either side?). Also, the lighthouse appears to be a bit underlit / dark.', '2013-10-21 23:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119952, 1087162, 77196, '<td valign="top">Comment Challenge: This is such a great image on so many levels. I love the three incarnations - the real, the reflection, and the portrait. I love the use of the arched alcove above the reflection''s head. Very nice monochrome.</td>', 'Comment Challenge: This is such a great image on so many levels. I love the three incarnations - the real, the reflection, and the portrait. I love the use of the arched alcove above the reflection''s head. Very nice monochrome.', '2013-10-21 23:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119953, 1086105, 136989, '<td valign="top">Very creative take for the title.  Love the lines and the otherworldly colors.</td>', 'Very creative take for the title.  Love the lines and the otherworldly colors.', '2013-10-21 23:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119957, 1087222, 77196, '<td valign="top">Comment Challenge: Something doesn''t work with this image. I think it is the woman vs. the car - she looks like she has been photoshopped into the picture - like she is supposed to be sitting on the car, but appears to be too big to be that far back in the image. At the same time, her position is too awkward to be doing anything but sitting on the car. I love the car''s cracking paint, missing doors, lights, etc. The pink cast is well done, and if it is too much, just a tad.</td>', 'Comment Challenge: Something doesn''t work with this image. I think it is the woman vs. the car - she looks like she has been photoshopped into the picture - like she is supposed to be sitting on the car, but appears to be too big to be that far back in the image. At the same time, her position is too awkward to be doing anything but sitting on the car. I love the car''s cracking paint, missing doors, lights, etc. The pink cast is well done, and if it is too much, just a tad.', '2013-10-21 23:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119958, 1086700, 136989, '<td valign="top">Much better depiction of the novel than I had in my brain.  Very glad my idea fizzled as yours is much better. I like the sepia choice.</td>', 'Much better depiction of the novel than I had in my brain.  Very glad my idea fizzled as yours is much better. I like the sepia choice.', '2013-10-21 23:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119959, 1086979, 77196, '<td valign="top">Comment Challenge: The lighting on this is fantastic. It definitely carries the theme. This must be a beautiful scene in person. The darkened upper right corner bothers me - seems a bit too much for the rest of the image.</td>', 'Comment Challenge: The lighting on this is fantastic. It definitely carries the theme. This must be a beautiful scene in person. The darkened upper right corner bothers me - seems a bit too much for the rest of the image.', '2013-10-21 23:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119960, 1086679, 77196, '<td valign="top">Comment Challenge: Nice abstract-ish image. Great use of light, overexposure, shadow, and darkness, combined with the Eastern religious figure (on the curtain?)</td>', 'Comment Challenge: Nice abstract-ish image. Great use of light, overexposure, shadow, and darkness, combined with the Eastern religious figure (on the curtain?)', '2013-10-21 23:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119961, 1087201, 136989, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Great details in the shadows and I love the tunnel to the inner garden.</td>', 'Very nice. Great details in the shadows and I love the tunnel to the inner garden.', '2013-10-21 23:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119962, 1086858, 136989, '<td valign="top">Wonderful details and great symmetry.</td>', 'Wonderful details and great symmetry.', '2013-10-21 23:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119963, 1086113, 77196, '<td valign="top">Comment Challenge: The image has some problems, but I like that it breaks enough rules that it portrays everyday life, rather than an idealized fantasy. However, for me, that does not quite overcome the "flaws". For example, it looks like he has on headphones, but with only one pad covering an ear. Where the other pad is isn''t clear - at first the outdoor light behind and above the other side of his head looks like it, but no. The door closer sits like a box on this shoulder, competing with his face in lightness and emphasis. The purpose of the bag he''s holding isn''t clear, nor is its decoration, nor contents. The soffet on the right side of the picture is a clear feature, and it leads the viewer''s eye to...uh the bottom edge of the picture. Even if all these "flaws" were deliberate choices, for me, the combined impact has more to do with frozen in time than with living.</td>', 'Comment Challenge: The image has some problems, but I like that it breaks enough rules that it portrays everyday life, rather than an idealized fantasy. However, for me, that does not quite overcome the "flaws". For example, it looks like he has on headphones, but with only one pad covering an ear. Where the other pad is isn''t clear - at first the outdoor light behind and above the other side of his head looks like it, but no. The door closer sits like a box on this shoulder, competing with his face in lightness and emphasis. The purpose of the bag he''s holding isn''t clear, nor is its decoration, nor contents. The soffet on the right side of the picture is a clear feature, and it leads the viewer''s eye to...uh the bottom edge of the picture. Even if all these "flaws" were deliberate choices, for me, the combined impact has more to do with frozen in time than with living.', '2013-10-21 23:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119964, 1087102, 136989, '<td valign="top">This looks so much like what I pictured the house to look like I can''t believe it.  Nice find and great pic.  My favorite in this challenge.  <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1082013" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This looks so much like what I pictured the house to look like I can''t believe it.  Nice find and great pic.  My favorite in this challenge.  ', '2013-10-21 23:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119967, 1087039, 77196, '<td valign="top">Comment Challenge: Interesting building and posts between the road and the walkway. The image, however, seems to be overprocessed, with too much overexposure on the left, and too little exposure in the bottom right. I like the clouds, and the sun''s reflection in the windows. I''m not sure what the tilted perspective gives you.</td>', 'Comment Challenge: Interesting building and posts between the road and the walkway. The image, however, seems to be overprocessed, with too much overexposure on the left, and too little exposure in the bottom right. I like the clouds, and the sun''s reflection in the windows. I''m not sure what the tilted perspective gives you.', '2013-10-21 23:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119968, 1087223, 77196, '<td valign="top">Comment Challenge: Nice leading lines, drawing your eye to "Alice" For me, the close to to in-focus left side of the bridge detracts from the mystical feel of the image. I like the girl''s motion - it adds to the sense of her exploring the unfamiliar.</td>', 'Comment Challenge: Nice leading lines, drawing your eye to "Alice" For me, the close to to in-focus left side of the bridge detracts from the mystical feel of the image. I like the girl''s motion - it adds to the sense of her exploring the unfamiliar.', '2013-10-21 23:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119969, 1087057, 77196, '<td valign="top">Comment Challnege: While not a literal interpretation, I believe this definitely captures the tone of Twain''s book. A lazy day, a lazy river, golden sun and blue water, a little hamlet on the far shore. This has nice lines leading the eye into the picture.</td>', 'Comment Challnege: While not a literal interpretation, I believe this definitely captures the tone of Twain''s book. A lazy day, a lazy river, golden sun and blue water, a little hamlet on the far shore. This has nice lines leading the eye into the picture.', '2013-10-22 00:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119970, 1086340, 77196, '<td valign="top">Comment Challenge: I like the whimsical-ish feel to this shot. Nicely done.</td>', 'Comment Challenge: I like the whimsical-ish feel to this shot. Nicely done.', '2013-10-22 00:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119972, 1087198, 8759, '<td valign="top">I had to come back to this one. There is something not working well here. The background (the right side) but at the same time his head angle and the look are together closing a nice circle. He seems concentrated yet void. bump to 7</td>', 'I had to come back to this one. There is something not working well here. The background (the right side) but at the same time his head angle and the look are together closing a nice circle. He seems concentrated yet void. bump to 7', '2013-10-22 00:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119973, 1087086, 77196, '<td valign="top">Comment Challenge: This has enough common elements to be ordinary, and enough uncommon ones (the onion dome, the paths through the tent tops, the "folding fence") to make it foreboding. The perpendicular crop rows in the foreground are used to good advantage, and keep an otherwise uninteresting foreground engaging. The use of contrast, black and white, is very effective.</td>', 'Comment Challenge: This has enough common elements to be ordinary, and enough uncommon ones (the onion dome, the paths through the tent tops, the "folding fence") to make it foreboding. The perpendicular crop rows in the foreground are used to good advantage, and keep an otherwise uninteresting foreground engaging. The use of contrast, black and white, is very effective.', '2013-10-22 00:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119975, 1086936, 112828, '<td valign="top">This seems to be just lazy.  You could have at least chosen a novel that was reasonably applicable to the image.  Maybe something from Douglas Adams....<br/> <br/>Really, it''s not even a great street photo, it''s ok for sure, and she''s somewhat interesting, but I just can''t find any real love for this image.<br/> <br/>1 - sorry, but there''s just nothing to redeem this one for me.</td>', 'This seems to be just lazy.  You could have at least chosen a novel that was reasonably applicable to the image.  Maybe something from Douglas Adams.... Really, it''s not even a great street photo, it''s ok for sure, and she''s somewhat interesting, but I just can''t find any real love for this image. 1 - sorry, but there''s just nothing to redeem this one for me.', '2013-10-22 00:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119976, 1087071, 77196, '<td valign="top">Comment Challenge: Fire is very difficult to capture well, and this image does a good job of it. I like that there is a bit of text that is still legible. The burned portions seem a bit unrealistic.</td>', 'Comment Challenge: Fire is very difficult to capture well, and this image does a good job of it. I like that there is a bit of text that is still legible. The burned portions seem a bit unrealistic.', '2013-10-22 00:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119977, 1087150, 112828, '<td valign="top">Can''t find a novel by this name, nor does this strike me as a quote.<br/> <br/>Image is also rather mundane. composition is the strongest point here - but the tilted horizon affects even that.<br/> <br/>1</td>', 'Can''t find a novel by this name, nor does this strike me as a quote. Image is also rather mundane. composition is the strongest point here - but the tilted horizon affects even that. 1', '2013-10-22 00:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119978, 1087216, 112828, '<td valign="top">Am I missing the story here?<br/> <br/>Is this a clever comment on catching those before they fall?  Who is the man in the print in the cloth?<br/> <br/>What is going on here?<br/> <br/>...<br/> <br/>I''m afraid that you''ve failed to engage me, this image doesn''t speak to me in any way, and all I see is a strange grouping of images that have little or nothing to do with the book.<br/> <br/>2</td>', 'Am I missing the story here? Is this a clever comment on catching those before they fall?  Who is the man in the print in the cloth? What is going on here? ... I''m afraid that you''ve failed to engage me, this image doesn''t speak to me in any way, and all I see is a strange grouping of images that have little or nothing to do with the book. 2', '2013-10-22 00:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119979, 1086433, 77196, '<td valign="top">Comment Challenge: Great clouds, sky, and use of what looks like an observation device as a robot stand-in. I especially like the placement of the sun.</td>', 'Comment Challenge: Great clouds, sky, and use of what looks like an observation device as a robot stand-in. I especially like the placement of the sun.', '2013-10-22 00:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119980, 1087219, 112828, '<td valign="top">Pretty sure that''s a goose.<br/> <br/>Processing seems harsh, and we now have a grey goose.  Now I need a drink. ;)<br/> <br/>Seriously though, the book is about anything but a black goose.   I''m sure you''ll find an explanation for my outlier vote of 3. ;)  (reference to novel... Hope you get it)<br/> <br/>Bumping to 4.  In context it is better than I first found it to be.</td>', 'Pretty sure that''s a goose. Processing seems harsh, and we now have a grey goose.  Now I need a drink. ;) Seriously though, the book is about anything but a black goose.   I''m sure you''ll find an explanation for my outlier vote of 3. ;)  (reference to novel... Hope you get it) Bumping to 4.  In context it is better than I first found it to be.', '2013-10-22 00:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119982, 1087222, 112828, '<td valign="top">Hmm...  What''s up with the weirdness of the dress?  Almost looks like you pasted her in.<br/> <br/>And why is everything all soft and weird?  It''s like there''s a glow effect that I would likely expect in a baby''s portrait...<br/> <br/>In any case, the opulence of the novel would never have included such a scene with the old well worn (and lovely) car, and dirty barn/garage.<br/> <br/>I can''t help but think this was very close to the mark, but missed it entirely.  <br/> <br/>Processing taken into account, and the lack of a real fit or story here, I feel that a 4 is appropriate.</td>', 'Hmm...  What''s up with the weirdness of the dress?  Almost looks like you pasted her in. And why is everything all soft and weird?  It''s like there''s a glow effect that I would likely expect in a baby''s portrait... In any case, the opulence of the novel would never have included such a scene with the old well worn (and lovely) car, and dirty barn/garage. I can''t help but think this was very close to the mark, but missed it entirely.   Processing taken into account, and the lack of a real fit or story here, I feel that a 4 is appropriate.', '2013-10-22 00:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119983, 1087192, 112828, '<td valign="top">Cute.<br/> <br/>But totally wrong - why not go with Vonnegut''s "Galapagos" or something like that?<br/> <br/>Seriously, the book was set in Alaska, and was about dog sled teams and wolves, and men....  This doesn''t speak to that.<br/> <br/>..<br/> <br/>Nice image though.  Very well shot and well processed.  I''ll give you a 4 for sheer image quality.</td>', 'Cute. But totally wrong - why not go with Vonnegut''s "Galapagos" or something like that? Seriously, the book was set in Alaska, and was about dog sled teams and wolves, and men....  This doesn''t speak to that. .. Nice image though.  Very well shot and well processed.  I''ll give you a 4 for sheer image quality.', '2013-10-22 00:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119984, 1086679, 112828, '<td valign="top">Ever read a novel?  They''re a bit different than poetry collections. ;)<br/> <br/>Image is good.  Love the figure on the floor looking out the window. <br/> <br/>Love the reason for the image much less, it seems like this could have been so much more if only attributed to a different book.<br/> <br/>4</td>', 'Ever read a novel?  They''re a bit different than poetry collections. ;) Image is good.  Love the figure on the floor looking out the window.  Love the reason for the image much less, it seems like this could have been so much more if only attributed to a different book. 4', '2013-10-22 00:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119985, 1087044, 112828, '<td valign="top">Surely you mean "Go tell it on the Mountain"?<br/> <br/>If that''s the case, then your image doesn''t at all fit the book as far as I can see....  <br/> <br/>Really nice image though, tad oversharp on the foreground mountain ridges, but overall very nice.<br/> <br/>4, because it is a really nice image, but unfortunately doesn''t meet the challenge well, and has some minor processing flaws.</td>', 'Surely you mean "Go tell it on the Mountain"? If that''s the case, then your image doesn''t at all fit the book as far as I can see....   Really nice image though, tad oversharp on the foreground mountain ridges, but overall very nice. 4, because it is a really nice image, but unfortunately doesn''t meet the challenge well, and has some minor processing flaws.', '2013-10-22 00:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119986, 1087120, 112828, '<td valign="top"><b>Initial Reaction: </b> I like aerial photography.  Don''t really like the inclusion of the cockpit/instrument panel.<br/><b>Suitability for Challenge Topic: </b>It''s an airport.  I do not see snow, and don''t really feel this captures the spirit of the book.<br/><b>Aesthetic: </b>  The only thing that makes this more than a snapshot is the fact that you''re in the air. Otherwise, I see nothing different from this or simply poking a camera out the car window while driving.<br/><b>Needs Work: </b> Concept<br/><b>Final Thoughts: </b> Ends up seeming like a snapshot, with little substantial connection to the chosen book.<br/><b>Score: </b>4</td>', 'Initial Reaction:  I like aerial photography.  Don''t really like the inclusion of the cockpit/instrument panel.Suitability for Challenge Topic: It''s an airport.  I do not see snow, and don''t really feel this captures the spirit of the book.Aesthetic:   The only thing that makes this more than a snapshot is the fact that you''re in the air. Otherwise, I see nothing different from this or simply poking a camera out the car window while driving.Needs Work:  ConceptFinal Thoughts:  Ends up seeming like a snapshot, with little substantial connection to the chosen book.Score: 4', '2013-10-22 00:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119987, 1087139, 112828, '<td valign="top"><b>Initial Reaction: </b> An organ...  <br/><b>Suitability for Challenge Topic: </b> It seems this book is about a Russian poet found dead in Scotland.  By a retiring detective.  Ok, so sure, organs are used at funerals, but... That''s a pretty weak connection.<br/><b>Aesthetic: </b>Lint on keys, and a bit dark overall.  Nice DOF.<br/><b>Needs Work: </b>Exposure, concept<br/><b>Final Thoughts: </b>Not a bad image, just the wrong challenge, or book choice.<br/><b>Score: </b>4</td>', 'Initial Reaction:  An organ...  Suitability for Challenge Topic:  It seems this book is about a Russian poet found dead in Scotland.  By a retiring detective.  Ok, so sure, organs are used at funerals, but... That''s a pretty weak connection.Aesthetic: Lint on keys, and a bit dark overall.  Nice DOF.Needs Work: Exposure, conceptFinal Thoughts: Not a bad image, just the wrong challenge, or book choice.Score: 4', '2013-10-22 00:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119988, 1087096, 112828, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t capture the darkness of the novel...  I''d make suggestions on how to improve it, but you''d probably find them disturbing.<br/> <br/>3</td>', 'Doesn''t capture the darkness of the novel...  I''d make suggestions on how to improve it, but you''d probably find them disturbing. 3', '2013-10-22 00:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119989, 1087125, 112828, '<td valign="top">No novel of this name exists.  Can''t find a connection anywhere.  There was a play by this name, but surely that''s no novel.<br/> <br/>3 - because it''s not a terrible photo.</td>', 'No novel of this name exists.  Can''t find a connection anywhere.  There was a play by this name, but surely that''s no novel. 3 - because it''s not a terrible photo.', '2013-10-22 00:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119990, 1087093, 112828, '<td valign="top">Damn...  I''m almost angry at you for taking what could have been an EXCELLENT book to portray and giving me a silly pun.<br/> <br/>Weak sauce. 3 because I almost like the image.</td>', 'Damn...  I''m almost angry at you for taking what could have been an EXCELLENT book to portray and giving me a silly pun. Weak sauce. 3 because I almost like the image.', '2013-10-22 00:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119991, 1086767, 8759, '<td valign="top">Need to explain a bit. The mere anatomy of the bird on the cold rock is beautiful. The dark area looks like the last drops of its soul are crossing the last passage. I wonder if more details in the dark area of the tail would have brought more to the image. I also would have tried a softer focus. But all these do not matter and won''t alter the vote. Good luck 8</td>', 'Need to explain a bit. The mere anatomy of the bird on the cold rock is beautiful. The dark area looks like the last drops of its soul are crossing the last passage. I wonder if more details in the dark area of the tail would have brought more to the image. I also would have tried a softer focus. But all these do not matter and won''t alter the vote. Good luck 8', '2013-10-22 00:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119994, 1086858, 77196, '<td valign="top">Comment Challenge: This is a very nice image, with good depth, nice processing, nice colors, and great architecture. However, to me, it comes across as an austere documentation of the building, with no personable human touch.</td>', 'Comment Challenge: This is a very nice image, with good depth, nice processing, nice colors, and great architecture. However, to me, it comes across as an austere documentation of the building, with no personable human touch.', '2013-10-22 00:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119997, 1087150, 77196, '<td valign="top">Comment Challnege: Interesting colors in the rocks in the foreground, and very nice sky. To me, the picture is bland - like it would make a great background, does not have a subject.</td>', 'Comment Challnege: Interesting colors in the rocks in the foreground, and very nice sky. To me, the picture is bland - like it would make a great background, does not have a subject.', '2013-10-22 00:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119998, 1087187, 77196, '<td valign="top">Comment Challnege: Love the texture and tones in this. The wires in the upper part are a bit distracting. Interesting contrast between the metal armored windows and the empty / open doorway.</td>', 'Comment Challnege: Love the texture and tones in this. The wires in the upper part are a bit distracting. Interesting contrast between the metal armored windows and the empty / open doorway.', '2013-10-22 00:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7119999, 1086865, 96751, '<td valign="top">Coooooold!!!</td>', 'Coooooold!!!', '2013-10-22 00:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120002, 1087151, 77196, '<td valign="top">Comment Challenge: I like this subtle but effective picture. The girl in the glass is potentially missed, but the subtleness of her adds to the feeling of hidden / secret. The image seems to say, "I am hiding something from you."</td>', 'Comment Challenge: I like this subtle but effective picture. The girl in the glass is potentially missed, but the subtleness of her adds to the feeling of hidden / secret. The image seems to say, "I am hiding something from you."', '2013-10-22 00:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120003, 1087135, 96751, '<td valign="top">A beautiful butterfly with too much negative space all around it</td>', 'A beautiful butterfly with too much negative space all around it', '2013-10-22 00:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120004, 1087036, 96751, '<td valign="top">Spectacular night shot. What gorgeous reflections</td>', 'Spectacular night shot. What gorgeous reflections', '2013-10-22 00:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120005, 1087216, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is one of those philosophical shots with a message and a cool, hep factor. I don''t get it, nor how it relates to the title, which is a witty take on a classic</td>', 'This is one of those philosophical shots with a message and a cool, hep factor. I don''t get it, nor how it relates to the title, which is a witty take on a classic', '2013-10-22 00:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120007, 1087205, 96751, '<td valign="top">A very interesting subject, beautiful tones and shapes, although I feel the light is just a tad dull</td>', 'A very interesting subject, beautiful tones and shapes, although I feel the light is just a tad dull', '2013-10-22 00:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120008, 1086987, 77196, '<td valign="top">Comment Challenge: I love the color and motion in this. However, the fish in the middle, and just to the right of center has two heads. That looks like a mouth with the upper left fish about to swim into its jaws.</td>', 'Comment Challenge: I love the color and motion in this. However, the fish in the middle, and just to the right of center has two heads. That looks like a mouth with the upper left fish about to swim into its jaws.', '2013-10-22 00:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120009, 1087184, 77196, '<td valign="top">Comment Challenge: Great image and setup. My only wish is that the postman''s face be better lit.</td>', 'Comment Challenge: Great image and setup. My only wish is that the postman''s face be better lit.', '2013-10-22 00:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120010, 1086992, 30861, '<td valign="top">This works for me as having been inspired by the novel. I''ve spent a lot of time in "Steinbeck Country", Salinas and environs, and this scene feels faithful to the rundown farm buildings (and run-down people) we used to see a lot of, and maybe still do for all I know. There''s a nice sense of hopeless foreboding ("What''s the world gonna throw at me NEXT?") in this shot, and that works.<br/> <br/>I''m not sure all your processing choices really work for me, but I can see why you made them. I do like the granularity of it. 7 from me.</td>', 'This works for me as having been inspired by the novel. I''ve spent a lot of time in "Steinbeck Country", Salinas and environs, and this scene feels faithful to the rundown farm buildings (and run-down people) we used to see a lot of, and maybe still do for all I know. There''s a nice sense of hopeless foreboding ("What''s the world gonna throw at me NEXT?") in this shot, and that works. I''m not sure all your processing choices really work for me, but I can see why you made them. I do like the granularity of it. 7 from me.', '2013-10-22 00:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120011, 1087141, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is splendid for that book!</td>', 'Oh, this is splendid for that book!', '2013-10-22 00:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120012, 1086453, 30982, '<td valign="top">Indeed.  Wonderful interpretation.</td>', 'Indeed.  Wonderful interpretation.', '2013-10-22 00:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120013, 1086692, 30861, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s a nice pun :-) Technically the image is pretty accomplished, though I''m seeing an odd disconnect between face color/tones and the rest of her skin that really bothers me.<br/> <br/>In the end, it doesn''t connect for me. I need more, at some level. 5.</td>', 'Well, it''s a nice pun :-) Technically the image is pretty accomplished, though I''m seeing an odd disconnect between face color/tones and the rest of her skin that really bothers me. In the end, it doesn''t connect for me. I need more, at some level. 5.', '2013-10-22 00:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120015, 1087162, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great interpretation.  Haunting!</td>', 'Great interpretation.  Haunting!', '2013-10-22 00:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120017, 1087057, 112828, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  Other than period issues (that boat would have been COOL if it was an old log raft)...  I think the image is very nice.  Processing here leaves me feeling as though I''m looking at a very well done painting, and while it doesn''t exactly evoke the grandness of the Mississippi, it''s certainly coming very close to the hopes I had for this challenge.  <br/> <br/>8</td>', 'Excellent.  Other than period issues (that boat would have been COOL if it was an old log raft)...  I think the image is very nice.  Processing here leaves me feeling as though I''m looking at a very well done painting, and while it doesn''t exactly evoke the grandness of the Mississippi, it''s certainly coming very close to the hopes I had for this challenge.   8', '2013-10-22 00:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120018, 1087188, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great energy!</td>', 'Great energy!', '2013-10-22 00:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120019, 1087151, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nicely understated.</td>', 'Nicely understated.', '2013-10-22 00:30:58.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(7120020, 1087072, 30861, '<td valign="top">Technically I don''t much care for this; the framing is awkward, the light is kind of blah, it''s just so matter-of-fact. But the Old Curiosity Shop was a magical place, layer upon layers of remarkable things. So this is just a disconnect for me. <br/> <br/>I''ll give it a 4.</td>', 'Technically I don''t much care for this; the framing is awkward, the light is kind of blah, it''s just so matter-of-fact. But the Old Curiosity Shop was a magical place, layer upon layers of remarkable things. So this is just a disconnect for me.  I''ll give it a 4.', '2013-10-22 00:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120023, 1087086, 30982, '<td valign="top">Another great interpretation.</td>', 'Another great interpretation.', '2013-10-22 00:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120024, 1087036, 30861, '<td valign="top">Not to pick nits, but "The Thousand Nights and a Night" isn''t a novel, it''s a collection of stories woven together.<br/> <br/>That said, clearly the image IS from the Middle East and it IS night, and it''s nicely put together technically. Looks like a magical place. 6 from me.</td>', 'Not to pick nits, but "The Thousand Nights and a Night" isn''t a novel, it''s a collection of stories woven together. That said, clearly the image IS from the Middle East and it IS night, and it''s nicely put together technically. Looks like a magical place. 6 from me.', '2013-10-22 00:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120025, 1086767, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a find - sad but fascinating, and beautifully photographed.</td>', 'What a find - sad but fascinating, and beautifully photographed.', '2013-10-22 00:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120026, 1086433, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent take on the title!</td>', 'Excellent take on the title!', '2013-10-22 00:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120027, 1086692, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the flare on her throat.</td>', 'Love the flare on her throat.', '2013-10-22 00:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120028, 1087195, 30861, '<td valign="top">It''s an absolutely gorgeous, misty sunrise. I''m having a hard time figuring out if it''s possible to have that color water under that color sky, though, and that bothers me some.<br/> <br/>I''m more bothered by the fact that it has absolutely nothing to do, emotionally, with the Hemingway novel. But you''re far from alone in having taken this approach, working from a title only.<br/> <br/>6 from me.</td>', 'It''s an absolutely gorgeous, misty sunrise. I''m having a hard time figuring out if it''s possible to have that color water under that color sky, though, and that bothers me some. I''m more bothered by the fact that it has absolutely nothing to do, emotionally, with the Hemingway novel. But you''re far from alone in having taken this approach, working from a title only. 6 from me.', '2013-10-22 00:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120029, 1086734, 30982, '<td valign="top">Will look to see the notes on this - where, and how!  Stunning.</td>', 'Will look to see the notes on this - where, and how!  Stunning.', '2013-10-22 00:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120030, 1086987, 30861, '<td valign="top">I like this very much. I can see the koi as metaphors for the water babies. I like the feel of it and the color of it. Nice job! 8</td>', 'I like this very much. I can see the koi as metaphors for the water babies. I like the feel of it and the color of it. Nice job! 8', '2013-10-22 00:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120031, 1086992, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very much evokes the novel.  Well done.</td>', 'Very much evokes the novel.  Well done.', '2013-10-22 00:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120032, 1086113, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quite fitting for a Rand novel.</td>', 'Quite fitting for a Rand novel.', '2013-10-22 00:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120033, 1086989, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the leading power lines.</td>', 'Nice use of the leading power lines.', '2013-10-22 00:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120046, 1086734, 108069, '<td valign="top">Immense scene. Powerful yet serene. Beautiful stuff.</td>', 'Immense scene. Powerful yet serene. Beautiful stuff.', '2013-10-22 01:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120049, 1086983, 108069, '<td valign="top">Perfectly done. Very impressive.</td>', 'Perfectly done. Very impressive.', '2013-10-22 01:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120050, 1086744, 108069, '<td valign="top">Love the delicate drops, focal depth. Very, very nice. (Not voting)</td>', 'Love the delicate drops, focal depth. Very, very nice. (Not voting)', '2013-10-22 01:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120051, 1087000, 108069, '<td valign="top">Beautifully processed.</td>', 'Beautifully processed.', '2013-10-22 01:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120052, 1086999, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great stuff.</td>', 'Great stuff.', '2013-10-22 01:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120053, 1087071, 108069, '<td valign="top">Extremely well done. Has to be right up there when it''s all counted. (Not voting)</td>', 'Extremely well done. Has to be right up there when it''s all counted. (Not voting)', '2013-10-22 01:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120054, 1087162, 108069, '<td valign="top">Quite well done.</td>', 'Quite well done.', '2013-10-22 01:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120056, 1086692, 108069, '<td valign="top">Clever stuff. Pretty stuff.</td>', 'Clever stuff. Pretty stuff.', '2013-10-22 01:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120057, 1087112, 108069, '<td valign="top">Very well done. Beautifully lit.</td>', 'Very well done. Beautifully lit.', '2013-10-22 01:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120058, 1086672, 108069, '<td valign="top">Careful, buddy.</td>', 'Careful, buddy.', '2013-10-22 01:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120059, 1087207, 96751, '<td valign="top">I''m not familiar to this short story :)</td>', 'I''m not familiar to this short story :)', '2013-10-22 01:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120060, 1087078, 96751, '<td valign="top">Bold tones and textures</td>', 'Bold tones and textures', '2013-10-22 01:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120063, 1087222, 96751, '<td valign="top">You are adorable, Beata. I''m puzzled by the featureless legs and skirt, especially coupled with the rest of the highly textured treatment, but I just LOVE the attitude</td>', 'You are adorable, Beata. I''m puzzled by the featureless legs and skirt, especially coupled with the rest of the highly textured treatment, but I just LOVE the attitude', '2013-10-22 01:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120064, 1086939, 96751, '<td valign="top">Really wonderfully pp''d as paint</td>', 'Really wonderfully pp''d as paint', '2013-10-22 01:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120065, 1087208, 96751, '<td valign="top">Most excellent wildlife capture, a la Richard</td>', 'Most excellent wildlife capture, a la Richard', '2013-10-22 01:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120066, 1086761, 96751, '<td valign="top">An odd, and I''m not sure "fitting" choice for this classic. But a really interesting image</td>', 'An odd, and I''m not sure "fitting" choice for this classic. But a really interesting image', '2013-10-22 01:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120067, 1087198, 96751, '<td valign="top">A marvelous portrait, though I feel it could use a bit more light</td>', 'A marvelous portrait, though I feel it could use a bit more light', '2013-10-22 01:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120068, 1087141, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very spectacular. Great choice of contrast. I might guess this to be Alessandro''s work. And if it''s not him, consider it a compliment :-)</td>', 'Very spectacular. Great choice of contrast. I might guess this to be Alessandro''s work. And if it''s not him, consider it a compliment :-)', '2013-10-22 01:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120070, 1086992, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fabulous. I love everything about this except the crop. Perhaps it is too obvious to make this square, but although I understand the need for some space to the right I feel that there''s just a tad too much of it.</td>', 'Fabulous. I love everything about this except the crop. Perhaps it is too obvious to make this square, but although I understand the need for some space to the right I feel that there''s just a tad too much of it.', '2013-10-22 01:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120072, 1086986, 96751, '<td valign="top">Incredible. This is truly terrifying and extraordinary. When you read the book, it is practically impossible to imagine little boys behaving in such a horrific way. This image hints at that possibility. Well done</td>', 'Incredible. This is truly terrifying and extraordinary. When you read the book, it is practically impossible to imagine little boys behaving in such a horrific way. This image hints at that possibility. Well done', '2013-10-22 01:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120073, 1086157, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2013-10-22 01:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120074, 1086433, 96751, '<td valign="top">Ha! Very clever. Perfect timing. Would love to know if you planned to be there at this time, or if it just happened</td>', 'Ha! Very clever. Perfect timing. Would love to know if you planned to be there at this time, or if it just happened', '2013-10-22 01:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
