(7120153, 1087072, 12611, '<td valign="top">I think the redeeming thing about this photo is the skull; its a decent theme, but not very sharp, colors a bit flat, a full frontal crop, but then, you see the skull. that saves it.</td>', 'I think the redeeming thing about this photo is the skull; its a decent theme, but not very sharp, colors a bit flat, a full frontal crop, but then, you see the skull. that saves it.', '2013-10-22 10:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120154, 1087102, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like the light and the details, perhaps the composition is unbalances by the tree, or not enough of it. The major color tones are spot on, and the glow of the sky behind the building is not overly off-putting.</td>', 'I like the light and the details, perhaps the composition is unbalances by the tree, or not enough of it. The major color tones are spot on, and the glow of the sky behind the building is not overly off-putting.', '2013-10-22 10:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120155, 1086914, 100831, '<td valign="top">I have read Orwell, of course, but not this. My search came up with this quote Mrs Weaver nosed among the books, too dim-witted to grasp that they were in alphabetical order. and it seems to fit this image well. Continuing, I discovered that "the aspidistra is the tree of life and it hit me.This image is so interesting.. the ins and outs of life and the struggle to get it right. Excellent work here.</td>', 'I have read Orwell, of course, but not this. My search came up with this quote Mrs Weaver nosed among the books, too dim-witted to grasp that they were in alphabetical order. and it seems to fit this image well. Continuing, I discovered that "the aspidistra is the tree of life and it hit me.This image is so interesting.. the ins and outs of life and the struggle to get it right. Excellent work here.', '2013-10-22 10:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120157, 1086983, 100831, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite books ever, and the movie is a classic too. Though a literal interpretation, I find this image compelling. I feel that courtroom in this grasp. Excellent.</td>', 'One of my favorite books ever, and the movie is a classic too. Though a literal interpretation, I find this image compelling. I feel that courtroom in this grasp. Excellent.', '2013-10-22 10:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
