(7120289, 1086744, 100975, '<td valign="top">Overall the image is just ok.  I like the water droplets in the web, and I like the light green and tan colors of the background.  The dark green doesn''t fit to me.  A different angle perhaps would have made the background better.  <br/> <br/>I would also liked to have seen more detail on that spider.<br/> <br/>Gave it a 4</td>', 'Overall the image is just ok.  I like the water droplets in the web, and I like the light green and tan colors of the background.  The dark green doesn''t fit to me.  A different angle perhaps would have made the background better.   I would also liked to have seen more detail on that spider. Gave it a 4', '2013-10-22 13:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120290, 1087216, 100975, '<td valign="top">So I guess catcher in wry would be the wry look on the faces.  I personally do not like this image.  I am sure there is a reason behind each piece in the image, but it feels very disjointed to me.  In my opinion, the composition of the image needs to be changed.  I think the lighting of the rye? (only on the top) is good.  I don''t care for the white guy at the bottom or the reflection of Jimi in the other picture.<br/> <br/>Gave it a 2</td>', 'So I guess catcher in wry would be the wry look on the faces.  I personally do not like this image.  I am sure there is a reason behind each piece in the image, but it feels very disjointed to me.  In my opinion, the composition of the image needs to be changed.  I think the lighting of the rye? (only on the top) is good.  I don''t care for the white guy at the bottom or the reflection of Jimi in the other picture. Gave it a 2', '2013-10-22 13:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
