(7120319, 1087135, 100975, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the image.  The one distractor for me is the reflection in the jar.  Maybe a portrait shot and a little closer may have made this a better image.  I would like to see more detail in the butterfly.<br/> <br/>Gave it a 4</td>', 'I like the idea of the image.  The one distractor for me is the reflection in the jar.  Maybe a portrait shot and a little closer may have made this a better image.  I would like to see more detail in the butterfly. Gave it a 4', '2013-10-22 14:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120320, 1086679, 100975, '<td valign="top">This is a great image.  I particularly like the colors and the composition.<br/> <br/>Gave it a 9</td>', 'This is a great image.  I particularly like the colors and the composition. Gave it a 9', '2013-10-22 14:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120322, 1087048, 100975, '<td valign="top">Just seems like a picture in a park.  Nothing secret or magical about it to me.  It is a nice photo, but it doesn''t make me feel anything.  I particularly like the lighting on the leaves in the tree.<br/> <br/>Gave it a 5</td>', 'Just seems like a picture in a park.  Nothing secret or magical about it to me.  It is a nice photo, but it doesn''t make me feel anything.  I particularly like the lighting on the leaves in the tree. Gave it a 5', '2013-10-22 14:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120323, 1087223, 35804, '<td valign="top">7...yes, this conjures Alice for me. That''s what I love about the lensbaby, and I''m assuming this was a LB shot, it lets us make believe, shows other worlds we can''t see without it. The B&amp;W conversion is what holds me back from a higher vote, but that''s my bias to get over.<br/> <br/>Bumping to an 8.</td>', '7...yes, this conjures Alice for me. That''s what I love about the lensbaby, and I''m assuming this was a LB shot, it lets us make believe, shows other worlds we can''t see without it. The B&W conversion is what holds me back from a higher vote, but that''s my bias to get over. Bumping to an 8.', '2013-10-22 14:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120325, 1086113, 35804, '<td valign="top">6...and here''s your damn fries. Technically the quality is lacking, but the pissed off look on his face makes up for that for some reason. Enjoy your meal.<br/> <br/>The fries were nice and hot..I''m bumping this to 7.</td>', '6...and here''s your damn fries. Technically the quality is lacking, but the pissed off look on his face makes up for that for some reason. Enjoy your meal. The fries were nice and hot..I''m bumping this to 7.', '2013-10-22 14:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120327, 1087096, 35804, '<td valign="top">6...It''s the cutest of the 3 Lord of Flies entries. The light is pretty too. Though it is a really nice B&amp;W conversion, I wonder how this would have been in color?</td>', '6...It''s the cutest of the 3 Lord of Flies entries. The light is pretty too. Though it is a really nice B&W conversion, I wonder how this would have been in color?', '2013-10-22 14:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120335, 1087000, 138253, '<td valign="top">i like the hazy quality of the image, <strike>but find the plant too distracting</strike>. upon viewing this in the thumbnail view, the plant seems more natural. <br/>a <strike>6</strike> 7 from me</td>', 'i like the hazy quality of the image, but find the plant too distracting. upon viewing this in the thumbnail view, the plant seems more natural. a 6 7 from me', '2013-10-22 15:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120337, 1087194, 138253, '<td valign="top">don''t they know the war''s over?<br/> <br/>interesting capture, i like the spray coming out of the barrell and the shredded grass coming up in the vacinity.<br/>I find the hint of the confederate flag too minimal, but wonder if including more would throw off the balance of the soldiers and the cannon.<br/>a 7 from me</td>', 'don''t they know the war''s over? interesting capture, i like the spray coming out of the barrell and the shredded grass coming up in the vacinity.I find the hint of the confederate flag too minimal, but wonder if including more would throw off the balance of the soldiers and the cannon.a 7 from me', '2013-10-22 15:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120338, 1087205, 138253, '<td valign="top">definitely gives a feeling of previous glory and how that fades<br/>While this topic can be viewed in many ways (everything that is alive or constructed by man will inevitibly fall into this), the presentation here is neither degrading, nor sterile, and that makes worlds of difference<br/>an 8 from me</td>', 'definitely gives a feeling of previous glory and how that fadesWhile this topic can be viewed in many ways (everything that is alive or constructed by man will inevitibly fall into this), the presentation here is neither degrading, nor sterile, and that makes worlds of differencean 8 from me', '2013-10-22 15:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120339, 1087102, 138253, '<td valign="top">Liking the detail captured here, and the sense of foreboding inside the building.<br/>7 from me</td>', 'Liking the detail captured here, and the sense of foreboding inside the building.7 from me', '2013-10-22 15:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120341, 1086865, 138253, '<td valign="top">personally, the grass in front ruin the symmetry for me. i tried with a printscreen and cropped the image just above the grass and prefer that look substantially more. the grass draws your eye down to the bottom 10% or so of the image, and away from the mountain, which i think would be your primary subject based on the title.<br/>there is sufficient evidence of the cold weather in the ice on the lake and snows on the mountain.<br/>a <strike>6</strike> 7 from me (after finishing and reviewing), though I could easily see voting higher without the grass</td>', 'personally, the grass in front ruin the symmetry for me. i tried with a printscreen and cropped the image just above the grass and prefer that look substantially more. the grass draws your eye down to the bottom 10% or so of the image, and away from the mountain, which i think would be your primary subject based on the title.there is sufficient evidence of the cold weather in the ice on the lake and snows on the mountain.a 6 7 from me (after finishing and reviewing), though I could easily see voting higher without the grass', '2013-10-22 15:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120343, 1086479, 138253, '<td valign="top">The color palette and open landscape are perfectly suited to your title. I personally like the "approaching darkness" feel, there is little "warm and fuzzy" that can be taken from this image.<br/>a <strike>7</strike> 8 from me (upon reviewing my comments and votes when finished)</td>', 'The color palette and open landscape are perfectly suited to your title. I personally like the "approaching darkness" feel, there is little "warm and fuzzy" that can be taken from this image.a 7 8 from me (upon reviewing my comments and votes when finished)', '2013-10-22 15:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120345, 1086858, 138253, '<td valign="top">Love the detail and shading, as well as the continual nature implied in the design.<br/>I''m not familiar with the book but after a quick look it seems the image is at least geographically in keeping, and the image does certainly seem to be mausoleum-esque.<br/>I keep having the sensation that it is not level, caused mostly by the small bit in the bottom center, but upon righting myself to the image realize that it is this aspect, and not the whole image, that is causing my skew.<br/>The pillars and archways do wonders to draw the eye to the shaded mural on the wall. <br/>overall i''m giving this an <strike>8</strike> 9 and would expect this to finish in the top 10.<br/>this is also getting a favorite (and bumped score) after finishing all voting.</td>', 'Love the detail and shading, as well as the continual nature implied in the design.I''m not familiar with the book but after a quick look it seems the image is at least geographically in keeping, and the image does certainly seem to be mausoleum-esque.I keep having the sensation that it is not level, caused mostly by the small bit in the bottom center, but upon righting myself to the image realize that it is this aspect, and not the whole image, that is causing my skew.The pillars and archways do wonders to draw the eye to the shaded mural on the wall. overall i''m giving this an 8 9 and would expect this to finish in the top 10.this is also getting a favorite (and bumped score) after finishing all voting.', '2013-10-22 15:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120346, 1086433, 138253, '<td valign="top">Personally, given the source and the image here, I like the connection of the sun setting on the time of man as the superior force on the earth, with the "eye" watching us observe the last light, while still obscuring the horizon (our future with them over us).<br/>One may also see a lack of technology being active in the dark buildings below, indicative of overthrowing the machine in the end, and we have gone full circle to rely on the sun, the way our ancestors did, with the reminder of what almost was, looming prominent in the foreground - sterile and lifeless.<br/>i have to say that i think this is going to be a contender for my favorite image in the challenge and a definite 9+</td>', 'Personally, given the source and the image here, I like the connection of the sun setting on the time of man as the superior force on the earth, with the "eye" watching us observe the last light, while still obscuring the horizon (our future with them over us).One may also see a lack of technology being active in the dark buildings below, indicative of overthrowing the machine in the end, and we have gone full circle to rely on the sun, the way our ancestors did, with the reminder of what almost was, looming prominent in the foreground - sterile and lifeless.i have to say that i think this is going to be a contender for my favorite image in the challenge and a definite 9+', '2013-10-22 15:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120347, 1087093, 138253, '<td valign="top">wow....that''s more detail than i ever thought i''d see regarding a bull''s nose. have to say it''s quite humorous, though generally unappealing to me.<br/>technically well done for the focus and detail.<br/>*edited* forgot to include vote before - this gets a 6 from me</td>', 'wow....that''s more detail than i ever thought i''d see regarding a bull''s nose. have to say it''s quite humorous, though generally unappealing to me.technically well done for the focus and detail.*edited* forgot to include vote before - this gets a 6 from me', '2013-10-22 15:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120349, 1087205, 118154, '<td valign="top">A little lacking in the poke department and not sure why you left the shine top right.5.</td>', 'A little lacking in the poke department and not sure why you left the shine top right.5.', '2013-10-22 15:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120350, 1087057, 118154, '<td valign="top">Average nice image,ok.6.</td>', 'Average nice image,ok.6.', '2013-10-22 15:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120357, 1087015, 103142, '<td valign="top">I have the same type of comment as I had on the other Wuthering Heights shot. Interesting building. But it doesn''t evoke much of the emotion or feeling of the novel. On the plus side -- normally I don''t like harsh shadows, but it works in this case to get some of the moodiness. But there''s so much to this novel, I don''t know that a building alone can really channel it. -6-</td>', 'I have the same type of comment as I had on the other Wuthering Heights shot. Interesting building. But it doesn''t evoke much of the emotion or feeling of the novel. On the plus side -- normally I don''t like harsh shadows, but it works in this case to get some of the moodiness. But there''s so much to this novel, I don''t know that a building alone can really channel it. -6-', '2013-10-22 16:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120363, 1087148, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF, but I''m not sure of the angle that you chose. It looks a little flat overall, both in composition and in tonality, imo. I''m curious what it would have looked like at more of a diagonal on the keyboard, and with the whites a little whiter. -5-</td>', 'I like the DOF, but I''m not sure of the angle that you chose. It looks a little flat overall, both in composition and in tonality, imo. I''m curious what it would have looked like at more of a diagonal on the keyboard, and with the whites a little whiter. -5-', '2013-10-22 16:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120365, 1087162, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. A few small nitpicks: the hands are a little odd -- flat and blown? And the arch coming out of the head in the mirror is odd and very distracting. I wish it wasn''t centered on the head. Just a little to the left or right and it would have been much better. That being said, it''s one of my favorites in the challenge. -9-</td>', 'Very nicely done. A few small nitpicks: the hands are a little odd -- flat and blown? And the arch coming out of the head in the mirror is odd and very distracting. I wish it wasn''t centered on the head. Just a little to the left or right and it would have been much better. That being said, it''s one of my favorites in the challenge. -9-', '2013-10-22 16:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120366, 1087122, 103142, '<td valign="top">It''s such a beautiful shot, but the processing has taken so much from it, imo. It looks like it would have such wonderful deep, rich tones that have been so washed out by being so bright. I think the over-sharpening could work if only it were darker and richer. -5-</td>', 'It''s such a beautiful shot, but the processing has taken so much from it, imo. It looks like it would have such wonderful deep, rich tones that have been so washed out by being so bright. I think the over-sharpening could work if only it were darker and richer. -5-', '2013-10-22 16:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120367, 1086979, 68504, '<td valign="top">lovely landscape, possibly overdone with the bright glow things - would love to see bigger. maybe we should have an "inspired by the <b>title</b>" challenge. 6</td>', 'lovely landscape, possibly overdone with the bright glow things - would love to see bigger. maybe we should have an "inspired by the title" challenge. 6', '2013-10-22 16:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120368, 1087102, 68504, '<td valign="top">not exactly wuthering heights, but an interesting photo. I feel a war has passed through here. convincing light and colour, good angles. 6</td>', 'not exactly wuthering heights, but an interesting photo. I feel a war has passed through here. convincing light and colour, good angles. 6', '2013-10-22 16:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120371, 1086999, 68504, '<td valign="top">good bw tones, but not a wonderful composition: the modern spoon troubles me, as does the clean white cuff. I do like the grungy right hand. However very little speaks from the picture as a whole: rather than a supplication, this is more a presentation of incongruous tableware. 3</td>', 'good bw tones, but not a wonderful composition: the modern spoon troubles me, as does the clean white cuff. I do like the grungy right hand. However very little speaks from the picture as a whole: rather than a supplication, this is more a presentation of incongruous tableware. 3', '2013-10-22 16:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120373, 1087192, 68504, '<td valign="top">oye! what have you done to my dog story?!?!?! For the sheer force and intent of the reptile 4.</td>', 'oye! what have you done to my dog story?!?!?! For the sheer force and intent of the reptile 4.', '2013-10-22 17:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120375, 1087015, 68504, '<td valign="top">I wish I didn''t feel this was an outbuilding in a park or an estate. overdone pp: the light and shadows might have been quite nice. 2</td>', 'I wish I didn''t feel this was an outbuilding in a park or an estate. overdone pp: the light and shadows might have been quite nice. 2', '2013-10-22 17:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120376, 1087139, 94815, '<td valign="top">Based on the plot summary (I haven''t read the book) there is no apparent connection to this crime novel, only a literal reference to its title. The shot is well detailed and moodily exposed and I like the POV to add some instability/tension - but this old organ has me thinking more Broadway theatrical horror (as in Phantom of the Opera) than modern Welsh noir thriller. 5</td>', 'Based on the plot summary (I haven''t read the book) there is no apparent connection to this crime novel, only a literal reference to its title. The shot is well detailed and moodily exposed and I like the POV to add some instability/tension - but this old organ has me thinking more Broadway theatrical horror (as in Phantom of the Opera) than modern Welsh noir thriller. 5', '2013-10-22 17:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120379, 1087162, 68504, '<td valign="top">ah. you went for it. possibly too literal, maybe even too ambitious. 5</td>', 'ah. you went for it. possibly too literal, maybe even too ambitious. 5', '2013-10-22 17:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120383, 1087188, 68504, '<td valign="top">another inspired by the title but not by the book. I like blur but a good blur has to show something, never mind its literate connect. 2</td>', 'another inspired by the title but not by the book. I like blur but a good blur has to show something, never mind its literate connect. 2', '2013-10-22 17:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120385, 1087141, 35804, '<td valign="top">6...a nice rich B&amp;W conversion. For me the vignette is maybe a bit strong as it encroaches around the edges and seems unnecessary. But the light-the light is so beautiful.</td>', '6...a nice rich B&W conversion. For me the vignette is maybe a bit strong as it encroaches around the edges and seems unnecessary. But the light-the light is so beautiful.', '2013-10-22 17:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120386, 1087055, 35804, '<td valign="top">4...oh that purple thong strap. This would have been a hundred times better without it. It would have flattered your model so much more. Her hair  is also blending into the background a bit too much giving this strange effect of her being bald. Dappled light is tough to shoot in. Reflectors can sometimes help fill in those shadow areas.</td>', '4...oh that purple thong strap. This would have been a hundred times better without it. It would have flattered your model so much more. Her hair  is also blending into the background a bit too much giving this strange effect of her being bald. Dappled light is tough to shoot in. Reflectors can sometimes help fill in those shadow areas.', '2013-10-22 17:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120388, 1086734, 147314, '<td valign="top">Magnificent image: the snow, shadows, sky, wind, light and colours, really breathtaking.</td>', 'Magnificent image: the snow, shadows, sky, wind, light and colours, really breathtaking.', '2013-10-22 17:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120389, 1087135, 147314, '<td valign="top">I love this one, that beautiful coloured butterfly against that soft reflection in the glass.</td>', 'I love this one, that beautiful coloured butterfly against that soft reflection in the glass.', '2013-10-22 17:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120390, 1087141, 147314, '<td valign="top">Lovely contrast in lights and shadows, nice composition as well!</td>', 'Lovely contrast in lights and shadows, nice composition as well!', '2013-10-22 17:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120391, 1086157, 147314, '<td valign="top">I really like the colours, the milky river and the disappearing trees in the background, not sure about the processing (just too much?) and the border.</td>', 'I really like the colours, the milky river and the disappearing trees in the background, not sure about the processing (just too much?) and the border.', '2013-10-22 17:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120392, 1086858, 147314, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shapes, details and colours, perfect symmetry!</td>', 'Fantastic shapes, details and colours, perfect symmetry!', '2013-10-22 17:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120393, 1087223, 147314, '<td valign="top">Nice way to show ''Alice'' disappearing to the other world.</td>', 'Nice way to show ''Alice'' disappearing to the other world.', '2013-10-22 17:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120395, 1087221, 147314, '<td valign="top">Nice way to combine the clock and the orange; +1 for the humor.</td>', 'Nice way to combine the clock and the orange; +1 for the humor.', '2013-10-22 17:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120396, 1087023, 147314, '<td valign="top">Nice POV, great reflections and beautiful colours</td>', 'Nice POV, great reflections and beautiful colours', '2013-10-22 17:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120398, 1087082, 94815, '<td valign="top">Visual impact here is mixed: nicely framed and centered subject and atmospheric with a cottony sea from the long exposure. However, on my monitor, the colors appear oversaturated and the contrast a little excessive with halos along the contrasty edges caused by a bit too strong sharpening. The centered composition is useful to pull attention to the lighthouse itself, which would or should be the main subject. As to topicality, like so many others in the challenge, this is a very literal take on the title of the book. I haven''t read the book but from the synopsis is appears the trip to the lighthouse only takes place only in the last section of the book and may include a sunset, if only in the minds of the characters. Overall, I feel this rates a 5. Could be a 6 with gentler processing.</td>', 'Visual impact here is mixed: nicely framed and centered subject and atmospheric with a cottony sea from the long exposure. However, on my monitor, the colors appear oversaturated and the contrast a little excessive with halos along the contrasty edges caused by a bit too strong sharpening. The centered composition is useful to pull attention to the lighthouse itself, which would or should be the main subject. As to topicality, like so many others in the challenge, this is a very literal take on the title of the book. I haven''t read the book but from the synopsis is appears the trip to the lighthouse only takes place only in the last section of the book and may include a sunset, if only in the minds of the characters. Overall, I feel this rates a 5. Could be a 6 with gentler processing.', '2013-10-22 17:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120399, 1087162, 147314, '<td valign="top">This image has a nice, almost mysterious atmosphere, makes me think of a Hitchcock B&amp;W movie. Great picture!</td>', 'This image has a nice, almost mysterious atmosphere, makes me think of a Hitchcock B&W movie. Great picture!', '2013-10-22 17:46:20.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(7120401, 1086672, 147314, '<td valign="top">I thought to do something simular, glad I did not. You really managed to get the two characters in one face!</td>', 'I thought to do something simular, glad I did not. You really managed to get the two characters in one face!', '2013-10-22 17:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120402, 1087208, 147314, '<td valign="top">This could have been a smashing wildlife pic, but the light on the animal is too bright/harsh.</td>', 'This could have been a smashing wildlife pic, but the light on the animal is too bright/harsh.', '2013-10-22 17:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120404, 1087007, 147314, '<td valign="top">Have seen this book 3 or 4 times now, to me this is the best image to represent it. Love the light coming through the trees, the expression on the boy''s face. Bump!</td>', 'Have seen this book 3 or 4 times now, to me this is the best image to represent it. Love the light coming through the trees, the expression on the boy''s face. Bump!', '2013-10-22 17:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120406, 1087222, 147314, '<td valign="top">There is something very unreal with that woman''s dress. Maybe it is according to the book, sorry when I''m mistaken, but it ruins this image for me.</td>', 'There is something very unreal with that woman''s dress. Maybe it is according to the book, sorry when I''m mistaken, but it ruins this image for me.', '2013-10-22 17:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120407, 1087198, 68504, '<td valign="top">It is a wonderful portrait. More Mennonite than Joycean artist. 7</td>', 'It is a wonderful portrait. More Mennonite than Joycean artist. 7', '2013-10-22 17:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120408, 1086936, 147314, '<td valign="top">Have been looking at the picture for some time now, but I can''t connect this image with the Alice story.</td>', 'Have been looking at the picture for some time now, but I can''t connect this image with the Alice story.', '2013-10-22 17:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120411, 1087044, 68504, '<td valign="top">ho hum. 3</td>', 'ho hum. 3', '2013-10-22 18:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120412, 1087093, 68504, '<td valign="top">simply not. 1</td>', 'simply not. 1', '2013-10-22 18:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120413, 1087208, 68504, '<td valign="top">good face on and interpretation/inspiration. 6</td>', 'good face on and interpretation/inspiration. 6', '2013-10-22 18:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120414, 1087194, 94815, '<td valign="top">Somehow I hadn''t heard of the book, which seems to be too recent to be considered a "classic" but we''ll let that pass. So this is clearly a Civil War reenactment so it seems to fit the novel, although the action is more of less static except for firing the gun. The photo itself is perfectly timed to capture not only the smoke but the flash and even a the shock as the discharge blows up debris from the ground. However, the processing has created halos edging the gun and gunners against the white smoke, and the overall contrast is washed out. 5</td>', 'Somehow I hadn''t heard of the book, which seems to be too recent to be considered a "classic" but we''ll let that pass. So this is clearly a Civil War reenactment so it seems to fit the novel, although the action is more of less static except for firing the gun. The photo itself is perfectly timed to capture not only the smoke but the flash and even a the shock as the discharge blows up debris from the ground. However, the processing has created halos edging the gun and gunners against the white smoke, and the overall contrast is washed out. 5', '2013-10-22 18:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120415, 1087194, 68504, '<td valign="top">I have always wondered what they were shooting at. probably nothing. 3</td>', 'I have always wondered what they were shooting at. probably nothing. 3', '2013-10-22 18:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120416, 1087120, 68504, '<td valign="top">nice wide view in vertical mode. photo doesn''t say much, nor does it more than nominally reference the book. 5</td>', 'nice wide view in vertical mode. photo doesn''t say much, nor does it more than nominally reference the book. 5', '2013-10-22 18:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120418, 1087141, 12611, '<td valign="top">I am thinking that this would look even better at hi res, much bigger. I will say, this black and white processing helps increase the drama.</td>', 'I am thinking that this would look even better at hi res, much bigger. I will say, this black and white processing helps increase the drama.', '2013-10-22 18:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120420, 1086744, 94815, '<td valign="top">A true classic, which can''t be said of many other entries. However, it would have been nice to have some specific reference to the book beyond the anonymous spider and pearl-drop dappled web. The water drops are pretty as captured but overall the image lacks impact to raise it above an average score. 5</td>', 'A true classic, which can''t be said of many other entries. However, it would have been nice to have some specific reference to the book beyond the anonymous spider and pearl-drop dappled web. The water drops are pretty as captured but overall the image lacks impact to raise it above an average score. 5', '2013-10-22 18:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120421, 1087039, 12611, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites. The off-kilter horizon, low -fi processing and cyanotype quality leaves the viewer pleasantly on edge.</td>', 'One of my favorites. The off-kilter horizon, low -fi processing and cyanotype quality leaves the viewer pleasantly on edge.', '2013-10-22 18:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120422, 1087093, 12611, '<td valign="top">I love the point when you see the eyes. great overall pink tones.</td>', 'I love the point when you see the eyes. great overall pink tones.', '2013-10-22 18:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120423, 1087055, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like this a great deal, the light, the expression, the turned body and exposed single nipple- well done.</td>', 'I like this a great deal, the light, the expression, the turned body and exposed single nipple- well done.', '2013-10-22 18:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
