(7120561, 1087121, 100975, '<td valign="top">Originally gave it a 4, but I moved it up to a 5.<br/> <br/>I like the foggy look to the image.  I think it would have been a better image had it been oriented landscape and a little of the water out of the image.  Or if staying portrait, less water and more sky.</td>', 'Originally gave it a 4, but I moved it up to a 5. I like the foggy look to the image.  I think it would have been a better image had it been oriented landscape and a little of the water out of the image.  Or if staying portrait, less water and more sky.', '2013-10-22 21:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
