(7120566, 1087055, 100975, '<td valign="top">I don''t find this image interesting at all.  The lighting seems really bad to me.  If you want to accent parts of the body, the lighting needs to be placed strategically.  It seems that you just used what was available.  The shadows really do a disservice to the overall image.<br/> <br/>If you wanted to go for title...which you obviously did, maybe you should have had your subject bent over with her "fanny" in the air making a "hill".  This would have made more sense than just having a naked woman in a photo.<br/> <br/>Gave it a 2</td>', 'I don''t find this image interesting at all.  The lighting seems really bad to me.  If you want to accent parts of the body, the lighting needs to be placed strategically.  It seems that you just used what was available.  The shadows really do a disservice to the overall image. If you wanted to go for title...which you obviously did, maybe you should have had your subject bent over with her "fanny" in the air making a "hill".  This would have made more sense than just having a naked woman in a photo. Gave it a 2', '2013-10-22 22:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
