(7120632, 1087219, 68504, '<td valign="top">a little cramped, but his eye and clumpy feathering are engaging.  That Taleb is one busy guy, I wouldn''t be surprised if he starts to write novels, or indeed turns everything into a novel. extraordinary to be inspired by his writings to produce this.  I find his observations profoundly depressing.4</td>', 'a little cramped, but his eye and clumpy feathering are engaging.  That Taleb is one busy guy, I wouldn''t be surprised if he starts to write novels, or indeed turns everything into a novel. extraordinary to be inspired by his writings to produce this.  I find his observations profoundly depressing.4', '2013-10-22 23:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
