(7120718, 1086700, 30861, '<td valign="top">I find myself almost resentful of this, because the book''s so human and yearning, and the image is so cold and clinical... That''s an intensely personal reaction, I''m aware of this, but that''s after all what art''s about, isn''t it?<br/> <br/>I''m giving you a 5 because it IS pretty much on topic and it IS well-made, but I really don''t much care for it. I Love the book, BTW.</td>', 'I find myself almost resentful of this, because the book''s so human and yearning, and the image is so cold and clinical... That''s an intensely personal reaction, I''m aware of this, but that''s after all what art''s about, isn''t it? I''m giving you a 5 because it IS pretty much on topic and it IS well-made, but I really don''t much care for it. I Love the book, BTW.', '2013-10-23 00:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
