(7120786, 1087096, 94815, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7 although I neglected to post the number in my comment. My bad.</td>', 'I gave this a 7 although I neglected to post the number in my comment. My bad.', '2013-10-23 02:06:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(7120787, 1087162, 114285, '<td valign="top">This is very very good, well deserved ribbon,</td>', 'This is very very good, well deserved ribbon,', '2013-10-23 02:06:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(7120788, 1086992, 114285, '<td valign="top">That expression says it all, wonderful stuff,</td>', 'That expression says it all, wonderful stuff,', '2013-10-23 02:08:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7120789, 1087065, 123833, '<td valign="top">Great shot, congrats on TT!</td>', 'Great shot, congrats on TT!', '2013-10-23 02:11:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(7120792, 1087208, 54446, '<td valign="top">I really like this image and felt strongly it met the challenge.  Super good rep of your chosen novel.  I felt your processing was right on target.  It''s not overly sharpened.  Excellent control of the exposure, too.  The pose you have captured is a really good example of a <a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flehmen_response" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Flehmen response</a>.  It''s the manner in which many of the large cervids (and bovids) detect pheromones in the air.  Likely. few city dwellers would recognize the behavior.  I gave this a "7", but it deserved higher than that.  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'I really like this image and felt strongly it met the challenge.  Super good rep of your chosen novel.  I felt your processing was right on target.  It''s not overly sharpened.  Excellent control of the exposure, too.  The pose you have captured is a really good example of a Flehmen response.  It''s the manner in which many of the large cervids (and bovids) detect pheromones in the air.  Likely. few city dwellers would recognize the behavior.  I gave this a "7", but it deserved higher than that.  Keep up the good work.', '2013-10-23 02:17:04.000000', NULL, 0),
