(7120811, 1087222, 28742, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> ok, this is immediately intriguing because of its oddness. That car doesn''t look like it''s from the 1920s, but I think you''re trying to imply that... a sense of time travel. The woman is long gone, though she is fresh in our imagination, which allows her to cheat death and decay.</i></td></tr></table> <br/>Obviously he nailed it. :P</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: ok, this is immediately intriguing because of its oddness. That car doesn''t look like it''s from the 1920s, but I think you''re trying to imply that... a sense of time travel. The woman is long gone, though she is fresh in our imagination, which allows her to cheat death and decay. Obviously he nailed it. :P', '2013-10-23 03:25:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(7120813, 1087208, 28742, '<td valign="top">I think this is a terrific image, but I like this one better for the challenge: <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1088276" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50641/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1088276.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50641/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1088276.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50641/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1088276.jpg"/></a> <br/>Still, not a bad finish. :)</td>', 'I think this is a terrific image, but I like this one better for the challenge:  Still, not a bad finish. :)', '2013-10-23 03:28:26.000000', NULL, 0),
