(7120906, 1086983, 108580, '<td valign="top">WD Susan. Great image and <strike>live</strike> I love the backstory. The only Top Ten image actually done in a Portrait Orientation that is usable for a Novel Cover where any edit would harm the overall composition or feel. No one appeared to pick up on this small overlooked criterion in this challenge. Novels/Paperbacks are taller than wider!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-10-23 07:37:17.</i></td>', 'WD Susan. Great image and live I love the backstory. The only Top Ten image actually done in a Portrait Orientation that is usable for a Novel Cover where any edit would harm the overall composition or feel. No one appeared to pick up on this small overlooked criterion in this challenge. Novels/Paperbacks are taller than wider!', '2013-10-23 08:35:55.000000', '2013-10-23 08:37:17.000000', 0),
